#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:54
msgid ""
"First, :ref:`enable product tracking using lots <inventory/management/"
"track_products_by_lots>` by navigating to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, and checking the box for :guilabel:`Lots & "
"Serial Numbers` under the :guilabel:`Traceability` heading."
msgstr ""
"Avvalo, :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Settings` "
"yo'lidan o'tib, :guilabel:`Traceability` sarlavhasi ostidagi :guilabel:`Lots "
"& Serial Numbers` katagini belgilash orqali :ref:`partiyalar yordamida "
"mahsulot kuzatuvini yoqing <inventory/management/track_products_by_lots>`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:58
msgid ""
"Then, set up the product barcode by navigating to the intended product form "
"in :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Products --> Products` and selecting "
"the product. On the product form, click :guilabel:`Edit`. Then, in "
"the :guilabel:`General Information` tab, fill in the :guilabel:`Barcode` "
"field with the unique 14-digit `Global Trade Item Number (GTIN) <https://"
"www.gs1.org/standards/get-barcodes>`_, which is a universally recognized "
"identifying number that is provided by GS1."
msgstr ""
"So'ngra, :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Products --> Products` yo'lidan "
"kerakli mahsulot formasiga o'tib, mahsulotni tanlash orqali mahsulot shtrix-"
"kodini sozlang. Mahsulot formasida :guilabel:`Edit` tugmasini bosing. "
"Keyin, :guilabel:`General Information` varag'ida :guilabel:`Barcode` "
"maydonini noyob 14 xonali `Global Trade Item Number (GTIN) <https://"
"www.gs1.org/standards/get-barcodes>`_ bilan to'ldiring — bu GS1 tomonidan "
"taqdim etiladigan, butun dunyoda tan olingan identifikatsiya raqamidir."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:66
msgid ""
"On the product form, omit the |AI| `01` for |GTIN| product barcode pattern, "
"as it is only used to encode multiple barcodes into a single barcode that "
"contains detailed information about the package contents."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulot formasida |GTIN| mahsulot shtrix-kod shabloni uchun |AI| `01` ni "
"kiritmang, chunki u faqat bir nechta shtrix-kodni qadoq tarkibi haqida "
"batafsil ma'lumotni o'z ichiga olgan yagona shtrix-kodga kodlash uchun "
"ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:72
msgid ""
"To record the GS1 barcode for the product, `Fuji Apple`, enter the 14-digit |"
"GTIN| `20611628936004` in the :guilabel:`Barcode` field on the product form."
msgstr ""
"`Fuji Apple` mahsuloti uchun GS1 shtrix-kodini yozib qo'yish uchun mahsulot "
"formasidagi :guilabel:`Barcode` maydoniga 14 xonali |GTIN| `20611628936004` "
"ni kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:0
msgid "Enter 14-digit GTIN into the Barcode field on product form."
msgstr "Mahsulot formasidagi Barcode maydoniga 14 xonali GTIN ni kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:80
msgid ""
"To view a list of *all* products and their corresponding barcodes in the "
"Odoo database, navigate to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --"
"> Settings`. Under the :guilabel:`Barcode` heading, click on "
"the :guilabel:`Configure Product Barcodes` button under "
"the :guilabel:`Barcode Scanner` section. Enter the 14-digit |GTIN| into "
"the :guilabel:`Barcode` column, then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo ma'lumotlar bazasidagi *barcha* mahsulotlar va ularga tegishli shtrix-"
"kodlar ro'yxatini ko'rish uchun :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings` yo'lidan o'ting. :guilabel:`Barcode` sarlavhasi "
"ostida, :guilabel:`Barcode Scanner` bo'limidagi :guilabel:`Configure Product "
"Barcodes` tugmasini bosing. 14 xonali |GTIN| ni :guilabel:`Barcode` ustuniga "
"kiriting, so'ngra :guilabel:`Save` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:0
msgid "View the Product Barcodes page from inventory settings."
msgstr "Zaxira sozlamalaridan Product Barcodes sahifasini ko'rish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:92
msgid ""
"After activating tracking by lots and serial numbers from the settings page, "
"specify that this feature is to be applied on each product by navigating to "
"the :guilabel:`Inventory` tab on the product form. "
"Under :guilabel:`Tracking`, choose the :guilabel:`By Lots` radio button."
msgstr ""
"Sozlamalar sahifasidan partiyalar va seriya raqamlari bo'yicha kuzatuvni "
"faollashtirgandan so'ng, mahsulot formasidagi :guilabel:`Inventory` "
"varag'iga o'tib, bu funksiya har bir mahsulotga qo'llanilishini "
"belgilang. :guilabel:`Tracking` ostida :guilabel:`By Lots` radio tugmasini "
"tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:None
msgid ""
"Enable product tracking by lots in the \"Inventory\" tab of the product form."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulot formasining \"Inventory\" varag'ida partiyalar bo'yicha mahsulot "
"kuzatuvini yoqing."

