"Odoo **Barcode** ilovasidan **Inventory** ilovasida yaratilgan *guruhli*, "
"*to'lqinli* va *klasterli* ko'chirishlarni qayta ishlash uchun foydalanish "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/process_transfers.rst:9
