"ichidagi mahsulotlar joylashuvini yangilash uchun :ref:`Move Entire Packages "
"<inventory/product_management/move-entire-pack>` funksiyasini yoqish mumkin"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure.rst:71
