"operatsiyaga biriktirilgan eng katta paket bo'yicha filtrlangan. Barcha "
"paketlarni ko'rish uchun :guilabel:`Main Packages` filtrini olib tashlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:None
