"tugmasini bosing. Standart holatda, bu ro'yxat :guilabel:`Main Packages`, "
"ya'ni operatsiyaga biriktirilgan eng katta paket bo'yicha filtrlangan. "
"Barcha paketlarni ko'rish uchun :guilabel:`Main Packages` filtrini olib "
"tashlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:157
msgid ""
"Select the check boxes next to the packages that you want to remove, then "
"click the :guilabel:`Remove` button."
msgstr ""
"Olib tashlamoqchi bo'lgan paketlar yonidagi belgilash katakchalarini "
