"qo'shish uchun ularning chap tomonidagi belgilash katagini bosing. "
"Keyin, :guilabel:`Add:Transfers` oynasini yopish uchun :guilabel:`Select` "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/picking_methods/batch.rst:0
