"uchun :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Categories` "
"yo'lidan o'ting va kerakli mahsulot toifasini tanlang. "
"So'ngra :guilabel:`Force Removal Strategy` maydonida :guilabel:`First In "
"First Out (FIFO)` ni belgilang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fifo.rst:None
msgid "Set First In First Out as the product category removal strategy."
msgstr ""
"First In First Out ni mahsulot toifasining olib chiqish strategiyasi "
"sifatida o'rnating."

