"right` :guilabel:`(right-pointing arrow)` belgisini tanlang, shunda "
"mahsulotning zaxiradagi partiyalari yoki seriya raqamlari ro'yxati "
"ochiladi. :guilabel:`Created on` maydoni partiya/seriya raqami yaratilgan "
"sanani ko'rsatadi, tizim buni kelish sanasi deb hisoblaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fifo.rst:100
msgid ""
"Serial number `0000000000500` of the product, `Cabinet with Doors`, arrived "
