"Configuration --> Delivery Methods` yo'lidan o'ting, so'ngra yetkazib berish "
"usuli formasini ochish uchun :guilabel:`New` tugmasini bosing. Agar yetkazib "
"berish usuli allaqachon yaratilgan bo'lsa, uni ushbu ekrandan tanlash mumkin."

