"search results that appear in the resulting pop-up window, "
"choose :guilabel:`Settings / Technical / Reporting / Reports` to open "
"the :guilabel:`Reports` page."
msgstr ""
"Odoo'da Zebra yorlig'ini moslashtirishni boshlash uchun :ref:`dasturchi "
"rejimini <developer-mode>` yoqing va Odoo asosiy boshqaruv panelida "
"`Reports` deb yozing. Ochilgan qalqib chiquvchi oynada paydo bo'lgan qidiruv "
"natijalaridan :guilabel:`Reports` sahifasini ochish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Settings / Technical / Reporting / Reports` ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/zebra.rst:34
