msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Incoming Shipments`: omborda mahsulotlarni :doc:`bir <../../"
"shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_one_step>`, :doc:`ikki "
"<../../shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps>` "
"yoki :doc:`uch <../../shipping_receiving/daily_operations/"
"receipts_three_steps>` bosqichda qabul qilish variantini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses.rst:47
msgid ""
