"daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps>`, or :doc:`three <../../"
"shipping_receiving/daily_operations/delivery_three_steps>` steps."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Outgoing Shipments`: ombordan mahsulotlarni :doc:`bir <../../"
"shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_one_step>`, :doc:`ikki "
"<../../shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps>` "
"yoki :doc:`uch <../../shipping_receiving/daily_operations/"
"delivery_three_steps>` bosqichda yetkazib berish variantini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses.rst:52
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Dropship Subcontractors`: available with the *Subcontracting* "
"feature enabled in :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`. Tick this checkbox to purchase components from vendors, and "
"dropship them to subcontractors."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Dropship Subcontractors`: :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings` yo'lida *Subcontracting* funksiyasi yoqilganda "
"mavjud bo'ladi. Komponentlarni yetkazib beruvchilardan xarid qilib, ularni "
