"boshqaruvi, shuningdek zaxira boshqaruvi bilan bog'liq asosiy "
"ko'rsatkichlarni kuzatish va tahlil qilish imkonini beradi:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/dashboards.rst:9
