"so'ngra chap paneldagi :guilabel:`Logistics` bo'limiga o'ting va tegishli "
"boshqaruv paneli nomini bosing. Boshqaruv paneli asosiy ko'rinishda ochiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/dashboards.rst:22
msgid ""
"The :ref:`rights to access <dashboards/access-and-sharing>` Odoo dashboards "
"are based on user groups, and are managed within the **Dashboards** app. By "
"default, the :guilabel:`Operation analysis` and :guilabel:`Warehouse "
"Metrics` dashboards are only visible to, and can only be accessed by, users "
"with admin access to the **Inventory** app."
msgstr ""
"Odoo boshqaruv panellariga :ref:`kirish huquqlari <dashboards/access-and-"
"sharing>` foydalanuvchi guruhlariga asoslanadi va **Dashboards** ilovasi "
"ichida boshqariladi. Standart holatda :guilabel:`Operation analysis` "
"va :guilabel:`Warehouse Metrics` boshqaruv panellari faqat **Inventory** "
"ilovasiga admin kirish huquqiga ega foydalanuvchilarga ko'rinadi va faqat "
"ular tomonidan ochilishi mumkin."

