#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/dashboards.rst:34
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/dashboards.rst:None
msgid "Warehouse Daily Operations dashboard"
msgstr "Warehouse Daily Operations boshqaruv paneli"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/dashboards.rst:36
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Warehouse Daily Operations dashboard` provides a real-time "
"view of critical outstanding tasks across receipts, deliveries, and internal "
"transfers, allowing warehouse managers to prioritize work and prevent "
"bottlenecks. It immediately identifies overdue operations, as well as "
"transfers that have not yet been assigned to an employee. It also forecasts "
"scheduled activity for the next 7 days."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Warehouse Daily Operations dashboard` qabul qilishlar, yetkazib "
"berishlar va ichki ko'chirishlar bo'yicha muhim bajarilmagan vazifalarning "
"real vaqtdagi ko'rinishini taqdim etadi, bu ombor menejerlariga ishlarni "
"ustuvorlashtirish va tiqilishlarning oldini olish imkonini beradi. U muddati "
"o'tgan operatsiyalarni, shuningdek hali xodimga biriktirilmagan "
"ko'chirishlarni darhol aniqlaydi. U yana keyingi 7 kun uchun "
"rejalashtirilgan faoliyatni ham prognoz qiladi."

