#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:35
msgid ":guilabel:`To`: destination location of the moved product."
msgstr ":guilabel:`To`: ko'chirilgan mahsulotning boradigan joylashuvi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:36
msgid ":guilabel:`Quantity`: number of products moved."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Quantity`: ko'chirilgan mahsulotlar soni."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:37
msgid ":guilabel:`Unit`: unit of measure of the products moved."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Unit`: ko'chirilgan mahsulotlarning o'lchov birligi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:38
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Status`: indicates the move status, which can "
"be :guilabel:`Done`, :guilabel:`Available` (ready for action), "
"or :guilabel:`Partially Available` (insufficient quantities to complete the "
"operation)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Status`: harakat holatini bildiradi, "
"u :guilabel:`Done`, :guilabel:`Available` (harakatga tayyor) "
"yoki :guilabel:`Partially Available` (operatsiyani yakunlash uchun miqdor "
"yetarli emas) bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:43
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:65
msgid "Search options"
msgstr "Qidiruv opsiyalari"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:45
msgid ""
"Use the following search options to customize the :guilabel:`Moves History` "
"report to display relevant information"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Moves History` hisobotini kerakli ma'lumotlarni ko'rsatadigan "
"qilib moslashtirish uchun quyidagi qidiruv opsiyalaridan foydalaning"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:50
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:69
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/delayed.rst:38
msgid "Filters"
msgstr "Filtrlar"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:52
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:71
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Filters` section allows users to search among pre-made and "
"custom filters to find specific stock records."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Filters` bo'limi foydalanuvchilarga muayyan zaxira yozuvlarini "
"topish uchun tayyor va maxsus filtrlar orasidan qidirish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:55
msgid ""
":guilabel:`To Do`: show stock move records that are in progress. This "
"includes lines with a :guilabel:`Status` column value "
"of :guilabel:`Available` or :guilabel:`Partially Available`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`To Do`: bajarilayotgan zaxira harakati yozuvlarini ko'rsatadi. "
"Bunga :guilabel:`Status` ustuni qiymati :guilabel:`Available` "
"yoki :guilabel:`Partially Available` bo'lgan qatorlar kiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:57
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Done`: completed stock moves, with a :guilabel:`Status` "
"of :guilabel:`Done`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Done`: yakunlangan zaxira harakatlari, "
"ularning :guilabel:`Status` qiymati :guilabel:`Done` bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:58
msgid ":guilabel:`Incoming`: displays move records from vendor locations."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Incoming`: yetkazib beruvchi joylashuvlaridan kelgan harakat "
"yozuvlarini ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:59
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Outgoing`: displays move records to customer locations, including "
"customer returns."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Outgoing`: mijoz joylashuvlariga yo'naltirilgan harakat "
"yozuvlarini, shu jumladan mijoz qaytarishlarini ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:61
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Internal`: displays move records from one internal location to "
"another."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Internal`: bir ichki joylashuvdan boshqasiga bo'lgan harakat "
"yozuvlarini ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:62
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Manufacturing`: shows records where products were produced from "
"the virtual, production :doc:`location <../inventory_management/"
"use_locations>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Manufacturing`: mahsulotlar virtual ishlab "
"chiqarish :doc:`joylashuvidan <../inventory_management/use_locations>` "
"ishlab chiqarilgan yozuvlarni ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:64
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Date`: select this drop-down menu to access various date filter "
"options and view stock moves from a specific month, quarter, or year."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Date`: turli sana filtri opsiyalariga kirish hamda muayyan oy, "
"chorak yoki yildagi zaxira harakatlarini ko'rish uchun ushbu ochiluvchi "
"menyuni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:66
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Last 30 Days`: show records that occurred in the last thirty days."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Last 30 Days`: oxirgi o'ttiz kun ichida yuz bergan yozuvlarni "
"ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:67
msgid ":guilabel:`Last 3 Months`: show records from the last three months."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Last 3 Months`: oxirgi uch oydagi yozuvlarni ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:69
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:110
msgid "Group By"
msgstr "Guruhlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:71
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Group By` section allows users to add pre-made and custom "
"groupings to the search."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Group By` bo'limi foydalanuvchilarga qidiruvga tayyor va maxsus "
"guruhlashlarni qo'shish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:74
msgid ":guilabel:`Product`: group records by product."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Product`: yozuvlarni mahsulot bo'yicha guruhlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:75
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Status`: group records by the three status "
"types: :guilabel:`Done`, :guilabel:`Available`, and :guilabel:`Partially "
"Available`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Status`: yozuvlarni uchta holat turi bo'yicha "
"guruhlaydi: :guilabel:`Done`, :guilabel:`Available` va :guilabel:`Partially "
"Available`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:77
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Date`: group records "
"by :guilabel:`Year`, :guilabel:`Quarter`, :guilabel:`Month`, :guilabel:`Week`, "
"or :guilabel:`Day`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Date`: "
"yozuvlarni :guilabel:`Year`, :guilabel:`Quarter`, :guilabel:`Month`, :guilabel:`Week` "
"yoki :guilabel:`Day` bo'yicha guruhlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:79
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Transfers`: group records by operation number, e.g. `WH/OUT/"
"00012`, `WH/MO/00211`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Transfers`: yozuvlarni operatsiya raqami bo'yicha guruhlaydi, "
"masalan, `WH/OUT/00012`, `WH/MO/00211`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:81
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Location`: group records by source location (the :guilabel:`From` "
"column in this report)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Location`: yozuvlarni manba joylashuvi (ushbu "
"hisobotdagi :guilabel:`From` ustuni) bo'yicha guruhlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:83
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Category`: group records by product category. To configure these, "
"go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Products: Product "
"Categories`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Category`: yozuvlarni mahsulot toifasi bo'yicha guruhlaydi. "
"Ularni sozlash uchun :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> "
"Products: Product Categories` yo'lidan o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:85
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Batch Transfer`: group records by :doc:`batch <../../"
"shipping_receiving/picking_methods/batch>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Batch Transfer`: yozuvlarni :doc:`partiya <../../"
"shipping_receiving/picking_methods/batch>` bo'yicha guruhlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:88
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:122
msgid "Favorites"
msgstr "Saralanganlar"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:90
msgid ""
"To save the current applied filters and groups, so the same information can "
"be easily accessed after closing this page, click :guilabel:`Save current "
"search`."
msgstr ""
"Joriy qo'llanilgan filtrlar va guruhlashlarni saqlash va ushbu sahifa "
"yopilgandan keyin ham bir xil ma'lumotlarga osongina kirish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Save current search` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:93
msgid ""
"Optionally, tick the :guilabel:`Default filter` checkbox to make this "
"current view the default filter when opening the :guilabel:`Moves History` "
"report. Or tick the :guilabel:`Shared` checkbox to make the search option "
"available to other users."
msgstr ""
"Ixtiyoriy ravishda, :guilabel:`Moves History` hisobotini ochishda joriy "
"ko'rinishni standart filtrga aylantirish uchun :guilabel:`Default filter` "
"katagini belgilang. Yoki qidiruv opsiyasini boshqa foydalanuvchilar uchun "
"ham ochiq qilish uchun :guilabel:`Shared` katagini belgilang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:97
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:131
msgid "Lastly, click the :guilabel:`Save` button."
msgstr "Nihoyat, :guilabel:`Save` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:100
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:134
msgid ":doc:`../../../../essentials/search`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../../../essentials/search`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:3
msgid "Stock report"
msgstr "Zaxira hisoboti"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:5
msgid ""
"Use the stock report in Odoo *Inventory* for a detailed list of all stored "
"products, including those reserved, purchased and in transit, as well as "
"those delivered to customers."
msgstr ""
"Barcha saqlanayotgan mahsulotlarning, shu jumladan zaxiraga olingan, xarid "
"qilingan va yo'ldagi hamda mijozlarga yetkazib berilgan mahsulotlarning "
"batafsil ro'yxatini olish uchun Odoo *Inventory* ilovasidagi zaxira "
"hisobotidan foydalaning."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:12
msgid ""
"To access the stock report, go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Reporting --> Stock`."
msgstr ""
"Zaxira hisobotiga kirish uchun :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Reporting --"
"> Stock` yo'lidan o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:None
msgid ""
"Show the stock report, accessible by going to Inventory > Reporting > Stock."
msgstr ""
"Inventory > Reporting > Stock yo'lidan o'tish orqali ochiladigan zaxira "
"hisobotini ko'rsatish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:21
msgid ""
"On the stock report, the left sidebar includes several groupings to narrow "
"down what is being shown. The default groupings are :guilabel:`Warehouses`,  "
"which filters products by specific warehouses, and :guilabel:`Category`, "
"which shows products within a selected product category."
msgstr ""
"Zaxira hisobotida chap yon panelda ko'rsatilayotgan ma'lumotlarni "
"aniqlashtirish uchun bir nechta guruhlashlar mavjud. Standart "
"guruhlashlar :guilabel:`Warehouses` (mahsulotlarni muayyan omborlar bo'yicha "
"filtrlaydi) va :guilabel:`Category` (tanlangan mahsulot toifasidagi "
"mahsulotlarni ko'rsatadi) hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:26
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Warehouse` grouping is only available when there are multiple "
"warehouses in the database. Refer to the :doc:`../inventory_management/"
"warehouses` documentation for more details."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Warehouse` guruhlashi faqat ma'lumotlar bazasida bir nechta ombor "
"mavjud bo'lganda ochiq bo'ladi. Batafsil ma'lumot uchun :doc:`../"
"inventory_management/warehouses` hujjatiga qarang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:29
msgid "In the report itself, the columns represent:"
msgstr "Hisobotning o'zida ustunlar quyidagilarni bildiradi:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:31
msgid ":guilabel:`Product`: name of the product."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Product`: mahsulot nomi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Unit Cost`: average inventory valuation per unit, adjusted based "
"on the cost to purchase and/or manufacture the product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Unit Cost`: mahsulotni xarid qilish va/yoki ishlab chiqarish "
"xarajatlari asosida tuzatilgan, bir birlik uchun o'rtacha zaxira qiymati."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Total Value`: Total inventory valuation of the product, "
"calculated by multiplying unit cost by on-hand quantity."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Total Value`: mahsulotning umumiy zaxira qiymati bo'lib, birlik "
"tannarxini mavjud miqdorga ko'paytirish orqali hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:38
msgid ""
":ref:`Compute average cost inventory valuation per unit <inventory/avg_cost/"
"formula>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Birlik uchun o'rtacha tannarx bo'yicha zaxira qiymatini hisoblash "
"<inventory/avg_cost/formula>`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:39
msgid ""
":doc:`Inventory valuation methods <../../inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Zaxirani baholash usullari <../../inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet>`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`On Hand`: current quantity of products. Click the :icon:`fa-"
"pencil` :guilabel:`(pencil)` icon to :doc:`modify the on-hand quantity <../"
"inventory_management/count_products>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`On Hand`: mahsulotlarning joriy miqdori. :doc:`Mavjud miqdorni "
"o'zgartirish <../inventory_management/count_products>` uchun :icon:`fa-"
"pencil` :guilabel:`(pencil)` belgisini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:44
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Free to Use`: on-hand quantity that are **not** reserved for "
"delivery or manufacturing orders, and are available to sell or use."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Free to Use`: yetkazib berish yoki ishlab chiqarish buyurtmalari "
"uchun **band qilinmagan**, sotish yoki foydalanish uchun mavjud bo'lgan "
"miqdor."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:46
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Incoming`: items expected to arrive at the warehouse. Number of "
"products is based on quantities in confirmed purchase orders."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Incoming`: omborga kelishi kutilayotgan mahsulotlar. Mahsulotlar "
"soni tasdiqlangan xarid buyurtmalaridagi miqdorlarga asoslanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:48
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Outgoing`: items expected to leave the warehouse or be consumed "
"in manufacturing orders. Number of products is based on quantities in "
"confirmed sales or manufacturing orders."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Outgoing`: ombordan chiqishi yoki ishlab chiqarish buyurtmalarida "
"sarflanishi kutilayotgan mahsulotlar. Mahsulotlar soni tasdiqlangan sotuv "
"yoki ishlab chiqarish buyurtmalaridagi miqdorlarga asoslanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:53
msgid ""
":guilabel:`History`: access the stock move history of the product, "
"displaying information about the quantity and description of why the product "
"was moved from one location to another."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`History`: mahsulotning zaxira harakatlari tarixiga kirish bo'lib, "
"unda miqdor haqidagi ma'lumot va mahsulot nima uchun bir joydan boshqa joyga "
"ko'chirilganligi tavsifi ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:55
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Replenishment`: access the :doc:`reordering rules <../"
"replenishment/reordering_rules>` page for the product to create or manage "
"methods of procuring the product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Replenishment`: mahsulotni ta'minlash usullarini yaratish yoki "
"boshqarish uchun mahsulotning :doc:`qayta buyurtma qoidalari <../"
"replenishment/reordering_rules>` sahifasiga kirish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:58
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Locations`: break down of on-hand quantity at multiple storage "
"locations. Only available when the product is stored in multiple locations."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Locations`: mavjud miqdorning bir nechta saqlash joylari bo'yicha "
"taqsimoti. Faqat mahsulot bir nechta joyda saqlanganda mavjud bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:60
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Forecast`: access the forecasted report to view on-hand, "
"incoming, and outgoing quantities. Report also contains links to confirmed "
"purchase, sales, or manufacturing orders. Only available when there are "
"confirmed sales, purchase, or manufacturing orders for the product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Forecast`: mavjud, kiruvchi va chiquvchi miqdorlarni ko'rish "
"uchun prognoz hisobotiga kirish. Hisobotda tasdiqlangan xarid, sotuv yoki "
"ishlab chiqarish buyurtmalariga havolalar ham mavjud. Faqat mahsulot uchun "
"tasdiqlangan sotuv, xarid yoki ishlab chiqarish buyurtmalari mavjud "
"bo'lganda ko'rinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:74
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Published`: display products published on the website. Only "
"available with the *Website* app installed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Published`: veb-saytda e'lon qilingan mahsulotlarni ko'rsatadi. "
"Faqat *Website* ilovasi o'rnatilgan bo'lsa mavjud bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:76
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Available in POS`: display products available through the *Point "
"of Sale* app."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Available in POS`: *Point of Sale* ilovasi orqali mavjud bo'lgan "
"mahsulotlarni ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:77
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Available in Self`: display products available in self order "
"through the *Point of Sale* app. Appears in the search because "
"the :guilabel:`Available in Self Order` checkbox was ticked in "
"the :guilabel:`Point of Sale` section of a product form's :guilabel:`Sales` "
"tab. The option is only available when the :guilabel:`Available in POS` "
"checkbox is ticked."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Available in Self`: *Point of Sale* ilovasi orqali mustaqil "
"buyurtmada mavjud bo'lgan mahsulotlarni ko'rsatadi. Mahsulot "
"formasining :guilabel:`Sales` varag'idagi :guilabel:`Point of Sale` "
"bo'limida :guilabel:`Available in Self Order` katakchasi belgilangani uchun "
"qidiruvda paydo bo'ladi. Bu variant faqat :guilabel:`Available in POS` "
"katakchasi belgilangan bo'lsa mavjud bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:0
msgid ""
"In the Sales tab of a product form, showing *Available in Self Order* "
"setting."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulot formasining Sales varag'ida *Available in Self Order* sozlamasi "
"ko'rsatilgan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:86
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Not available in Self`: display products available in *PoS*, but "
"not available in self order."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Not available in Self`: *PoS* da mavjud bo'lgan, ammo mustaqil "
"buyurtmada mavjud bo'lmagan mahsulotlarni ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:90
msgid "`Configure PoS products <https://youtu.be/REbA3TBhFa4>`_"
msgstr "`PoS mahsulotlarini sozlash <https://youtu.be/REbA3TBhFa4>`_"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:92
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Can be Sold`: display products that can be sold to customers. "
"Appears in the search because the :guilabel:`Can be Sold` checkbox is ticked "
"on the product form."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Can be Sold`: mijozlarga sotilishi mumkin bo'lgan mahsulotlarni "
"ko'rsatadi. Mahsulot formasida :guilabel:`Can be Sold` katakchasi "
"belgilangani uchun qidiruvda paydo bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:94
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Can be Purchased`: display products that can be bought from "
"vendors. Appears in the search because the :guilabel:`Can be Purchased` "
"checkbox is ticked on the product form."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Can be Purchased`: yetkazib beruvchilardan sotib olinishi mumkin "
"bo'lgan mahsulotlarni ko'rsatadi. Mahsulot formasida :guilabel:`Can be "
"Purchased` katakchasi belgilangani uchun qidiruvda paydo bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:96
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Can be Recurring`: show subscription products, indicated by "
"ticking the :guilabel:`Recurring` checkbox on the product form. Only "
"available with the *Subscription* app activated."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Can be Recurring`: mahsulot formasida :guilabel:`Recurring` "
"katakchasini belgilash orqali ko'rsatilgan obuna mahsulotlarini ko'rsatadi. "
"Faqat *Subscription* ilovasi faollashtirilgan bo'lsa mavjud bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:99
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Can be Rented`: show products that can be loaned to customers for "
"a certain time. Appears in the search because the :guilabel:`Can be Rented` "
"checkbox was ticked on the product form. Only available with the *Rental* "
"app installed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Can be Rented`: mijozlarga ma'lum vaqtga berilishi mumkin bo'lgan "
"mahsulotlarni ko'rsatadi. Mahsulot formasida :guilabel:`Can be Rented` "
"katakchasi belgilangani uchun qidiruvda paydo bo'ladi. Faqat *Rental* "
"ilovasi o'rnatilgan bo'lsa mavjud bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:102
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Can be Subcontracted`: display products that can be produced by a "
"third-party manufacturer. Available only with the *Manufacturing* app "
"installed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Can be Subcontracted`: uchinchi tomon ishlab chiqaruvchisi "
"tomonidan ishlab chiqarilishi mumkin bo'lgan mahsulotlarni ko'rsatadi. Faqat "
"*Manufacturing* ilovasi o'rnatilgan bo'lsa mavjud bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:104
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Can be Expensed`: show items that can be expensed. Only available "
"with the *Expenses* app installed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Can be Expensed`: xarajat sifatida hisobga olinishi mumkin "
"bo'lgan mahsulotlarni ko'rsatadi. Faqat *Expenses* ilovasi o'rnatilgan "
"bo'lsa mavjud bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:108
msgid ":doc:`../../product_management/configure/type`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../product_management/configure/type`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:112
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Group By` section allows users to add pre-made and custom "
"groupings to the search results."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Group By` bo'limi foydalanuvchilarga qidiruv natijalariga tayyor "
"va maxsus guruhlashlarni qo'shish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:115
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Product Type`: group items by :doc:`product type <../../"
"product_management/configure/type>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Product Type`: mahsulotlarni :doc:`mahsulot turi <../../"
"product_management/configure/type>` bo'yicha guruhlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:117
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Product Category`: group items by product category. To configure "
"these, go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Products: "
"Product Categories`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Product Category`: mahsulotlarni mahsulot kategoriyasi bo'yicha "
"guruhlaydi. Ularni sozlash uchun :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Configuration --> Products: Product Categories` yo'lidan o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:119
msgid ""
":guilabel:`POS Product Category`: group items by :ref:`point of sale product "
"categories <pos/products/categories>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`POS Product Category`: mahsulotlarni :ref:`savdo nuqtasi mahsulot "
"kategoriyalari <pos/products/categories>` bo'yicha guruhlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:124
msgid ""
"To save the current applied filters and groupbys, so the same information "
"can be easily accessed after closing this page, click :guilabel:`Save "
"current search`."
msgstr ""
"Joriy qo'llanilgan filtrlar va guruhlashlarni saqlash va shu orqali sahifa "
"yopilgandan keyin ham xuddi shu ma'lumotga oson kirish uchun :guilabel:`Save "
"current search` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:127
msgid ""
"Optionally, tick the :guilabel:`Default filter` checkbox to make this "
"current view the default filter when opening the stock report. Or tick "
"the :guilabel:`Shared` checkbox to make the search option available to other "
"users."
msgstr ""
"Ixtiyoriy ravishda, zaxira hisobotini ochishda ushbu joriy ko'rinishni "
"standart filtr qilish uchun :guilabel:`Default filter` katakchasini "
"belgilang. Yoki qidiruv variantini boshqa foydalanuvchilar uchun mavjud "
"qilish uchun :guilabel:`Shared` katakchasini belgilang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance.rst:8
msgid "Maintenance"
msgstr "Texnik xizmat"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance.rst:10
msgid ""
"**Odoo Maintenance** helps extend the effectiveness of equipment by keeping "
"track of maintenance requirements."
msgstr ""
"**Odoo Maintenance** texnik xizmat talablarini kuzatib borish orqali "
"uskunalarning samaradorligini uzaytirishga yordam beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance.rst:14
msgid ""
"`Odoo Tutorials: Managing Equipment Maintenance <https://www.odoo.com/slides/"
"slide/managing-equipment-maintenance-709>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Odoo darsliklari: Uskunalar texnik xizmatini boshqarish <https://"
"www.odoo.com/slides/slide/managing-equipment-maintenance-709>`_"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:3
msgid "Add new equipment"
msgstr "Yangi uskuna qo'shish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:7
msgid ""
"In Odoo, *equipment* refers to any item that is used in everyday operations, "
"including the manufacturing of products. This can mean a piece of machinery "
"on a production line, a tool that is used in different locations, or a "
"computer in an office space. Equipment registered in Odoo can be owned by "
"the company that uses the Odoo database, or by a third party, such as a "
"vendor in the case of equipment rentals."
msgstr ""
"Odoo'da *uskuna* deganda kundalik operatsiyalarda, jumladan mahsulotlarni "
"ishlab chiqarishda foydalaniladigan har qanday buyum tushuniladi. Bu ishlab "
"chiqarish liniyasidagi mashina, turli joylarda foydalaniladigan asbob yoki "
"ofisdagi kompyuter bo'lishi mumkin. Odoo'da ro'yxatga olingan uskuna Odoo "
"ma'lumotlar bazasidan foydalanadigan kompaniyaga yoki uchinchi tomonga, "
"masalan, uskuna ijarasi holatida yetkazib beruvchiga tegishli bo'lishi "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:13
msgid ""
"Using Odoo *Maintenance*, it is possible to track individual pieces of "
"equipment, along with information about their maintenance requirements. To "
"add a new piece of equipment, navigate to the :guilabel:`Maintenance` "
"module, select :menuselection:`Equipments --> Machines & Tools --> Create`, "
"and configure the equipment as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo *Maintenance* yordamida alohida uskunalarni ularning texnik xizmat "
"talablari haqidagi ma'lumotlar bilan birga kuzatib borish mumkin. Yangi "
"uskuna qo'shish uchun :guilabel:`Maintenance` moduliga "
"o'ting, :menuselection:`Equipments --> Machines & Tools --> Create` yo'lini "
"tanlang va uskunani quyidagicha sozlang:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:18
msgid ":guilabel:`Equipment Name`: the product name of the piece of equipment"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Equipment Name`: uskunaning mahsulot nomi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:19
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Equipment Category`: the category that the equipment belongs to; "
"for example, computers, machinery, tools, etc.; new categories can be "
"created by navigating to :menuselection:`Configuration --> Equipment "
"Categories` and clicking :guilabel:`Create`"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Equipment Category`: uskuna tegishli bo'lgan kategoriya; masalan, "
"kompyuterlar, mashinalar, asboblar va h.k.; yangi kategoriyalarni yaratish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Configuration --> Equipment Categories` yo'lidan "
"o'ting va :guilabel:`Create` tugmasini bosing"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:22
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: the company that owns the equipment; again, this can be "
"the company that uses the Odoo database, or a third-party company"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Company`: uskunaga egalik qiluvchi kompaniya; bu yana Odoo "
"ma'lumotlar bazasidan foydalanadigan kompaniya yoki uchinchi tomon "
"kompaniyasi bo'lishi mumkin"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:24
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Used By`: specify if the equipment is used by a specific "
"employee, department, or both; select :guilabel:`Other` to specify both an "
"employee and a department"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Used By`: uskunadan muayyan xodim, bo'lim yoki ikkalasi ham "
"foydalanishini ko'rsating; ham xodimni, ham bo'limni ko'rsatish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Other` variantini tanlang"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:26
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Maintenance Team`: the team responsible for servicing the "
"equipment; new teams can be created by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Configuration --> Maintenance Teams` and "
"selecting :guilabel:`Create`; the members of each team can also be assigned "
"from this page"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Maintenance Team`: uskunaga xizmat ko'rsatish uchun mas'ul jamoa; "
"yangi jamoalarni yaratish uchun :menuselection:`Configuration --> "
"Maintenance Teams` yo'lidan o'ting va :guilabel:`Create` tugmasini tanlang; "
"har bir jamoa a'zolarini ham shu sahifadan tayinlash mumkin"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:29
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Technician`: the person responsible for servicing the equipment; "
"this can be used to assign a specific individual in the event that no "
"maintenance team is assigned or when a specific member of the assigned team "
"should always be responsible for the equipment; any person added to Odoo as "
"a user can be assigned as a technician"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Technician`: uskunaga xizmat ko'rsatish uchun mas'ul shaxs; bu "
"texnik xizmat jamoasi tayinlanmagan holatda yoki tayinlangan jamoaning "
"muayyan a'zosi har doim uskuna uchun mas'ul bo'lishi kerak bo'lganda muayyan "
"shaxsni tayinlash uchun ishlatilishi mumkin; Odoo'ga foydalanuvchi sifatida "
"qo'shilgan har qanday shaxs texnik sifatida tayinlanishi mumkin"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:33
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Used in location`: the location where the equipment is used; this "
"is a simple text field that can be used to specify locations that are not "
"work centers, like an office, for example"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Used in location`: uskuna foydalaniladigan joy; bu oddiy matn "
"maydoni bo'lib, ish markazi bo'lmagan joylarni, masalan, ofisni ko'rsatish "
"uchun ishlatilishi mumkin"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:36
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Work Center`: if the equipment is used at a work center, specify "
"it here; equipment can also be assigned to a work center by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Maintenance --> Equipments --> Work Centers`, selecting a "
"work center or creating a new one using the :guilabel:`Create` button, and "
"clicking the :guilabel:`Equipment` tab on the work center form"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Work Center`: agar uskuna ish markazida foydalanilsa, uni shu "
"yerda ko'rsating; uskunani ish markaziga tayinlash "
"uchun :menuselection:`Maintenance --> Equipments --> Work Centers` yo'lidan "
"o'tib, ish markazini tanlash yoki :guilabel:`Create` tugmasi yordamida "
"yangisini yaratish va ish markazi formasidagi :guilabel:`Equipment` "
"varag'ini bosish ham mumkin"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:None
msgid "An example of a fully configured new equipment form."
msgstr "To'liq sozlangan yangi uskuna formasining namunasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:46
msgid "Include additional product information"
msgstr "Qo'shimcha mahsulot ma'lumotlarini kiritish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:48
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Product Information` tab at the bottom of the page can be "
"used to provide further details about the piece of equipment:"
msgstr ""
"Sahifaning pastki qismidagi :guilabel:`Product Information` varag'i uskuna "
"haqida qo'shimcha ma'lumotlarni kiritish uchun ishlatilishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:51
msgid ":guilabel:`Vendor`: the vendor that the equipment was purchased from"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Vendor`: uskuna sotib olingan yetkazib beruvchi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:52
msgid ":guilabel:`Vendor Reference`: the reference code assigned to the vendor"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Vendor Reference`: yetkazib beruvchiga tayinlangan mos yozuvlar "
"kodi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:53
msgid ":guilabel:`Model`: the specific model of the piece of equipment"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Model`: uskunaning aniq modeli"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:54
msgid ":guilabel:`Serial Number`: the unique serial number of the equipment"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Serial Number`: uskunaning noyob seriya raqami"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:55
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Effective Date`: the date that the equipment became available for "
"use; this is used to calculate the :abbr:`MTBF (Mean Time Between Failures)`"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Effective Date`: uskuna foydalanish uchun mavjud bo'lgan sana; "
"bu :abbr:`MTBF (Mean Time Between Failures)` ni hisoblash uchun ishlatiladi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:57
msgid ":guilabel:`Cost`: the amount the equipment was purchased for"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Cost`: uskuna sotib olingan summa"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:58
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Warranty Expiration Date`: the date on which the equipment's "
"warranty will expire"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Warranty Expiration Date`: uskunaning kafolat muddati tugaydigan "
"sana"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:None
msgid "The product information tab for the new piece of equipment."
msgstr "Yangi uskuna uchun mahsulot ma'lumotlari varag'i."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:65
msgid "Add maintenance details"
msgstr "Texnik xizmat tafsilotlarini qo'shish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:67
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Maintenance` tab at the bottom of the page provides "
"information about the failure frequency of the piece of equipment:"
msgstr ""
"Sahifaning pastki qismidagi :guilabel:`Maintenance` varag'i uskunaning "
"nosozliklar chastotasi haqida ma'lumot beradi:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:70
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expected Mean Time Between Failure`: the average number of days "
"the equipment is expected to operate between failures. This number can be "
"configured manually."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Expected Mean Time Between Failure`: uskunaning nosozliklar "
"orasida ishlashi kutilayotgan o'rtacha kunlar soni. Bu raqamni qo'lda "
"sozlash mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:72
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Mean Time Between Failure`: the average number of days the "
"equipment operates between failures. This number is calculated automatically "
"based on previous failures, and cannot be configured manually."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Mean Time Between Failure`: uskunaning nosozliklar orasida "
"ishlaydigan o'rtacha kunlar soni. Bu raqam oldingi nosozliklar asosida "
"avtomatik hisoblanadi va uni qo'lda sozlab bo'lmaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:75
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Estimated Next Failure`: the estimated date the equipment may "
"experience its next failure. This date is calculated automatically based on "
"the data in the :guilabel:`Mean Time Between Failure` and :guilabel:`Latest "
"Failure` fields, and cannot be configured manually."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Estimated Next Failure`: uskunada keyingi nosozlik yuz berishi "
"mumkin bo'lgan taxminiy sana. Bu sana :guilabel:`Mean Time Between Failure` "
"va :guilabel:`Latest Failure` maydonlaridagi ma'lumotlar asosida avtomatik "
"hisoblanadi va uni qo'lda sozlab bo'lmaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:79
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Latest Failure`: the most recent date on which the equipment "
"failed. This date is based on the creation date of the equipment's most "
"recent maintenance request, and cannot be configured manually."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Latest Failure`: uskuna ishdan chiqqan eng so'nggi sana. Bu sana "
"uskunaning eng so'nggi texnik xizmat so'rovining yaratilgan sanasiga "
"asoslanadi va uni qo'lda sozlab bo'lmaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:82
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Mean Time To Repair`: the average number of days needed to repair "
"the equipment. This number is calculated automatically based on the duration "
"of previous maintenance requests, and cannot be configured manually."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Mean Time To Repair`: uskunani ta'mirlash uchun zarur bo'lgan "
"o'rtacha kunlar soni. Bu raqam oldingi texnik xizmat so'rovlarining "
"davomiyligi asosida avtomatik hisoblanadi va uni qo'lda sozlab bo'lmaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:None
msgid "The maintenance tab for a piece of equipment."
msgstr "Uskuna uchun texnik xizmat varag'i."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment.rst:91
msgid ""
"To see any open maintenance requests for a piece of equipment, go to the "
"page for the equipment, and click the :guilabel:`Maintenance` smart button "
"at the top of the page."
msgstr ""
"Uskuna bo'yicha ochiq texnik xizmat so'rovlarini ko'rish uchun uskuna "
"sahifasiga o'ting va sahifaning yuqori qismidagi :guilabel:`Maintenance` "
"aqlli tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:3
msgid "Maintenance calendar"
msgstr "Texnik xizmat kalendari"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:7
msgid ""
"Avoiding equipment breakdowns, and blocks in warehouse work centers, "
"requires constant equipment maintenance. Timely corrective maintenance for "
"machines and tools that break unexpectedly, as well as preventive "
"maintenance to ensure that such issues are avoided, are key to keeping "
"warehouse operations running smoothly."
msgstr ""
"Uskunalarning ishdan chiqishi va ombordagi ish markazlarida "
"to'xtalishlarning oldini olish uskunalarga doimiy texnik xizmat ko'rsatishni "
"talab qiladi. Kutilmaganda buziladigan mashina va asboblar uchun o'z vaqtida "
"tuzatuvchi texnik xizmat, shuningdek bunday muammolarning oldini olishni "
"ta'minlovchi profilaktik texnik xizmat ombor operatsiyalarining uzluksiz "
"ishlashini ta'minlashda asosiy omil hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:12
msgid ""
"In Odoo *Maintenance*, users can access the *Maintenance Calendar* to "
"create, schedule, and edit both corrective and preventive maintenance "
"requests, to stay on top of equipment and work centers."
msgstr ""
"Odoo *Maintenance* ilovasida foydalanuvchilar uskunalar va ish markazlarini "
"nazorat qilib borish uchun *Texnik xizmat kalendari*dan foydalanib, "
"tuzatuvchi va profilaktik texnik xizmat so'rovlarini yaratishi, "
"rejalashtirishi va tahrirlashi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:16
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_requests.rst:45
msgid "Create maintenance request"
msgstr "Texnik xizmat so'rovini yaratish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:18
msgid ""
"Maintenance requests can be created directly from the *Maintenance "
"Calendar*. To access the calendar, navigate to :menuselection:`Maintenance "
"app --> Maintenance --> Maintenance Calendar`."
msgstr ""
"Texnik xizmat so'rovlarini to'g'ridan-to'g'ri *Texnik xizmat kalendari*dan "
"yaratish mumkin. Kalendarga kirish uchun :menuselection:`Maintenance app --> "
"Maintenance --> Maintenance Calendar` yo'lidan o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:21
msgid ""
"To create a new request, click anywhere on the calendar. Doing so opens "
"a :guilabel:`New Event` pop-up window. In the :guilabel:`Name:` field, "
"assign a title to the new request."
msgstr ""
"Yangi so'rov yaratish uchun kalendarning istalgan joyini bosing. "
"Shunda :guilabel:`New Event` qalqib chiquvchi oynasi "
"ochiladi. :guilabel:`Name:` maydonida yangi so'rovga sarlavha bering."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:None
msgid "New event creation pop-up window."
msgstr "Yangi tadbir yaratish qalqib chiquvchi oynasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:28
msgid ""
"Clicking :guilabel:`Create` on the pop-up window saves the new request with "
"no additional details. If the request's creation should be cancelled, "
"click :guilabel:`Cancel`."
msgstr ""
"Qalqib chiquvchi oynada :guilabel:`Create` tugmasini bosish yangi so'rovni "
"qo'shimcha tafsilotlarsiz saqlaydi. Agar so'rovni yaratishni bekor qilish "
"kerak bo'lsa, :guilabel:`Cancel` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:31
msgid ""
"To add more details and schedule the request for a specific date and time, "
"click :guilabel:`Edit`."
msgstr ""
"Ko'proq tafsilotlar qo'shish va so'rovni ma'lum bir sana va vaqtga "
"rejalashtirish uchun :guilabel:`Edit` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:33
msgid ""
"Clicking :guilabel:`Edit` opens a blank maintenance request form, where "
"various details about the request can be filled out."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Edit` tugmasini bosish bo'sh texnik xizmat so'rovi formasini "
"ochadi, unda so'rov haqidagi turli tafsilotlarni to'ldirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:37
msgid "Edit maintenance request"
msgstr "Texnik xizmat so'rovini tahrirlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:39
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Request` field, assign a title to the new request. In "
"the :guilabel:`Created By` field, from the drop-down menu, select which user "
"the request was created by. By default, this field populates with the user "
"actually creating the request."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Request` maydonida yangi so'rovga sarlavha "
"bering. :guilabel:`Created By` maydonida, ochiluvchi menyudan so'rov qaysi "
"foydalanuvchi tomonidan yaratilganini tanlang. Standart holatda bu maydon "
"so'rovni haqiqatda yaratayotgan foydalanuvchi bilan to'ldiriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:None
msgid "New maintenance request form creation."
msgstr "Yangi texnik xizmat so'rovi formasini yaratish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:47
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`For` field, from the drop-down menu, select if this "
"request is being created for a piece of :guilabel:`Equipment`, or "
"a :guilabel:`Work Center`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`For` maydonida, ochiluvchi menyudan bu "
"so'rov :guilabel:`Equipment` uchunmi yoki :guilabel:`Work Center` uchun "
"yaratilayotganini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:51
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`Work Center` is selected in the :guilabel:`For` field's drop-"
"down menu, two additional fields appear on the form: :guilabel:`Work Center` "
"and :guilabel:`Block Workcenter`."
msgstr ""
"Agar :guilabel:`For` maydonining ochiluvchi menyusida :guilabel:`Work "
"Center` tanlangan bo'lsa, formada ikkita qo'shimcha maydon paydo "
"bo'ladi: :guilabel:`Work Center` va :guilabel:`Block Workcenter`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:54
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Work Center` field, select which work center in the "
"warehouse this maintenance request applies to."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Work Center` maydonida bu texnik xizmat so'rovi ombordagi qaysi "
"ish markaziga tegishli ekanini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:57
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Block Workcenter` option's checkbox is ticked, it is not "
"possible to plan work orders, or other maintenance requests, in this work "
"center during the time that this request is being performed."
msgstr ""
"Agar :guilabel:`Block Workcenter` opsiyasining belgilash katagi belgilangan "
"bo'lsa, ushbu so'rov bajarilayotgan vaqt davomida bu ish markazida ish "
"buyurtmalari yoki boshqa texnik xizmat so'rovlarini rejalashtirish mumkin "
"bo'lmaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:61
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`Equipment` is selected in the :guilabel:`For` field, which it "
"is by default, select which machine or tool requires maintenance from "
"the :guilabel:`Equipment` field. Once a specific piece of equipment is "
"selected, a greyed-out :guilabel:`Category` field appears, listing the "
"*Equipment Category* to which the equipment belongs."
msgstr ""
"Agar :guilabel:`For` maydonida :guilabel:`Equipment` tanlangan bo'lsa (u "
"standart holatda tanlangan), :guilabel:`Equipment` maydonidan qaysi mashina "
"yoki asbob texnik xizmatga muhtoj ekanini tanlang. Muayyan uskuna "
"tanlangandan so'ng, kulrang :guilabel:`Category` maydoni paydo bo'ladi va "
"unda uskuna tegishli bo'lgan *Uskuna toifasi* ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:66
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Worksheet Template` field, if necessary, click the drop-"
"down menu to select a worksheet template. These templates are custom "
"templates that can be filled out by the employee performing the maintenance."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Worksheet Template` maydonida, agar kerak bo'lsa, ish varag'i "
"shablonini tanlash uchun ochiluvchi menyuni bosing. Bu shablonlar texnik "
"xizmatni bajaruvchi xodim tomonidan to'ldirilishi mumkin bo'lgan maxsus "
"shablonlardir."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:70
msgid ""
"Under the :guilabel:`Category` field, the :guilabel:`Request Date` field "
"displays the date requested for the maintenance to happen."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Category` maydonining ostida :guilabel:`Request Date` maydoni "
"texnik xizmat o'tkazilishi so'ralgan sanani ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:73
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Maintenance Type` field provides two selectable radio button "
"options: :guilabel:`Corrective` and :guilabel:`Preventive`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Maintenance Type` maydoni tanlash mumkin bo'lgan ikkita radio "
"tugma opsiyasini taqdim etadi: :guilabel:`Corrective` "
"va :guilabel:`Preventive`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:76
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Corrective` maintenance is for requests that arise for immediate "
"needs, such as broken equipment, while :guilabel:`Preventive` maintenance is "
"for planned requests, to avoid breakdowns in the future."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Corrective` texnik xizmat buzilgan uskuna kabi zudlik bilan hal "
"qilinishi kerak bo'lgan ehtiyojlar uchun yuzaga keladigan so'rovlarga "
"mo'ljallangan, :guilabel:`Preventive` texnik xizmat esa kelajakda "
"buzilishlarning oldini olish uchun rejalashtirilgan so'rovlarga "
"mo'ljallangan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:80
msgid ""
"If this request is tied to a specific |MO|, select that |MO| from "
"the :guilabel:`Manufacturing Order` field."
msgstr ""
"Agar bu so'rov muayyan |MO| bilan bog'liq bo'lsa, o'sha |MO|"
"ni :guilabel:`Manufacturing Order` maydonidan tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:83
msgid ""
"From the drop-down menu for the :guilabel:`Team` field, select the desired "
"maintenance team who will perform the maintenance. In "
"the :guilabel:`Responsible` field, select the technician responsible for the "
"request."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Team` maydonining ochiluvchi menyusidan texnik xizmatni "
"bajaradigan kerakli texnik xizmat jamoasini tanlang. :guilabel:`Responsible` "
"maydonida so'rov uchun mas'ul texnikni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:None
msgid "Filled-out details of maintenance request form."
msgstr "Texnik xizmat so'rovi formasining to'ldirilgan tafsilotlari."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:91
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Scheduled Date` field, click the date to open a calendar "
"popover. From this popover, select the planned date of the maintenance, and "
"click :guilabel:`Apply` to save the date."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Scheduled Date` maydonida kalendar oynachasini ochish uchun "
"sanani bosing. Bu oynachadan texnik xizmatning rejalashtirilgan sanasini "
"tanlang va sanani saqlash uchun :guilabel:`Apply` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:94
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Duration` field, enter the the amount of hours (in a "
"`00:00` format) that the maintenance is planned to take."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Duration` maydonida texnik xizmat uchun rejalashtirilgan soatlar "
"miqdorini (`00:00` formatida) kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:97
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Priority` field, choose a priority between one and "
"three :guilabel:`⭐⭐⭐ (stars)`. This indicates the importance of the "
"maintenance request."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Priority` maydonida birdan uchgacha :guilabel:`⭐⭐⭐ (stars)` "
"oralig'ida ustuvorlikni tanlang. Bu texnik xizmat so'rovining muhimligini "
"bildiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:100
msgid ""
"If working in a multi-company environment, from the drop-down menu in "
"the :guilabel:`Company` field, select the company to which this maintenance "
"request belongs."
msgstr ""
"Agar ko'p kompaniyali muhitda ishlayotgan bo'lsangiz, :guilabel:`Company` "
"maydonidagi ochiluvchi menyudan bu texnik xizmat so'rovi tegishli bo'lgan "
"kompaniyani tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:103
msgid ""
"At the bottom of the form, there are two tabs: :guilabel:`Notes` "
"and :guilabel:`Instructions`."
msgstr ""
"Formaning pastki qismida ikkita varaq bor: :guilabel:`Notes` "
"va :guilabel:`Instructions`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:105
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Notes` tab, type out any internal notes for the team or "
"technician assigned to the request, if necessary."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Notes` varag'ida, agar kerak bo'lsa, so'rovga tayinlangan jamoa "
"yoki texnik uchun ichki eslatmalarni yozing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:108
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Instructions` tab, if necessary, select one of the three "
"radio button options to provide maintenance instructions to the assigned "
"team or technician. The available methods for providing instructions are "
"via :guilabel:`PDF`, :guilabel:`Google Slide`, or :guilabel:`Text`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Instructions` varag'ida, agar kerak bo'lsa, tayinlangan jamoa "
"yoki texnikka texnik xizmat ko'rsatmalarini berish uchun uchta radio tugma "
"opsiyasidan birini tanlang. Ko'rsatmalarni berishning mavjud "
"usullari: :guilabel:`PDF`, :guilabel:`Google Slide` yoki :guilabel:`Text` "
"orqali."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:None
msgid "Instructions tab options on maintenance request form."
msgstr "Texnik xizmat so'rovi formasidagi Instructions varag'i opsiyalari."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:117
msgid "Calendar elements"
msgstr "Kalendar elementlari"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:119
msgid ""
"The *Maintenance Calendar* provides various views, search functions, and "
"filters to help keep track of the progress of ongoing and planned "
"maintenance requests."
msgstr ""
"*Texnik xizmat kalendari* davom etayotgan va rejalashtirilgan texnik xizmat "
"so'rovlarining borishini kuzatib borishga yordam beradigan turli "
"ko'rinishlar, qidiruv funksiyalari va filtrlarni taqdim etadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:122
msgid ""
"The following sections describe elements found across various views of the "
"calendar."
msgstr ""
"Quyidagi bo'limlar kalendarning turli ko'rinishlarida uchraydigan "
"elementlarni tavsiflaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:125
msgid "Filters and Favorites"
msgstr "Filtrlar va Saralanganlar"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:127
msgid ""
"To access the maintenance calendar, navigate to :menuselection:`Maintenance "
"app --> Maintenance --> Maintenance Calendar`."
msgstr ""
"Texnik xizmat kalendariga kirish uchun :menuselection:`Maintenance app --> "
"Maintenance --> Maintenance Calendar` yo'lidan o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:130
msgid ""
"To add and remove filters for sorting data on the *Maintenance Calendar*, "
"click the :guilabel:`🔻 (triangle pointed down)` icon, to the right of the "
"search bar at the top of the page."
msgstr ""
"*Texnik xizmat kalendari*dagi ma'lumotlarni saralash uchun filtrlarni "
"qo'shish va olib tashlash maqsadida sahifaning yuqori qismidagi qidiruv "
"panelining o'ng tomonidagi :guilabel:`🔻 (triangle pointed down)` belgisini "
"bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:133
msgid ""
"The left-hand side of the resulting drop-down menu lists all the "
"different :guilabel:`Filters` users can select. By default, :guilabel:`To "
"Do` and :guilabel:`Active` are selected, so all open requests are displayed."
msgstr ""
"Ochilgan ochiluvchi menyuning chap tomonida foydalanuvchilar tanlashi mumkin "
"bo'lgan barcha turli :guilabel:`Filters` ro'yxati keltirilgan. Standart "
"holatda :guilabel:`To Do` va :guilabel:`Active` tanlangan bo'ladi, shuning "
"uchun barcha ochiq so'rovlar ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:138
msgid ""
"To add a custom filter to the :guilabel:`Maintenance Calendar`, "
"click :guilabel:`Add Custom Filter`, under the :guilabel:`Filters` section "
"of the drop-down menu. This opens an :guilabel:`Add Custom Filter` pop-up "
"window."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Maintenance Calendar`ga maxsus filtr qo'shish uchun ochiluvchi "
"menyuning :guilabel:`Filters` bo'limi ostidagi :guilabel:`Add Custom Filter` "
"tugmasini bosing. Bu :guilabel:`Add Custom Filter` qalqib chiquvchi oynasini "
"ochadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:142
msgid ""
"From this pop-up window, configure the properties of the new rule for the "
"filter. Once ready, click :guilabel:`Add`."
msgstr ""
"Bu qalqib chiquvchi oynadan filtr uchun yangi qoidaning xususiyatlarini "
"sozlang. Tayyor bo'lgach, :guilabel:`Add` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:145
msgid ""
"The right-hand side of the drop-down menu lists the :guilabel:`Favorites`, "
"or any searches that have been saved as a favorite to be revisited at a "
"later date."
msgstr ""
"Ochiluvchi menyuning o'ng tomonida :guilabel:`Favorites`, ya'ni keyinroq "
"qayta foydalanish uchun saralangan sifatida saqlangan qidiruvlar ro'yxati "
"keltirilgan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:None
msgid "Favorites section of filters drop-down menu."
msgstr "Filtrlar ochiluvchi menyusining Saralanganlar bo'limi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:152
msgid ""
"To save a new :guilabel:`Favorite` search, select the "
"desired :guilabel:`Filters`. Then, click :guilabel:`Save current search`. In "
"the field directly below :guilabel:`Save current search`, assign a name to "
"the search."
msgstr ""
"Yangi :guilabel:`Favorite` qidiruvni saqlash uchun "
"kerakli :guilabel:`Filters`ni tanlang. So'ngra :guilabel:`Save current "
"search` tugmasini bosing. :guilabel:`Save current search`ning bevosita "
"ostidagi maydonda qidiruvga nom bering."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:156
msgid ""
"Under the assigned name, there are two options, to save the current search "
"either as the :guilabel:`Default filter`, or as a :guilabel:`Shared` filter."
msgstr ""
"Berilgan nom ostida joriy qidiruvni :guilabel:`Default filter` sifatida "
"yoki :guilabel:`Shared` filtr sifatida saqlash uchun ikkita opsiya mavjud."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:159
msgid ""
"Selecting :guilabel:`Default filter` sets this filter as the default when "
"opening this calendar view."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Default filter`ni tanlash bu filtrni ushbu kalendar ko'rinishi "
"ochilganda standart filtr sifatida o'rnatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:162
msgid ""
"Selecting the :guilabel:`Shared` filter makes this filter available to other "
"users."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Shared` filtrni tanlash bu filtrni boshqa foydalanuvchilar uchun "
"ham mavjud qiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:164
msgid ""
"Once ready, click :guilabel:`Save`. When clicked, the "
"new :guilabel:`Favorite` filter appears in the :guilabel:`Favorites` column, "
"and a :guilabel:`⭐ (gold star)` icon appears with the filter's name in the "
"search bar."
msgstr ""
"Tayyor bo'lgach, :guilabel:`Save` tugmasini bosing. Bosilgach, "
"yangi :guilabel:`Favorite` filtr :guilabel:`Favorites` ustunida paydo "
"bo'ladi va qidiruv panelida filtr nomi bilan birga :guilabel:`⭐ (gold "
"star)` belgisi paydo bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:169
msgid "Views"
msgstr "Ko'rinishlar"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:171
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Maintenance Calendar` is available in six different "
"views: :guilabel:`Calendar` "
"(default), :guilabel:`Kanban`, :guilabel:`List`, :guilabel:`Pivot`, :guilabel:`Graph`, "
"and :guilabel:`Activity`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Maintenance Calendar` oltita turli ko'rinishda "
"mavjud: :guilabel:`Calendar` "
"(standart), :guilabel:`Kanban`, :guilabel:`List`, :guilabel:`Pivot`, :guilabel:`Graph` "
"va :guilabel:`Activity`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:None
msgid "Different view type icons for maintenance calendar."
msgstr "Texnik xizmat kalendari uchun turli ko'rinish turi belgilari."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:180
msgid "Calendar view"
msgstr "Kalendar ko'rinishi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:182
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Calendar` is the default view displayed when "
"the :guilabel:`Maintenance Calendar` is opened. There are a number of "
"options in this view type for sorting and grouping information about "
"maintenance requests."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Calendar` — :guilabel:`Maintenance Calendar` ochilganda "
"ko'rsatiladigan standart ko'rinish. Bu ko'rinish turida texnik xizmat "
"so'rovlari haqidagi ma'lumotlarni saralash va guruhlash uchun bir qancha "
"opsiyalar mavjud."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:186
msgid ""
"In the top-left corner of the page, there is a drop-down menu set "
"to :guilabel:`Week`, by default. Clicking that drop-down menu reveals the "
"different periods of time, in which the calendar can be "
"viewed: :guilabel:`Day`, :guilabel:`Month`, and :guilabel:`Year`. There is "
"also an option to :guilabel:`Show weekends`, selected by default. If "
"unselected, weekends are not shown on the calendar."
msgstr ""
"Sahifaning yuqori chap burchagida standart holatda :guilabel:`Week`ga "
"o'rnatilgan ochiluvchi menyu bor. Bu ochiluvchi menyuni bosish kalendarni "
"ko'rish mumkin bo'lgan turli vaqt davrlarini "
"ko'rsatadi: :guilabel:`Day`, :guilabel:`Month` va :guilabel:`Year`. "
"Shuningdek, standart holatda tanlangan :guilabel:`Show weekends` opsiyasi "
"ham mavjud. Agar tanlovi olib tashlansa, dam olish kunlari kalendarda "
"ko'rsatilmaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:None
msgid "Calendar period drop-down menu options."
msgstr "Kalendar davri ochiluvchi menyu variantlari."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:196
msgid ""
"To the left of this menu, there is a :guilabel:`⬅️ (left arrow)` icon and "
"a :guilabel:`➡️ (right arrow)` icon. Clicking these arrows moves the calendar "
"backward or forward in time, respectively."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu menyuning chap tomonida :guilabel:`⬅️ (left arrow)` belgisi "
"va :guilabel:`➡️ (right arrow)` belgisi mavjud. Ushbu strelkalarni bosish "
"kalendarni mos ravishda vaqt bo'yicha orqaga yoki oldinga siljitadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:199
msgid ""
"To the right of the drop-down menu set to :guilabel:`Week`, by default, is "
"a :guilabel:`Today` button. Clicking this button resets the calendar to view "
"today's date, no matter which point in time is being viewed before clicking "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Standart holatda :guilabel:`Week` qilib o'rnatilgan ochiluvchi menyuning "
"o'ng tomonida :guilabel:`Today` tugmasi joylashgan. Ushbu tugmani bosish, "
"undan oldin qaysi vaqt nuqtasi ko'rilayotganidan qat'i nazar, kalendarni "
"bugungi sanani ko'rsatish holatiga qaytaradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:203
msgid ""
"At the far-right side of the page is a sidebar column, containing a "
"minimized calendar set to today's date, and a :guilabel:`Technician` list, "
"displaying all the *Technicians* with requests currently open. Click "
"the :guilabel:`(panel)` icon at the top of this sidebar to open or close the "
"sidebar."
msgstr ""
"Sahifaning eng o'ng tomonida yon panel ustuni joylashgan bo'lib, unda "
"bugungi sanaga o'rnatilgan kichraytirilgan kalendar va hozirda ochiq "
"so'rovlari bo'lgan barcha *Texniklar* ko'rsatilgan :guilabel:`Technician` "
"ro'yxati mavjud. Yon panelni ochish yoki yopish uchun ushbu panelning "
"yuqorisidagi :guilabel:`(panel)` belgisini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:209
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Technician` list only displays if technicians are assigned to "
"open requests, and individual technicians are only listed, if they are "
"listed as :guilabel:`Responsible` on at least **one** maintenance request "
"form."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Technician` ro'yxati faqat texniklar ochiq so'rovlarga "
"tayinlangan bo'lsa ko'rsatiladi va alohida texniklar faqat kamida **bitta** "
"texnik xizmat so'rovi formasida :guilabel:`Responsible` sifatida "
"ko'rsatilgan bo'lsa, ro'yxatga kiritiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:214
msgid "Kanban view"
msgstr "Kanban ko'rinishi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:216
msgid ""
"With the :guilabel:`Kanban` view, all open maintenance requests are "
"displayed in Kanban-style columns, in their respective stages of the "
"maintenance process."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kanban` ko'rinishida barcha ochiq texnik xizmat so'rovlari texnik "
"xizmat jarayonining tegishli bosqichlarida, Kanban uslubidagi ustunlarda "
"ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:219
msgid ""
"Each maintenance request appears on its own task card, and each task card "
"can be dragged-and-dropped to a different stage of the Kanban pipeline."
msgstr ""
"Har bir texnik xizmat so'rovi o'zining alohida vazifa kartochkasida "
"ko'rsatiladi va har bir vazifa kartochkasini Kanban konveyerining boshqa "
"bosqichiga sudrab olib o'tish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:222
msgid ""
"Each column has a name (i.e. :guilabel:`In Progress`). Hovering at the top "
"of a column reveals a :guilabel:`⚙️ (gear)` icon. Clicking the :guilabel:`⚙️ "
"(gear)` icon reveals a list of options for that "
"column: :guilabel:`Fold`, :guilabel:`Edit`, :guilabel:`Automations`, "
"and :guilabel:`Delete`."
msgstr ""
"Har bir ustunning nomi bor (masalan, :guilabel:`In Progress`). Ustunning "
"yuqori qismiga kursorni olib borganda :guilabel:`⚙️ (gear)` belgisi paydo "
"bo'ladi. :guilabel:`⚙️ (gear)` belgisini bosish ushbu ustun uchun parametrlar "
"ro'yxatini "
"ochadi: :guilabel:`Fold`, :guilabel:`Edit`, :guilabel:`Automations` "
"va :guilabel:`Delete`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:None
msgid "Column options for stage in Kanban view."
msgstr "Kanban ko'rinishidagi bosqich uchun ustun parametrlari."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:230
msgid "Clicking :guilabel:`Fold` folds the column to hide its contents."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Fold` tugmasini bosish ustunni yig'ib, uning tarkibini yashiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:232
msgid ""
"Clicking :guilabel:`Edit` opens an :guilabel:`Edit: (stage name)` pop-up "
"window, with the corresponding stage name, wherein the column's details can "
"be edited. The following are the column options that can be edited:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Edit` tugmasini bosish tegishli bosqich nomi "
"bilan :guilabel:`Edit: (stage name)` qalqib chiquvchi oynasini ochadi, unda "
"ustun tafsilotlarini tahrirlash mumkin. Quyidagilar tahrirlash mumkin "
"bo'lgan ustun parametrlaridir:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:None
msgid "Edit In Progress pop-up window."
msgstr "Edit In Progress qalqib chiquvchi oynasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:240
msgid ":guilabel:`Name`: the name of the stage in the Kanban pipeline."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Name`: Kanban konveyeridagi bosqichning nomi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:241
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Folded in Maintenance Pipe`: when checked, this stage's column is "
"folded by default in the :guilabel:`Kanban` view type."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Folded in Maintenance Pipe`: belgilanganda, ushbu bosqich "
"ustuni :guilabel:`Kanban` ko'rinish turida standart holatda yig'ilgan "
"bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:243
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Request Confirmed`: when this box is not ticked, and the "
"maintenance request type is set to *Work Center*, no leave is created for "
"the respective work center when a maintenance request is created. If the box "
"*is* ticked, the work center is automatically blocked for the listed "
"duration, either at the specified date, or as soon as possible, if the work "
"center is unavailable."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Request Confirmed`: ushbu katakcha belgilanmagan va texnik xizmat "
"so'rovi turi *Work Center* qilib o'rnatilgan bo'lsa, texnik xizmat so'rovi "
"yaratilganda tegishli ish markazi uchun ta'til yaratilmaydi. Agar katakcha "
"belgilangan *bo'lsa*, ish markazi ko'rsatilgan muddat davomida avtomatik "
"ravishda bloklanadi — belgilangan sanada yoki, agar ish markazi band bo'lsa, "
"imkon qadar tezroq."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:248
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sequence`: the order in the maintenance process, in which this "
"stage appears."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Sequence`: texnik xizmat jarayonida ushbu bosqich paydo "
"bo'ladigan tartib."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:249
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Request Done`: if ticked, this box indicates this stage is the "
"final step of the maintenance process. Requests moved to this stage are "
"closed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Request Done`: belgilangan bo'lsa, ushbu katakcha bu bosqich "
"texnik xizmat jarayonining yakuniy qadami ekanligini bildiradi. Ushbu "
"bosqichga ko'chirilgan so'rovlar yopiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:252
msgid ""
"Once ready, click :guilabel:`Save & Close`. If no changes have been made, "
"click :guilabel:`Discard`, or click the :guilabel:`X` icon to close the pop-"
"up window."
msgstr ""
"Tayyor bo'lgach, :guilabel:`Save & Close` tugmasini bosing. Agar hech qanday "
"o'zgartirish kiritilmagan bo'lsa, :guilabel:`Discard` tugmasini bosing yoki "
"qalqib chiquvchi oynani yopish uchun :guilabel:`X` belgisini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:256
msgid "List view"
msgstr "Ro'yxat ko'rinishi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:258
msgid ""
"With the :guilabel:`List` view selected, all open maintenance requests are "
"displayed in a list, with information about each request listed in its "
"respective row."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`List` ko'rinishi tanlanganda, barcha ochiq texnik xizmat "
"so'rovlari ro'yxatda ko'rsatiladi va har bir so'rov haqidagi ma'lumotlar "
"tegishli qatorda keltiriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:261
msgid ""
"The columns of information displayed in this view type are the following:"
msgstr ""
"Ushbu ko'rinish turida ko'rsatiladigan ma'lumot ustunlari quyidagilardir:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:263
msgid ":guilabel:`Subjects`: the name assigned to the maintenance request."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Subjects`: texnik xizmat so'roviga berilgan nom."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:264
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employee`: the employee who originally created the maintenance "
"request."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Employee`: texnik xizmat so'rovini dastlab yaratgan xodim."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:265
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Technician`: the technician responsible for the maintenance "
"request."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Technician`: texnik xizmat so'rovi uchun mas'ul texnik."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:266
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Category`: the category the equipment being repaired belongs to."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Category`: ta'mirlanayotgan uskuna tegishli bo'lgan kategoriya."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:267
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Stage`: the stage of the maintenance process the request is "
"currently in."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Stage`: so'rov hozirda joylashgan texnik xizmat jarayoni bosqichi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:268
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: if in a multi-company environment, the company in the "
"database the request is assigned to."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Company`: ko'p kompaniyali muhitda bo'lsa, so'rov tayinlangan "
"ma'lumotlar bazasidagi kompaniya."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:272
msgid "Pivot view"
msgstr "Pivot ko'rinishi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:274
msgid ""
"With the :guilabel:`Pivot` view selected, maintenance requests are displayed "
"in a pivot table, and can be customized to show different data metrics."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Pivot` ko'rinishi tanlanganda, texnik xizmat so'rovlari yig'ma "
"jadvalda ko'rsatiladi va turli ma'lumot ko'rsatkichlarini ko'rsatish uchun "
"moslashtirilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:277
msgid ""
"To add more data to the pivot table, click the :guilabel:`Measures` button "
"to reveal a drop-down menu. By default, :guilabel:`Count` is selected. "
"Additional options to add to the table are :guilabel:`Additional Leaves to "
"Plan Ahead`, :guilabel:`Duration`, and :guilabel:`Repeat Every`."
msgstr ""
"Yig'ma jadvalga ko'proq ma'lumot qo'shish uchun ochiluvchi menyuni ochish "
"maqsadida :guilabel:`Measures` tugmasini bosing. Standart "
"holatda :guilabel:`Count` tanlangan. Jadvalga qo'shish mumkin bo'lgan "
"qo'shimcha parametrlar: :guilabel:`Additional Leaves to Plan "
"Ahead`, :guilabel:`Duration` va :guilabel:`Repeat Every`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:None
msgid "Measures options on Pivot view page."
msgstr "Pivot ko'rinishi sahifasidagi Measures parametrlari."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:285
msgid ""
"To the right of the :guilabel:`Measures` button is the :guilabel:`Insert in "
"Spreadsheet` button. Clicking this button opens a pop-up window "
"titled :guilabel:`Select a spreadsheet to insert your pivot.`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Measures` tugmasining o'ng tomonida :guilabel:`Insert in "
"Spreadsheet` tugmasi joylashgan. Ushbu tugmani bosish :guilabel:`Select a "
"spreadsheet to insert your pivot.` sarlavhali qalqib chiquvchi oynani ochadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:289
msgid ""
"There are two tabs in this pop-up window: :guilabel:`Spreadsheets` "
"and :guilabel:`Dashboards`. Click into one of these tabs, and select a "
"spreadsheet or dashboard in the database to add this pivot table to. Once "
"ready, click :guilabel:`Confirm`. If this table shouldn't be added to a "
"spreadsheet or dashboard, click :guilabel:`Cancel`, or click "
"the :guilabel:`X` icon to close the pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu qalqib chiquvchi oynada ikkita varaq mavjud: :guilabel:`Spreadsheets` "
"va :guilabel:`Dashboards`. Ushbu varaqlardan biriga o'ting va ushbu yig'ma "
"jadvalni qo'shish uchun ma'lumotlar bazasidagi elektron jadval yoki "
"boshqaruv panelini tanlang. Tayyor bo'lgach, :guilabel:`Confirm` tugmasini "
"bosing. Agar ushbu jadvalni elektron jadval yoki boshqaruv paneliga qo'shish "
"kerak bo'lmasa, :guilabel:`Cancel` tugmasini bosing yoki qalqib chiquvchi "
"oynani yopish uchun :guilabel:`X` belgisini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:294
msgid ""
"To the right of the :guilabel:`Insert in Spreadsheet` button are three "
"buttons:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Insert in Spreadsheet` tugmasining o'ng tomonida uchta tugma "
"joylashgan:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:296
msgid ":guilabel:`Flip axis`: the x and y axis of the pivot data table flip."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Flip axis`: yig'ma ma'lumotlar jadvalining x va y o'qlari "
"almashadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:297
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expand all`: all the available rows and columns of the pivot data "
"table expand fully."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Expand all`: yig'ma ma'lumotlar jadvalining barcha mavjud "
"qatorlari va ustunlari to'liq yoyiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:298
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Download xlsx`: the pivot data table is downloaded as an .xlsx "
"file."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Download xlsx`: yig'ma ma'lumotlar jadvali .xlsx fayl sifatida "
"yuklab olinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:301
msgid "Graph view"
msgstr "Grafik ko'rinishi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:303
msgid ""
"With the graph view selected, the following options appear between the "
"search bar and visual representation of the data. These graph-specific "
"options are located to the right of the :guilabel:`Measures` "
"and :guilabel:`Insert in Spreadsheet` buttons."
msgstr ""
"Grafik ko'rinishi tanlanganda, qidiruv paneli va ma'lumotlarning vizual "
"tasviri orasida quyidagi parametrlar paydo bo'ladi. Ushbu grafikka xos "
"parametrlar :guilabel:`Measures` va :guilabel:`Insert in Spreadsheet` "
"tugmalarining o'ng tomonida joylashgan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:None
msgid "Graph type icons on Graph view page."
msgstr "Grafik ko'rinishi sahifasidagi grafik turi belgilari."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:311
msgid ""
"There are three different types of graphs available to users to view the "
"data:"
msgstr ""
"Foydalanuvchilar ma'lumotlarni ko'rishlari uchun uch xil turdagi grafiklar "
"mavjud:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:313
msgid ":guilabel:`Bar Chart`: the data is displayed in a bar chart."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Bar Chart`: ma'lumotlar ustunli diagrammada ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:314
msgid ":guilabel:`Line Chart`: the data is displayed in a line chart."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Line Chart`: ma'lumotlar chiziqli diagrammada ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:315
msgid ":guilabel:`Pie Chart`: the data is displayed in a pie chart."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Pie Chart`: ma'lumotlar doiraviy diagrammada ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:317
msgid ""
"When viewing the data as a :guilabel:`Bar Chart` graph, the data can be "
"formatted in the following ways:"
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlarni :guilabel:`Bar Chart` grafigi sifatida ko'rishda, "
"ma'lumotlarni quyidagi usullarda formatlash mumkin:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:320
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:327
msgid ":guilabel:`Stacked`: the data is stacked on the graph."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Stacked`: ma'lumotlar grafikda ustma-ust joylashtiriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:321
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:329
msgid ":guilabel:`Descending`: the data is displayed in descending order."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Descending`: ma'lumotlar kamayish tartibida ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:322
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:330
msgid ":guilabel:`Ascending`: the data is displayed in ascending order."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Ascending`: ma'lumotlar o'sish tartibida ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:324
msgid ""
"When viewing the data as a :guilabel:`Line Chart` graph, the data can be "
"formatted in the following ways:"
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlarni :guilabel:`Line Chart` grafigi sifatida ko'rishda, "
"ma'lumotlarni quyidagi usullarda formatlash mumkin:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:328
msgid ":guilabel:`Cumulative`: the data is increasingly accumulated."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Cumulative`: ma'lumotlar ortib boruvchi tarzda yig'iladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:332
msgid ""
"When viewing the data as a :guilabel:`Pie Chart` graph, all relevant data is "
"displayed by default, and no additional formatting options are available."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlarni :guilabel:`Pie Chart` grafigi sifatida ko'rishda, barcha "
"tegishli ma'lumotlar standart holatda ko'rsatiladi va qo'shimcha formatlash "
"parametrlari mavjud emas."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:336
msgid "Activity view"
msgstr "Faoliyat ko'rinishi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:338
msgid ""
"With the :guilabel:`Activity` view selected, all open maintenance requests "
"are listed in their own row, with the ability to schedule activities related "
"to those requests."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Activity` ko'rinishi tanlanganda, barcha ochiq texnik xizmat "
"so'rovlari alohida qatorda ro'yxatlanadi va ushbu so'rovlarga oid "
"faoliyatlarni rejalashtirish imkoniyati mavjud bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:None
msgid "Maintenance requests on Activity view."
msgstr "Faoliyat ko'rinishidagi texnik xizmat so'rovlari."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:345
msgid ""
"Maintenance requests are listed in the :guilabel:`Maintenance Request` "
"column as activities. Clicking a request opens a :guilabel:`Maintenance "
"Request` popover that indicates the status of the request, and the "
"responsible technician. To schedule an activity directly from the popover, "
"click :guilabel:`➕ Schedule an activity`. This opens a :guilabel:`Schedule "
"Activity` pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"Texnik xizmat so'rovlari :guilabel:`Maintenance Request` ustunida "
"faoliyatlar sifatida ro'yxatlanadi. So'rovni bosish so'rovning holati va "
"mas'ul texnikni ko'rsatuvchi :guilabel:`Maintenance Request` qalqib "
"chiquvchi oynachasini ochadi. Faoliyatni to'g'ridan-to'g'ri ushbu oynachadan "
"rejalashtirish uchun :guilabel:`➕ Schedule an activity` tugmasini bosing. "
"Bu :guilabel:`Schedule Activity` qalqib chiquvchi oynasini ochadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:350
msgid ""
"From the pop-up window, choose the :guilabel:`Activity Type`, provide "
"a :guilabel:`Summary`, schedule a :guilabel:`Due Date`, and choose the "
"responsible user in the :guilabel:`Assigned to` field."
msgstr ""
"Qalqib chiquvchi oynada :guilabel:`Activity Type` ni "
"tanlang, :guilabel:`Summary` kiriting, :guilabel:`Due Date` ni "
"rejalashtiring va :guilabel:`Assigned to` maydonida mas'ul foydalanuvchini "
"tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:None
msgid "Schedule Activity pop-up window."
msgstr "Schedule Activity qalqib chiquvchi oynasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:358
msgid ""
"Type any additional notes for the new activity in the blank space under the "
"greyed-out :guilabel:`Log a note...` field. When clicked, this changes "
"to :guilabel:`Type \"/\" for commands`."
msgstr ""
"Yangi faoliyat uchun qo'shimcha izohlarni kulrang "
"ko'rinishdagi :guilabel:`Log a note...` maydoni ostidagi bo'sh joyga "
"kiriting. Bosilganda, u :guilabel:`Type \"/\" for commands` ga o'zgaradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:361
msgid ""
"Once ready, click :guilabel:`Schedule` to schedule the activity. "
"Alternatively, click :guilabel:`Schedule & Mark as Done` to close the "
"activity, click :guilabel:`Done & Schedule Next` to close the activity and "
"open a new one, or click :guilabel:`Cancel` to cancel the activity."
msgstr ""
"Tayyor bo'lgach, faoliyatni rejalashtirish uchun :guilabel:`Schedule` "
"tugmasini bosing. Shuningdek, faoliyatni yopish uchun :guilabel:`Schedule & "
"Mark as Done` tugmasini, faoliyatni yopib yangisini ochish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Done & Schedule Next` tugmasini yoki faoliyatni bekor "
"qilish uchun :guilabel:`Cancel` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:365
msgid ""
"With the :guilabel:`Activity` view selected, each activity type available "
"when scheduling an activity is listed as its own column. These columns "
"are :guilabel:`Email`, :guilabel:`Call`, :guilabel:`Meeting`, :guilabel:`Maintenance "
"Request`, :guilabel:`To-Do`, :guilabel:`Upload Document`, :guilabel:`Request "
"Signature`, and :guilabel:`Grant Approval`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Activity` ko'rinishi tanlangan holatda, faoliyatni "
"rejalashtirishda mavjud bo'lgan har bir faoliyat turi alohida ustun sifatida "
"ko'rsatiladi. Bu ustunlar "
"quyidagilardir: :guilabel:`Email`, :guilabel:`Call`, :guilabel:`Meeting`, :guilabel:`Maintenance "
"Request`, :guilabel:`To-Do`, :guilabel:`Upload Document`, :guilabel:`Request "
"Signature` va :guilabel:`Grant Approval`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:370
msgid ""
"To schedule an activity with that specific activity type, click into any "
"blank box on the corresponding row for the desired maintenance request, and "
"click the :guilabel:`➕ (plus)` icon. This opens an :guilabel:`Odoo` pop-up "
"window, wherein the activity can be scheduled."
msgstr ""
"Aynan shu faoliyat turi bilan faoliyat rejalashtirish uchun kerakli texnik "
"xizmat so'roviga tegishli qatordagi istalgan bo'sh katakchani bosing va "
"keyin :guilabel:`➕ (plus)` belgisini bosing. Bu :guilabel:`Odoo` qalqib "
"chiquvchi oynasini ochadi, unda faoliyatni rejalashtirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/maintenance_calendar.rst:None
msgid "Odoo pop-up schedule activity window."
msgstr "Odoo faoliyat rejalashtirish qalqib chiquvchi oynasi."

