msgstr ""
"Ushbu formada :guilabel:`Components` varag'i ostida tanlangan variant uchun "
"tegishli komponentlar ro'yxati keltirilgan. Va variantga qarab turli "
"komponentlar ro'yxatda ko'rsatiladi. Har qanday majburiy yoki "
"ixtiyoriy :guilabel:`Operation` bosqichlarini ko'rish uchun :guilabel:`Work "
"Orders` varag'ini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/product_variants.rst:174
msgid ""
"To enter the tablet view work order screen, click the :guilabel:`tablet "
"icon` to the right of the row for the desired operation to be completed."
msgstr ""
"Planshet ko'rinishidagi ish buyurtmasi ekraniga kirish uchun bajarilishi "
"kerak bo'lgan operatsiya qatorining o'ng tomonidagi :guilabel:`tablet icon` "
"belgisini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/product_variants.rst:177
msgid ""
"From the tablet view, click :guilabel:`Mark as Done` as the operation "
"progresses to complete the operation steps."
msgstr ""
"Planshet ko'rinishidan operatsiya bosqichlarini yakunlash uchun operatsiya "
"davomida :guilabel:`Mark as Done` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/product_variants.rst:180
msgid ""
"Alternatively, click the :guilabel:`Mark as Done` button at the top of the "
"manufacturing order form to complete the order."
msgstr ""
"Yoki buyurtmani yakunlash uchun ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasi formasi "
"yuqorisidagi :guilabel:`Mark as Done` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/product_variants.rst:None
msgid "Manufacturing order for variant of BoM product."
msgstr "BoM mahsuloti varianti uchun ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/product_variants.rst:187
msgid ""
"Then, navigate back to the :abbr:`SO (sales order)` via the breadcrumbs at "
"the top of the page."
msgstr ""
"So'ngra, sahifa yuqorisidagi navigatsiya yo'li (breadcrumbs) "
"orqali :abbr:`SO (sales order)` ga qayting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/product_variants.rst:189
msgid ""
"Now that the product has been manufactured, click the :guilabel:`Delivery` "
"smart button to deliver the product to the customer. From "
"the :guilabel:`Delivery Order` form, click :guilabel:`Validate`, then "
"click :guilabel:`Apply` to deliver the product."
msgstr ""
"Endi mahsulot ishlab chiqarilgach, mahsulotni mijozga yetkazib berish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Delivery` smart tugmasini bosing. :guilabel:`Delivery "
"Order` formasidan :guilabel:`Validate` tugmasini bosing, so'ngra mahsulotni "
"yetkazib berish uchun :guilabel:`Apply` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/product_variants.rst:193
msgid ""
"To finish the sale, click back to the :abbr:`SO (sales order)` via "
"the :guilabel:`breadcrumbs` at the top of the page again. Then, "
"click :guilabel:`Create Invoice` followed by :guilabel:`Create Invoice` "
"again to invoice the customer for the order."
msgstr ""
"Sotuvni yakunlash uchun yana sahifa yuqorisidagi :guilabel:`breadcrumbs` "
"orqali :abbr:`SO (sales order)` ga qayting. So'ngra, buyurtma uchun mijozga "
"hisob-faktura yozish uchun :guilabel:`Create Invoice` tugmasini, keyin "
"yana :guilabel:`Create Invoice` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:3
msgid "Multilevel BoMs"
msgstr "Ko'p darajali BoM lar"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:9
msgid ""
"Use a multilevel bill of materials (BoM) when a manufactured product is part "
"of another assembly. This method nests |BOMs| within other |BOMs|, "
"organizing complex products while simplifying manufacturing by defining each "
"procurement and production step separately."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarilgan mahsulot boshqa yig'maning bir qismi bo'lganida ko'p "
"darajali materiallar ro'yxati (BoM) dan foydalaning. Bu usul |BOMs| larni "
"boshqa |BOMs| lar ichiga joylashtiradi, murakkab mahsulotlarni tartibga "
"solib, har bir ta'minot va ishlab chiqarish bosqichini alohida aniqlash "
"orqali ishlab chiqarishni soddalashtiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:13
msgid ""
"Sublevel |BOMs| (subassemblies or semifinished products) streamline these "
"production workflows, and are beneficial when the subassembly is used across "
"multiple finished products (meaning they'd appear on multiple top-level |"
"BOMs|). The more complicated a product is to build or procure, the more "
"value a multilevel |BOM| can provide. Because of this, component and "
"subassembly replenishment planning is vital to ensuring multilevel |BOMs| "
"run smoothly."
msgstr ""
"Quyi darajali |BOMs| lar (yig'ma qismlar yoki yarim tayyor mahsulotlar) "
"ushbu ishlab chiqarish jarayonlarini soddalashtiradi va yig'ma qism bir "
"nechta tayyor mahsulotlarda ishlatilganda (ya'ni ular bir nechta yuqori "
"darajali |BOMs| larda paydo bo'lganda) foydali hisoblanadi. Mahsulotni "
"yasash yoki ta'minlash qanchalik murakkab bo'lsa, ko'p darajali |BOM| "
"shunchalik ko'p foyda keltirishi mumkin. Shu sababli, komponent va yig'ma "
"qismlarni to'ldirishni rejalashtirish ko'p darajali |BOMs| larning muammosiz "
"ishlashini ta'minlash uchun juda muhimdir."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:20
msgid "Why replenishment planning is important"
msgstr "Nima uchun to'ldirishni rejalashtirish muhim"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:22
msgid ""
":doc:`Replenishment <../../inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment>` is "
"critical for multilevel BoMs to prevent bottlenecks, manage lead times, and "
"optimize inventory. Without it, missing components can halt production, "
"delay orders, and increase costs. A well-planned replenishment strategy "
"ensures :doc:`just-in-time availability <../../inventory/warehouses_storage/"
"replenishment/reordering_rules>`, :doc:`automates procurement <../../"
"inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/reordering_rules>`, balances "
"stock levels, and keeps supply chains efficient. This minimizes delays, "
"reduces manual effort, and ensures smooth manufacturing."
msgstr ""
":doc:`To'ldirish <../../inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment>` ko'p "
"darajali BoM lar uchun to'siqlarning oldini olish, yetkazib berish "
"muddatlarini boshqarish va zaxirani optimallashtirish uchun juda muhimdir. "
"Usiz yetishmayotgan komponentlar ishlab chiqarishni to'xtatishi, "
"buyurtmalarni kechiktirishi va xarajatlarni oshirishi mumkin. Yaxshi "
"rejalashtirilgan to'ldirish strategiyasi :doc:`o'z vaqtida mavjudlikni "
"<../../inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/reordering_rules>` "
"ta'minlaydi, :doc:`ta'minotni avtomatlashtiradi <../../inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/replenishment/reordering_rules>`, zaxira darajalarini "
"muvozanatlaydi va ta'minot zanjirlarini samarali saqlaydi. Bu kechikishlarni "
"minimallashtiradi, qo'l mehnatini kamaytiradi va muammosiz ishlab "
"chiqarishni ta'minlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:31
msgid ""
"Manufacturing orders (MO)s that come from a |BOM| require all components to "
"be available before the |MO| can be completed. The :guilabel:`Component "
"Status` for that |MO| provides this information. Learn how to :doc:`check an "
"MO's component status <../basic_setup/bill_configuration>`."
msgstr ""
"|BOM| dan keladigan ishlab chiqarish buyurtmalari (MO) |MO| yakunlanishidan "
"oldin barcha komponentlarning mavjud bo'lishini talab qiladi. Ushbu |MO| "
"uchun :guilabel:`Component Status` shu ma'lumotni taqdim etadi. :doc:`MO "
"ning komponent holatini tekshirishni <../basic_setup/bill_configuration>` "
"o'rganing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:38
msgid "Create a multilevel BoM"
msgstr "Ko'p darajali BoM yaratish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:40
msgid ""
"To set up a multilevel |BOM|, the top-level product and sublevel products's |"
"BOMs| must be created. If starting from scratch, build the |BOMs| from the "
"bottom up. Start with the lowest-level product |BOMs|, then include those "
"products as components in higher-level |BOMs|."
msgstr ""
"Ko'p darajali |BOM| ni sozlash uchun yuqori darajali mahsulot va quyi "
"darajali mahsulotlarning |BOMs| lari yaratilishi kerak. Agar noldan "
"boshlanayotgan bo'lsa, |BOMs| larni pastdan yuqoriga qarab quring. Eng quyi "
"darajali mahsulot |BOMs| laridan boshlang, so'ngra ushbu mahsulotlarni "
"yuqori darajali |BOMs| larga komponent sifatida kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:45
msgid ""
"A printed circuit board (PCB) for a custom keyboard is composed of hundreds "
"of electronic components, such as transistors, resistors, and capacitors. "
"Instead of listing all of those components out, a sublevel product and |BOM| "
"for a `PCB` is created, to track the quantities of transistors and other "
"small components, without needing to overcrowd the top-level |BOM| for the "
"custom keyboard by listing them. Instead, the custom keyboard's |BOM| "
"consists of an assortment of components and sublevel |BOMs| alike, like key "
"caps, switches, the PCB, and keyboard plate."
msgstr ""
"Maxsus klaviatura uchun bosma plata (PCB) tranzistorlar, rezistorlar va "
"kondensatorlar kabi yuzlab elektron komponentlardan iborat. Ushbu "
"komponentlarning barchasini ro'yxatga kiritish o'rniga, `PCB` uchun quyi "
"darajali mahsulot va |BOM| yaratiladi. Bu tranzistorlar va boshqa mayda "
"komponentlarning miqdorlarini kuzatish imkonini beradi hamda maxsus "
"klaviaturaning yuqori darajali |BOM| ini ularni ro'yxatga kiritib to'ldirib "
"yuborishga hojat qoldirmaydi. Buning o'rniga, maxsus klaviaturaning |BOM| i "
"turli komponentlar va quyi darajali |BOMs| lardan, masalan, tugma "
"qopqoqlari, kalitlar (switch), PCB va klaviatura plitasidan iborat bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:52
msgid ""
":doc:`Learn how to build a simple bill of materials <../basic_setup/"
"bill_configuration>`. For the PCB, this would include the transistors, "
"resistors, and other components."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Oddiy materiallar ro'yxatini qanday tuzishni o'rganing <../basic_setup/"
"bill_configuration>`. PCB uchun bu tranzistorlar, rezistorlar va boshqa "
"komponentlarni o'z ichiga oladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:None
msgid "A bill of materials for a PCB."
msgstr "PCB uchun materiallar ro'yxati."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:58
msgid ""
"After the sublevel products (like the PCB, key caps, and keyboard plate) are "
"fully configured, create the top-level product by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Products --> Products`, and then "
"selecting :guilabel:`New`. From here, configure the product's specifications "
"as needed."
msgstr ""
"Quyi darajali mahsulotlar (PCB, tugma qopqoqlari va klaviatura plitasi kabi) "
"to'liq sozlangandan so'ng, :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Products --"
"> Products` yo'lidan o'tib, so'ngra :guilabel:`New` tugmasini tanlab, yuqori "
"darajali mahsulotni yarating. Bu yerdan mahsulot spetsifikatsiyalarini kerak "
"bo'lganda sozlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:63
msgid ""
"Once the top-level product (the keyboard) is configured, click "
"the :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` smart button on the product form, and then "
"select :guilabel:`New` to make a |BOM| for the top-level product. Add the "
"sublevel products to this |BOM|, along with any other necessary components."
msgstr ""
"Yuqori darajali mahsulot (klaviatura) sozlangach, mahsulot "
"formasidagi :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` smart tugmasini bosing, so'ngra "
"yuqori darajali mahsulot uchun |BOM| yaratish maqsadida :guilabel:`New` ni "
"tanlang. Ushbu |BOM| ga quyi darajali mahsulotlarni va boshqa barcha zarur "
"komponentlarni qo'shing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:None
msgid ""
"A bill of materials for a keyboard, containing a bill of materials for a PCB."
msgstr ""
"PCB uchun materiallar ro'yxatini o'z ichiga olgan klaviatura uchun "
"materiallar ro'yxati."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:71
msgid "Manage production planning"
msgstr "Ishlab chiqarishni rejalashtirishni boshqarish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:73
msgid ""
"The two options below are two of the best ways to manage manufacturing order "
"automation for products with multilevel |BOMs|."
msgstr ""
"Quyidagi ikki variant ko'p darajali |BOMs| ga ega mahsulotlar uchun ishlab "
"chiqarish buyurtmalarini avtomatlashtirishni boshqarishning eng yaxshi "
"usullaridan ikkitasidir."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:77
msgid ""
"Complex |BOMs| are specifically used to manage products that require "
"manufactured components. If a BoM is being created to organize components or "
"bundle sellable products, :doc:`use a kit <kit_shipping>` instead."
msgstr ""
"Murakkab |BOMs| lar maxsus ravishda ishlab chiqarilgan komponentlarni talab "
"qiladigan mahsulotlarni boshqarish uchun ishlatiladi. Agar BoM "
"komponentlarni tartibga solish yoki sotiladigan mahsulotlarni to'plamga "
"birlashtirish uchun yaratilayotgan bo'lsa, buning o'rniga :doc:`komplektdan "
"foydalaning <kit_shipping>`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:81
msgid ""
"To automatically trigger manufacturing orders for sublevel products after "
"confirming a manufacturing order for the main product, there are two options:"
msgstr ""
"Asosiy mahsulot uchun ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasi tasdiqlangandan so'ng quyi "
"darajali mahsulotlar uchun ishlab chiqarish buyurtmalarini avtomatik "
"ravishda ishga tushirish uchun ikkita variant mavjud:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:84
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:153
msgid ""
"**Option 1 (recommended):** Create *Reordering Rules* for the sublevel "
"products and set both the minimum and maximum needed stock quantities to `0`."
msgstr ""
"**1-variant (tavsiya etiladi):** Quyi darajali mahsulotlar uchun *Qayta "
"buyurtma qoidalari* ni yarating va kerakli minimal va maksimal zaxira "
"miqdorlarining ikkalasini ham `0` ga o'rnating."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:86
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:155
msgid ""
"**Option 2:** Activate the :guilabel:`Replenish on Order (MTO)` "
"and :guilabel:`Manufacture` routes under the :guilabel:`Inventory` tab of "
"the sublevel product's product form."
msgstr ""
"**2-variant:** Quyi darajali mahsulotning mahsulot "
"formasidagi :guilabel:`Inventory` varag'i ostidagi :guilabel:`Replenish on "
"Order (MTO)` va :guilabel:`Manufacture` marshrutlarini faollashtiring."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:90
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:159
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/products/reordering.rst:82
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/products/temporary_reordering.rst:27
msgid ""
":doc:`../../inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/reordering_rules`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`../../inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/reordering_rules`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:91
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:160
msgid ":doc:`../../inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:93
msgid ""
"Option 1 is more flexible than Option 2 and is recommended. Reordering rules "
"do not directly link demand to replenishment, allowing stock to be "
"unreserved and reassigned as needed. The Replenish on Order (MTO) route, "
"however, uniquely links sublevel and top-level products, reserving "
"quantities for the confirmed top-level manufacturing order."
msgstr ""
"1-variant 2-variantga qaraganda moslashuvchanroq va tavsiya etiladi. Qayta "
"buyurtma qoidalari talabni to'ldirish bilan bevosita bog'lamaydi, bu esa "
"zaxirani band qilinmagan holda qoldirish va kerak bo'lganda qayta taqsimlash "
"imkonini beradi. Replenish on Order (MTO) marshruti esa quyi darajali va "
"yuqori darajali mahsulotlarni o'zaro bog'lab, tasdiqlangan yuqori darajali "
"ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasi uchun miqdorlarni band qiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:98
msgid ""
"In both methods, sublevel products must be fully manufactured before "
"starting the top-level product."
msgstr ""
"Ikkala usulda ham yuqori darajali mahsulotni boshlashdan oldin quyi darajali "
"mahsulotlar to'liq ishlab chiqarilgan bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:101
msgid "Multilevel BoM setup flow"
msgstr "Ko'p darajali BoM sozlash jarayoni"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:103
msgid ""
"The following section details how to set up multilevel BoMs, set the initial "
"inventory, establish a :ref:`0/0/1 reordering rule <manufacturing/advanced/"
"procurement-method>` (the recommended production plan), configure lead "
"times, and set up production options."
msgstr ""
"Quyidagi bo'limda ko'p darajali BoM larni sozlash, boshlang'ich zaxirani "
"o'rnatish, :ref:`0/0/1 qayta buyurtma qoidasini <manufacturing/advanced/"
"procurement-method>` (tavsiya etilgan ishlab chiqarish rejasi) belgilash, "
"yetkazib berish muddatlarini sozlash va ishlab chiqarish opsiyalarini "
"o'rnatish batafsil bayon etilgan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:107
msgid ""
"Creating a 0/0/1 reordering rule for the sublevel products (minimum stock "
"set at zero, maximum stock set at zero, reorder one automatically) "
"regardless of whether they are a component or subassembly is the recommended "
"approach for managing a multilevel |BOM|. This setup uses the **Inventory**, "
"**Manufacturing**, and **Purchase** apps."
msgstr ""
"Quyi darajali mahsulotlar komponent yoki yig'ma qism bo'lishidan qat'i "
"nazar, ular uchun 0/0/1 qayta buyurtma qoidasini yaratish (minimal zaxira "
"nolga o'rnatilgan, maksimal zaxira nolga o'rnatilgan, avtomatik ravishda "
"bittadan qayta buyurtma qilinadi) ko'p darajali |BOM| ni boshqarishning "
"tavsiya etilgan yondashuvidir. Ushbu sozlash **Inventory**, "
"**Manufacturing** va **Purchase** ilovalaridan foydalanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:113
msgid ""
"This is only one example of how to set up a multilevel |BOM| in Odoo. "
"Consider any unique circumstances that need to be addressed during the "
"configuration, and make sure they are included in the setup. If any specific "
"help is needed during setup, consider purchasing a `success pack <https://"
"www.odoo.com/pricing-packs>`_."
msgstr ""
"Bu Odoo da ko'p darajali |BOM| ni sozlashning faqat bitta misolidir. Sozlash "
"jarayonida hal qilinishi kerak bo'lgan har qanday o'ziga xos holatlarni "
"hisobga oling va ularning sozlashga kiritilganligiga ishonch hosil qiling. "
"Agar sozlash paytida biror aniq yordam kerak bo'lsa, `success pack <https://"
"www.odoo.com/pricing-packs>`_ sotib olishni ko'rib chiqing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:119
msgid "Create the BoMs"
msgstr "BoM larni yaratish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:121
msgid ""
"Follow the steps in the :ref:`Create a multilevel BoM <manufactuing/advanced/"
"create-multilevel-bom>` section to build the |BOMs|."
msgstr ""
"|BOMs| larni qurish uchun :ref:`Ko'p darajali BoM yaratish <manufactuing/"
"advanced/create-multilevel-bom>` bo'limidagi qadamlarni bajaring."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:124
msgid ""
"Make sure to build the multilevel |BOM| from the bottom up. Start by "
"creating the lowest-level component products in Odoo, then the subassembly "
"products that those are used for, then the |BOM| for that subassembly, and "
"repeat until every level of the multilevel |BOM| is created."
msgstr ""
"Ko'p darajali |BOM| ni pastdan yuqoriga qarab qurishga ishonch hosil qiling. "
"Odoo da eng quyi darajali komponent mahsulotlarini yaratishdan boshlang, "
"so'ngra ular ishlatiladigan yig'ma qism mahsulotlarini, keyin ushbu yig'ma "
"qism uchun |BOM| ni yarating va ko'p darajali |BOM| ning har bir darajasi "
"yaratilgunga qadar takrorlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:129
msgid "Set the initial inventory"
msgstr "Boshlang'ich zaxirani o'rnatish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:132
msgid ""
"If there's no initial inventory to configure, then skip this section and "
"begin configuring the procurement method for the multilevel |BOM|."
msgstr ""
"Agar sozlanadigan boshlang'ich zaxira bo'lmasa, bu bo'limni o'tkazib "
"yuboring va ko'p darajali |BOM| uchun ta'minot usulini sozlashni boshlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:135
msgid ""
"Update the quantity on hand for each of the products configured in the prior "
"step (both components, subassemblies, and the final product). To do this, "
"open the **Inventory** app, and then find the products with filters, the "
"search bar, or scrolling, and then click on them to open their product form. "
"From here, click the :guilabel:`On Hand` smart button, :doc:`select the "
"variant <../../../sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants>` if that "
"was configured, and then enter the quantity on hand."
msgstr ""
"Oldingi bosqichda sozlangan har bir mahsulot (komponentlar, quyi yig'ilmalar "
"va yakuniy mahsulot) uchun mavjud miqdorni yangilang. Buning uchun "
"**Inventory** ilovasini oching, so'ngra mahsulotlarni filtrlar, qidiruv "
"paneli yoki varaqlash orqali toping va ularning mahsulot formasini ochish "
"uchun ustiga bosing. Bu yerdan :guilabel:`On Hand` aqlli tugmasini bosing, "
"agar sozlangan bo'lsa, :doc:`variantni tanlang <../../../sales/sales/"
"products_prices/products/variants>`, so'ngra mavjud miqdorni kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:148
msgid "Configure the procurement method"
msgstr "Ta'minot usulini sozlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:150
msgid ""
"Now it is time to pick the procurement method this multilevel |BOM| uses. "
"The two options below are preferred, but unique circumstances may lead to "
"another procurement method making more sense."
msgstr ""
"Endi ushbu ko'p darajali |BOM| foydalanadigan ta'minot usulini tanlash vaqti "
"keldi. Quyidagi ikkita variant afzal ko'riladi, biroq o'ziga xos "
"vaziyatlarda boshqa ta'minot usuli mantiqiyroq bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:162
msgid ""
"Reordering rules are recommended because they do not tie the manufactured "
"product to a specific sales order, allowing that manufactured product to "
"fulfill a different sales order if the original gets cancelled."
msgstr ""
"Qayta buyurtma qoidalari tavsiya etiladi, chunki ular ishlab chiqarilgan "
"mahsulotni muayyan sotuv buyurtmasiga bog'lamaydi va asl buyurtma bekor "
"qilingan taqdirda, ushbu ishlab chiqarilgan mahsulot boshqa sotuv "
"buyurtmasini bajarish uchun ishlatilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:166
msgid ""
"Making the product to order is not recommended because the manufactured "
"product cannot be used to fulfill another sales order. However, this could "
"be helpful if strict tracking is necessary for the business."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulotni buyurtma asosida ishlab chiqarish tavsiya etilmaydi, chunki "
"ishlab chiqarilgan mahsulotni boshqa sotuv buyurtmasini bajarish uchun "
"ishlatib bo'lmaydi. Biroq, agar biznes uchun qat'iy kuzatuv zarur bo'lsa, bu "
"foydali bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:171
msgid "Enter vendor and manufacturing lead times"
msgstr "Yetkazib beruvchi va ishlab chiqarish yetkazish muddatlarini kiritish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:173
msgid ""
"Vendor and manufacturing lead times are used by Odoo to coordinate "
"production and procurement actions to fulfill orders on time. Set vendor "
"lead times for components that are purchased. These can appear at any level "
"in a multilevel |BOM| except the final product. Set manufacturing lead times "
"for products that are built using a |BOM|. These can appear at any level in "
"a multilevel |BOM| except the lowest level (when individual components are "
"procured)."
msgstr ""
"Yetkazib beruvchi va ishlab chiqarish yetkazish muddatlari Odoo tomonidan "
"buyurtmalarni o'z vaqtida bajarish uchun ishlab chiqarish va ta'minot "
"harakatlarini muvofiqlashtirishda ishlatiladi. Sotib olinadigan komponentlar "
"uchun yetkazib beruvchi muddatlarini o'rnating. Ular ko'p darajali |BOM| "
"ning yakuniy mahsulotdan tashqari istalgan darajasida uchrashi mumkin. |BOM| "
"yordamida yig'iladigan mahsulotlar uchun ishlab chiqarish muddatlarini "
"o'rnating. Ular ko'p darajali |BOM| ning eng quyi darajasidan (alohida "
"komponentlar ta'minlanadigan holat) tashqari istalgan darajasida uchrashi "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:180
msgid ":doc:`../../inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:183
msgid "Build out operations to handle the production flow"
msgstr "Ishlab chiqarish oqimini boshqarish uchun operatsiyalarni tuzish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:185
msgid ""
"First, determine the current manufacturing flow for the business, then match "
"the corresponding Odoo setup. The list below are only some of the "
"configuration pieces that could be involved in this step."
msgstr ""
"Avval biznes uchun joriy ishlab chiqarish oqimini aniqlang, so'ngra unga mos "
"Odoo sozlamasini moslashtiring. Quyidagi ro'yxat ushbu bosqichda ishtirok "
"etishi mumkin bo'lgan sozlash qismlarining faqat bir qismidir."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:188
msgid ""
"**Manufacturing Steps**: Consider how many manufacturing steps are taken "
"(one-, two-, or three-step manufacturing)."
msgstr ""
"**Manufacturing Steps**: Nechta ishlab chiqarish bosqichi bajarilishini "
"ko'rib chiqing (bir, ikki yoki uch bosqichli ishlab chiqarish)."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:190
msgid ""
"**Work Centers**: Decide if any :doc:`work centers <using_work_centers>` "
"need to be configured."
msgstr ""
"**Work Centers**: Birorta :doc:`ish markazlari <using_work_centers>` "
"sozlanishi kerakligini hal qiling."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:191
msgid ""
"**Master Production Schedule**: If manually planned manufacturing orders are "
"needed (e.g., to handle seasonal demand), make a :doc:`master production "
"schedule <../workflows/use_mps>` (MPS)."
msgstr ""
"**Master Production Schedule**: Agar qo'lda rejalashtirilgan ishlab "
"chiqarish buyurtmalari zarur bo'lsa (masalan, mavsumiy talabni qondirish "
"uchun), :doc:`asosiy ishlab chiqarish jadvali <../workflows/use_mps>` (MPS) "
"tuzing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:195
msgid ""
"Manufacturing operations is an art and a science, so configuring an "
"established flow into Odoo is the recommended approach for this step. Read "
"more about :doc:`manufacturing in Odoo <../../manufacturing>`"
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish operatsiyalari ham san'at, ham fandir, shuning uchun ushbu "
"bosqichda o'rnatilgan oqimni Odoo ga sozlash tavsiya etiladigan yondashuv "
"hisoblanadi. :doc:`Odoo da ishlab chiqarish <../../manufacturing>` haqida "
"batafsil o'qing"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:200
msgid "Configuration summary"
msgstr "Sozlash xulosasi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:202
msgid ""
"At the end of this process, the multilevel |BOM| is configured, and the top-"
"level product has its inventory counts, procurement method set, procurement "
"lead times, and manufacturing operations configured. From here, sales orders "
"can include the top-level product, automatic procurement through vendors or "
"manufacturing can begin, the top-level product can be included in an "
"**eCommerce** store."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu jarayon oxirida ko'p darajali |BOM| sozlangan bo'ladi va yuqori "
"darajadagi mahsulotning zaxira hisoblari, ta'minot usuli, ta'minot yetkazish "
"muddatlari va ishlab chiqarish operatsiyalari sozlangan bo'ladi. Bundan "
"keyin sotuv buyurtmalari yuqori darajadagi mahsulotni o'z ichiga olishi, "
"yetkazib beruvchilar orqali avtomatik ta'minot yoki ishlab chiqarish "
"boshlanishi, yuqori darajadagi mahsulot **eCommerce** do'koniga kiritilishi "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:209
msgid ":doc:`../../../websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../../websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:5
msgid ""
"*Work centers* are where **Manufacturing** work orders are processed, and "
"can be used to track costs, make schedules, plan capacity, organize "
"equipment, and track efficiency. Specifying a work center is required when a "
"work order is defined in the *Operations* tab of a bill of materials (BoM) "
"for a product."
msgstr ""
"*Ish markazlari* — bu **Manufacturing** ish buyurtmalari qayta ishlanadigan "
"joylar bo'lib, ulardan xarajatlarni kuzatish, jadvallar tuzish, quvvatni "
"rejalashtirish, uskunalarni tartibga solish va samaradorlikni kuzatish uchun "
"foydalanish mumkin. Mahsulot uchun materiallar ro'yxati (BoM) ning "
"*Operations* varag'ida ish buyurtmasi belgilanganda, ish markazini "
"ko'rsatish talab qilinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:11
msgid ""
"Work centers only appear if the :guilabel:`Work Orders` setting is enabled. "
"To do so, navigate to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --"
"> Settings`, then tick the :guilabel:`Work Orders` checkbox. Work orders can "
"be managed in the :guilabel:`Manufacturing` app by "
"selecting :menuselection:`Operations --> Work Orders`."
msgstr ""
"Ish markazlari faqat :guilabel:`Work Orders` sozlamasi yoqilgan bo'lsa "
"ko'rinadi. Buning uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration "
"--> Settings` yo'lidan o'ting, so'ngra :guilabel:`Work Orders` katagiga "
"belgi qo'ying. Ish buyurtmalarini :guilabel:`Manufacturing` "
"ilovasida :menuselection:`Operations --> Work Orders` ni tanlash orqali "
"boshqarish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:17
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:55
msgid ":doc:`../basic_setup/bill_configuration`"
msgstr ":doc:`../basic_setup/bill_configuration`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:20
msgid "Work center configuration"
msgstr "Ish markazini sozlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:25
msgid "Create a new work center"
msgstr "Yangi ish markazini yaratish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:27
msgid ""
"In the **Manufacturing** app, select :menuselection:`Configuration --> Work "
"Centers` and click the :guilabel:`New` button to open a new work center form."
msgstr ""
"**Manufacturing** ilovasida :menuselection:`Configuration --> Work Centers` "
"ni tanlang va yangi ish markazi formasini ochish uchun :guilabel:`New` "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:None
msgid "An example of a fully configured work center form."
msgstr "To'liq sozlangan ish markazi formasiga misol."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:33
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Work Center Name`: the label for the work center used to select "
"it on a work order or on the reporting dashboards"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Work Center Name`: ish buyurtmasida yoki hisobot boshqaruv "
"panellarida ish markazini tanlash uchun ishlatiladigan yorliq"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tag`: reusable labels that can be used to sort work centers in "
"list view"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tag`: ro'yxat ko'rinishida ish markazlarini saralash uchun "
"ishlatilishi mumkin bo'lgan qayta foydalaniladigan yorliqlar"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:36
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Alternative Workcenters`: where a work order should be carried "
"out if this work center is not available"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Alternative Workcenters`: agar ushbu ish markazi mavjud bo'lmasa, "
"ish buyurtmasi bajarilishi kerak bo'lgan joy"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:38
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Code`: reference id for the work center that is displayed in the "
"list view"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Code`: ro'yxat ko'rinishida ko'rsatiladigan ish markazining mos "
"yozuvlar identifikatori"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:39
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Working Hours`: the hours that work center can be used during the "
"week"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Working Hours`: hafta davomida ish markazidan foydalanish mumkin "
"bo'lgan soatlar"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:44
msgid "Working hours"
msgstr "Ish soatlari"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:46
msgid ""
"*Working hours* define when a work center should operate, based on a one- or "
"two-week schedule. These hours also form the basis for calculating *overall "
"equipment efficiency* (OEE)."
msgstr ""
"*Ish soatlari* bir yoki ikki haftalik jadval asosida ish markazi qachon "
"ishlashi kerakligini belgilaydi. Bu soatlar shuningdek *uskunaning umumiy "
"samaradorligi* (OEE) ni hisoblash uchun asos bo'lib xizmat qiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:50
msgid ""
"By default, Odoo uses the `Standard 40 hours/week` working hours, which "
"expects work centers to operate between 8:00 AM and 5:00 PM on Monday "
"through Friday."
msgstr ""
"Standart holatda Odoo `Standard 40 hours/week` ish soatlaridan foydalanadi, "
"bunda ish markazlari dushanbadan jumagacha soat 8:00 dan 17:00 gacha "
"ishlashi kutiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:53
msgid ""
"To change the working hours, hover over the current :guilabel:`Working "
"Hours` value and click the :icon:`fa-arrow-right` (:guilabel:`Internal "
"link`) icon to open the working hours form."
msgstr ""
"Ish soatlarini o'zgartirish uchun joriy :guilabel:`Working Hours` qiymati "
"ustiga kursorni olib boring va ish soatlari formasini ochish uchun :icon:`fa-"
"arrow-right` (:guilabel:`Internal link`) belgisini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:None
msgid "The working hours form for Standard 40 hours/week."
msgstr "Standard 40 hours/week uchun ish soatlari formasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:59
msgid ""
"To create a new set of working hours, click the :guilabel:`New` button and "
"give it a name. From here, edit any :guilabel:`Work from` or :guilabel:`Work "
"to` value to adjust the time range. Remove a line by clicking click "
"the :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`(trash)` icon. To create a new time range, "
"click :guilabel:`Add a line` at the bottom of the list."
msgstr ""
"Yangi ish soatlari to'plamini yaratish uchun :guilabel:`New` tugmasini "
"bosing va unga nom bering. Bu yerdan vaqt oralig'ini o'zgartirish uchun "
"istalgan :guilabel:`Work from` yoki :guilabel:`Work to` qiymatini "
"tahrirlang. Qatorni o'chirish uchun :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`(trash)` "
"belgisini bosing. Yangi vaqt oralig'ini yaratish uchun ro'yxatning "
"pastidagi :guilabel:`Add a line` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:65
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:95
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:205
msgid ":doc:`../reporting/oee`"
msgstr ":doc:`../reporting/oee`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:66
msgid ":doc:`../workflows/work_center_time_off`"
msgstr ":doc:`../workflows/work_center_time_off`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:69
msgid "Set productivity standards and allowed employees"
msgstr "Unumdorlik standartlari va ruxsat etilgan xodimlarni belgilash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:71
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`General Information` tab on the work center form allows for "
"productivity goals to be assigned to a work center. These are used as the "
"basis for calculating how much of the potential time the work center is "
"being used and its operating costs."
msgstr ""
"Ish markazi formasidagi :guilabel:`General Information` varag'i ish "
"markaziga unumdorlik maqsadlarini biriktirish imkonini beradi. Ular ish "
"markazining potensial vaqtining qancha qismi ishlatilayotganini va uning "
"ishlash xarajatlarini hisoblash uchun asos sifatida ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:None
msgid "The general information tab of the work center form."
msgstr "Ish markazi formasining umumiy ma'lumot varag'i."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:78
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Time Efficiency`: a multiplier for how using this work center "
"affects the normal speed of execution of a work order"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Time Efficiency`: ushbu ish markazidan foydalanish ish "
"buyurtmasini bajarishning odatiy tezligiga qanday ta'sir qilishini "
"ko'rsatuvchi koeffitsient"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:82
msgid ""
"If a work center has older equipment and work orders take twice as long to "
"produce, the `Time Efficiency` would be `50.00%`."
msgstr ""
"Agar ish markazida eskiroq uskunalar bo'lsa va ish buyurtmalarini bajarish "
"ikki barobar ko'p vaqt olsa, `Time Efficiency` `50.00%` bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:85
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Capacity`: the number of products that can be processed at the "
"work center simultaneously"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Capacity`: ish markazida bir vaqtning o'zida qayta ishlanishi "
"mumkin bo'lgan mahsulotlar soni"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:88
msgid ":guilabel:`OEE Target`: the target for efficiency at the work center"
msgstr ":guilabel:`OEE Target`: ish markazidagi samaradorlik uchun maqsad"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:91
msgid ""
"If a work center is available for `8 hours per day` but is only expected to "
"be used for `7 hours per day`, the OEE would be "
"`87.50%`. :math:`7/8*100=87.5`"
msgstr ""
"Agar ish markazi `8 hours per day` davomida mavjud bo'lsa, lekin undan faqat "
"`7 hours per day` davomida foydalanish kutilsa, OEE `87.50%` "
"bo'ladi. :math:`7/8*100=87.5`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:97
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Setup Time`: the time required before work can commence on a work "
"order"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Setup Time`: ish buyurtmasi bo'yicha ish boshlanishidan oldin "
"talab qilinadigan vaqt"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:98
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Cleanup Time`: breakdown or cleanup time required after a work "
"order is finished"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cleanup Time`: ish buyurtmasi tugagandan so'ng talab qilinadigan "
"yig'ishtirish yoki tozalash vaqti"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:99
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Cost per hour`: the operating expense of that workstation. "
"The :guilabel:`per employee` value is for estimating the average cost per "
"employee."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cost per hour`: ushbu ish joyining ishlash "
"xarajati. :guilabel:`per employee` qiymati har bir xodimga to'g'ri keladigan "
"o'rtacha xarajatni baholash uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:103
msgid ":doc:`../basic_setup/mo_costs`"
msgstr ":doc:`../basic_setup/mo_costs`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:105
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Allowed Employees`: the employees who can perform work at the "
"work center. If blank, all employees are allowed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Allowed Employees`: ish markazida ish bajarishi mumkin bo'lgan "
"xodimlar. Agar bo'sh qoldirilsa, barcha xodimlarga ruxsat beriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:109
msgid ""
"If equipment at a work center requires a certification to "
"operate, :guilabel:`Allowed Employees` could list only those employees who "
"have the certification."
msgstr ""
"Agar ish markazidagi uskunani ishlatish uchun sertifikat talab "
"qilinsa, :guilabel:`Allowed Employees` ro'yxatida faqat sertifikatga ega "
"xodimlar ko'rsatilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:113
msgid "Set production capacities"
msgstr "Ishlab chiqarish quvvatlarini belgilash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:115
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Capacity` setting on a work center creates a default value "
"for how many units can be produced at one time in a work center. To specify "
"that a work center can produce different quantities of different products, "
"select the :guilabel:`Specific Capacities` tab."
msgstr ""
"Ish markazidagi :guilabel:`Capacity` sozlamasi ish markazida bir vaqtning "
"o'zida qancha birlik ishlab chiqarilishi mumkinligi uchun standart qiymatni "
"yaratadi. Ish markazi turli mahsulotlarning turli miqdorlarini ishlab "
"chiqarishi mumkinligini ko'rsatish uchun :guilabel:`Specific Capacities` "
"varag'ini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:None
msgid ""
"A work center form with different capacities specified for different "
"products."
msgstr ""
"Turli mahsulotlar uchun turli quvvatlar ko'rsatilgan ish markazi formasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:123
msgid ""
"To specify production capacities in different measurements from a count of "
"units, enable the *Units of Measure* feature in the **Inventory** app."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish quvvatlarini birliklar sonidan farqli o'lchovlarda "
"ko'rsatish uchun **Inventory** ilovasida *Units of Measure* funksiyasini "
"yoqing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:127
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:153
msgid ":doc:`../../maintenance/add_new_equipment`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../maintenance/add_new_equipment`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:132
msgid "Integrate IoT devices"
msgstr "IoT qurilmalarini integratsiya qilish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:134
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`IoT Triggers` tab enables the integration of :abbr:`IoT "
"(Internet of Things)` devices with a work center:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`IoT Triggers` varag'i :abbr:`IoT (Internet of Things)` "
"qurilmalarini ish markazi bilan integratsiya qilish imkonini beradi:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:137
msgid ":guilabel:`Device`: specifies the IoT device to be triggered"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Device`: ishga tushiriladigan IoT qurilmasini belgilaydi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:138
msgid ":guilabel:`Key`: the security key for the device"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Key`: qurilma uchun xavfsizlik kaliti"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:139
msgid ":guilabel:`Action`: the IoT device action triggered"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Action`: ishga tushiriladigan IoT qurilmasi harakati"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:None
msgid "The IoT Triggers tab of the work center form."
msgstr "Ish markazi formasidagi IoT Triggers varag'i."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:145
msgid "Assigning equipment to work centers"
msgstr "Ish markazlariga uskuna biriktirish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:147
msgid ""
"The **Maintenance** app makes it possible to add specific equipment to a "
"work center and individually track its costs and productivity. It also adds "
"the :guilabel:`Equipment` and :guilabel:`Maintenance` tabs to the work "
"center form, used to list equipment and schedule maintenance activities."
msgstr ""
"**Maintenance** ilovasi ish markaziga muayyan uskunani qo'shish hamda uning "
"xarajatlari va unumdorligini alohida kuzatish imkonini beradi. Shuningdek, u "
"ish markazi formasiga uskunalarni ro'yxatga olish va texnik xizmat "
"faoliyatlarini rejalashtirish uchun ishlatiladigan :guilabel:`Equipment` "
"va :guilabel:`Maintenance` varaqlarini qo'shadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:156
msgid "Configure equipment"
msgstr "Uskunani sozlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:158
msgid ""
"Using the :guilabel:`Equipment` tab, it is possible for specific pieces of "
"equipment to be assigned to a work center. The following information is "
"displayed for each piece of equipment added:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Equipment` varag'i yordamida muayyan uskunalarni ish markaziga "
"biriktirish mumkin. Qo'shilgan har bir uskuna uchun quyidagi ma'lumotlar "
"ko'rsatiladi:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:161
msgid ":guilabel:`Equipment Name`: the name of the piece of equipment"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Equipment Name`: uskunaning nomi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:162
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Technician`: the technician responsible for servicing the "
"equipment"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Technician`: uskunaga xizmat ko'rsatish uchun mas'ul texnik xodim"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:163
msgid ":guilabel:`Equipment Category`: the category the equipment belongs to"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Equipment Category`: uskuna tegishli bo'lgan toifa"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:164
msgid ""
":guilabel:`MTBF`: mean time between failures; the average time that the "
"piece of equipment will operate before failing"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`MTBF`: nosozliklar orasidagi o'rtacha vaqt; uskunaning "
"nosozlikkacha ishlab turadigan o'rtacha vaqti"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:166
msgid ""
":guilabel:`MTTR`: mean time to recovery; the average time it takes for the "
"equipment to become fully operational again"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`MTTR`: tiklanishgacha bo'lgan o'rtacha vaqt; uskunaning yana "
"to'liq ishga tushishi uchun ketadigan o'rtacha vaqt"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:168
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Est. Next Failure`: an estimate of when the next equipment "
"failure will occur"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Est. Next Failure`: uskunaning keyingi nosozligi qachon yuz "
"berishi haqidagi taxmin"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:None
msgid "The equipment tab of the work center form."
msgstr "Ish markazi formasidagi uskuna varag'i."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:174
msgid ""
":guilabel:`MTBF`, :guilabel:`MTTR`, and :guilabel:`Est. Next Failure` are "
"all calculated automatically based on past failure data, if any exists."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`MTBF`, :guilabel:`MTTR` va :guilabel:`Est. Next Failure` "
"qiymatlari, agar mavjud bo'lsa, o'tgan nosozlik ma'lumotlari asosida "
"avtomatik hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:178
msgid "Work center planning"
msgstr "Ish markazini rejalashtirish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:180
msgid ""
"The currently scheduled work orders can be viewed by "
"accessing :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Planning --> Planning by "
"Workcenter`."
msgstr ""
"Hozirda rejalashtirilgan ish buyurtmalarini :menuselection:`Manufacturing "
"app --> Planning --> Planning by Workcenter` yo'lidan o'tib ko'rish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:None
msgid "The Gantt view of planning showing two assembly work centers."
msgstr ""
"Ikkita yig'ish ish markazini ko'rsatuvchi rejalashtirishning Gantt "
"ko'rinishi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:186
msgid ""
"Different views show how many individual work orders are scheduled, how many "
"minutes of each hour the work center is in production, and the dates and "
"times that are currently scheduled for work orders. Times and planned work "
"centers can be changed by clicking to access the individual work order."
msgstr ""
"Turli ko'rinishlar nechta alohida ish buyurtmasi rejalashtirilganini, ish "
"markazi har soatning necha daqiqasida ishlab chiqarishda bo'lishini hamda "
"ish buyurtmalari uchun hozirda rejalashtirilgan sana va vaqtlarni "
"ko'rsatadi. Vaqtlar va rejalashtirilgan ish markazlarini alohida ish "
"buyurtmasini bosib ochish orqali o'zgartirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:192
msgid "Work center performance"
msgstr "Ish markazi samaradorligi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:194
msgid ""
"Performance for an individual work center can be viewed by "
"selecting :menuselection:`Configuration --> Work Centers`, and clicking on a "
"work center. Metrics are displayed in smart buttons at the top of the form."
msgstr ""
"Alohida ish markazining samaradorligini :menuselection:`Configuration --> "
"Work Centers` yo'lidan o'tib va ish markazini bosib ko'rish mumkin. "
"Ko'rsatkichlar forma yuqorisidagi aqlli tugmalarda ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:None
msgid "A work center form with smart buttons showing performance metrics."
msgstr ""
"Samaradorlik ko'rsatkichlarini aks ettiruvchi aqlli tugmalarga ega ish "
"markazi formasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:201
msgid ""
":guilabel:`OEE`: overall equipment effectiveness, the percentage of time "
"that the work center has been productive out of its available work hours."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`OEE`: uskunaning umumiy samaradorligi, ish markazining mavjud ish "
"soatlaridan unumli ishlagan vaqti foizi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:207
msgid ":guilabel:`Lost`: the amount of time lost due to work stoppages"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Lost`: ish to'xtab qolishlari tufayli yo'qotilgan vaqt miqdori"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:208
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Load`: the amount of time it will take to complete the current "
"workload"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Load`: joriy ish hajmini bajarish uchun ketadigan vaqt miqdori"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:209
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Performance`: the real duration of work time, shown as a "
"percentage of the expected duration"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Performance`: ish vaqtining haqiqiy davomiyligi, kutilgan "
"davomiylikka nisbatan foizda ko'rsatiladi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:213
msgid "Use case: measuring performance by shift using work centers"
msgstr ""
"Amaliy misol: ish markazlari yordamida samaradorlikni smenalar bo'yicha "
"o'lchash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:215
msgid ""
"Work centers support defined working hours, enabling the tracking of "
"production efficiency by shift. To configure shift-based tracking, create "
"working hours for each of the shifts, then duplicate versions of each work "
"center for each of the shifts. With this setup, comparing shift productivity "
"can be done with any of the available :doc:`reporting <../../../essentials/"
"reporting>` tools."
msgstr ""
"Ish markazlari belgilangan ish soatlarini qo'llab-quvvatlaydi, bu ishlab "
"chiqarish samaradorligini smenalar bo'yicha kuzatish imkonini beradi. "
"Smenaga asoslangan kuzatuvni sozlash uchun har bir smena uchun ish "
"soatlarini yarating, so'ngra har bir ish markazining har bir smena uchun "
"nusxalarini yarating. Ushbu sozlama bilan smenalar unumdorligini "
"mavjud :doc:`hisobot <../../../essentials/reporting>` vositalarining "
"istalgani yordamida taqqoslash mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:221
msgid "Working hours for multiple shifts"
msgstr "Bir nechta smena uchun ish soatlari"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:223
msgid ""
"To create working hours for multiple shifts, open a work center form and in "
"the :guilabel:`Working Hours` field click the :icon:`fa-arrow-right` "
"(:guilabel:`Internal link`), and then click the :guilabel:`New` button to "
"create a new set of hours for the second shift."
msgstr ""
"Bir nechta smena uchun ish soatlarini yaratish maqsadida ish markazi "
"formasini oching va :guilabel:`Working Hours` maydonida :icon:`fa-arrow-"
"right` (:guilabel:`Internal link`) belgisini bosing, so'ngra ikkinchi smena "
"uchun yangi soatlar to'plamini yaratish uchun :guilabel:`New` tugmasini "
"bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:228
msgid ""
"A manufacturer has two shifts: a day shift from 5 AM to 1 PM and a night "
"shift from 1 PM to 9 PM. Starting from any existing work center, edit the "
"existing working hours to match the day shift."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqaruvchida ikkita smena bor: ertalab 5 dan 13:00 gacha kunduzgi "
"smena va 13:00 dan 21:00 gacha tungi smena. Istalgan mavjud ish markazidan "
"boshlab, mavjud ish soatlarini kunduzgi smenaga moslashtirib tahrirlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:0
msgid "The working hours for a day shift"
msgstr "Kunduzgi smena uchun ish soatlari"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:234
msgid ""
"Once the day shift is saved, click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(cog)` icon "
"and select :guilabel:`Duplicate`. Rename this new schedule `Night Shift` and "
"change each :guilabel:`Work from` to 1 PM and :guilabel:`Work from` to 9 PM."
msgstr ""
"Kunduzgi smena saqlangach, :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(cog)` belgisini bosing "
"va :guilabel:`Duplicate` bandini tanlang. Ushbu yangi jadvalni `Night Shift` "
"deb qayta nomlang va har bir :guilabel:`Work from` qiymatini 13:00 ga "
"va :guilabel:`Work from` qiymatini 21:00 ga o'zgartiring."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:0
msgid "The working hours for a night shift"
msgstr "Tungi smena uchun ish soatlari"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:242
msgid "Work centers for multiple shifts"
msgstr "Bir nechta smena uchun ish markazlari"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:244
msgid ""
"To create the duplicate work centers, return to the work center view by "
"navigating to :menuselection:`Configuration --> Work Centers` and "
"duplicating each of the work centers that are used by both shifts, either on "
"the individual work center forms, or directly from the list view."
msgstr ""
"Nusxa ish markazlarini yaratish uchun :menuselection:`Configuration --> Work "
"Centers` yo'lidan o'tib ish markazlari ko'rinishiga qayting va har ikkala "
"smena tomonidan ishlatiladigan har bir ish markazidan alohida ish markazi "
"formalarida yoki to'g'ridan-to'g'ri ro'yxat ko'rinishida nusxa oling."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:249
msgid ""
"To duplicate work centers directly from the list view, click the :icon:`fa-"
"check-square-o` :guilabel:`(checkbox)` that appears above the list items to "
"select all. Then, click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions` button at the "
"top of the list and select :guilabel:`Duplicate`."
msgstr ""
"Ish markazlaridan to'g'ridan-to'g'ri ro'yxat ko'rinishida nusxa olish uchun "
"barchasini tanlash maqsadida ro'yxat elementlari ustida paydo "
"bo'ladigan :icon:`fa-check-square-o` :guilabel:`(checkbox)` belgisini "
"bosing. So'ngra ro'yxat yuqorisidagi :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions` "
"tugmasini bosing va :guilabel:`Duplicate` bandini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:255
msgid ""
"A manufacturer has two work centers, `Assembly Line 1` and `Assembly Line "
"2`, and two working hours, `Day Shift` and `Night Shift`."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqaruvchida ikkita ish markazi — `Assembly Line 1` va `Assembly "
"Line 2` hamda ikkita ish soatlari to'plami — `Day Shift` va `Night Shift` "
"mavjud."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:0
msgid "Work centers copied for day and night shifts."
msgstr "Kunduzgi va tungi smenalar uchun nusxalangan ish markazlari."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:261
msgid ""
"To create versions of `Assembly Line 1` and `Assembly Line 2` for each "
"shift, duplicate each of the work centers. Select the first work center and "
"add the shift name in that work center's name and assign it the appropriate "
"working hours. Optionally, configure each work center to use its opposite "
"shift counterpart as an alternate work center to make sure that "
"manufacturing orders get assigned to both. Tags can also help make a visual "
"distinction between each shift."
msgstr ""
"Har bir smena uchun `Assembly Line 1` va `Assembly Line 2` versiyalarini "
"yaratish maqsadida har bir ish markazidan nusxa oling. Birinchi ish "
"markazini tanlang, ish markazi nomiga smena nomini qo'shing va unga tegishli "
"ish soatlarini biriktiring. Ixtiyoriy ravishda, ishlab chiqarish "
"buyurtmalari ikkalasiga ham biriktirilishini ta'minlash uchun har bir ish "
"markazini qarama-qarshi smenadagi juftini muqobil ish markazi sifatida "
"ishlatishga sozlang. Teglar ham har bir smena o'rtasida vizual farq "
"yaratishga yordam beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:268
msgid ""
"Use the :icon:`oi-chevron-left` :guilabel:`(left arrow)` and :icon:`oi-"
"chevron-right` :guilabel:`(right arrow)` buttons in the top left corner to "
"move on to the next form in the list without returning to the list view."
msgstr ""
"Ro'yxat ko'rinishiga qaytmasdan ro'yxatdagi keyingi formaga o'tish uchun "
"yuqori chap burchakdagi :icon:`oi-chevron-left` :guilabel:`(left arrow)` "
"va :icon:`oi-chevron-right` :guilabel:`(right arrow)` tugmalaridan "
"foydalaning."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:273
msgid "Reports comparing different shifts"
msgstr "Turli smenalarni taqqoslovchi hisobotlar"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:275
msgid ""
"With multiple work centers created to represent shifts, reports that sort by "
"work center will now compare shifts. This can be used to compare the number "
"of work orders that are being assigned each shift, the OEE, or actual time "
"that each shift is taking to produce a product."
msgstr ""
"Smenalarni ifodalash uchun bir nechta ish markazi yaratilgach, ish markazi "
"bo'yicha saralanadigan hisobotlar endi smenalarni taqqoslaydi. Bundan har "
"bir smenaga biriktirilayotgan ish buyurtmalari sonini, OEE ko'rsatkichini "
"yoki har bir smenaning mahsulot ishlab chiqarishga sarflayotgan haqiqiy "
"vaqtini taqqoslash uchun foydalanish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:280
msgid ""
"A report has been created to compare the time efficiency of two shifts "
"producing the same product in the same work center."
msgstr ""
"Bir xil ish markazida bir xil mahsulot ishlab chiqarayotgan ikki smenaning "
"vaqt samaradorligini taqqoslash uchun hisobot yaratildi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:None
msgid ""
"A bar graph of two work centers with duration deviations of -6.50 and 15.00"
msgstr ""
"Davomiylik og'ishlari -6.50 va 15.00 bo'lgan ikkita ish markazining ustunli "
"grafigi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:286
msgid ""
"To create this report, go to :menuselection:`Reporting --> Work Orders` and "
"click to remove the :icon:`fa-filter` **Ready** *or* **Waiting** *or* "
"**Pending** *or* **In Progress** filter by clicking the :icon:`fa-"
"x` :guilabel:`Remove` icon on its right side. Next, click "
"the :guilabel:`Measures` button and select :guilabel:`Duration Deviation (%)`"
msgstr ""
"Ushbu hisobotni yaratish uchun :menuselection:`Reporting --> Work Orders` "
"yo'lidan o'ting va :icon:`fa-filter` **Ready** *yoki* **Waiting** *yoki* "
"**Pending** *yoki* **In Progress** filtrini uning o'ng tomonidagi :icon:`fa-"
"x` :guilabel:`Remove` belgisini bosib olib tashlang. "
"Keyin :guilabel:`Measures` tugmasini bosing va :guilabel:`Duration Deviation "
"(%)` bandini tanlang"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers.rst:291
msgid ""
"In this case, the day shift has on average taken more than the expected time "
"to produce products (-6.50%) while the night shift took less than the "
"expected time (15.00%)."
msgstr ""
"Bu holatda kunduzgi smena mahsulot ishlab chiqarish uchun o'rtacha kutilgan "
"vaqtdan ko'proq vaqt sarflagan (-6.50%), tungi smena esa kutilgan vaqtdan "
"kamroq vaqt sarflagan (15.00%)."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:3
msgid "Work order dependencies"
msgstr "Ish buyurtmasi bog'liqliklari"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:7
msgid ""
"When manufacturing certain products, specific operations may need to be "
"completed before others can begin. To ensure operations are carried out in "
"the correct order, the **Manufacturing** app features a *work order "
"dependencies* setting. Enabling this setting allows for operations on a bill "
"of materials (BoM) to be blocked by other operations that should occur first."
msgstr ""
"Ayrim mahsulotlarni ishlab chiqarishda muayyan operatsiyalar boshqalari "
"boshlanishidan oldin yakunlanishi kerak bo'lishi mumkin. Operatsiyalar "
"to'g'ri tartibda bajarilishini ta'minlash uchun **Manufacturing** ilovasida "
"*ish buyurtmasi bog'liqliklari* sozlamasi mavjud. Ushbu sozlamani yoqish "
"materiallar ro'yxati (BoM) dagi operatsiyalarning avval bajarilishi kerak "
"bo'lgan boshqa operatsiyalar tomonidan bloklanishiga imkon beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:15
msgid ""
"The *work order dependencies* setting is not enabled by default. To enable "
"it, navigate to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`. Then, enable the :guilabel:`Work Orders` setting, if it is not "
"already active."
msgstr ""
"*Ish buyurtmasi bog'liqliklari* sozlamasi standart holatda yoqilmagan. Uni "
"yoqish uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --> "
"Settings` yo'lidan o'ting. So'ngra, agar hali faol bo'lmasa, :guilabel:`Work "
"Orders` sozlamasini yoqing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:19
msgid ""
"After enabling the :guilabel:`Work Orders` setting, the :guilabel:`Work "
"Order Dependencies` setting appears below it. Enable :guilabel:`Work Order "
"Dependencies`, then click :guilabel:`Save` to confirm the changes."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Work Orders` sozlamasi yoqilgach, uning ostida :guilabel:`Work "
"Order Dependencies` sozlamasi paydo bo'ladi. :guilabel:`Work Order "
"Dependencies` sozlamasini yoqing, so'ngra o'zgarishlarni tasdiqlash "
"uchun :guilabel:`Save` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:24
msgid "Add dependencies to BoM"
msgstr "BoM ga bog'liqliklar qo'shish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:26
msgid ""
"Work order dependencies are configured on a product's |BOM|. To do so, "
"navigate to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Products --> Bills of "
"Materials`, then select a |BOM|, or create a new one by "
"clicking :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"Ish buyurtmasi bog'liqliklari mahsulotning |BOM| hujjatida sozlanadi. Buning "
"uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Products --> Bills of Materials` "
"yo'lidan o'ting, so'ngra |BOM| ni tanlang yoki :guilabel:`New` tugmasini "
"bosib yangisini yarating."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:30
msgid ""
"On the |BOM|, open the *Miscellaneous* tab, then enable "
"the :guilabel:`Operation Dependencies` checkbox. The :guilabel:`Blocked By` "
"option becomes available under the :icon:`oi-settings-"
"adjust` :guilabel:`(settings)` menu of the *Operations* tab."
msgstr ""
"|BOM| da *Miscellaneous* varag'ini oching, so'ngra :guilabel:`Operation "
"Dependencies` katagini yoqing. :guilabel:`Blocked By` varianti *Operations* "
"varag'ining :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` :guilabel:`(settings)` menyusi ostida "
"mavjud bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:None
msgid "The Operation Dependencies checkbox on the Miscellaneous tab of a BoM."
msgstr "BoM ning Miscellaneous varag'idagi Operation Dependencies katagi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:37
msgid ""
"Open the *Operations* tab. Click the :icon:`oi-settings-"
"adjust` :guilabel:`(settings)` icon, then enable the :guilabel:`Blocked By` "
"checkbox. The :guilabel:`Blocked By` field appears for each operation in the "
"tab."
msgstr ""
"*Operations* varag'ini oching. :icon:`oi-settings-"
"adjust` :guilabel:`(settings)` belgisini bosing, so'ngra :guilabel:`Blocked "
"By` katagini yoqing. Varaqda har bir operatsiya uchun :guilabel:`Blocked By` "
"maydoni paydo bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:None
msgid "The settings for the Operations tab on a BoM."
msgstr "BoM dagi Operations varag'i sozlamalari."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:44
msgid ""
"In the line of the operation that should be blocked by another operation, "
"click the :guilabel:`Blocked By` field. The *Open: Operations* pop-up window "
"opens. In the :guilabel:`Blocked By` field, select the blocking operation "
"that must be completed *before* the operation that is blocked."
msgstr ""
"Boshqa operatsiya tomonidan bloklanishi kerak bo'lgan operatsiya "
"qatorida :guilabel:`Blocked By` maydonini bosing. *Open: Operations* qalqib "
"chiquvchi oynasi ochiladi. :guilabel:`Blocked By` maydonida bloklanadigan "
"operatsiyadan *oldin* yakunlanishi shart bo'lgan bloklovchi operatsiyani "
"tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:None
msgid "The Blocked By drop-down field for an operation on a BoM."
msgstr "BoM dagi operatsiya uchun Blocked By ochiluvchi maydoni."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:52
msgid ""
"Finally, save the |BOM| by clicking :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` :guilabel:`(Save "
"manually)`."
msgstr ""
"Nihoyat, :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` :guilabel:`(Save manually)` tugmasini bosib "
"|BOM|ni saqlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:58
msgid "Plan work orders using dependencies"
msgstr "Bog'liqliklar yordamida ish buyurtmalarini rejalashtirish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:60
msgid ""
"After work order dependencies are configured for a |BOM|, the "
"**Manufacturing** app can plan when work orders are scheduled based on those "
"dependencies. To plan the work orders for a manufacturing order, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Operations --> Manufacturing "
"Orders`."
msgstr ""
"Ish buyurtmasi bog'liqliklari |BOM| uchun sozlangandan so'ng, "
"**Manufacturing** ilovasi ish buyurtmalari qachon boshlanishini ana shu "
"bog'liqliklarga asoslanib rejalashtirishi mumkin. Ishlab chiqarish "
"buyurtmasining ish buyurtmalarini rejalashtirish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Operations --> Manufacturing "
"Orders` yo'lidan o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:64
msgid ""
"Next, select a manufacturing order for a product with work order "
"dependencies set on its |BOM|, or create a new manufacturing order by "
"clicking :guilabel:`New`. If a new manufacturing order is created, select a |"
"BOM| configured with work order dependencies from the :guilabel:`Bill of "
"Material` drop-down field, then click :guilabel:`Confirm`."
msgstr ""
"Keyin, |BOM|ida ish buyurtmasi bog'liqliklari o'rnatilgan mahsulot uchun "
"ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasini tanlang yoki :guilabel:`New` tugmasini bosib "
"yangi ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasini yarating. Agar yangi ishlab chiqarish "
"buyurtmasi yaratilsa, :guilabel:`Bill of Material` ochiluvchi maydonidan ish "
"buyurtmasi bog'liqliklari bilan sozlangan |BOM|ni tanlang, "
"so'ngra :guilabel:`Confirm` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:69
msgid ""
"After confirming the manufacturing order, open the *Work Orders* tab to view "
"the work orders required to complete it. Any work orders that are *not* "
"blocked by a different work order display a :guilabel:`To Do` tag in "
"the :guilabel:`Status` column."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasini tasdiqlagandan so'ng, uni bajarish uchun zarur "
"bo'lgan ish buyurtmalarini ko'rish uchun *Work Orders* varag'ini oching. "
"Boshqa ish buyurtmasi tomonidan *bloklanmagan* har qanday ish "
"buyurtmalari :guilabel:`Status` ustunida :guilabel:`To Do` tegini ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:73
msgid ""
"Work orders that are blocked by other work orders display "
"a :guilabel:`Blocked` tag instead. After the blocking work orders are "
"completed, the tag updates to :guilabel:`To Do`."
msgstr ""
"Boshqa ish buyurtmalari tomonidan bloklangan ish buyurtmalari "
"esa :guilabel:`Blocked` tegini ko'rsatadi. Bloklovchi ish buyurtmalari "
"bajarilgandan so'ng, teg :guilabel:`To Do` ga yangilanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:None
msgid "The status tags for work orders on a manufacturing order."
msgstr "Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasidagi ish buyurtmalari uchun holat teglari."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:79
msgid ""
"To schedule the manufacturing order's work orders, click "
"the :guilabel:`Plan` button at the top of the page. After doing so, "
"the :guilabel:`Start` field for each work order on the *Work Orders* tab "
"populates with a scheduled start date and time. A blocked work order is "
"scheduled at the end of the time period specified in the :guilabel:`Expected "
"Duration` field of the work order that precedes it."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasining ish buyurtmalarini rejalashtirish uchun "
"sahifaning yuqorisidagi :guilabel:`Plan` tugmasini bosing. Shundan so'ng, "
"*Work Orders* varag'idagi har bir ish buyurtmasi uchun :guilabel:`Start` "
"maydoni rejalashtirilgan boshlanish sanasi va vaqti bilan to'ldiriladi. "
"Bloklangan ish buyurtmasi undan oldingi ish "
"buyurtmasining :guilabel:`Expected Duration` maydonida ko'rsatilgan vaqt "
"oralig'i oxiriga rejalashtiriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:None
msgid ""
"The Scheduled Start Date field for work orders on a manufacturing order."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasidagi ish buyurtmalari uchun rejalashtirilgan "
"boshlanish sanasi maydoni."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:88
msgid ""
"A manufacturing order is created for Product A. The manufacturing order has "
"two operations: Cut and Assemble. Each operation has an expected duration of "
"60 minutes, and the Assemble operation is blocked by the Cut operation."
msgstr ""
"A mahsuloti uchun ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasi yaratiladi. Ishlab chiqarish "
"buyurtmasida ikkita operatsiya bor: Cut (kesish) va Assemble (yig'ish). Har "
"bir operatsiyaning kutilayotgan davomiyligi 60 daqiqa bo'lib, Assemble "
"operatsiyasi Cut operatsiyasi tomonidan bloklangan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:92
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Plan` button for the manufacturing order is clicked at 1:30 "
"pm, and the Cut operation is scheduled to begin immediately. Since the Cut "
"operation has an expected duration of 60 minutes, the Assemble operation is "
"scheduled to begin at 2:30 pm."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasi uchun :guilabel:`Plan` tugmasi soat 13:30 da "
"bosiladi va Cut operatsiyasi darhol boshlanishi rejalashtiriladi. Cut "
"operatsiyasining kutilayotgan davomiyligi 60 daqiqa bo'lgani uchun, Assemble "
"operatsiyasi soat 14:30 da boshlanishi rejalashtiriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:97
msgid "Planning views"
msgstr "Rejalashtirish ko'rinishlari"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:99
msgid ""
"Two work order planning views are available to display a visual "
"representation of how work orders are planned:"
msgstr ""
"Ish buyurtmalari qanday rejalashtirilganining vizual tasvirini ko'rsatish "
"uchun ikkita ish buyurtmasini rejalashtirish ko'rinishi mavjud:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:102
msgid ""
":menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Planning --> Planning by Production`"
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Planning --> Planning by Production`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:103
msgid ""
":menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Planning --> Planning by Workcenter`"
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Planning --> Planning by Workcenter`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:105
msgid ""
"Both open a *Work Orders Planning* page. This page shows a timeline of all "
"the work orders scheduled for each operation."
msgstr ""
"Ikkalasi ham *Work Orders Planning* sahifasini ochadi. Bu sahifa har bir "
"operatsiya uchun rejalashtirilgan barcha ish buyurtmalarining vaqt jadvalini "
"ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:108
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Planning by Production` is best used to view work orders grouped "
"by manufacturing order. This view is ideal for providing estimated delivery "
"times or determining if an order will be completed on schedule."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Planning by Production` ish buyurtmalarini ishlab chiqarish "
"buyurtmasi bo'yicha guruhlangan holda ko'rish uchun eng qulay. Bu ko'rinish "
"taxminiy yetkazib berish vaqtlarini taqdim etish yoki buyurtma jadval "
"bo'yicha bajarilishini aniqlash uchun juda mos keladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:112
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Planning by Workcenter` is best used to view work orders grouped "
"by the work center at which they take place. This view can help identify "
"overloaded machines or bottlenecks in production."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Planning by Workcenter` ish buyurtmalarini ular bajariladigan ish "
"markazi bo'yicha guruhlangan holda ko'rish uchun eng qulay. Bu ko'rinish "
"ortiqcha yuklangan mashinalarni yoki ishlab chiqarishdagi tor joylarni "
"aniqlashga yordam beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:115
msgid ""
"In both views, if one work order is blocked by the completion of another, "
"the work order that is blocked is shown as scheduled to start after the work "
"order that blocks it. In addition, a grey arrow connects the two work "
"orders, leading from the blocking operation to the blocked operation."
msgstr ""
"Ikkala ko'rinishda ham, agar bir ish buyurtmasi boshqasining bajarilishi "
"bilan bloklangan bo'lsa, bloklangan ish buyurtmasi uni bloklayotgan ish "
"buyurtmasidan keyin boshlanishi rejalashtirilgan holda ko'rsatiladi. Bundan "
"tashqari, kulrang strelka ikki ish buyurtmasini bog'lab, bloklovchi "
"operatsiyadan bloklangan operatsiyaga yo'naladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:None
msgid ""
"The arrow connecting a blocked work order to the work order blocking it."
msgstr ""
"Bloklangan ish buyurtmasini uni bloklayotgan ish buyurtmasi bilan bog'lovchi "
"strelka."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:123
msgid "Rescheduling work orders"
msgstr "Ish buyurtmalarini qayta rejalashtirish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:125
msgid ""
"By default, linked work orders on the *Work Orders Planning* page can be "
"rescheduled automatically, ensuring that work orders cannot be moved out of "
"the order they are set in."
msgstr ""
"Standart holatda, *Work Orders Planning* sahifasidagi bog'langan ish "
"buyurtmalari avtomatik ravishda qayta rejalashtirilishi mumkin, bu esa ish "
"buyurtmalari o'rnatilgan tartibdan chiqarilmasligini ta'minlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:128
msgid ""
"Work orders can be scheduled with a buffer, or the time gap between "
"consecutive work orders. By default, this view is set to :guilabel:`Auto-"
"Reschedule (Keep Buffer)`. When the buffer is kept, the work orders are "
"moved, and the gap is maintained. If the buffer is important, use this "
"setting."
msgstr ""
"Ish buyurtmalari bufer, ya'ni ketma-ket ish buyurtmalari orasidagi vaqt "
"oralig'i bilan rejalashtirilishi mumkin. Standart holatda, bu "
"ko'rinish :guilabel:`Auto-Reschedule (Keep Buffer)` ga o'rnatilgan. Bufer "
"saqlanganda, ish buyurtmalari ko'chiriladi va oraliq saqlanib qoladi. Agar "
"bufer muhim bo'lsa, ushbu sozlamadan foydalaning."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:133
msgid "A manufacturing order for a table has two work orders:"
msgstr "Stol uchun ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasida ikkita ish buyurtmasi bor:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:135
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:166
msgid "Apply finish"
msgstr "Pardoz berish (Apply finish)"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:136
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:165
msgid "Assemble"
msgstr "Yig'ish (Assemble)"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:138
msgid ""
"The first work order has a 24-hour buffer built in to allow for the finish "
"to cure. When a work order is rescheduled, the 24-hour buffer is maintained."
msgstr ""
"Birinchi ish buyurtmasiga pardoz qotishi uchun 24 soatlik bufer kiritilgan. "
"Ish buyurtmasi qayta rejalashtirilganda, 24 soatlik bufer saqlanib qoladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:141
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can use the :guilabel:`Auto-Reschedule (Use Buffer)` "
"setting by selecting it from the :guilabel:`Auto-Reschedule (Keep Buffer)` "
"drop-down menu. Select this option if the gaps were accidental and meeting a "
"due date is a priority."
msgstr ""
"Muqobil ravishda, :guilabel:`Auto-Reschedule (Keep Buffer)` ochiluvchi "
"menyusidan tanlash orqali :guilabel:`Auto-Reschedule (Use Buffer)` "
"sozlamasidan foydalanishingiz mumkin. Agar oraliqlar tasodifan paydo bo'lgan "
"bo'lsa va belgilangan muddatga rioya qilish ustuvor bo'lsa, ushbu variantni "
"tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:145
msgid ""
"For full control over rescheduling work orders, select :guilabel:`Manual "
"Reschedule`."
msgstr ""
"Ish buyurtmalarini qayta rejalashtirishni to'liq nazorat qilish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Manual Reschedule` ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:148
msgid ""
"Unless there is a specific reason to compress the buffer, it is important to "
"maintain the :guilabel:`Auto-Reschedule (Keep Buffer)` setting. Other work "
"orders upstream from the work order being rescheduled could run late and "
"cause issues with the production schedule."
msgstr ""
"Buferni qisqartirish uchun aniq sabab bo'lmasa, :guilabel:`Auto-Reschedule "
"(Keep Buffer)` sozlamasini saqlab qolish muhim. Qayta rejalashtirilayotgan "
"ish buyurtmasidan oldingi boshqa ish buyurtmalari kechikishi va ishlab "
"chiqarish jadvalida muammolarga sabab bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:153
msgid "Resolving inconsistencies"
msgstr "Nomuvofiqliklarni bartaraf etish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:155
msgid ""
"When the *Work Orders Planning* page is set to manually reschedule work "
"orders, it is possible to introduce inconsistencies in the manufacturing "
"order."
msgstr ""
"*Work Orders Planning* sahifasi ish buyurtmalarini qo'lda qayta "
"rejalashtirishga o'rnatilganda, ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasiga "
"nomuvofiqliklar kiritilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:158
msgid ""
"The arrows on the *Work Orders Planning* page can also point out "
"inconsistencies in the manufacturing order and how to correct them. When the "
"arrow changes color, an inconsistency has been introduced."
msgstr ""
"*Work Orders Planning* sahifasidagi strelkalar ishlab chiqarish "
"buyurtmasidagi nomuvofiqliklarni va ularni qanday tuzatishni ham ko'rsatishi "
"mumkin. Strelka rangi o'zgarganda, nomuvofiqlik kiritilgan bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:163
msgid "A workshop is manufacturing a table in three work orders:"
msgstr "Ustaxona stolni uchta ish buyurtmasida ishlab chiqarmoqda:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:167
msgid "Dry"
msgstr "Quritish (Dry)"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:169
msgid ""
"If the third work order is moved before the second work order, the third "
"work order and the arrow pointing to it turn red to indicate that the "
"planned schedule violates the defined work order dependency."
msgstr ""
"Agar uchinchi ish buyurtmasi ikkinchi ish buyurtmasidan oldinga ko'chirilsa, "
"rejalashtirilgan jadval belgilangan ish buyurtmasi bog'liqligini "
"buzayotganini bildirish uchun uchinchi ish buyurtmasi va unga yo'nalgan "
"strelka qizil rangga aylanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:0
msgid "A red line appears between two work orders."
msgstr "Ikki ish buyurtmasi orasida qizil chiziq paydo bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:176
msgid ""
"When hovering over the connecting line, an **X** (cancel) button appears. "
"When clicking this button, Odoo assumes the dependencies no longer apply due "
"to an exception, and the link between the steps is broken. To remove the "
"dependency, hover over the connecting line. Click the **X** (cancel) button "
"that appears, and the arrow between the two work orders disappears."
msgstr ""
"Bog'lovchi chiziq ustiga kursor olib borilganda, **X** (bekor qilish) "
"tugmasi paydo bo'ladi. Ushbu tugma bosilganda, Odoo istisno tufayli "
"bog'liqliklar endi amal qilmaydi deb hisoblaydi va qadamlar orasidagi "
"bog'lanish uziladi. Bog'liqlikni olib tashlash uchun kursorni bog'lovchi "
"chiziq ustiga olib boring. Paydo bo'lgan **X** (bekor qilish) tugmasini "
"bosing, shunda ikki ish buyurtmasi orasidagi strelka yo'qoladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:181
msgid ""
"To resolve the scheduling conflict and keep the dependency, select the red "
"work order. Click the :guilabel:`Edit` button, and the *Open* window "
"appears. Click the red :icon:`fa-exclamation-"
"triangle` :guilabel:`(exclamation triangle)` icon next to "
"the :guilabel:`Start Date`, and the *Scheduling Information* pop-up window "
"appears."
msgstr ""
"Rejalashtirish ziddiyatini hal qilish va bog'liqlikni saqlab qolish uchun "
"qizil ish buyurtmasini tanlang. :guilabel:`Edit` tugmasini bosing, shunda "
"*Open* oynasi paydo bo'ladi. :guilabel:`Start Date` yonidagi qizil :icon:`fa-"
"exclamation-triangle` :guilabel:`(exclamation triangle)` belgisini bosing, "
"shunda *Scheduling Information* qalqib chiquvchi oynasi paydo bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:None
msgid "Click the Replan button to reschedule the inconsistent work order."
msgstr ""
"Nomuvofiq ish buyurtmasini qayta rejalashtirish uchun Replan tugmasini "
"bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies.rst:189
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Replan` button, then click :guilabel:`Save` to save the "
"changes to the work order. The work order is rescheduled after the previous "
"work order in a way that maintains the work order dependency."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Replan` tugmasini bosing, so'ngra ish buyurtmasidagi "
"o'zgarishlarni saqlash uchun :guilabel:`Save` tugmasini bosing. Ish "
"buyurtmasi ish buyurtmasi bog'liqligini saqlaydigan tarzda oldingi ish "
"buyurtmasidan keyinga qayta rejalashtiriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup.rst:5
msgid "Basic setup"
msgstr "Asosiy sozlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:3
msgid "Bill of materials"
msgstr "Materiallar ro'yxati"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:9
msgid ""
"A *bill of materials* (or *BoM* for short) documents specific components, "
"along with their respective quantities, that are needed to produce or repair "
"a product. In Odoo, |BoMs| serve as blueprints for manufactured goods and "
"kits, and often include production operations and step-by-step guidelines, "
"as well."
msgstr ""
"*Materiallar ro'yxati* (yoki qisqacha *BoM*) mahsulotni ishlab chiqarish "
"yoki ta'mirlash uchun zarur bo'lgan aniq komponentlarni ularning tegishli "
"miqdorlari bilan birga hujjatlashtiradi. Odoo'da |BoMs| ishlab chiqarilgan "
"mahsulotlar va to'plamlar uchun andoza vazifasini bajaradi hamda ko'pincha "
"ishlab chiqarish operatsiyalari va bosqichma-bosqich yo'riqnomalarni ham o'z "
"ichiga oladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:17
msgid "BoM setup"
msgstr "BoM sozlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:19
msgid ""
"To create a |BOM|, go to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Products --> "
"Bills of Materials` and click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"|BOM| yaratish uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Products --> "
"Bills of Materials` yo'lidan o'ting va :guilabel:`New` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:22
msgid ""
"Next, set the :guilabel:`BoM Type` to :guilabel:`Manufacture this Product`."
msgstr ""
"Keyin, :guilabel:`BoM Type` maydonini :guilabel:`Manufacture this Product` "
"ga o'rnating."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:24
msgid ""
"Then, specify :ref:`required components <manufacturing/basic_setup/setup-"
"components>` and, if necessary, define any :ref:`manufacturing operations "
"<manufacturing/basic_setup/setup-operations>`."
msgstr ""
"So'ngra, :ref:`zarur komponentlarni <manufacturing/basic_setup/setup-"
"components>` belgilang va zarur bo'lsa, har qanday :ref:`ishlab chiqarish "
"operatsiyalarini <manufacturing/basic_setup/setup-operations>` aniqlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:28
msgid ""
"Individual |BOMs| can also be quickly accessed or created by clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` smart button on any product form, as "
"accessible through the *Sales*, *Inventory*, and *Manufacturing* apps, as "
"well as through any internal links where a product is referenced (such as in "
"a field or a line item)."
msgstr ""
"Alohida |BOMs|ga har qanday mahsulot formasidagi :guilabel:`Bill of "
"Materials` aqlli tugmasini bosish orqali ham tezda kirish yoki ularni "
"yaratish mumkin; mahsulot formalariga *Sales*, *Inventory* va "
"*Manufacturing* ilovalari orqali, shuningdek mahsulotga havola qilingan har "
"qanday ichki havolalar (masalan, maydonda yoki qator elementida) orqali "
"kirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:37
msgid "Show BoM for a product, with components listed."
msgstr "Komponentlari ro'yxatlangan holda mahsulot uchun BoM ko'rsatilgan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:37
msgid "BoM for `Drawer`, displaying the **Components** tab."
msgstr "`Drawer` uchun BoM, **Components** varag'i ko'rsatilgan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:40
msgid ":doc:`../advanced_configuration/kit_shipping`"
msgstr ":doc:`../advanced_configuration/kit_shipping`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:41
msgid ":doc:`../subcontracting/subcontracting_basic`"
msgstr ":doc:`../subcontracting/subcontracting_basic`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:46
msgid "Components"
msgstr "Komponentlar"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:48
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Components` tab of a |BOM|, specify components used to "
"manufacture the product by clicking :guilabel:`Add a line`. From "
"the :guilabel:`Components` drop-down menu, select from existing products or "
"create a new product by typing the name and selecting either "
"the :guilabel:`Create \" \"` option to quickly add the line item, or "
"the :guilabel:`Create and edit...` option to add the component and continue "
"to its configuration form."
msgstr ""
"|BOM|ning :guilabel:`Components` varag'ida :guilabel:`Add a line` tugmasini "
"bosib mahsulotni ishlab chiqarishda ishlatiladigan komponentlarni "
"belgilang. :guilabel:`Components` ochiluvchi menyusidan mavjud "
"mahsulotlardan tanlang yoki nomini yozib, qator elementini tezda qo'shish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Create \" \"` variantini yoki komponentni qo'shib, uning "
"sozlash formasiga o'tish uchun :guilabel:`Create and edit...` variantini "
"tanlash orqali yangi mahsulot yarating."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:None
msgid "Add a component by selecting it from the drop-down menu."
msgstr "Komponentni ochiluvchi menyudan tanlab qo'shing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:58
msgid ""
"Optionally, access additional fields by clicking the :icon:`oi-settings-"
"adjust` :guilabel:`(settings adjust)` icon to the far-right of "
"the :guilabel:`Components` tab. Tick the checkboxes for the following "
"features to enable these columns:"
msgstr ""
"Ixtiyoriy ravishda, :guilabel:`Components` varag'ining eng o'ng "
"tomonidagi :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` :guilabel:`(settings adjust)` "
"belgisini bosib qo'shimcha maydonlarga kiring. Ushbu ustunlarni yoqish uchun "
"quyidagi funksiyalarning katakchalarini belgilang:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:62
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Apply on Variants`: specify which :doc:`product variant <../"
"advanced_configuration/product_variants>` each component is used in. When "
"the field is left blank, the component is used in all product variants."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Apply on Variants`: har bir komponent qaysi :doc:`mahsulot "
"variantida <../advanced_configuration/product_variants>` ishlatilishini "
"belgilang. Maydon bo'sh qoldirilganda, komponent barcha mahsulot "
"variantlarida ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:68
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Consumed in Operation`: specify the operation using the "
"component. Useful for determining :ref:`manufacturing readiness "
"<manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing-readiness>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Consumed in Operation`: komponentdan foydalanadigan operatsiyani "
"belgilang. :ref:`Ishlab chiqarishga tayyorlikni <manufacturing/basic_setup/"
"manufacturing-readiness>` aniqlash uchun foydali."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:70
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Manual Consumption`: tick the checkbox to force operators to "
"check the :guilabel:`Consumed` checkbox on a manufacturing order (MO)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Manual Consumption`: operatorlarni ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasida "
"(MO) :guilabel:`Consumed` katakchasini belgilashga majburlash uchun "
"katakchani belgilang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:0
msgid "Show a manufacturing order, highlighting the *Consumed* field."
msgstr ""
"*Consumed* maydoni ajratib ko'rsatilgan ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasini "
"ko'rsatish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:77
msgid ""
"Not doing so triggers the :guilabel:`Consumption Warning` error message, "
"where the consumed component quantity must be manually inputted. Otherwise, "
"the operation cannot be completed."
msgstr ""
"Bunday qilinmasa, :guilabel:`Consumption Warning` xatolik xabari paydo "
"bo'ladi va iste'mol qilingan komponent miqdorini qo'lda kiritish talab "
"qilinadi. Aks holda, operatsiyani yakunlab bo'lmaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:0
msgid "Show the consumption warning error message."
msgstr "Iste'mol haqidagi ogohlantirish xatolik xabarini ko'rsatish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:89
msgid ""
"Add an *operation* to a |BOM| to specify instructions for production and "
"register time spent on an operation. To use this feature, first enable the "
"*Work Orders* feature by going to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`. In the :guilabel:`Operations` section, tick "
"the :guilabel:`Work Orders` checkbox to enable the feature."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish bo'yicha ko'rsatmalarni belgilash va operatsiyaga "
"sarflangan vaqtni qayd etish uchun |BOM| ga *operatsiya* qo'shing. Bu "
"funksiyadan foydalanish uchun avval :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings` yo'lidan o'tib, *Work Orders* funksiyasini "
"yoqing. :guilabel:`Operations` bo'limida funksiyani yoqish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Work Orders` katagiga belgi qo'ying."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:95
msgid ":doc:`../advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies`"
msgstr ":doc:`../advanced_configuration/work_order_dependencies`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:None
msgid "\"Work Orders\" feature in the Settings page."
msgstr "Sozlamalar sahifasidagi \"Work Orders\" funksiyasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:101
msgid ""
"Next, navigate to the |BOM| by going to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --"
"> Products --> Bill of Materials` and selecting the desired |BOM|. To add a "
"new operation, go to the :guilabel:`Operations` tab, and "
"click :guilabel:`Add a line`."
msgstr ""
"Keyin, :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Products --> Bill of Materials` "
"yo'lidan o'tib va kerakli |BOM| ni tanlab, |BOM| ga o'ting. Yangi operatsiya "
"qo'shish uchun :guilabel:`Operations` varag'iga o'ting va :guilabel:`Add a "
"line` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:105
msgid ""
"Doing so opens the :guilabel:`Create Operations` pop-up window, where the "
"various fields of the operation are configured:"
msgstr ""
"Shunda operatsiyaning turli maydonlari sozlanadigan :guilabel:`Create "
"Operations` qalqib chiquvchi oynasi ochiladi:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:108
msgid ":guilabel:`Operation`: name of the operation."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Operation`: operatsiyaning nomi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:109
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Work Center`: select existing locations to perform the operation, "
"or create a new work center by typing the name and selecting "
"the :guilabel:`Create \" \"` option."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Work Center`: operatsiyani bajarish uchun mavjud joylarni tanlang "
"yoki nomini yozib, :guilabel:`Create \" \"` variantini tanlash orqali yangi "
"ish markazini yarating."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:111
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Apply on Variants`: specify if this operation is only available "
"for certain product variants. If the operation applies to all product "
"variants, leave this field blank."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Apply on Variants`: bu operatsiya faqat ma'lum mahsulot "
"variantlari uchun mavjudligini belgilang. Agar operatsiya barcha mahsulot "
"variantlariga tegishli bo'lsa, bu maydonni bo'sh qoldiring."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:115
msgid ""
":doc:`Configuring BoMs for product variants <../advanced_configuration/"
"product_variants>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Mahsulot variantlari uchun BoM larni sozlash <../"
"advanced_configuration/product_variants>`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:117
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Duration Computation`: choose how time spent on the operation is "
"tracked. Opt for :guilabel:`Compute based on tracked time` to use the "
"operation's time tracker or :guilabel:`Set duration manually` if operators "
"can record and modify time themselves."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Duration Computation`: operatsiyaga sarflangan vaqt qanday "
"kuzatilishini tanlang. Operatsiyaning vaqt hisoblagichidan foydalanish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Compute based on tracked time` ni tanlang yoki operatorlar "
"vaqtni o'zlari qayd etib, o'zgartira olishi uchun :guilabel:`Set duration "
"manually` ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:121
msgid ""
"Choosing the :guilabel:`Compute based on tracked time` option enables "
"the :guilabel:`Based on last __ work orders` option, which automatically "
"estimates the time to complete this operation based on the last few "
"operations. Choosing :guilabel:`Set duration manually` enables "
"the :guilabel:`Default Duration` field instead."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Compute based on tracked time` variantini "
"tanlash :guilabel:`Based on last __ work orders` variantini yoqadi, bu esa "
"ushbu operatsiyani yakunlash vaqtini oxirgi bir nechta operatsiyalar asosida "
"avtomatik baholaydi. :guilabel:`Set duration manually` ni tanlash esa "
"o'rniga :guilabel:`Default Duration` maydonini yoqadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:125
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Default Duration`: estimated amount of time to complete the "
"operation; used for `planning manufacturing orders <https://www.youtube.com/"
"watch?v=TK55jIq00pc>`_ and determining `work center availability <https://"
"www.youtube.com/watch?v=3YwFlD97Bio>`_."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Default Duration`: operatsiyani yakunlash uchun taxminiy vaqt; "
"`ishlab chiqarish buyurtmalarini rejalashtirish <https://www.youtube.com/"
"watch?v=TK55jIq00pc>`_ va `ish markazining mavjudligini <https://"
"www.youtube.com/watch?v=3YwFlD97Bio>`_ aniqlash uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:128
msgid ":guilabel:`Company`: specify the company the |BOM| is available in."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Company`: |BOM| qaysi kompaniyada mavjud bo'lishini belgilang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:130
msgid ""
"Include operation details in the :guilabel:`Work Sheet` tab. "
"Choose :guilabel:`PDF` to attach a file or :guilabel:`Google Slide` with "
"*public* access to share a link. Select :guilabel:`Text` to type "
"instructions in the :guilabel:`Description` text field."
msgstr ""
"Operatsiya tafsilotlarini :guilabel:`Work Sheet` varag'iga kiriting. Fayl "
"biriktirish uchun :guilabel:`PDF` ni yoki havolani ulashish uchun *ochiq* "
"kirish huquqiga ega :guilabel:`Google Slide` ni tanlang. "
"Ko'rsatmalarni :guilabel:`Description` matn maydoniga yozish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Text` ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:135
msgid ""
"Type `/` for a list of formatting options and features, including ChatGPT."
msgstr ""
"Formatlash variantlari va funksiyalar, jumladan ChatGPT ro'yxatini ko'rish "
"uchun `/` belgisini kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:0
msgid "Show ChatGPT feature to generate instructions for a work order."
msgstr ""
"Ish buyurtmasi uchun ko'rsatmalar yaratish uchun ChatGPT funksiyasini "
"ko'rsatish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:None
msgid "Fill out the Create Operations pop-up window."
msgstr "Create Operations qalqib chiquvchi oynasini to'ldirish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:145
msgid ""
"Finally, click :guilabel:`Save \\& Close` to close the pop-up window. To add "
"more operations, click :guilabel:`Save & New` and repeat the same steps "
"above to configure another operation."
msgstr ""
"Nihoyat, qalqib chiquvchi oynani yopish uchun :guilabel:`Save \\& Close` "
"tugmasini bosing. Ko'proq operatsiyalar qo'shish uchun :guilabel:`Save & "
"New` tugmasini bosing va boshqa operatsiyani sozlash uchun yuqoridagi "
"qadamlarni takrorlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:149
msgid ""
"Each operation is unique, as it is always exclusively linked to one |BOM|."
msgstr ""
"Har bir operatsiya noyobdir, chunki u har doim faqat bitta |BOM| ga "
"bog'langan bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:152
msgid ""
"After creating an operation, click the :guilabel:`Copy Existing Operations` "
"button to choose an operation to duplicate."
msgstr ""
"Operatsiya yaratilgandan so'ng, nusxalash uchun operatsiyani tanlash "
"maqsadida :guilabel:`Copy Existing Operations` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:0
msgid ""
"Show Operation tab, highlighting the \"Copy Existing Operations\" field."
msgstr ""
"\"Copy Existing Operations\" maydoni ajratib ko'rsatilgan Operation "
"varag'ini ko'rsatish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:160
msgid "Instructions"
msgstr "Ko'rsatmalar"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:163
msgid ""
"To add detailed instructions to operations, the *Quality* app must be "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"Operatsiyalarga batafsil ko'rsatmalar qo'shish uchun *Quality* ilovasi "
"o'rnatilgan bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:165
msgid ""
"Add specific instructions to an existing operation by clicking the "
"operation's :icon:`fa-list-ul` :guilabel:`(list)` icon in "
"the :guilabel:`Instructions` column. The number in "
"the :guilabel:`Instructions` column shows the number of existing detailed "
"instructions there are for the operation."
msgstr ""
"Mavjud operatsiyaga aniq ko'rsatmalar qo'shish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Instructions` ustunidagi operatsiyaning :icon:`fa-list-"
"ul` :guilabel:`(list)` belgisini bosing. :guilabel:`Instructions` ustunidagi "
"raqam operatsiya uchun mavjud batafsil ko'rsatmalar sonini ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:None
msgid "Show the Instructions column, and list icon."
msgstr "Instructions ustuni va ro'yxat belgisini ko'rsatish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:174
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Steps` dashboard, click :guilabel:`New` to open a blank "
"quality control point form where the new manufacturing step can be created. "
"Here, give the specific instruction a :guilabel:`Title` and set "
"the :guilabel:`Type` to :guilabel:`Instructions`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Instructions` tab of the form, write out the directions for "
"the step in the operation."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Steps` boshqaruv panelida :guilabel:`New` tugmasini bosing, "
"shunda yangi ishlab chiqarish bosqichini yaratish mumkin bo'lgan bo'sh sifat "
"nazorati nuqtasi formasi ochiladi. Bu yerda aniq "
"ko'rsatmaga :guilabel:`Title` bering va :guilabel:`Type` "
"ni :guilabel:`Instructions` ga o'rnating. Formaning :guilabel:`Instructions` "
"varag'ida operatsiyadagi bosqich uchun yo'riqnomalarni yozing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:180
msgid ""
"Further customizations can be made here on this form, beyond ordinary "
"instructions, to also include specific types of quality control points that "
"carry specific (or complex) conditions. For more details about quality "
"control points refer the :doc:`Instruction check <../../quality/"
"quality_check_types/instructions_check>` documentation."
msgstr ""
"Bu formada oddiy ko'rsatmalardan tashqari, muayyan (yoki murakkab) "
"shartlarga ega bo'lgan maxsus turdagi sifat nazorati nuqtalarini ham qamrab "
"oladigan qo'shimcha moslashtirishlar qilish mumkin. Sifat nazorati nuqtalari "
"haqida batafsil ma'lumot olish uchun :doc:`Ko'rsatma tekshiruvi <../../"
"quality/quality_check_types/instructions_check>` hujjatiga murojaat qiling."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:None
msgid "Show the page to add a quality check."
msgstr "Sifat tekshiruvi qo'shish sahifasini ko'rsatish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:190
msgid "Miscellaneous"
msgstr "Boshqalar"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:192
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Miscellaneous` tab contains more |BoM| configurations to "
"customize procurement, calculate costs, and define how components are "
"consumed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Miscellaneous` varag'ida ta'minotni moslashtirish, xarajatlarni "
"hisoblash va komponentlar qanday iste'mol qilinishini belgilash uchun "
"ko'proq |BoM| sozlamalari mavjud."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:197
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Manufacturing Readiness`: choosing :guilabel:`When components for "
"the 1st operation are available` shows the :guilabel:`Component Status` as a "
"**green** :guilabel:`Not Available`, when only the components that are "
"consumed in the first operation are in stock. This indicates that although "
"not all components are available, operators can at least begin with the "
"first operation. Choosing :guilabel:`When all components are available` "
"displays a **red** :guilabel:`Not Available` component status unless all "
"components are in available."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Manufacturing Readiness`: :guilabel:`When components for the 1st "
"operation are available` ni tanlash, faqat birinchi operatsiyada iste'mol "
"qilinadigan komponentlar zaxirada bo'lganda, :guilabel:`Component Status` ni "
"**yashil** :guilabel:`Not Available` sifatida ko'rsatadi. Bu barcha "
"komponentlar mavjud bo'lmasa ham, operatorlar hech bo'lmaganda birinchi "
"operatsiyani boshlashi mumkinligini bildiradi. :guilabel:`When all "
"components are available` ni tanlash esa, barcha komponentlar mavjud "
"bo'lmaguncha, **qizil** :guilabel:`Not Available` komponent holatini "
"ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:205
msgid ""
"Specify which operation consumes each component on the |BoM| in "
"the :ref:`Manual Consumption field <manufacturing/basic_setup/consumed-in-"
"operation>`."
msgstr ""
"|BoM| dagi har bir komponentni qaysi operatsiya iste'mol "
"qilishini :ref:`Manual Consumption maydonida <manufacturing/basic_setup/"
"consumed-in-operation>` belgilang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:0
msgid "Show the *Component Status* field on the manufacturing order dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasi boshqaruv panelidagi *Component Status* "
"maydonini ko'rsatish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:212
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Version`: displays the current |BoM| version, visible with the "
"Odoo *PLM* app installed for managing |BoM| changes."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Version`: joriy |BoM| versiyasini ko'rsatadi, |BoM| "
"o'zgarishlarini boshqarish uchun Odoo *PLM* ilovasi o'rnatilgan bo'lsa "
"ko'rinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:214
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Flexible Consumption`: specifies if components used can deviate "
"from the quantity defined on the |BoM|. Choose :guilabel:`Blocked` if "
"operators **must** adhere strictly to the |BoM| quantity. Otherwise, "
"choose :guilabel:`Allowed` or :guilabel:`Allowed with Warning`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Flexible Consumption`: ishlatiladigan komponentlar |BoM| da "
"belgilangan miqdordan chetga chiqishi mumkinligini belgilaydi. Agar "
"operatorlar |BoM| miqdoriga qat'iy rioya qilishi **shart** "
"bo'lsa, :guilabel:`Blocked` ni tanlang. Aks holda, :guilabel:`Allowed` "
"yoki :guilabel:`Allowed with Warning` ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:217
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Routing`: select the preferred warehouse's manufacturing "
"operation type for products produced in multiple warehouses. If left blank, "
"this warehouse's `Manufacturing` operation type is used by default."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Routing`: bir nechta omborda ishlab chiqariladigan mahsulotlar "
"uchun afzal ko'rilgan omborning ishlab chiqarish operatsiya turini tanlang. "
"Agar bo'sh qoldirilsa, standart holatda ushbu omborning `Manufacturing` "
"operatsiya turi ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:220
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Analytic Distribution`: select pre-created :doc:`analytic "
"distribution models <../../../finance/accounting/reporting/"
"analytic_accounting>` from the list to automatically record the cost of "
"manufacturing products in the chosen journal."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Analytic Distribution`: ishlab chiqarilgan mahsulotlar tannarxini "
"tanlangan jurnalda avtomatik qayd etish uchun ro'yxatdan oldindan "
"yaratilgan :doc:`analitik taqsimlash modellarini <../../../finance/"
"accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting>` tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:223
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Manuf Lead Time`: define the number of days needed to complete a |"
"MO| from the date of confirmation."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Manuf Lead Time`: |MO| ni tasdiqlangan sanadan boshlab yakunlash "
"uchun kerak bo'ladigan kunlar sonini belgilang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:225
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Days to prepare Manufacturing Order`: number of days needed to "
"replenish components, or manufacture sub-assemblies of the product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Days to prepare Manufacturing Order`: komponentlarni to'ldirish "
"yoki mahsulotning yig'ma qismlarini ishlab chiqarish uchun kerak bo'ladigan "
"kunlar soni."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:229
msgid ""
":doc:`Analytic distribution <../../../finance/accounting/reporting/"
"analytic_accounting>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Analitik taqsimlash <../../../finance/accounting/reporting/"
"analytic_accounting>`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:230
msgid ""
":doc:`Lead times <../../inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/"
"lead_times>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Yetkazib berish muddatlari <../../inventory/warehouses_storage/"
"replenishment/lead_times>`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:None
msgid "Show the *Miscellaneous* tab of the BoM."
msgstr "BoM ning *Miscellaneous* varag'ini ko'rsatish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:237
msgid "Add by-products to BoMs"
msgstr "BoM larga qo'shimcha mahsulotlar qo'shish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:239
msgid ""
"A *by-product* is a residual product that is created during production in "
"addition to the main product of a |BOM|. Unlike the primary product, there "
"can be more than one by-product on a |BOM|."
msgstr ""
"*Qo'shimcha mahsulot* — bu ishlab chiqarish jarayonida |BOM| ning asosiy "
"mahsulotiga qo'shimcha ravishda hosil bo'ladigan qoldiq mahsulot. Asosiy "
"mahsulotdan farqli o'laroq, bitta |BOM| da bir nechta qo'shimcha mahsulot "
"bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:242
msgid ""
"To add by-products to a |BOM|, first enable the *By-Products* feature "
"in :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --> Settings`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Operations` section, tick the checkbox for :guilabel:`By-"
"Products` to enable the feature."
msgstr ""
"|BOM| ga qo'shimcha mahsulotlar qo'shish uchun "
"avval :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --> Settings` da "
"*By-Products* funksiyasini yoqing. :guilabel:`Operations` bo'limida "
"funksiyani yoqish uchun :guilabel:`By-Products` katagiga belgi qo'ying."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:None
msgid "\"By Products\" feature in the settings page."
msgstr "Sozlamalar sahifasidagi \"By Products\" funksiyasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:250
msgid ""
"Once the feature is enabled, add by-products to a |BOM| by clicking "
"the :guilabel:`By-products` tab. Click :guilabel:`Add a line`, and fill in "
"the :guilabel:`By-product`, :guilabel:`Quantity`, and :guilabel:`Unit of "
"Measure`. Optionally, specify a :guilabel:`Produced in Operation` for the by-"
"product."
msgstr ""
"Funksiya yoqilgach, :guilabel:`By-products` varag'ini bosish orqali |BOM| ga "
"qo'shimcha mahsulotlar qo'shing. :guilabel:`Add a line` tugmasini bosing "
"va :guilabel:`By-product`, :guilabel:`Quantity` va :guilabel:`Unit of "
"Measure` maydonlarini to'ldiring. Ixtiyoriy ravishda, qo'shimcha mahsulot "
"uchun :guilabel:`Produced in Operation` ni belgilang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:256
msgid ""
"The by-product, `Mush`, is created in the `Grind grapes` operation when "
"producing `Red Wine`."
msgstr ""
"`Red Wine` ishlab chiqarishda `Mush` qo'shimcha mahsuloti `Grind grapes` "
"operatsiyasida hosil bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:0
msgid "Show sample by-product in the BoM."
msgstr "BoM dagi qo'shimcha mahsulot namunasini ko'rsatish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/configure_manufacturing_product.rst:5
msgid "Manufacturing product configuration"
msgstr "Ishlab chiqarish mahsulotini sozlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/configure_manufacturing_product.rst:7
msgid ""
"Manufacturing products can be configured with lots or serial numbers "
"for :doc:`tracking <../../inventory/product_management/product_tracking>`, "
"and a bill of materials (BoM) for :doc:`replenishment <../../inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto>`."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqariladigan mahsulotlarni :doc:`kuzatish <../../inventory/"
"product_management/product_tracking>` uchun partiya (lot) yoki seriya "
"raqamlari bilan, :doc:`to'ldirish <../../inventory/warehouses_storage/"
"replenishment/mto>` uchun esa materiallar ro'yxati (BoM) bilan sozlash "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/configure_manufacturing_product.rst:16
msgid ""
"To optionally :doc:`assign lots or serial numbers <../../inventory/"
"product_management/product_tracking>` to newly manufactured products, go "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Products --> Products`. Then, select an "
"existing product, or create a new one by clicking :guilabel:`New`. Go to "
"the :guilabel:`Inventory` tab, and open the :guilabel:`General Information` "
"tab. In the :guilabel:`Track Inventory` field, select :guilabel:`By Unique "
"Serial Number` or :guilabel:`By Lots`."
msgstr ""
"Yangi ishlab chiqarilgan mahsulotlarga ixtiyoriy ravishda :doc:`partiya yoki "
"seriya raqamlarini biriktirish <../../inventory/product_management/"
"product_tracking>` uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Products --> "
"Products` yo'lidan o'ting. So'ngra mavjud mahsulotni tanlang "
"yoki :guilabel:`New` tugmasini bosib yangisini "
"yarating. :guilabel:`Inventory` varag'iga o'ting va :guilabel:`General "
"Information` varag'ini oching. :guilabel:`Track Inventory` "
"maydonida :guilabel:`By Unique Serial Number` yoki :guilabel:`By Lots` ni "
"tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/configure_manufacturing_product.rst:23
msgid ""
"Doing so enables the :guilabel:`Lot/Serial Number` field on a manufacturing "
"order, or the :guilabel:`Register Production` instruction on a work order "
"card in the **Shop Floor** app."
msgstr ""
"Shunday qilinsa, ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasida :guilabel:`Lot/Serial Number` "
"maydoni yoki **Shop Floor** ilovasidagi ish buyurtmasi "
"kartasida :guilabel:`Register Production` ko'rsatmasi yoqiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/configure_manufacturing_product.rst:29
msgid "\"Lot/Serial Number\" field on the MO."
msgstr "MO dagi \"Lot/Serial Number\" maydoni."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/configure_manufacturing_product.rst:29
msgid "**Lot/Serial Number** field on the MO."
msgstr "MO dagi **Lot/Serial Number** maydoni."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/configure_manufacturing_product.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Register Production** option to generate lot/serial number on a work order "
"card."
msgstr ""
"Ish buyurtmasi kartasida partiya/seriya raqamini yaratish uchun **Register "
"Production** varianti."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/configure_manufacturing_product.rst:39
msgid "Configure a bill of materials (BoM)"
msgstr "Materiallar ro'yxatini (BoM) sozlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/configure_manufacturing_product.rst:41
msgid ""
"Next, a |BOM| must be configured for the product so Odoo knows how it is "
"manufactured. A |BOM| is a list of the components and operations required to "
"manufacture a product."
msgstr ""
"Keyin, Odoo mahsulot qanday ishlab chiqarilishini bilishi uchun mahsulot "
"uchun |BOM| sozlanishi kerak. |BOM| — bu mahsulotni ishlab chiqarish uchun "
"zarur bo'lgan komponentlar va operatsiyalar ro'yxati."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/configure_manufacturing_product.rst:44
msgid ""
"To create a |BOM| for a specific product, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Products --> Products`, then select the "
"product. On the product page, click the :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` smart "
"button at the top of the page, then select :guilabel:`New` to configure a "
"new |BOM|."
msgstr ""
"Muayyan mahsulot uchun |BOM| yaratish uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing --"
"> Products --> Products` yo'lidan o'ting, so'ng mahsulotni tanlang. Mahsulot "
"sahifasida, sahifaning yuqori qismidagi :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` smart "
"tugmasini bosing, so'ng yangi |BOM| sozlash uchun :guilabel:`New` ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/configure_manufacturing_product.rst:None
msgid "The Bill of Materials smart button on a product page."
msgstr "Mahsulot sahifasidagi Bill of Materials smart tugmasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/configure_manufacturing_product.rst:51
msgid ""
"On the |BOM|, the :guilabel:`Product` field auto-populates with the product. "
"In the :guilabel:`Quantity` field, specify the number of units that the BoM "
"produces."
msgstr ""
"|BOM| da :guilabel:`Product` maydoni mahsulot bilan avtomatik "
"to'ldiriladi. :guilabel:`Quantity` maydonida BoM ishlab chiqaradigan "
"birliklar sonini ko'rsating."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/configure_manufacturing_product.rst:54
msgid ""
"Add a component to the |BOM| by selecting the :guilabel:`Components` tab and "
"clicking :guilabel:`Add a line`. Select a component from "
"the :guilabel:`Component` drop-down menu, then enter the quantity in "
"the :guilabel:`Quantity` field. Continue adding components on new lines "
"until all components have been added."
msgstr ""
"|BOM| ga komponent qo'shish uchun :guilabel:`Components` varag'ini tanlang "
"va :guilabel:`Add a line` tugmasini bosing. :guilabel:`Component` ochiluvchi "
"menyusidan komponentni tanlang, so'ng :guilabel:`Quantity` maydoniga "
"miqdorni kiriting. Barcha komponentlar qo'shilguncha yangi qatorlarda "
"komponentlar qo'shishni davom ettiring."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/configure_manufacturing_product.rst:None
msgid "The Components tab on a bill of materials."
msgstr "Materiallar ro'yxatidagi Components varag'i."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/configure_manufacturing_product.rst:62
msgid ""
"Next, select the :guilabel:`Operations` tab. Click :guilabel:`Add a line` "
"and a :guilabel:`Create Operations` pop-up window appears. In "
"the :guilabel:`Operation` field, specify the name of the operation being "
"added (e.g. Assemble, Cut, etc.). Select the work center where the operation "
"will be carried out from the :guilabel:`Work Center` drop-down menu. "
"Finally, click :guilabel:`Save & Close` to finish adding operations, "
"or :guilabel:`Save & New` to add more."
msgstr ""
"Keyin, :guilabel:`Operations` varag'ini tanlang. :guilabel:`Add a line` "
"tugmasini bosing, shunda :guilabel:`Create Operations` qalqib chiquvchi "
"oynasi paydo bo'ladi. :guilabel:`Operation` maydonida qo'shilayotgan "
"operatsiyaning nomini ko'rsating (masalan, Yig'ish, Kesish va "
"h.k.). :guilabel:`Work Center` ochiluvchi menyusidan operatsiya "
"bajariladigan ish markazini tanlang. Nihoyat, operatsiyalar qo'shishni "
"tugatish uchun :guilabel:`Save & Close` tugmasini, yoki ko'proq qo'shish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Save & New` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/configure_manufacturing_product.rst:69
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Operations` tab only appears if the :guilabel:`Work Orders` "
"setting is enabled. To do so, navigate to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, then enable the :guilabel:`Work Orders` "
"checkbox."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Operations` varag'i faqat :guilabel:`Work Orders` sozlamasi "
"yoqilgan bo'lsa paydo bo'ladi. Buning uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing --"
"> Configuration --> Settings` yo'lidan o'ting, so'ng :guilabel:`Work Orders` "
"katagini yoqing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/configure_manufacturing_product.rst:None
msgid "The Operations tab on a bill of materials."
msgstr "Materiallar ro'yxatidagi Operations varag'i."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/configure_manufacturing_product.rst:77
msgid ":doc:`bill_configuration`."
msgstr ":doc:`bill_configuration`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:3
msgid "Manufacturing order costs"
msgstr "Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasi xarajatlari"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:11
msgid ""
"The ability to accurately calculate the cost of manufacturing a product is "
"critical when determining product profitability. Odoo's **Manufacturing** "
"app simplifies this calculation by automatically calculating the cost to "
"complete each manufacturing order (MO), as well as the average production "
"cost of a product, based on all completed |MOs|."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulotni ishlab chiqarish xarajatini aniq hisoblash qobiliyati mahsulot "
"rentabelligini aniqlashda juda muhimdir. Odoo ning **Manufacturing** ilovasi "
"har bir ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasini (MO) bajarish xarajatini, shuningdek "
"barcha bajarilgan |MOs| asosida mahsulotning o'rtacha ishlab chiqarish "
"xarajatini avtomatik hisoblash orqali bu hisob-kitobni soddalashtiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:17
msgid ""
"Odoo's Manufacturing app distinguishes between the *MO cost* and the *real "
"cost* of an |MO|."
msgstr ""
"Odoo ning Manufacturing ilovasi |MO| ning *MO xarajati* va *haqiqiy "
"xarajati* o'rtasida farq qiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:19
msgid ""
"The |MO| cost represents how much it *should* cost to complete an |MO|, "
"based on the configuration of the product's bill of materials (BoM). This "
"takes into account the cost and quantity of components, as well as the cost "
"of completing the necessary operations."
msgstr ""
"|MO| xarajati mahsulotning materiallar ro'yxati (BoM) konfiguratsiyasiga "
"asoslanib, |MO| ni bajarish qancha turishi *kerakligini* bildiradi. Bu "
"komponentlarning xarajati va miqdorini, shuningdek zarur operatsiyalarni "
"bajarish xarajatini hisobga oladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:23
msgid ""
"The real cost represents how much it *actually* costs to complete the |MO|. "
"A few factors can cause the real cost to differ from the |MO| cost. For "
"example, an operation may take longer to complete than estimated, a greater "
"component quantity might be needed than was specified on the |BoM|, or the "
"price of components may change during manufacturing."
msgstr ""
"Haqiqiy xarajat |MO| ni bajarish *aslida* qancha turishini bildiradi. Bir "
"nechta omillar haqiqiy xarajatning |MO| xarajatidan farq qilishiga sabab "
"bo'lishi mumkin. Masalan, operatsiyani bajarish taxmin qilinganidan ko'proq "
"vaqt olishi, |BoM| da ko'rsatilganidan ko'proq komponent miqdori kerak "
"bo'lishi yoki ishlab chiqarish davomida komponentlar narxi o'zgarishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:31
msgid "Cost configuration"
msgstr "Xarajat konfiguratsiyasi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:33
msgid ""
"Odoo computes |MO| costs based on the configuration of the |BoM| used to "
"manufacture a product. This calculation includes the cost and quantity of "
"components and operations listed on the |BoM|, in addition to the operating "
"costs of the work centers where those operations are carried out, and the "
"amount paid to each employee who works on an operation."
msgstr ""
"Odoo |MO| xarajatlarini mahsulotni ishlab chiqarish uchun ishlatiladigan |"
"BoM| konfiguratsiyasiga asoslanib hisoblaydi. Bu hisob-kitob |BoM| da "
"keltirilgan komponentlar va operatsiyalarning xarajati va miqdorini, "
"shuningdek ushbu operatsiyalar bajariladigan ish markazlarining ishlash "
"xarajatlarini hamda operatsiyada ishlaydigan har bir xodimga to'lanadigan "
"summani o'z ichiga oladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:41
msgid "Component cost"
msgstr "Komponent xarajati"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:43
msgid ""
"Component cost is calculated automatically, based on the average purchase "
"cost of a component across all purchase orders (POs). To view a component's "
"cost, navigate to :guilabel:`Inventory app --> Products --> Products`, and "
"select a component product. The cost is displayed in the :guilabel:`Cost` "
"field of the :guilabel:`General Information` tab, on the component's product "
"form."
msgstr ""
"Komponent xarajati barcha xarid buyurtmalari (POs) bo'yicha komponentning "
"o'rtacha xarid xarajatiga asoslanib avtomatik hisoblanadi. Komponentning "
"xarajatini ko'rish uchun :guilabel:`Inventory app --> Products --> Products` "
"yo'lidan o'ting va komponent mahsulotni tanlang. Xarajat komponentning "
"mahsulot formasidagi :guilabel:`General Information` "
"varag'ining :guilabel:`Cost` maydonida ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:48
msgid ""
"It is possible to set the cost of a component manually, by clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Cost` field on the component's product form and entering a "
"value. However, any future |POs| for the component override a manually "
"entered value, resetting the :guilabel:`Cost` field back to an automatically "
"computed value."
msgstr ""
"Komponentning xarajatini komponentning mahsulot formasidagi :guilabel:`Cost` "
"maydonini bosib va qiymat kiritib qo'lda belgilash mumkin. Biroq, komponent "
"uchun kelajakdagi har qanday |POs| qo'lda kiritilgan qiymatni bekor "
"qilib, :guilabel:`Cost` maydonini yana avtomatik hisoblangan qiymatga "
"qaytaradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:56
msgid "Work center cost"
msgstr "Ish markazi xarajati"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:58
msgid ""
"To set the operating cost for a specific work center, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --> Work Centers`, "
"and select a work center."
msgstr ""
"Muayyan ish markazi uchun ishlash xarajatini belgilash "
"uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --> Work Centers` "
"yo'lidan o'ting va ish markazini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:61
msgid ""
"To set the cost of operating the work center for one hour, enter a value in "
"the :guilabel:`per workcenter` field, located beside the :guilabel:`Cost per "
"hour` section on the work center's :guilabel:`General Information` tab."
msgstr ""
"Ish markazini bir soat ishlatish xarajatini belgilash uchun ish "
"markazining :guilabel:`General Information` varag'idagi :guilabel:`Cost per "
"hour` bo'limi yonida joylashgan :guilabel:`per workcenter` maydoniga qiymat "
"kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:65
msgid ""
"To set the hourly cost of each employee that operates the work center, enter "
"a value in the :guilabel:`per employee` field, located beside "
"the :guilabel:`Cost per hour` section on the work "
"center's :guilabel:`General Information` tab. For example, if `25.00` is "
"entered in the :guilabel:`per employee` field, it costs $25.00 per hour for "
"*each* employee working at the work center."
msgstr ""
"Ish markazida ishlaydigan har bir xodimning soatlik xarajatini belgilash "
"uchun ish markazining :guilabel:`General Information` "
"varag'idagi :guilabel:`Cost per hour` bo'limi yonida "
"joylashgan :guilabel:`per employee` maydoniga qiymat kiriting. "
"Masalan, :guilabel:`per employee` maydoniga `25.00` kiritilsa, ish markazida "
"ishlaydigan *har bir* xodim uchun soatiga $25.00 xarajat qilinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:72
msgid ""
"The value entered in the :guilabel:`per employee` field is only used to "
"calculate the |MO| cost, which is the estimated cost of completing the |MO|."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`per employee` maydoniga kiritilgan qiymat faqat |MO| xarajatini, "
"ya'ni |MO| ni bajarishning taxminiy xarajatini hisoblash uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:75
msgid ""
"The actual cost of completing the |MO| is represented by the real cost. "
"Instead of using the value entered in the :guilabel:`per employee` field, "
"the real cost is calculated using the hourly cost specific to each employee."
msgstr ""
"|MO| ni bajarishning haqiqiy xarajati real xarajat bilan "
"ifodalanadi. :guilabel:`per employee` maydoniga kiritilgan qiymatni "
"ishlatish o'rniga, haqiqiy xarajat har bir xodimga xos soatlik xarajat "
"yordamida hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:79
msgid ""
"For example, if the :guilabel:`per employee` cost of a work center is "
"'$50.00', and an employee with an hourly cost of '$60.00' completes a work "
"order there, the |MO| cost (estimated) is calculated using the $50/hr cost, "
"while the real cost is calculated using the $60/hr cost."
msgstr ""
"Masalan, agar ish markazining :guilabel:`per employee` xarajati '$50.00' "
"bo'lsa va soatlik xarajati '$60.00' bo'lgan xodim u yerda ish buyurtmasini "
"bajarsa, |MO| xarajati (taxminiy) soatiga $50 xarajat yordamida, haqiqiy "
"xarajat esa soatiga $60 xarajat yordamida hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:83
msgid ""
"See the :ref:`employee cost section <manufacturing/mo-costs/employee-cost>` "
"below for information on how to set the cost for specific employees."
msgstr ""
"Muayyan xodimlar uchun xarajatni qanday belgilash haqida ma'lumot olish "
"uchun quyidagi :ref:`xodim xarajati bo'limi <manufacturing/mo-costs/employee-"
"cost>` ga qarang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:89
msgid "Employee cost"
msgstr "Xodim xarajati"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:91
msgid ""
"To set the hourly cost for a specific employee, navigate to "
"the :menuselection:`Employees` app, and select an employee. On the "
"employee's form, select the :guilabel:`Settings` tab, and enter the "
"employee's rate in the :guilabel:`Hourly Cost` field of "
"the :guilabel:`Application Settings` section."
msgstr ""
"Muayyan xodim uchun soatlik xarajatni belgilash "
"uchun :menuselection:`Employees` ilovasiga o'ting va xodimni tanlang. Xodim "
"formasida :guilabel:`Settings` varag'ini tanlang va :guilabel:`Application "
"Settings` bo'limining :guilabel:`Hourly Cost` maydoniga xodimning stavkasini "
"kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:97
msgid ""
"As detailed in the :ref:`work center cost section <manufacturing/mo-costs/"
"work-center-cost>` above, the value entered in the :guilabel:`Hourly Cost` "
"field on the employee's form is used to calculate the real cost of an |MO|. "
"The estimated cost of an |MO|, referred to as the |MO| cost, uses the per "
"employee cost set on each work center's form."
msgstr ""
"Yuqoridagi :ref:`ish markazi xarajati bo'limi <manufacturing/mo-costs/work-"
"center-cost>` da batafsil bayon etilganidek, xodim "
"formasidagi :guilabel:`Hourly Cost` maydoniga kiritilgan qiymat |MO| ning "
"haqiqiy xarajatini hisoblash uchun ishlatiladi. |MO| xarajati deb ataladigan "
"|MO| ning taxminiy xarajati har bir ish markazi formasida belgilangan har "
"bir xodim uchun xarajatdan foydalanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:105
msgid "|BoM| configuration"
msgstr "|BoM| konfiguratsiyasi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:107
msgid ""
"Configuring a |BoM| so Odoo can accurately calculate the cost of |MOs| that "
"use it requires two steps. First, components **must** be added, and the "
"required quantity specified. Second, operations **must** be added, along "
"with the work centers where they are carried out."
msgstr ""
"Odoo undan foydalanadigan |MOs| xarajatini aniq hisoblay olishi uchun |BoM| "
"ni sozlash ikki qadamni talab qiladi. Birinchidan, komponentlar qo'shilishi "
"**shart** va zarur miqdor ko'rsatilishi kerak. Ikkinchidan, operatsiyalar "
"ular bajariladigan ish markazlari bilan birga qo'shilishi **shart**."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:111
msgid ""
"Begin by navigating to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Products --> "
"Bills of Materials`. Select a |BoM|, or create a new one by "
"clicking :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Products --> Bills of Materials` "
"yo'lidan o'tishdan boshlang. |BoM| ni tanlang yoki :guilabel:`New` tugmasini "
"bosib yangisini yarating."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:114
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Components` tab of the |BoM| form, add each component by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Add a line`, selecting the component from the drop-down "
"menu in the :guilabel:`Component` column, and entering the quantity in "
"the :guilabel:`Quantity` column."
msgstr ""
"|BoM| formasining :guilabel:`Components` varag'ida har bir "
"komponentni :guilabel:`Add a line` tugmasini bosib, :guilabel:`Component` "
"ustunidagi ochiluvchi menyudan komponentni tanlab va :guilabel:`Quantity` "
"ustuniga miqdorni kiritib qo'shing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:118
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Operations` tab, add an operation by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Add a line` to open the :guilabel:`Create Operations` "
"pop-up window. Enter a title for the operation in the :guilabel:`Operation` "
"field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Operations` varag'ida operatsiya qo'shish uchun :guilabel:`Add a "
"line` tugmasini bosib :guilabel:`Create Operations` qalqib chiquvchi "
"oynasini oching. :guilabel:`Operation` maydoniga operatsiya sarlavhasini "
"kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:122
msgid ""
"Select the :guilabel:`Work Center` where the operation is carried out. Then, "
"add a :guilabel:`Default Duration`, which is the estimated amount of time "
"the operation takes to complete."
msgstr ""
"Operatsiya bajariladigan :guilabel:`Work Center` ni tanlang. So'ng, "
"operatsiyani bajarish uchun ketadigan taxminiy vaqt "
"bo'lgan :guilabel:`Default Duration` ni qo'shing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:125
msgid ""
"By default, the :guilabel:`Duration Computation` field is set "
"to :guilabel:`Set duration manually`, which means that the number entered "
"in :guilabel:`Default Duration` field is always used as the expected "
"duration of the operation."
msgstr ""
"Standart holatda :guilabel:`Duration Computation` maydoni :guilabel:`Set "
"duration manually` qilib belgilangan, bu :guilabel:`Default Duration` "
"maydoniga kiritilgan raqam har doim operatsiyaning kutilayotgan davomiyligi "
"sifatida ishlatilishini anglatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:129
msgid ""
"Selecting :guilabel:`Compute based on tracked time` causes Odoo to "
"automatically compute the :guilabel:`Default Duration` based on a certain "
"number of work orders, which is set in the :guilabel:`Based on` field. "
"Before there are work orders to compute this duration, the value in "
"the :guilabel:`Default Duration` field is used instead."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Compute based on tracked time` ni tanlash Odoo "
"ga :guilabel:`Based on` maydonida belgilangan ma'lum miqdordagi ish "
"buyurtmalariga asoslanib :guilabel:`Default Duration` ni avtomatik "
"hisoblashga olib keladi. Bu davomiylikni hisoblash uchun ish buyurtmalari "
"mavjud bo'lgunga qadar, buning o'rniga :guilabel:`Default Duration` "
"maydonidagi qiymat ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:134
msgid ""
"The hourly cost of operating the work center, and the duration of the "
"operation, are used to calculate the operation's cost."
msgstr ""
"Ish markazini ishlatishning soatlik xarajati va operatsiyaning davomiyligi "
"operatsiya xarajatini hisoblash uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:137
msgid ""
"Finally, click :guilabel:`Save & Close` to add the operation to the |BoM|, "
"and close the :guilabel:`Create Operations` pop-up window. Alternatively, "
"click :guilabel:`Save & New` to add the operation to the |BoM|, and open a "
"blank :guilabel:`Create Operations` pop-up window to add another operation."
msgstr ""
"Nihoyat, operatsiyani |BoM| ga qo'shish va :guilabel:`Create Operations` "
"qalqib chiquvchi oynasini yopish uchun :guilabel:`Save & Close` tugmasini "
"bosing. Muqobil ravishda, operatsiyani |BoM| ga qo'shish va boshqa "
"operatsiya qo'shish uchun bo'sh :guilabel:`Create Operations` qalqib "
"chiquvchi oynasini ochish uchun :guilabel:`Save & New` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:143
msgid ""
"For a full overview of |BoM| configuration, see the documentation "
"on :doc:`bills of materials <bill_configuration>`."
msgstr ""
"|BoM| konfiguratsiyasining to'liq umumiy ko'rinishi uchun :doc:`materiallar "
"ro'yxati <bill_configuration>` haqidagi hujjatlarga qarang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:149
msgid "|MO| overview"
msgstr "|MO| umumiy ko'rinishi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:151
msgid ""
"Each |MO| has an *overview* page, which lists a variety of information about "
"the |MO|, including |MO| cost and real cost. To view the overview for an |"
"MO|, navigate to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Operations --> "
"Manufacturing Orders`, and select an |MO|. Then, click the :icon:`fa-"
"bars` :guilabel:`Overview` smart button at the top of the |MO|."
msgstr ""
"Har bir |MO| ning *umumiy ko'rinish* sahifasi bor, unda |MO| haqidagi turli "
"ma'lumotlar, jumladan |MO| xarajati va haqiqiy xarajat keltirilgan. |MO| "
"uchun umumiy ko'rinishni ko'rish uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> "
"Operations --> Manufacturing Orders` yo'lidan o'ting va |MO| ni tanlang. "
"So'ng, |MO| ning yuqori qismidagi :icon:`fa-bars` :guilabel:`Overview` smart "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:156
msgid ""
"Both the |MO| cost and real cost take into account the cost and quantity of "
"components, as well as the cost of completing each work order. The overview "
"page lists a row for each of these values, with the sum of them listed at "
"the bottom of the :guilabel:`MO Cost` and :guilabel:`Real Cost` columns."
msgstr ""
"|MO| xarajati ham, haqiqiy xarajat ham komponentlarning xarajati va "
"miqdorini, shuningdek har bir ish buyurtmasini bajarish xarajatini hisobga "
"oladi. Umumiy ko'rinish sahifasida bu qiymatlarning har biri uchun qator "
"keltirilgan bo'lib, ularning yig'indisi :guilabel:`MO Cost` "
"va :guilabel:`Real Cost` ustunlarining pastki qismida ko'rsatilgan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:160
msgid ""
"Before work begins on an |MO|, the :guilabel:`MO Cost` and :guilabel:`Real "
"Cost` columns display the same costs. This is the *estimated* cost of "
"completing the |MO|."
msgstr ""
"|MO| bo'yicha ish boshlanishidan oldin :guilabel:`MO Cost` "
"va :guilabel:`Real Cost` ustunlari bir xil xarajatlarni ko'rsatadi. Bu |MO| "
"ni bajarishning *taxminiy* xarajatidir."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:163
msgid ""
"However, once work commences, the values in the :guilabel:`Real Cost` column "
"may begin to diverge from the values in the :guilabel:`MO Cost` column. This "
"happens if a different component quantity is used than was listed on the |"
"MO|, the duration of a work order is different than expected, or the hourly "
"cost of the employee performing a work order differs from the employee cost "
"set on the work center."
msgstr ""
"Biroq, ish boshlangach, :guilabel:`Real Cost` ustunidagi "
"qiymatlar :guilabel:`MO Cost` ustunidagi qiymatlardan farq qila boshlashi "
"mumkin. Bu |MO| da ko'rsatilganidan boshqacha komponent miqdori "
"ishlatilganda, ish buyurtmasining davomiyligi kutilganidan farq qilganda "
"yoki ish buyurtmasini bajarayotgan xodimning soatlik xarajati ish markazida "
"belgilangan xodim xarajatidan farq qilganda sodir bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:169
msgid ""
"Once the |MO| has been completed by clicking :guilabel:`Produce All`, the "
"values in the :guilabel:`MO Cost` column update to match those displayed in "
"the :guilabel:`Real Cost` column."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Produce All` tugmasini bosish orqali |MO| "
"bajarilgach, :guilabel:`MO Cost` ustunidagi qiymatlar :guilabel:`Real Cost` "
"ustunida ko'rsatilganlariga mos ravishda yangilanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:None
msgid "The MO Overview page."
msgstr "MO Overview sahifasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:179
msgid "Average manufacturing cost"
msgstr "O'rtacha ishlab chiqarish xarajati"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:181
msgid ""
"In addition to the cost of each individual |MO| for a product, Odoo also "
"tracks the average cost of manufacturing the product, taking into account "
"the cost of every completed |MO|. To view this, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Products --> Products`, and select a "
"product."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulot uchun har bir alohida |MO| xarajatidan tashqari, Odoo har bir "
"bajarilgan |MO| xarajatini hisobga olib, mahsulotni ishlab chiqarishning "
"o'rtacha xarajatini ham kuzatib boradi. Buni ko'rish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Products --> Products` yo'lidan "
"o'ting va mahsulotni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:185
msgid ""
"The manufacturing cost of the product is displayed per unit of measure in "
"the :guilabel:`Cost` field, located in the :guilabel:`General Information` "
"tab. The value continues to update as the costs of additional |MOs| are "
"factored into the average cost."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulotning ishlab chiqarish xarajati :guilabel:`General Information` "
"varag'ida joylashgan :guilabel:`Cost` maydonida o'lchov birligi boshiga "
"ko'rsatiladi. Qo'shimcha |MOs| xarajatlari o'rtacha xarajatga hisobga "
"olingani sari qiymat yangilanishda davom etadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:189
msgid ""
"To the right of the :guilabel:`Cost` field is a :guilabel:`Compute Price "
"from BoM` button, which only appears for products with at least one |BoM|. "
"Click this button to reset the cost of the product to the expected cost, "
"which only takes into account the components and operations listed on the |"
"BoM|."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cost` maydonining o'ng tomonida :guilabel:`Compute Price from "
"BoM` tugmasi joylashgan bo'lib, u faqat kamida bitta |BoM| ga ega bo'lgan "
"mahsulotlar uchun paydo bo'ladi. Mahsulot xarajatini faqat |BoM| da "
"keltirilgan komponentlar va operatsiyalarni hisobga oladigan kutilayotgan "
"xarajatga qaytarish uchun bu tugmani bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:196
msgid ""
"Be aware that clicking :guilabel:`Compute Price from BoM` does not set the "
"price permanently. The cost continues to update based on the average of the |"
"BoM| price and the real cost of any future |MOs|."
msgstr ""
"Shuni yodda tutingki, :guilabel:`Compute Price from BoM` tugmasini bosish "
"narxni doimiy ravishda belgilamaydi. Xarajat |BoM| narxi va kelajakdagi har "
"qanday |MOs| ning haqiqiy xarajati o'rtachasiga asoslanib yangilanishda "
"davom etadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:200
msgid "Example workflow: manufacturing cost"
msgstr "Namuna ish jarayoni: ishlab chiqarish xarajati"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:203
msgid ""
"Golf product manufacturer *Fairway Fields* produces a variety of golf "
"products, including an indoor *putting green*. They have configured a |BoM| "
"for the putting green, so Odoo automatically calculates the manufacturing "
"cost of each putting green |MO|."
msgstr ""
"Golf mahsulotlari ishlab chiqaruvchisi *Fairway Fields* turli golf "
"mahsulotlarini, jumladan xona ichidagi *putting green* ni ishlab chiqaradi. "
"Ular putting green uchun |BoM| sozlashgan, shuning uchun Odoo har bir "
"putting green |MO| ning ishlab chiqarish xarajatini avtomatik hisoblaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:207
msgid "The |BoM| lists two components:"
msgstr "|BoM| da ikkita komponent keltirilgan:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:209
msgid "One unit of *green felt*, which costs $20.00."
msgstr "Bir dona *yashil kigiz*, narxi $20.00."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:210
msgid "One unit of a *rubber pad*, which costs $30.00."
msgstr "Bir dona *rezina taglik*, narxi $30.00."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:212
msgid ""
"The |BoM| also lists four operations, all of which are carried out at "
"*Assembly Station 1*, which has an hourly operating cost of $30.00. Those "
"operations are as follows:"
msgstr ""
"|BoM| da shuningdek to'rtta operatsiya keltirilgan bo'lib, ularning barchasi "
"soatlik ishlash xarajati $30.00 bo'lgan *Assembly Station 1* da bajariladi. "
"Bu operatsiyalar quyidagilardir:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:215
msgid ""
"*Cut felt*: default duration of seven minutes, for a total cost of $3.50."
msgstr "*Cut felt*: standart davomiyligi yetti daqiqa, umumiy xarajati $3.50."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:216
msgid ""
"*Cut rubber pad*: default duration of five minutes, for a total cost of "
"$2.50."
msgstr ""
"*Cut rubber pad*: standart davomiyligi besh daqiqa, umumiy xarajati $2.50."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:217
msgid ""
"*Attach pad to felt*: default duration of 15 minutes, for a total cost of "
"$7.50."
msgstr ""
"*Attach pad to felt*: standart davomiyligi 15 daqiqa, umumiy xarajati $7.50."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:218
msgid ""
"*Cut holes*: default duration of three minutes, for a total cost of $1.50."
msgstr "*Cut holes*: standart davomiyligi uch daqiqa, umumiy xarajati $1.50."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:220
msgid ""
"Altogether, the components required to produce one putting green cost "
"$50.00, and the operations required cost $15.00, for a total manufacturing "
"cost of $65.00. This cost is reflected in the :guilabel:`Cost` field on the "
"putting green's product form."
msgstr ""
"Umuman olganda, bitta patting-grin ishlab chiqarish uchun zarur komponentlar "
"$50.00 turadi, zarur operatsiyalar esa $15.00 turadi, ya'ni umumiy ishlab "
"chiqarish xarajati $65.00 bo'ladi. Bu xarajat patting-grin mahsulot "
"formasidagi :guilabel:`Cost` maydonida aks etadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:224
msgid ""
"Fairway Fields confirms an |MO| for one putting green. Before manufacturing "
"starts, the |MO| overview lists a cost of `$65.00` in both the :guilabel:`MO "
"Cost` and :guilabel:`Real Cost` fields."
msgstr ""
"Fairway Fields bitta patting-grin uchun |MO| ni tasdiqlaydi. Ishlab "
"chiqarish boshlanishidan oldin |MO| umumiy ko'rinishida ham :guilabel:`MO "
"Cost`, ham :guilabel:`Real Cost` maydonlarida `$65.00` xarajat ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:None
msgid "The MO Overview page for one putting green, before production starts."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish boshlanishidan oldin bitta patting-grin uchun MO umumiy "
"ko'rinish sahifasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:231
msgid ""
"Manufacturing begins, and the operations take ten minutes longer than "
"expected, for a total manufacturing time of 40 minutes. This deviation from "
"the |BoM| is reflected on the |MO| overview, which now lists "
"a :guilabel:`Real Cost` of `$70.00`."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish boshlanadi va operatsiyalar kutilganidan o'n daqiqa ko'proq "
"vaqt oladi, ya'ni umumiy ishlab chiqarish vaqti 40 daqiqa bo'ladi. |BoM| dan "
"bu og'ish |MO| umumiy ko'rinishida aks etadi, unda endi :guilabel:`Real "
"Cost` `$70.00` deb ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:None
msgid "The MO Overview page for one putting green, during production."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish jarayonida bitta patting-grin uchun MO umumiy ko'rinish "
"sahifasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:238
msgid ""
"Once manufacturing is finished, and the |MO| is marked as *Done*, the |MO| "
"overview updates again, so the values in the :guilabel:`MO Cost` "
"and :guilabel:`Real Cost` columns match, each displaying a value of `$70.00`."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish tugagach va |MO| *Done* deb belgilangach, |MO| umumiy "
"ko'rinishi yana yangilanadi, shunda :guilabel:`MO Cost` va :guilabel:`Real "
"Cost` ustunlaridagi qiymatlar mos keladi va har birida `$70.00` qiymati "
"ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/mo_costs.rst:242
msgid ""
"On the putting green's product page, the :guilabel:`Cost` field now displays "
"a cost of `$67.50`, the average of the original cost of $65.00 and the real "
"cost of $70.00 from the |MO|."
msgstr ""
"Patting-grin mahsulot sahifasida :guilabel:`Cost` maydoni endi `$67.50` "
"xarajatni ko'rsatadi, bu dastlabki $65.00 xarajat va |MO| dagi $70.00 "
"haqiqiy xarajatning o'rtacha qiymatidir."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:3
msgid "One-step manufacturing"
msgstr "Bir bosqichli ishlab chiqarish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:9
msgid ""
"Odoo *Manufacturing* allows users to manufacture products using one, two, or "
"three steps. When using one-step manufacturing, Odoo creates a manufacturing "
"order (MO), but does not generate transfers for the movement of components "
"out of inventory or finished products into stock. Inventory counts still "
"update based on the number of components used and products manufactured, but "
"the act of transferring them to and from inventory is not tracked."
msgstr ""
"Odoo *Manufacturing* foydalanuvchilarga mahsulotlarni bir, ikki yoki uch "
"bosqichda ishlab chiqarish imkonini beradi. Bir bosqichli ishlab "
"chiqarishdan foydalanilganda, Odoo ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasi (MO) "
"yaratadi, ammo komponentlarni zaxiradan chiqarish yoki tayyor mahsulotlarni "
"zaxiraga kiritish harakatlari uchun ko'chirishlar (transfer) yaratmaydi. "
"Zaxira hisoblari ishlatilgan komponentlar va ishlab chiqarilgan mahsulotlar "
"soniga qarab baribir yangilanadi, ammo ularni zaxiraga va zaxiradan "
"ko'chirish jarayoni kuzatilmaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:16
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:15
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:16
msgid ""
"The number of steps used in manufacturing is set at the warehouse level, "
"allowing for each warehouse to use a different number of steps. To change "
"the number of steps used for a specific warehouse, begin by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Warehouses`, and then "
"select a warehouse from the :guilabel:`Warehouses` screen."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarishda ishlatiladigan bosqichlar soni ombor darajasida "
"belgilanadi, bu har bir ombor uchun turli sonli bosqichlardan foydalanish "
"imkonini beradi. Muayyan ombor uchun ishlatiladigan bosqichlar sonini "
"o'zgartirish uchun avval :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> "
"Warehouses` yo'lidan o'ting, so'ngra :guilabel:`Warehouses` ekranidan "
"omborni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:21
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:20
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:21
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Warehouse Configuration` tab, find "
"the :guilabel:`Manufacture` radio input field, and select one of the three "
"options: :guilabel:`Manufacture (1 step)`, :guilabel:`Pick components and "
"then manufacture (2 steps)`, or :guilabel:`Pick components, manufacture and "
"then store products (3 steps)`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Warehouse Configuration` varag'ida :guilabel:`Manufacture` radio "
"kiritish maydonini toping va uchta variantdan birini "
"tanlang: :guilabel:`Manufacture (1 step)`, :guilabel:`Pick components and "
"then manufacture (2 steps)` yoki :guilabel:`Pick components, manufacture and "
"then store products (3 steps)`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:0
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:0
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:0
msgid "The Manufacture radio input field on a warehouse configuration page."
msgstr ""
"Ombor konfiguratsiyasi sahifasidagi Manufacture radio kiritish maydoni."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:33
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:30
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:31
msgid "Create manufacturing order"
msgstr "Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasini yaratish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:35
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:32
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:33
msgid ""
"To manufacture a product in Odoo *Manufacturing*, begin by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders`, "
"and then click :guilabel:`New` to create a new |MO|."
msgstr ""
"Odoo *Manufacturing* da mahsulot ishlab chiqarish uchun "
"avval :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders` "
"yo'lidan o'ting, so'ngra yangi |MO| yaratish uchun :guilabel:`New` tugmasini "
"bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:39
msgid ""
"On the new |MO|, select the product to be produced from "
"the :guilabel:`Product` drop-down menu. The :guilabel:`Bill of Material` "
"field auto-populates with the associated bill of materials (BoM)."
msgstr ""
"Yangi |MO| da ishlab chiqariladigan mahsulotni :guilabel:`Product` "
"ochiluvchi menyusidan tanlang. :guilabel:`Bill of Material` maydoni tegishli "
"materiallar ro'yxati (BoM) bilan avtomatik to'ldiriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:42
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:39
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:40
msgid ""
"If a product has more than one |BOM| configured for it, the specific |BOM| "
"can be selected in the :guilabel:`Bill of Material` field, and "
"the :guilabel:`Product` field auto-populates with the associated product."
msgstr ""
"Agar mahsulot uchun bir nechta |BOM| sozlangan bo'lsa, muayyan |BOM| "
"ni :guilabel:`Bill of Material` maydonida tanlash mumkin, "
"shunda :guilabel:`Product` maydoni tegishli mahsulot bilan avtomatik "
"to'ldiriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:46
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:43
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:44
msgid ""
"After a |BOM| has been selected, the :guilabel:`Components` "
"and :guilabel:`Work Orders` tabs auto-populate with the components and "
"operations specified on the |BOM|. If additional components or operations "
"are required for the |MO| being configured, add them to "
"the :guilabel:`Components` and :guilabel:`Work Orders` tabs by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Add a line`."
msgstr ""
"|BOM| tanlangandan so'ng, :guilabel:`Components` va :guilabel:`Work Orders` "
"varaqlari |BOM| da ko'rsatilgan komponentlar va operatsiyalar bilan "
"avtomatik to'ldiriladi. Agar sozlanayotgan |MO| uchun qo'shimcha "
"komponentlar yoki operatsiyalar zarur bo'lsa, ularni :guilabel:`Add a line` "
"tugmasini bosish orqali :guilabel:`Components` va :guilabel:`Work Orders` "
"varaqlariga qo'shing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:51
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:48
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:49
msgid "Finally, click :guilabel:`Confirm` to confirm the |MO|."
msgstr ""
"Nihoyat, |MO| ni tasdiqlash uchun :guilabel:`Confirm` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:54
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:75
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:72
msgid "Process manufacturing order"
msgstr "Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasini qayta ishlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:56
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:77
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:74
msgid ""
"An |MO| is processed by completing all of the work orders listed under "
"its :guilabel:`Work Orders` tab. This can be done on the |MO| itself, or "
"from the work order tablet view."
msgstr ""
"|MO| uning :guilabel:`Work Orders` varag'ida sanab o'tilgan barcha ish "
"buyurtmalarini bajarish orqali qayta ishlanadi. Buni |MO| ning o'zida yoki "
"ish buyurtmasining planshet ko'rinishida amalga oshirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:60
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:81
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:78
msgid "Basic workflow"
msgstr "Asosiy ish jarayoni"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:62
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:80
msgid ""
"To complete work orders from the |MO| itself, begin by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders`, "
"and then select an |MO|."
msgstr ""
"Ish buyurtmalarini |MO| ning o'zidan bajarish uchun "
"avval :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders` "
"yo'lidan o'ting, so'ngra |MO| ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:65
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:86
msgid ""
"On the |MO| page, select the :guilabel:`Work Orders` tab. Once work begins "
"on the first work order that needs to be completed, click "
"the :guilabel:`Start` button for that work order. Odoo *Manufacturing* then "
"starts a timer that keeps track of how long the work order takes to complete."
msgstr ""
"|MO| sahifasida :guilabel:`Work Orders` varag'ini tanlang. Bajarilishi kerak "
"bo'lgan birinchi ish buyurtmasi bo'yicha ish boshlangach, o'sha ish "
"buyurtmasi uchun :guilabel:`Start` tugmasini bosing. Shunda Odoo "
"*Manufacturing* ish buyurtmasini bajarish qancha vaqt olishini kuzatib "
"boruvchi taymerni ishga tushiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:None
msgid "The Start button for an operation on a manufacturing order."
msgstr "Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasidagi operatsiya uchun Start tugmasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:73
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:94
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:91
msgid ""
"When the work order is completed, click the :guilabel:`Done` button for that "
"work order. Repeat the same process for each work order listed on "
"the :guilabel:`Work Orders` tab."
msgstr ""
"Ish buyurtmasi bajarilgach, o'sha ish buyurtmasi uchun :guilabel:`Done` "
"tugmasini bosing. :guilabel:`Work Orders` varag'ida sanab o'tilgan har bir "
"ish buyurtmasi uchun xuddi shu jarayonni takrorlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:None
msgid "The Done button for an operation on a manufacturing order."
msgstr "Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasidagi operatsiya uchun Done tugmasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:80
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:101
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:98
msgid ""
"After completing all of the work orders, click :guilabel:`Produce All` at "
"the top of the screen to mark the |MO| as :guilabel:`Done`, and register the "
"manufactured product(s) into inventory."
msgstr ""
"Barcha ish buyurtmalarini bajarganingizdan so'ng, |MO| ni :guilabel:`Done` "
"deb belgilash va ishlab chiqarilgan mahsulot(lar)ni zaxiraga ro'yxatga olish "
"uchun ekranning yuqori qismidagi :guilabel:`Produce All` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:84
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:105
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:102
msgid "Shop Floor workflow"
msgstr "Shop Floor ish jarayoni"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:86
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:107
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:104
msgid ""
"To complete the work orders for an |MO| using the *Shop Floor* module, begin "
"by navigating to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> "
"Manufacturing Orders`, and then select an |MO|."
msgstr ""
"*Shop Floor* modulidan foydalanib |MO| uchun ish buyurtmalarini bajarish "
"uchun avval :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing "
"Orders` yo'lidan o'ting, so'ngra |MO| ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:89
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:110
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:107
msgid ""
"On the |MO|, click on the :guilabel:`Work Orders` tab, and then select "
"the :guilabel:`↗️ (square with arrow coming out of it)` button on the line of "
"the first work order to be processed. Doing so opens a :guilabel:`Work "
"Orders` pop-up window, with details and processing options for the work "
"order."
msgstr ""
"|MO| da :guilabel:`Work Orders` varag'ini bosing, so'ngra qayta ishlanishi "
"kerak bo'lgan birinchi ish buyurtmasi qatoridagi :guilabel:`↗️ (square with "
"arrow coming out of it)` tugmasini tanlang. Shunda ish buyurtmasi haqidagi "
"tafsilotlar va qayta ishlash variantlari ko'rsatilgan :guilabel:`Work "
"Orders` qalqib chiquvchi oynasi ochiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:94
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:115
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:112
msgid ""
"On the pop-up window, select the :guilabel:`Open Shop Floor` button at the "
"top-left of the window to open the *Shop Floor* module."
msgstr ""
"Qalqib chiquvchi oynada *Shop Floor* modulini ochish uchun oynaning yuqori "
"chap qismidagi :guilabel:`Open Shop Floor` tugmasini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:None
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:None
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:None
msgid "The Open Shop Floor button for a work order on a manufacturing order."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasidagi ish buyurtmasi uchun Open Shop Floor tugmasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:101
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:122
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:119
msgid ""
"When accessed directly from a specific work order within an |MO|, *Shop "
"Floor* defaults to the page for the work center where the work order is "
"configured to be carried out. The page shows a card for the work order that "
"displays the |MO| number, the product and number of units to be produced, "
"and the steps required to complete the work order."
msgstr ""
"|MO| ichidagi muayyan ish buyurtmasidan to'g'ridan-to'g'ri kirilganda, *Shop "
"Floor* standart holatda ish buyurtmasi bajarilishi sozlangan ish markazi "
"sahifasini ochadi. Sahifada ish buyurtmasi uchun |MO| raqami, mahsulot va "
"ishlab chiqarilishi kerak bo'lgan birliklar soni hamda ish buyurtmasini "
"bajarish uchun zarur qadamlar ko'rsatilgan karta aks etadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:None
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:None
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:None
msgid "A work order card on a work center page in the Shop Floor module."
msgstr "Shop Floor modulidagi ish markazi sahifasidagi ish buyurtmasi kartasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:110
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:128
msgid ""
"A work order is processed by completing each step listed on its card. This "
"can be done by clicking on a step and following the instructions listed on "
"the pop-up window that appears. Once the step is completed, "
"click :guilabel:`Next` to move on to the next step, if any are required."
msgstr ""
"Ish buyurtmasi uning kartasida sanab o'tilgan har bir qadamni bajarish "
"orqali qayta ishlanadi. Buni qadamni bosish va paydo bo'lgan qalqib "
"chiquvchi oynada ko'rsatilgan ko'rsatmalarga rioya qilish orqali amalga "
"oshirish mumkin. Qadam bajarilgach, agar yana qadamlar zarur bo'lsa, keyingi "
"qadamga o'tish uchun :guilabel:`Next` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:114
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:135
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:132
msgid ""
"Alternatively, work order steps can be completed by clicking the checkbox "
"that appears on the right side of the step's line on the work order card. "
"When using this method, the step is automatically marked as completed, "
"without a pop-up window appearing."
msgstr ""
"Shu bilan bir qatorda, ish buyurtmasi qadamlarini ish buyurtmasi kartasida "
"qadam qatorining o'ng tomonida paydo bo'ladigan belgilash katakchasini "
"bosish orqali ham bajarish mumkin. Bu usuldan foydalanilganda, qadam qalqib "
"chiquvchi oyna paydo bo'lmasdan avtomatik ravishda bajarilgan deb "
"belgilanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:118
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:139
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:136
msgid ""
"The final step on a work order card is titled *Register Production*. This "
"step is used to register the number of product units that were produced. If "
"the number produced is equal to the number that the |MO| was created for, "
"click the :guilabel:`# Units` button on the right side of the line to "
"automatically register that number as the quantity produced."
msgstr ""
"Ish buyurtmasi kartasidagi oxirgi qadam *Register Production* deb nomlanadi. "
"Bu qadam ishlab chiqarilgan mahsulot birliklari sonini ro'yxatga olish uchun "
"ishlatiladi. Agar ishlab chiqarilgan son |MO| yaratilgan songa teng bo'lsa, "
"o'sha sonni ishlab chiqarilgan miqdor sifatida avtomatik ro'yxatga olish "
"uchun qatorning o'ng tomonidagi :guilabel:`# Units` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:123
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:144
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:141
msgid ""
"If a different number must be entered, click the :guilabel:`Register "
"Production` step to open a pop-up window. Enter the number of units produced "
"in the :guilabel:`Units` field, and then click :guilabel:`Validate` to "
"register that number."
msgstr ""
"Agar boshqa son kiritilishi kerak bo'lsa, qalqib chiquvchi oynani ochish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Register Production` qadamini bosing. Ishlab chiqarilgan "
"birliklar sonini :guilabel:`Units` maydoniga kiriting, so'ngra o'sha sonni "
"ro'yxatga olish uchun :guilabel:`Validate` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:128
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:149
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:146
msgid ""
"The *Register Production* step appears on every work order card. It must be "
"completed for the first work order that is processed. After doing so, the "
"step appears as already completed for each remaining work order in the |MO|."
msgstr ""
"*Register Production* qadami har bir ish buyurtmasi kartasida paydo bo'ladi. "
"U qayta ishlanadigan birinchi ish buyurtmasi uchun bajarilishi shart. "
"Shundan so'ng bu qadam |MO| dagi qolgan har bir ish buyurtmasi uchun "
"allaqachon bajarilgan deb ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:132
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:153
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:150
msgid ""
"After completing all of the steps for a work order, a button appears on the "
"footer of the work order card. If any other work orders must be completed "
"before the |MO| can be closed, the button is titled :guilabel:`Mark as "
"Done`. If there are no additional work orders to complete, the button is "
"titled :guilabel:`Close Production`."
msgstr ""
"Ish buyurtmasi uchun barcha qadamlar bajarilgandan so'ng, ish buyurtmasi "
"kartasining pastki qismida tugma paydo bo'ladi. Agar |MO| yopilishidan oldin "
"boshqa ish buyurtmalari bajarilishi kerak bo'lsa, tugma :guilabel:`Mark as "
"Done` deb nomlanadi. Agar bajarilishi kerak bo'lgan qo'shimcha ish "
"buyurtmalari bo'lmasa, tugma :guilabel:`Close Production` deb nomlanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:137
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:158
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:155
msgid ""
"Clicking :guilabel:`Mark as Done` causes the work order card to fade away. "
"Once it disappears completely, the work order's status is marked as "
"*Finished* on the |MO|, and the next work order appears in the *Shop Floor* "
"module, on the page of the work center where it is configured to be carried "
"out. Any additional work orders can be processed using the instructions "
"detailed in this section."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Mark as Done` tugmasini bosish ish buyurtmasi kartasining asta-"
"sekin yo'qolishiga olib keladi. U to'liq yo'qolgach, ish buyurtmasining "
"holati |MO| da *Finished* deb belgilanadi va keyingi ish buyurtmasi *Shop "
"Floor* modulida, u bajarilishi sozlangan ish markazi sahifasida paydo "
"bo'ladi. Har qanday qo'shimcha ish buyurtmalarini ushbu bo'limda batafsil "
"bayon qilingan ko'rsatmalar yordamida qayta ishlash mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:143
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:164
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:161
msgid ""
"Clicking :guilabel:`Close Production` causes the work order card to fade "
"away. Once it disappears, the |MO| is marked as *Done*, and the units of the "
"product that were produced are entered into inventory."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Close Production` tugmasini bosish ish buyurtmasi kartasining "
"asta-sekin yo'qolishiga olib keladi. U yo'qolgach, |MO| *Done* deb "
"belgilanadi va ishlab chiqarilgan mahsulot birliklari zaxiraga kiritiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:147
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:168
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:165
msgid ""
"After clicking :guilabel:`Mark as Done` or :guilabel:`Close Production`, "
"each button is replaced by an :guilabel:`Undo` button. Click "
"the :guilabel:`Undo` button before the work order card fades away to keep "
"the work order open."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Mark as Done` yoki :guilabel:`Close Production` tugmasini "
"bosgandan so'ng, har bir tugma :guilabel:`Undo` tugmasi bilan "
"almashtiriladi. Ish buyurtmasini ochiq holda saqlash uchun ish buyurtmasi "
"kartasi yo'qolib ketishidan oldin :guilabel:`Undo` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:152
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:173
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:170
msgid ""
"This section details the basic workflow for processing an |MO| in the *Shop "
"Floor* module. For a more in-depth explanation of the module and all of its "
"features, please see the :doc:`../shop_floor/shop_floor_overview` "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu bo'limda *Shop Floor* modulida |MO| ni qayta ishlashning asosiy ish "
"jarayoni batafsil bayon qilingan. Modul va uning barcha imkoniyatlari haqida "
"chuqurroq tushuntirish uchun :doc:`../shop_floor/shop_floor_overview` "
"hujjatiga qarang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:3
msgid "Three-step manufacturing"
msgstr "Uch bosqichli ishlab chiqarish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:9
msgid ""
"Odoo *Manufacturing* allows users to manufacture products using one, two, or "
"three steps. When using three-step manufacturing, Odoo creates a pick "
"components transfer, a manufacturing order (MO), and a store finished "
"products transfer, and updates inventory counts based on the number of "
"components removed, and finished products created."
msgstr ""
"Odoo *Manufacturing* foydalanuvchilarga mahsulotlarni bir, ikki yoki uch "
"bosqichda ishlab chiqarish imkonini beradi. Uch bosqichli ishlab "
"chiqarishdan foydalanilganda, Odoo komponentlarni yig'ish ko'chirishini, "
"ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasini (MO) va tayyor mahsulotlarni saqlash "
"ko'chirishini yaratadi hamda olib chiqilgan komponentlar va yaratilgan "
"tayyor mahsulotlar soniga qarab zaxira hisoblarini yangilaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:36
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:37
msgid ""
"On the new |MO|, select the product to be produced from "
"the :guilabel:`Product` drop-down menu. The :guilabel:`Bill of Material` "
"field auto-populates with the associated Bill of Materials (BoM)."
msgstr ""
"Yangi |MO| da ishlab chiqariladigan mahsulotni :guilabel:`Product` "
"ochiluvchi menyusidan tanlang. :guilabel:`Bill of Material` maydoni tegishli "
"materiallar ro'yxati (BoM) bilan avtomatik to'ldiriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:51
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:52
msgid "Process pick components transfer"
msgstr "Komponentlarni yig'ish ko'chirishini qayta ishlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:53
msgid ""
"After confirming a three-step |MO|, a :guilabel:`Transfers` smart button "
"appears at the top of the page. Click it to be taken to "
"the :guilabel:`Transfers` page for the |MO|. The page lists two transfers: "
"*WH/PC/XXXXX* (the pick components transfer), and *WH/SFP/XXXXX* (the store "
"finished products transfer)."
msgstr ""
"Uch bosqichli |MO| tasdiqlangandan so'ng, sahifaning yuqori "
"qismida :guilabel:`Transfers` aqlli tugmasi paydo bo'ladi. |MO| "
"uchun :guilabel:`Transfers` sahifasiga o'tish uchun uni bosing. Sahifada "
"ikkita ko'chirish sanab o'tilgan: *WH/PC/XXXXX* (komponentlarni yig'ish "
"ko'chirishi) va *WH/SFP/XXXXX* (tayyor mahsulotlarni saqlash ko'chirishi)."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:58
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`WH/PC/XXXXX` to open the pick components transfer for the |"
"MO|. This transfer is used to track the movement of components from the "
"locations where they are stored to the location where they are used to "
"manufacture the product."
msgstr ""
"|MO| uchun komponentlarni yig'ish ko'chirishini ochish uchun :guilabel:`WH/"
"PC/XXXXX` ni tanlang. Bu ko'chirish komponentlarning saqlanadigan joylaridan "
"mahsulot ishlab chiqarish uchun ishlatiladigan joyga harakatini kuzatish "
"uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:62
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:59
msgid ""
"After transferring the components out of their storage location, "
"click :guilabel:`Validate` at the top of the transfer, followed "
"by :guilabel:`Apply` on the :guilabel:`Immediate Transfer?` pop-up window "
"that appears. Doing so marks the transfer as :guilabel:`Done`, and updates "
"inventory counts to reflect the quantity of components transferred."
msgstr ""
"Komponentlarni saqlash joyidan ko'chirgandan so'ng, ko'chirishning yuqori "
"qismidagi :guilabel:`Validate` tugmasini, so'ngra paydo "
"bo'lgan :guilabel:`Immediate Transfer?` qalqib chiquvchi "
"oynasidagi :guilabel:`Apply` tugmasini bosing. Shunda "
"ko'chirish :guilabel:`Done` deb belgilanadi va ko'chirilgan komponentlar "
"miqdorini aks ettirish uchun zaxira hisoblari yangilanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:67
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:64
msgid ""
"Finally, return to the |MO| by clicking the :guilabel:`WH/MO/XXXXX` "
"breadcrumb at the top of the page."
msgstr ""
"Nihoyat, sahifaning yuqori qismidagi :guilabel:`WH/MO/XXXXX` yo'l "
"ko'rsatkichini bosish orqali |MO| ga qayting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:None
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:None
msgid "The manufacturing order bread crumb on a pick components transfer."
msgstr ""
"Komponentlarni yig'ish ko'chirishidagi ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasi yo'l "
"ko'rsatkichi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:83
msgid ""
"To complete work orders from the |MO| itself, begin by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders`, "
"and then select a manufacturing order."
msgstr ""
"Ish buyurtmalarini |MO| ning o'zidan bajarish uchun "
"avval :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders` "
"yo'lidan o'ting, so'ngra ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:None
msgid "The Start button for a work order on a manufacturing order."
msgstr "Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasidagi ish buyurtmasi uchun Start tugmasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:None
msgid "The Done button for an work order on a manufacturing order."
msgstr "Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasidagi ish buyurtmasi uchun Done tugmasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:131
msgid ""
"A work order is processed by completing each step listed on its card. This "
"can be done by clicking on a step, and following the instructions listed on "
"the pop-up window that appears. Once the step is completed, "
"click :guilabel:`Next` to move on to the next step, if any are required."
msgstr ""
"Ish buyurtmasi uning kartasida ko'rsatilgan har bir qadamni bajarish orqali "
"qayta ishlanadi. Buni qadamni bosish va paydo bo'ladigan qalqib chiquvchi "
"oynada ko'rsatilgan ko'rsatmalarga amal qilish orqali bajarish mumkin. Qadam "
"bajarilgandan so'ng, agar yana qadamlar talab qilinsa, keyingi qadamga "
"o'tish uchun :guilabel:`Next` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:178
msgid "Process finished product transfer"
msgstr "Tayyor mahsulot ko'chirishini (transfer) qayta ishlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:180
msgid ""
"After completing the |MO|, return to the order's :guilabel:`Transfers` page "
"by clicking the :guilabel:`Transfers` button at the top of the order. This "
"time, select :guilabel:`WH/SFP/XXXXX` to open the store finished products "
"transfer. This transfer is used to track the movement of finished products "
"from the location where they were manufactured to the location where they "
"are stored."
msgstr ""
"|MO| ni yakunlagandan so'ng, buyurtmaning yuqori "
"qismidagi :guilabel:`Transfers` tugmasini bosib, "
"buyurtmaning :guilabel:`Transfers` sahifasiga qayting. Bu safar tayyor "
"mahsulotlarni saqlashga qo'yish ko'chirishini ochish uchun :guilabel:`WH/SFP/"
"XXXXX` ni tanlang. Bu ko'chirish tayyor mahsulotlarning ishlab chiqarilgan "
"joyidan saqlanadigan joyiga harakatini kuzatish uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:185
msgid ""
"After transferring the finished products to their storage location, "
"click :guilabel:`Validate` at the top of the transfer, followed "
"by :guilabel:`Apply` on the :guilabel:`Immediate Transfer?` pop-up window "
"that appears. Doing so marks the transfer as :guilabel:`Done`, and updates "
"inventory counts to reflect the quantity of finished products transferred."
msgstr ""
"Tayyor mahsulotlarni saqlash joyiga ko'chirgandan so'ng, ko'chirishning "
"yuqori qismidagi :guilabel:`Validate` tugmasini bosing, so'ngra paydo "
"bo'ladigan :guilabel:`Immediate Transfer?` qalqib chiquvchi "
"oynasida :guilabel:`Apply` tugmasini bosing. Shunday qilinganda "
"ko'chirish :guilabel:`Done` deb belgilanadi va zaxira hisoblari ko'chirilgan "
"tayyor mahsulotlar miqdorini aks ettirish uchun yangilanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:3
msgid "Two-step manufacturing"
msgstr "Ikki bosqichli ishlab chiqarish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:9
msgid ""
"Odoo *Manufacturing* allows users to manufacture products using one, two, or "
"three steps. When using two-step manufacturing, Odoo creates a manufacturing "
"order (MO) and a pick components transfer, but does not generate a transfer "
"for the movement of finished products into stock. Inventory counts still "
"update based on the number of products manufactured, but the act of "
"transferring them to and from inventory is not tracked."
msgstr ""
"Odoo *Manufacturing* foydalanuvchilarga mahsulotlarni bir, ikki yoki uch "
"bosqichda ishlab chiqarish imkonini beradi. Ikki bosqichli ishlab "
"chiqarishdan foydalanilganda, Odoo ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasi (MO) va "
"komponentlarni yig'ish ko'chirishini yaratadi, lekin tayyor mahsulotlarni "
"zaxiraga o'tkazish harakati uchun ko'chirish yaratmaydi. Zaxira hisoblari "
"baribir ishlab chiqarilgan mahsulotlar soniga qarab yangilanadi, ammo ularni "
"zaxiraga va zaxiradan ko'chirish harakati kuzatilmaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:54
msgid ""
"After confirming a two-step |MO|, a :guilabel:`Transfers` smart button "
"appears at the top of the page. Click it to open the pick components "
"transfer for the |MO|. This transfer is used to track the movement of "
"components from the locations where they are stored to the location where "
"they are used to manufacture the product."
msgstr ""
"Ikki bosqichli |MO| tasdiqlangandan so'ng, sahifaning yuqori "
"qismida :guilabel:`Transfers` smart tugmasi paydo bo'ladi. |MO| uchun "
"komponentlarni yig'ish ko'chirishini ochish uchun uni bosing. Bu ko'chirish "
"komponentlarning saqlanadigan joylaridan mahsulotni ishlab chiqarishda "
"ishlatiladigan joyga harakatini kuzatish uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:83
msgid ""
"On the |MO| page, select the :guilabel:`Work Orders` tab. Once work begins "
"on the first work order that needs to be completed, click "
"the :guilabel:`Start` button for that operation. Odoo *Manufacturing* then "
"starts a timer that keeps track of how long the work order takes to complete."
msgstr ""
"|MO| sahifasida :guilabel:`Work Orders` varag'ini tanlang. Bajarilishi kerak "
"bo'lgan birinchi ish buyurtmasi bo'yicha ish boshlangach, o'sha operatsiya "
"uchun :guilabel:`Start` tugmasini bosing. Shundan so'ng Odoo *Manufacturing* "
"ish buyurtmasini bajarish qancha vaqt olishini kuzatib boruvchi taymerni "
"ishga tushiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:None
msgid "The Start button for an work order on a manufacturing order."
msgstr "Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasidagi ish buyurtmasi uchun Start tugmasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:None
msgid "The Done button for a work order on a manufacturing order."
msgstr "Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasidagi ish buyurtmasi uchun Done tugmasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:3
msgid "Work-in-progress costs"
msgstr "Tugallanmagan ishlab chiqarish (WIP) xarajatlari"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:10
msgid ""
"When manufacturing processes take extended periods to complete, temporary "
"*work-in-progress (WIP)* :ref:`accounting journal entries <cheat_sheet/"
"journals>` can help to accurately reflect the value of partially completed "
"goods in financial statements, as well as potential insights on where cash "
"might be tied up in the manufacturing process."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish jarayonlari yakunlanishi uzoq vaqt talab qilganda, "
"vaqtinchalik *tugallanmagan ishlab chiqarish (WIP)* :ref:`buxgalteriya "
"jurnal yozuvlari <cheat_sheet/journals>` qisman tugallangan tovarlar "
"qiymatini moliyaviy hisobotlarda aniq aks ettirishga, shuningdek, ishlab "
"chiqarish jarayonida pul mablag'lari qayerda band bo'lishi mumkinligi haqida "
"tasavvur berishga yordam beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:15
msgid ""
"The **Manufacturing** app provides the option to manually post and reverse |"
"WIP| journal entries associated with an ongoing manufacturing order (MO) to "
"account for the *real cost* of components, work centers, and labor that have "
"already been incurred at the time the entry is posted."
msgstr ""
"**Manufacturing** ilovasi davom etayotgan ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasi (MO) "
"bilan bog'liq |WIP| jurnal yozuvlarini qo'lda joylashtirish va qaytarish "
"imkoniyatini taqdim etadi, bu yozuv joylashtirilgan paytga qadar allaqachon "
"sarflangan komponentlar, ish markazlari va mehnatning *haqiqiy xarajatini* "
"hisobga olish uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:22
msgid "Costs included in WIP entries"
msgstr "WIP yozuvlariga kiritilgan xarajatlar"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:24
msgid ""
"Consumption that is factored into the |WIP| accounting entry can be viewed "
"in the |MO|. Those values are used to calculate the total *real cost* in the "
"|MO| overview."
msgstr ""
"|WIP| buxgalteriya yozuviga kiritiladigan sarfni |MO| da ko'rish mumkin. Bu "
"qiymatlar |MO| umumiy ko'rinishida jami *haqiqiy xarajatni* hisoblash uchun "
"ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:28
msgid ""
"To configure the unit prices and hourly rates used to calculate |WIP| costs, "
"see :doc:`Manufacturing order costs <mo_costs>`."
msgstr ""
"|WIP| xarajatlarini hisoblash uchun ishlatiladigan birlik narxlari va "
"soatlik stavkalarni sozlash uchun :doc:`Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasi "
"xarajatlari <mo_costs>` sahifasiga qarang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:34
msgid "Consumption"
msgstr "Sarflanish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:36
msgid ""
"To view the *consumed* component quantities for a |WIP| order, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders`, "
"then select the |MO|. In the :guilabel:`Components` tab, "
"the :guilabel:`Consumed` column shows the quantity that has already been "
"consumed for each component in the |MO|."
msgstr ""
"|WIP| buyurtmasi uchun *sarflangan* komponent miqdorlarini ko'rish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders` "
"yo'lidan o'ting, so'ngra |MO| ni tanlang. :guilabel:`Components` "
"varag'ida :guilabel:`Consumed` ustuni |MO| dagi har bir komponent uchun "
"allaqachon sarflangan miqdorni ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:None
msgid "MO Components tab with the quantity of components consumed."
msgstr "Sarflangan komponentlar miqdori ko'rsatilgan MO Components varag'i."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:44
msgid ""
"To view the *real duration* of work order operations for a |WIP| order, "
"navigate to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing "
"Orders`, then select the |MO|. In the :guilabel:`Work Orders` tab, "
"the :guilabel:`Real Duration` column shows the duration of work that has "
"already been carried out for each operation in the |MO|."
msgstr ""
"|WIP| buyurtmasi uchun ish buyurtmasi operatsiyalarining *haqiqiy "
"davomiyligini* ko'rish uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --"
"> Manufacturing Orders` yo'lidan o'ting, so'ngra |MO| ni "
"tanlang. :guilabel:`Work Orders` varag'ida :guilabel:`Real Duration` ustuni |"
"MO| dagi har bir operatsiya uchun allaqachon bajarilgan ish davomiyligini "
"ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:None
msgid "MO Work Orders tab with the real-world duration of operations."
msgstr ""
"Operatsiyalarning haqiqiy davomiyligi ko'rsatilgan MO Work Orders varag'i."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:55
msgid "Real costs"
msgstr "Haqiqiy xarajatlar"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:57
msgid ""
"To view the *real costs* of consumed components and labor, click "
"the :guilabel:`Overview` smart button to visit the *MO Overview*. "
"The :guilabel:`MO Cost` column represents planned costs based on the bill of "
"materials, while the :guilabel:`Real Cost` column reflects actual incurred "
"costs that will be recorded in the |WIP| entry. Work center overhead costs "
"and labor costs are grouped together under the *Operations* section. The "
"totals for both the :guilabel:`MO Cost` (expected) and :guilabel:`Real Cost` "
"(incurred) are displayed in the :guilabel:`Unit Cost` row at the bottom."
msgstr ""
"Sarflangan komponentlar va mehnatning *haqiqiy xarajatlarini* ko'rish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Overview` smart tugmasini bosib, *MO Overview* sahifasiga "
"o'ting. :guilabel:`MO Cost` ustuni materiallar ro'yxatiga (BoM) asoslangan "
"rejalashtirilgan xarajatlarni ifodalaydi, :guilabel:`Real Cost` ustuni esa |"
"WIP| yozuvida qayd etiladigan haqiqatda sarflangan xarajatlarni aks "
"ettiradi. Ish markazining qo'shimcha xarajatlari va mehnat xarajatlari "
"*Operations* bo'limi ostida birlashtirilgan. Ham :guilabel:`MO Cost` "
"(kutilgan), ham :guilabel:`Real Cost` (sarflangan) uchun jami qiymatlar "
"pastdagi :guilabel:`Unit Cost` qatorida ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:None
msgid ""
"Manufacturing overview with the real costs for components and operations."
msgstr ""
"Komponentlar va operatsiyalar uchun haqiqiy xarajatlar ko'rsatilgan ishlab "
"chiqarish umumiy ko'rinishi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:67
msgid ""
"Amounts displayed in red or green highlight significant differences between "
"the :guilabel:`MO Cost` and :guilabel:`Real Cost` for each line item. This "
"can help identify potential issues in the manufacturing process, such as "
"unusually high component prices or slow operations."
msgstr ""
"Qizil yoki yashil rangda ko'rsatilgan summalar har bir qator elementi "
"uchun :guilabel:`MO Cost` va :guilabel:`Real Cost` o'rtasidagi sezilarli "
"farqlarni ajratib ko'rsatadi. Bu ishlab chiqarish jarayonidagi ehtimoliy "
"muammolarni, masalan, g'ayrioddiy yuqori komponent narxlari yoki sekin "
"operatsiyalarni aniqlashga yordam berishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:76
msgid ""
"By default, the Odoo database tracks the value of |WIP| costs under the "
"*Current Assets* :ref:`account type <chart-of-account/type>`. These default "
"accounts can be replaced with custom accounts."
msgstr ""
"Standart holatda Odoo ma'lumotlar bazasi |WIP| xarajatlari qiymatini "
"*Current Assets* :ref:`hisob turi <chart-of-account/type>` ostida kuzatib "
"boradi. Bu standart hisoblarni maxsus hisoblar bilan almashtirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:80
msgid ""
"To configure |WIP| accounts, navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, then scroll down to the *Inventory Valuation* "
"section. Under the *Manufacturing* section, select the accounts for both of "
"the drop-down fields:"
msgstr ""
"|WIP| hisoblarini sozlash uchun :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration "
"--> Settings` yo'lidan o'ting, so'ngra *Inventory Valuation* bo'limiga "
"pastga tushing. *Manufacturing* bo'limi ostida ikkala ochiluvchi maydon "
"uchun hisoblarni tanlang:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:84
msgid ""
":guilabel:`WIP Account`: tracks the value of |WIP| goods. The default "
"account is **110500 Work in Progress**."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`WIP Account`: |WIP| tovarlari qiymatini kuzatib boradi. Standart "
"hisob — **110500 Work in Progress**."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:86
msgid ""
":guilabel:`WIP Overhead Account`: tracks overhead costs. The default account "
"is **110400 Cost of Production**."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`WIP Overhead Account`: qo'shimcha xarajatlarni kuzatib boradi. "
"Standart hisob — **110400 Cost of Production**."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:92
msgid "WIP entry workflow"
msgstr "WIP yozuvi ish jarayoni"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:94
msgid ""
"|WIP| accounting entries are not automatically tied to |MO| progress. They "
"reflect costs at the moment the entry is posted, based on what has already "
"been consumed. These entries must be :ref:`manually posted <manufacturing/"
"basic_setup/post-wip-entries>` in order to accurately reflect |WIP| "
"valuation in the **Accounting** app."
msgstr ""
"|WIP| buxgalteriya yozuvlari |MO| jarayoniga avtomatik ravishda "
"bog'lanmaydi. Ular yozuv joylashtirilgan paytdagi xarajatlarni, allaqachon "
"sarflangan narsalar asosida aks ettiradi. |WIP| baholashni **Accounting** "
"ilovasida aniq aks ettirish uchun bu yozuvlar :ref:`qo'lda joylashtirilishi "
"<manufacturing/basic_setup/post-wip-entries>` kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:99
msgid ""
"|WIP| entries also need to be :ref:`reversed <manufacturing/basic_setup/"
"reverse-wip-entries>` once the manufacturing process is complete. These "
"entries are used to temporarily reflect manufacturing consumption and need "
"to be returned to an empty state in order to be used again in another "
"period. If needed, they can be reversed manually."
msgstr ""
"Shuningdek, ishlab chiqarish jarayoni yakunlangandan so'ng |WIP| "
"yozuvlari :ref:`qaytarilishi <manufacturing/basic_setup/reverse-wip-"
"entries>` kerak. Bu yozuvlar ishlab chiqarish sarfini vaqtincha aks ettirish "
"uchun ishlatiladi va boshqa davrda yana ishlatilishi uchun bo'sh holatga "
"qaytarilishi kerak. Zarur bo'lsa, ularni qo'lda qaytarish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:107
msgid "Post WIP entries"
msgstr "WIP yozuvlarini joylashtirish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:109
msgid "To manually post |WIP| entries:"
msgstr "|WIP| yozuvlarini qo'lda joylashtirish uchun:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:111
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:126
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders` "
"and access the desired order."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders` "
"yo'lidan o'ting va kerakli buyurtmani oching."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:113
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-cog` icon and select :guilabel:`Post WIP Accounting "
"Entry`."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-cog` belgisini bosing va :guilabel:`Post WIP Accounting Entry` ni "
"tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:114
msgid ""
"In the *Post WIP Accounting Entry* window, select the |WIP| accounting "
"journal."
msgstr ""
"*Post WIP Accounting Entry* oynasida |WIP| buxgalteriya jurnalini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:115
msgid "Adjust the dates and line items as needed, then click **Post WIP**."
msgstr ""
"Sanalar va qator elementlarini zaruratga qarab sozlang, so'ngra **Post WIP** "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:116
msgid ""
":ref:`Verify the entries are posted <manufacturing/basic_setup/verify-wip-"
"entries>` by reviewing the :guilabel:`Balance Sheet` report for that period."
msgstr ""
"O'sha davr uchun :guilabel:`Balance Sheet` hisobotini ko'rib chiqish "
"orqali :ref:`yozuvlar joylashtirilganini tekshiring <manufacturing/"
"basic_setup/verify-wip-entries>`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:122
msgid "Reverse WIP entries"
msgstr "WIP yozuvlarini qaytarish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:124
msgid "To manually reverse |WIP| entries:"
msgstr "|WIP| yozuvlarini qo'lda qaytarish uchun:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:128
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`WIP` smart button to display the |WIP| entries "
"associated with it."
msgstr ""
"U bilan bog'liq |WIP| yozuvlarini ko'rsatish uchun :guilabel:`WIP` smart "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:129
msgid ""
"Select the relevant reversal entry, click :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`Actions`, and select :guilabel:`Confirm Entries`."
msgstr ""
"Tegishli qaytarish yozuvini tanlang, :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions` "
"tugmasini bosing va :guilabel:`Confirm Entries` ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:131
msgid ""
":ref:`Verify the reversal is posted<manufacturing/basic_setup/verify-wip-"
"entries>` by reviewing the :guilabel:`Balance Sheet` report for that period."
msgstr ""
"O'sha davr uchun :guilabel:`Balance Sheet` hisobotini ko'rib chiqish "
"orqali :ref:`qaytarish joylashtirilganini tekshiring<manufacturing/"
"basic_setup/verify-wip-entries>`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:135
msgid ""
"By default, an action is automatically scheduled for the next day to reverse "
"the initial |WIP| entries once they are posted. If needed, this can be "
"adjusted when :ref:`posting the initial WIP entry <manufacturing/basic_setup/"
"post-wip-entries>` using the :guilabel:`Reversal Date` field."
msgstr ""
"Standart holatda dastlabki |WIP| yozuvlari joylashtirilgach, ularni "
"qaytarish uchun keyingi kunga avtomatik ravishda harakat rejalashtiriladi. "
"Zarur bo'lsa, buni :ref:`dastlabki WIP yozuvini joylashtirishda "
"<manufacturing/basic_setup/post-wip-entries>` :guilabel:`Reversal Date` "
"maydoni yordamida sozlash mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:142
msgid "Verify WIP entries"
msgstr "WIP yozuvlarini tekshirish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:144
msgid ""
"To verify that |WIP| accounting entries are being :ref:`posted "
"<manufacturing/basic_setup/post-wip-entries>` and :ref:`reversed "
"<manufacturing/basic_setup/reverse-wip-entries>` correctly, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Balance Sheet`. The values "
"should reflect manufacturing consumption at the time of posting and return "
"to zero once reversed."
msgstr ""
"|WIP| buxgalteriya yozuvlari to'g'ri :ref:`joylashtirilayotganini "
"<manufacturing/basic_setup/post-wip-entries>` va :ref:`qaytarilayotganini "
"<manufacturing/basic_setup/reverse-wip-entries>` tekshirish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Balance Sheet` yo'lidan "
"o'ting. Qiymatlar joylashtirish vaqtidagi ishlab chiqarish sarfini aks "
"ettirishi va qaytarilgandan so'ng nolga qaytishi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/work_in_progress.rst:151
msgid ""
"If the |WIP| accounting entries do not appear as expected in the *Balance "
"Sheet*, double-check the dates and filters applied to ensure they align with "
"the posting and reversal dates of the |WIP| accounting entries."
msgstr ""
"Agar |WIP| buxgalteriya yozuvlari *Balance Sheet* hisobotida kutilganidek "
"ko'rinmasa, qo'llanilgan sanalar va filtrlarni qayta tekshirib, ular |WIP| "
"buxgalteriya yozuvlarining joylashtirish va qaytarish sanalariga mos "
"kelishiga ishonch hosil qiling."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:3
msgid "Allocation reports"
msgstr "Taqsimlash hisobotlari"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:11
msgid ""
"When fulfilling sales orders (SOs), or sourcing components for manufacturing "
"orders (MOs), it is sometimes necessary to prioritize one |SO| or |MO| over "
"another. In situations where there is insufficient stock on-hand to fulfill "
"every |SO| or |MO|, ensuring that products and components are reserved for "
"priority orders is essential."
msgstr ""
"Sotuv buyurtmalarini (SO) bajarishda yoki ishlab chiqarish buyurtmalari (MO) "
"uchun komponentlarni ta'minlashda ba'zan bir |SO| yoki |MO| ga boshqasidan "
"ko'ra ustuvorlik berish zarur bo'ladi. Har bir |SO| yoki |MO| ni bajarish "
"uchun mavjud zaxira yetarli bo'lmagan holatlarda mahsulotlar va "
"komponentlarning ustuvor buyurtmalar uchun zaxiralanganligini ta'minlash "
"juda muhimdir."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:16
msgid ""
"In Odoo *Manufacturing*, allocation reports are used on |MOs| to assign "
"products to specific sales orders |SOs|, or components to specific |MOs|. "
"This ensures the products or components are available for those orders, and "
"are not used by mistake."
msgstr ""
"Odoo *Manufacturing* da taqsimlash hisobotlari |MOs| da mahsulotlarni "
"muayyan sotuv buyurtmalariga |SOs|, yoki komponentlarni muayyan |MOs| ga "
"biriktirish uchun ishlatiladi. Bu mahsulotlar yoki komponentlarning o'sha "
"buyurtmalar uchun mavjud bo'lishini va xato bilan ishlatilmasligini "
"ta'minlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:23
msgid ""
"To use allocation reports, the *Allocation Report for Manufacturing Orders* "
"feature **must** be enabled. To do so, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --> Settings`, and "
"tick the checkbox next to :guilabel:`Allocation Report for Manufacturing "
"Orders`. Then, click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Taqsimlash hisobotlaridan foydalanish uchun *Allocation Report for "
"Manufacturing Orders* funksiyasi **albatta** yoqilgan bo'lishi kerak. Buning "
"uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --> Settings` "
"yo'lidan o'ting va :guilabel:`Allocation Report for Manufacturing Orders` "
"yonidagi katakchani belgilang. So'ngra :guilabel:`Save` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:28
msgid ""
"For products that are sold, it is also necessary to configure them so they "
"can be included in |SOs|. To do so, begin by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Products --> Products`, and select a "
"product. Under the :guilabel:`Product Name` field on the product form, make "
"sure that the :guilabel:`Can Be Sold` checkbox is ticked."
msgstr ""
"Sotiladigan mahsulotlar uchun ularni |SOs| ga kiritish mumkin bo'lishi uchun "
"ham sozlash zarur. Buning uchun :menuselection:`Inventory --> Products --> "
"Products` yo'lidan o'ting va mahsulotni tanlang. Mahsulot "
"formasidagi :guilabel:`Product Name` maydoni ostida :guilabel:`Can Be Sold` "
"katakchasi belgilanganiga ishonch hosil qiling."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:34
msgid "Allocate products"
msgstr "Mahsulotlarni taqsimlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:36
msgid ""
"To allocate products or components from an |MO| to an |SO|, or to a "
"different |MO|, begin by navigating to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> "
"Operations --> Manufacturing Orders`. Click :guilabel:`New` to create a new |"
"MO|."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulotlar yoki komponentlarni |MO| dan |SO| ga yoki boshqa |MO| ga "
"taqsimlash uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Operations --> "
"Manufacturing Orders` yo'lidan o'ting. Yangi |MO| yaratish "
"uchun :guilabel:`New` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:40
msgid ""
"On the |MO| form, select a product in the :guilabel:`Product` field, and "
"specify the quantity to be produced in the :guilabel:`Quantity` field. "
"Finally, click :guilabel:`Confirm` to confirm the |MO|."
msgstr ""
"|MO| formasida :guilabel:`Product` maydonida mahsulotni tanlang "
"va :guilabel:`Quantity` maydonida ishlab chiqariladigan miqdorni ko'rsating. "
"Nihoyat, |MO| ni tasdiqlash uchun :guilabel:`Confirm` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:43
msgid ""
"The rest of the allocation workflow depends on the current on-hand quantity "
"of the product being manufactured, and whether or not there are any |SOs| or "
"|MOs| which require the product, but have not already been allocated units."
msgstr ""
"Taqsimlash ish jarayonining qolgan qismi ishlab chiqarilayotgan mahsulotning "
"joriy mavjud miqdoriga hamda mahsulotni talab qiladigan, lekin hali "
"birliklar taqsimlanmagan |SOs| yoki |MOs| bor-yo'qligiga bog'liq."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:47
msgid ""
"If there **are** existing |SOs| and |MOs| that require the product, **and** "
"there are too few units of the product on-hand to fulfill those orders, then "
"an :icon:`fa-list` :guilabel:`Allocation` smart button appears at the top of "
"the page as soon as the |MO| is confirmed."
msgstr ""
"Agar mahsulotni talab qiladigan mavjud |SOs| va |MOs| **bo'lsa**, **va** bu "
"buyurtmalarni bajarish uchun mahsulotning mavjud birliklari juda kam bo'lsa, "
"u holda |MO| tasdiqlanishi bilanoq sahifaning yuqori qismida :icon:`fa-"
"list` :guilabel:`Allocation` smart tugmasi paydo bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:51
msgid ""
"If there **are** existing |SOs| and |MOs| that require the product, **and** "
"there are enough units of the product on-hand to fulfill those orders, then "
"the :icon:`fa-list` :guilabel:`Allocation` smart button only appears at the "
"top of the page once the |MO| has been marked as done, by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Produce All`."
msgstr ""
"Agar mahsulotni talab qiladigan mavjud |SOs| va |MOs| **bo'lsa**, **va** bu "
"buyurtmalarni bajarish uchun mahsulotning mavjud birliklari yetarli bo'lsa, "
"u holda :icon:`fa-list` :guilabel:`Allocation` smart tugmasi "
"faqat :guilabel:`Produce All` tugmasini bosish orqali |MO| bajarilgan deb "
"belgilangandan so'ng sahifaning yuqori qismida paydo bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:None
msgid "The Allocation smart button at the top of an MO."
msgstr "MO ning yuqori qismidagi Allocation smart tugmasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:61
msgid ""
"If there **are not** any existing |SOs| and |MOs| that require the product, "
"the :icon:`fa-list` :guilabel:`Allocation` smart button does not appear, "
"even when the |MO| has been marked as done."
msgstr ""
"Agar mahsulotni talab qiladigan mavjud |SOs| va |MOs| "
"**bo'lmasa**, :icon:`fa-list` :guilabel:`Allocation` aqlli tugmasi, hatto |"
"MO| bajarilgan deb belgilangan bo'lsa ham, ko'rinmaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:64
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-list` :guilabel:`Allocation` smart button to open "
"the :guilabel:`MRP Reception Report` for the |MO|. This report lists open "
"delivery orders or |MOs|, depending on the type of product produced in the "
"original |MO|."
msgstr ""
"|MO| uchun :guilabel:`MRP Reception Report` hisobotini ochish "
"uchun :icon:`fa-list` :guilabel:`Allocation` aqlli tugmasini bosing. Ushbu "
"hisobot asl |MO| da ishlab chiqarilgan mahsulot turiga qarab, ochiq yetkazib "
"berish buyurtmalari yoki |MOs| ro'yxatini ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:69
msgid "Allocate to delivery order"
msgstr "Yetkazib berish buyurtmasiga taqsimlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:71
msgid ""
"If the |MO| contains a finished product, the report lists any open delivery "
"orders for which quantities of the product have yet to be reserved."
msgstr ""
"Agar |MO| tayyor mahsulotni o'z ichiga olsa, hisobot mahsulot miqdorlari "
"hali zaxiralanmagan barcha ochiq yetkazib berish buyurtmalarini ro'yxatga "
"oladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:75
msgid ""
"An |MO| is created to produce three units of a *rocking chair*. Clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Allocation` smart button on the |MO| opens an allocation "
"report that lists open delivery orders that require one or more rocking "
"chairs."
msgstr ""
"Uchta *tebranadigan kreslo* ishlab chiqarish uchun |MO| yaratiladi. |MO| "
"dagi :guilabel:`Allocation` aqlli tugmasini bosish bitta yoki bir nechta "
"tebranadigan kreslo talab qiladigan ochiq yetkazib berish buyurtmalarini "
"ro'yxatga oladigan taqsimlash hisobotini ochadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:79
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Assign All` button to the right of a specific order to "
"assign products for each quantity required to fulfill that order."
msgstr ""
"Muayyan buyurtmani bajarish uchun talab qilinadigan har bir miqdorga "
"mahsulotlarni biriktirish uchun ushbu buyurtmaning o'ng "
"tomonidagi :guilabel:`Assign All` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:83
msgid ""
"If an order requires one quantity of four units of the product, and one "
"quantity of one unit of the product, clicking :guilabel:`Assign All` assigns "
"five units of the product to fulfill both quantities."
msgstr ""
"Agar buyurtma mahsulotning to'rt birlikdan iborat bitta miqdorini va bir "
"birlikdan iborat bitta miqdorini talab qilsa, :guilabel:`Assign All` "
"tugmasini bosish ikkala miqdorni ham bajarish uchun mahsulotning besh "
"birligini biriktiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:87
msgid ""
"Alternatively, click :guilabel:`Assign` next to a specific quantity to only "
"assign products to that quantity, and not any others in the order."
msgstr ""
"Muqobil ravishda, mahsulotlarni faqat shu miqdorga biriktirish va "
"buyurtmadagi boshqa miqdorlarga biriktirmaslik uchun muayyan miqdor "
"yonidagi :guilabel:`Assign` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:91
msgid ""
"If an order requires one quantity of four units of the product, and one "
"quantity of one unit of the product, clicking :guilabel:`Assign` next to the "
"quantity of one unit assigns a product to that quantity, but leaves the "
"quantity of four units without any products assigned."
msgstr ""
"Agar buyurtma mahsulotning to'rt birlikdan iborat bitta miqdorini va bir "
"birlikdan iborat bitta miqdorini talab qilsa, bir birlik miqdori "
"yonidagi :guilabel:`Assign` tugmasini bosish shu miqdorga mahsulot "
"biriktiradi, ammo to'rt birlik miqdorini hech qanday mahsulot "
"biriktirilmagan holda qoldiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:None
msgid "The MRP Reception Report for an MO containing finished products."
msgstr "Tayyor mahsulotlarni o'z ichiga olgan MO uchun MRP Reception Report."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:100
msgid "Allocate to MO"
msgstr "MO ga taqsimlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:102
msgid ""
"If the |MO| contains a component, the report lists any open |MOs| for which "
"quantities of the component have yet to be reserved."
msgstr ""
"Agar |MO| komponentni o'z ichiga olsa, hisobot komponent miqdorlari hali "
"zaxiralanmagan barcha ochiq |MOs| ro'yxatini ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:106
msgid ""
"An |MO| is created to produce three units of *wood*, which is used as a "
"component for the *rocking chair* product. Clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Allocation` smart button on the |MO| opens an allocation "
"report that lists open rocking chair |MOs| that require one or more pieces "
"of wood."
msgstr ""
"*Tebranadigan kreslo* mahsuloti uchun komponent sifatida ishlatiladigan "
"*yog'och* dan uch birlik ishlab chiqarish uchun |MO| yaratiladi. |MO| "
"dagi :guilabel:`Allocation` aqlli tugmasini bosish bitta yoki bir nechta "
"yog'och bo'lagini talab qiladigan ochiq tebranadigan kreslo |MOs| ro'yxatini "
"ko'rsatadigan taqsimlash hisobotini ochadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:110
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Assign All` or :guilabel:`Assign` button to the right "
"of a specific |MO| to assign components to that |MO|."
msgstr ""
"Muayyan |MO| ga komponentlarni biriktirish uchun ushbu |MO| ning o'ng "
"tomonidagi :guilabel:`Assign All` yoki :guilabel:`Assign` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:None
msgid "The MRP Reception Report for an MO containing components."
msgstr "Komponentlarni o'z ichiga olgan MO uchun MRP Reception Report."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:118
msgid "Unassign products"
msgstr "Mahsulotlar biriktirishni bekor qilish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:120
msgid ""
"After assigning products to a quantity within a delivery order, or "
"components to an |MO|, the :guilabel:`Assign` button turns into "
"an :guilabel:`Unassign` button. Click :guilabel:`Unassign` to unreserve the "
"assigned products from that quantity, making them available for other "
"quantities."
msgstr ""
"Yetkazib berish buyurtmasidagi miqdorga mahsulotlarni yoki |MO| ga "
"komponentlarni biriktirgandan so'ng, :guilabel:`Assign` "
"tugmasi :guilabel:`Unassign` tugmasiga aylanadi. Biriktirilgan "
"mahsulotlarning shu miqdordagi zaxirasini bekor qilib, ularni boshqa "
"miqdorlar uchun mavjud qilish uchun :guilabel:`Unassign` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:125
msgid "Print labels"
msgstr "Yorliqlarni chop etish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:127
msgid ""
"After clicking :guilabel:`Assign All` or :guilabel:`Assign`, "
"the :guilabel:`Print Labels` or :guilabel:`Print Label` button to the right "
"of either button becomes selectable. Selecting either button generates and "
"downloads a PDF document with one label for each product that was assigned. "
"These labels are used to designate each product as being reserved for that "
"specific order."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Assign All` yoki :guilabel:`Assign` tugmasini bosgandan so'ng, "
"har ikkala tugmaning o'ng tomonidagi :guilabel:`Print Labels` "
"yoki :guilabel:`Print Label` tugmasi tanlanadigan bo'ladi. Ikkala tugmadan "
"birini tanlash biriktirilgan har bir mahsulot uchun bittadan yorliq bilan "
"PDF hujjatini yaratadi va yuklab oladi. Ushbu yorliqlar har bir mahsulotni "
"muayyan buyurtma uchun zaxiralangan deb belgilash uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/allocation.rst:None
msgid ""
"The assignment labels generated by clicking Print Labels or Print Label."
msgstr ""
"Print Labels yoki Print Label tugmasini bosish orqali yaratilgan biriktirish "
"yorliqlari."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/delayed.rst:3
msgid "Delays"
msgstr "Kechikishlar"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/delayed.rst:11
msgid ""
"Odoo's *Manufacturing* app displays *delays* in manufacturing orders through "
"the :guilabel:`Delayed Productions` filter. If the |MO|'s end date exceeds "
"its deadline, the deadline is highlighted in red to draw attention to the "
"delay."
msgstr ""
"Odoo ning *Manufacturing* ilovasi ishlab chiqarish buyurtmalaridagi "
"*kechikishlarni* :guilabel:`Delayed Productions` filtri orqali ko'rsatadi. "
"Agar |MO| ning tugash sanasi uning muddatidan oshsa, kechikishga e'tibor "
"qaratish uchun muddat qizil rangda ajratib ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/delayed.rst:None
msgid "The delayed production filter in Odoo."
msgstr "Odoo dagi kechikkan ishlab chiqarish filtri."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/delayed.rst:19
msgid "Deadline calculation"
msgstr "Muddatni hisoblash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/delayed.rst:21
msgid ""
"The |MO| deadline depends on how the |MO| was created, and is calculated as "
"follows:"
msgstr ""
"|MO| muddati |MO| qanday yaratilganiga bog'liq bo'lib, quyidagicha "
"hisoblanadi:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/delayed.rst:23
msgid ""
"**Make To Order**: the |MO| deadline is the *Sales Order Delivery Date*."
msgstr ""
"**Make To Order**: |MO| muddati *Sotuv buyurtmasining yetkazib berish "
"sanasi* hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/delayed.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Replenishment**: the |MO| deadline is *today + Manufacturing Lead Time*."
msgstr ""
"**To'ldirish**: |MO| muddati *bugun + ishlab chiqarish yetkazish muddati* "
"hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/delayed.rst:25
msgid "**Manually created MO**: the deadline field remains empty."
msgstr "**Qo'lda yaratilgan MO**: muddat maydoni bo'sh qoladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/delayed.rst:28
msgid "The |MO| *deadline* is not the same as the |MO| *end date*."
msgstr "|MO| *muddati* |MO| *tugash sanasi* bilan bir xil emas."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/delayed.rst:30
msgid "The end date is computed as:"
msgstr "Tugash sanasi quyidagicha hisoblanadi:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/delayed.rst:32
msgid ""
"\\text{End date} =\n"
" \\text{Scheduled start date}\n"
" +\\text{Total duration of all operations}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\text{End date} =\n"
" \\text{Scheduled start date}\n"
" +\\text{Total duration of all operations}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/delayed.rst:40
msgid "Several additional filters are available to help track delays:"
msgstr ""
"Kechikishlarni kuzatishga yordam beradigan bir nechta qo'shimcha filtrlar "
"mavjud:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/delayed.rst:42
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delayed Productions`: the |MO|'s *scheduled start date* is later "
"than the deadline."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Delayed Productions`: |MO| ning *rejalashtirilgan boshlanish "
"sanasi* muddatdan kechroq."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/delayed.rst:43
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Late`: the |MO|'s *scheduled end date* exceeds the deadline, "
"highlighted in red."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Late`: |MO| ning *rejalashtirilgan tugash sanasi* muddatdan "
"oshgan, qizil rangda ajratib ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/delayed.rst:44
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Late Availability`: one or more required components are not "
"available before the deadline. For example, a confirmed purchase order or "
"manufacturing order for components is scheduled to end *after* the |MO| "
"deadline."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Late Availability`: bitta yoki bir nechta talab qilinadigan "
"komponentlar muddatdan oldin mavjud emas. Masalan, komponentlar uchun "
"tasdiqlangan xarid buyurtmasi yoki ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasi |MO| "
"muddatidan *keyin* tugashi rejalashtirilgan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/delayed.rst:47
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Components Available`: all components are available to begin "
"production."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Components Available`: ishlab chiqarishni boshlash uchun barcha "
"komponentlar mavjud."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/delayed.rst:50
msgid "Use case"
msgstr "Foydalanish holati"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/delayed.rst:52
msgid "Consider an |MO| with a deadline of **September 17th**:"
msgstr "Muddati **17-sentabr** bo'lgan |MO| ni ko'rib chiqamiz:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/delayed.rst:54
msgid ""
"If production on the |MO| starts after September 17th, it appears in "
"the :guilabel:`Delayed Productions` filter."
msgstr ""
"Agar |MO| bo'yicha ishlab chiqarish 17-sentabrdan keyin boshlansa, "
"u :guilabel:`Delayed Productions` filtrida ko'rinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/delayed.rst:56
msgid ""
"If required components are scheduled to arrive after September 17th, the |"
"MO| appears in the :guilabel:`Late Availability` filter."
msgstr ""
"Agar talab qilinadigan komponentlarning 17-sentabrdan keyin yetib kelishi "
"rejalashtirilgan bo'lsa, |MO| :guilabel:`Late Availability` filtrida "
"ko'rinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/delayed.rst:58
msgid ""
"If the |MO| has a scheduled end date after September 17th, it appears in "
"the :guilabel:`Late` filter."
msgstr ""
"Agar |MO| ning rejalashtirilgan tugash sanasi 17-sentabrdan keyin bo'lsa, "
"u :guilabel:`Late` filtrida ko'rinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/delayed.rst:None
msgid "An MO with the deadline emphasized."
msgstr "Muddati ajratib ko'rsatilgan MO."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/delayed.rst:64
msgid ""
"By combining these indicators, planners can quickly identify where "
"production is at risk of missing delivery commitments."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu ko'rsatkichlarni birlashtirib, rejalashtiruvchilar ishlab chiqarish "
"qayerda yetkazib berish majburiyatlarini bajarmaslik xavfi ostida ekanligini "
"tezda aniqlashlari mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:3
msgid "Overall equipment effectiveness"
msgstr "Uskunaning umumiy samaradorligi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:9
msgid ""
"In Odoo's *Manufacturing* app, *overall equipment effectiveness* (OEE) "
"represents the amount of time a work center is fully productive. |OEE| is "
"displayed as a percentage of the total time a work center is active."
msgstr ""
"Odoo ning *Manufacturing* ilovasida *uskunaning umumiy samaradorligi* (OEE) "
"ish markazi to'liq unumli ishlaydigan vaqt miqdorini ifodalaydi. |OEE| ish "
"markazi faol bo'lgan umumiy vaqtning foizi sifatida ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:13
msgid ""
"Fully productive time is considered to be time when the work center is "
"operational **and** processing work orders that have not exceeded their "
"*expected duration*."
msgstr ""
"To'liq unumli vaqt deb ish markazi ishlayotgan **va** o'zining *kutilgan "
"davomiyligidan* oshmagan ish buyurtmalarini qayta ishlayotgan vaqt "
"hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:16
msgid ""
"|OEE| helps manufacturing teams understand the efficiency of work centers, "
"and the causes of manufacturing downtime."
msgstr ""
"|OEE| ishlab chiqarish jamoalariga ish markazlarining samaradorligini va "
"ishlab chiqarishdagi to'xtab qolishlar sabablarini tushunishga yordam beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:20
msgid ""
"Since |OEE| tracks work center productivity, using it requires enabling the "
"work centers feature in the settings of the Manufacturing app."
msgstr ""
"|OEE| ish markazi unumdorligini kuzatganligi sababli, undan foydalanish "
"Manufacturing ilovasi sozlamalarida ish markazlari funksiyasini yoqishni "
"talab qiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:23
msgid ""
"To do so, navigate to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --"
"> Settings`, and tick the checkbox next to :guilabel:`Work Orders`, under "
"the :guilabel:`Operations` heading. Then, click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Buning uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --> "
"Settings` yo'lidan o'ting va :guilabel:`Operations` sarlavhasi "
"ostidagi :guilabel:`Work Orders` yonidagi katakchani belgilang. "
"So'ngra :guilabel:`Save` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:28
msgid "Efficiency standards"
msgstr "Samaradorlik standartlari"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:30
msgid ""
"For |OEE| to accurately reflect the percentage of fully productive time for "
"a work center, the work center **must** be properly configured with the "
"correct productivity metrics. These include the work center's *time "
"efficiency*, *capacity*, and *OEE target*."
msgstr ""
"|OEE| ish markazi uchun to'liq unumli vaqt foizini aniq aks ettirishi uchun "
"ish markazi to'g'ri unumdorlik ko'rsatkichlari bilan tegishli tarzda "
"sozlangan bo'lishi **shart**. Bularga ish markazining *vaqt samaradorligi*, "
"*quvvati* va *OEE maqsadi* kiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:35
msgid "Time efficiency"
msgstr "Vaqt samaradorligi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:37
msgid ""
"Time efficiency represents the efficiency of a work center when processing "
"work orders, and is represented as a percentage. A time efficiency value of "
"100% signifies that the work center processes work orders at the speed of "
"the expected duration, as listed on a product's |BoM|. A value less than or "
"greater than 100% signifies that the work center processes work orders "
"slower or faster than an operation's expected duration, respectively."
msgstr ""
"Vaqt samaradorligi ish markazining ish buyurtmalarini qayta ishlashdagi "
"samaradorligini ifodalaydi va foiz sifatida ko'rsatiladi. 100% vaqt "
"samaradorligi qiymati ish markazi ish buyurtmalarini mahsulotning |BoM| da "
"ko'rsatilgan kutilgan davomiylik tezligida qayta ishlashini bildiradi. 100% "
"dan kam yoki ko'p qiymat ish markazi ish buyurtmalarini operatsiyaning "
"kutilgan davomiyligidan mos ravishda sekinroq yoki tezroq qayta ishlashini "
"bildiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:43
msgid ""
"To set the time efficiency for a work center, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --> Work Centers`, "
"and select a work center. On the :guilabel:`General Information` tab, enter "
"a numerical value in the :guilabel:`Time Efficiency` field."
msgstr ""
"Ish markazi uchun vaqt samaradorligini o'rnatish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --> Work Centers` "
"yo'lidan o'ting va ish markazini tanlang. :guilabel:`General Information` "
"varag'ida :guilabel:`Time Efficiency` maydoniga raqamli qiymat kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:48
msgid ""
"Manufacturing a *chair* product requires two operations: *cut* and "
"*assemble*. The product's |BoM| lists an expected duration of 30 minutes for "
"each operation."
msgstr ""
"*Stul* mahsulotini ishlab chiqarish ikkita operatsiyani talab qiladi: "
"*kesish* va *yig'ish*. Mahsulotning |BoM| da har bir operatsiya uchun 30 "
"daqiqalik kutilgan davomiylik ko'rsatilgan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:51
msgid ""
"The cut operation is carried out at the *cut station* work center, which has "
"a time efficiency value of 50%. This means it takes twice as long to "
"complete the operation, for a total time of one hour."
msgstr ""
"Kesish operatsiyasi vaqt samaradorligi qiymati 50% bo'lgan *kesish "
"stansiyasi* ish markazida amalga oshiriladi. Bu operatsiyani bajarish ikki "
"baravar ko'proq vaqt olishini, ya'ni jami bir soat vaqt ketishini bildiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:55
msgid ""
"The assemble operation is carried out at the *assembly line* work center, "
"which has a time efficiency value of 200%. This means it takes half as long "
"to complete the operation, for a total time of 15 minutes."
msgstr ""
"Yig'ish operatsiyasi vaqt samaradorligi qiymati 200% bo'lgan *yig'ish "
"liniyasi* ish markazida amalga oshiriladi. Bu operatsiyani bajarish ikki "
"baravar kamroq vaqt olishini, ya'ni jami 15 daqiqa vaqt ketishini bildiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:60
msgid "Capacity"
msgstr "Quvvat"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:62
msgid ""
"Capacity represents how many units of a product can be produced in parallel "
"at a work center. The duration of work orders for multiple units increases "
"or decreases, based on how many units the work center can handle."
msgstr ""
"Quvvat ish markazida bir vaqtning o'zida mahsulotning nechta birligini "
"ishlab chiqarish mumkinligini ifodalaydi. Bir nechta birlik uchun ish "
"buyurtmalarining davomiyligi ish markazi nechta birlikni qayta ishlay "
"olishiga qarab ortadi yoki kamayadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:66
msgid ""
"To set the capacity for a work center, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --> Work Centers`, "
"and select a work center. On the :guilabel:`General Information` tab, enter "
"a numerical value in the :guilabel:`Capacity` field."
msgstr ""
"Ish markazi uchun quvvatni o'rnatish uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app "
"--> Configuration --> Work Centers` yo'lidan o'ting va ish markazini "
"tanlang. :guilabel:`General Information` varag'ida :guilabel:`Capacity` "
"maydoniga raqamli qiymat kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:71
msgid ""
"A *drill station* work center has a capacity of one unit. An |MO| is "
"confirmed for 10 units of a *chair*, a product manufactured using the drill "
"station."
msgstr ""
"*Parmalash stansiyasi* ish markazining sig'imi bir birlikka teng. Parmalash "
"stansiyasi yordamida ishlab chiqariladigan *stul* mahsulotining 10 birligi "
"uchun |MO| tasdiqlanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:74
msgid ""
"Since there are ten times as many units to produce than the work center can "
"handle at once, the operation time is ten times the duration listed on the "
"product's |BoM|."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarilishi kerak bo'lgan birliklar soni ish markazi bir vaqtning "
"o'zida bajara oladiganidan o'n baravar ko'p bo'lgani uchun, operatsiya vaqti "
"mahsulotning |BoM| hujjatida ko'rsatilgan davomiylikdan o'n baravar uzun "
"bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:78
msgid "|OEE| target"
msgstr "|OEE| maqsadi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:80
msgid ""
"The |OEE| target is the goal for how much of a work center's operating time "
"should be fully productive time. It is displayed as a percentage, and should "
"only be set as high as `100%`."
msgstr ""
"|OEE| maqsadi ish markazining ishlash vaqtining qancha qismi to'liq unumli "
"vaqt bo'lishi kerakligi bo'yicha maqsaddir. U foiz sifatida ko'rsatiladi va "
"eng ko'pi bilan `100%` qilib belgilanishi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:83
msgid ""
"To set the |OEE| target for a work center, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --> Settings --> Work "
"Centers`, and select a work center. On the :guilabel:`General Information` "
"tab, enter a numerical value of `100.00` or less in the :guilabel:`OEE "
"Target` field."
msgstr ""
"Ish markazi uchun |OEE| maqsadini belgilash "
"uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --> Settings --> "
"Work Centers` yo'lidan o'ting va ish markazini tanlang. :guilabel:`General "
"Information` varag'ida :guilabel:`OEE Target` maydoniga `100.00` yoki undan "
"kichik raqamli qiymatni kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:88
msgid "Calculating |OEE|"
msgstr "|OEE| hisoblash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:90
msgid ""
"|OEE| is represented as a percentage value between zero and 100. The value "
"signifies the amount of time that a work center was fully productive. The "
"remainder signifies the amount of time that the work center was operating at "
"less than full efficiency. This can occur for a number of reasons, including "
"*reduced speed*, *material availability*, and *equipment failure*."
msgstr ""
"|OEE| noldan 100 gacha bo'lgan foiz qiymati sifatida ifodalanadi. Bu qiymat "
"ish markazi to'liq unumli ishlagan vaqt miqdorini bildiradi. Qolgan qismi "
"esa ish markazi to'liq samaradorlikdan pastroq darajada ishlagan vaqt "
"miqdorini bildiradi. Bu bir qancha sabablarga ko'ra yuz berishi mumkin, "
"jumladan *pasaygan tezlik*, *material mavjudligi* va *uskuna nosozligi*."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:96
msgid "Fully productive time"
msgstr "To'liq unumli vaqt"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:98
msgid ""
"For a work center to be considered fully productive, it must be able to "
"receive work orders, have the components necessary to process work orders, "
"and be operating within the expected duration of the work order it is "
"processing."
msgstr ""
"Ish markazi to'liq unumli deb hisoblanishi uchun u ish buyurtmalarini qabul "
"qila olishi, ish buyurtmalarini bajarish uchun zarur komponentlarga ega "
"bo'lishi va bajarayotgan ish buyurtmasining kutilgan davomiyligi doirasida "
"ishlashi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:103
msgid ""
"An *assembly line* work center is not blocked, and receives a work order to "
"assemble a *bicycle*. The required components are available, so production "
"begins as soon as they are picked and delivered to the work center. The work "
"order has an expected duration of 30 minutes, and is completed in 27 "
"minutes. All of this time is considered fully productive time."
msgstr ""
"*Yig'ish liniyasi* ish markazi bloklanmagan va *velosiped* yig'ish bo'yicha "
"ish buyurtmasini qabul qiladi. Zarur komponentlar mavjud, shuning uchun ular "
"yig'ib olinib, ish markaziga yetkazilishi bilanoq ishlab chiqarish "
"boshlanadi. Ish buyurtmasining kutilgan davomiyligi 30 daqiqa bo'lib, u 27 "
"daqiqada bajariladi. Bu vaqtning barchasi to'liq unumli vaqt deb hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:109
msgid "Reduced speed"
msgstr "Pasaygan tezlik"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:111
msgid ""
"When a work center is operating at reduced speed, it means that it is "
"processing a work order that has exceeded its expected duration. While the "
"work center may be operational, this is not considered fully productive time."
msgstr ""
"Ish markazi pasaygan tezlikda ishlayotgan bo'lsa, bu uning kutilgan "
"davomiylikdan oshib ketgan ish buyurtmasini bajarayotganini bildiradi. Ish "
"markazi ishlayotgan bo'lsa-da, bu to'liq unumli vaqt deb hisoblanmaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:116
msgid ""
"A *cutting station* work center receives a work order to cut boards for a "
"*table*. The expected duration of the work order is 15 minutes. The work "
"order ends up taking 18 minutes to complete. The work center is considered "
"to have been operating at reduced speed during the three minutes that "
"exceeded the expected duration."
msgstr ""
"*Kesish stansiyasi* ish markazi *stol* uchun taxtalarni kesish bo'yicha ish "
"buyurtmasini qabul qiladi. Ish buyurtmasining kutilgan davomiyligi 15 "
"daqiqa. Ish buyurtmasini bajarish 18 daqiqa vaqt oladi. Kutilgan "
"davomiylikdan oshib ketgan uch daqiqa davomida ish markazi pasaygan tezlikda "
"ishlagan deb hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:122
msgid "Material availability"
msgstr "Material mavjudligi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:124
msgid ""
"Material availability refers to situations where a work center is able to "
"accept a work order, but the required components are not available. This can "
"occur because the components are not in stock, or are reserved for a "
"different order."
msgstr ""
"Material mavjudligi ish markazi ish buyurtmasini qabul qila oladigan, lekin "
"zarur komponentlar mavjud bo'lmagan vaziyatlarni anglatadi. Bu komponentlar "
"zaxirada yo'qligi yoki boshqa buyurtma uchun band qilingani sababli yuz "
"berishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:129
msgid ""
"Manufacturing of a *bench* requires 20 units of *wood*. A manufacturing "
"order (MO) is confirmed for 10 units of the bench, but there is not enough "
"wood in stock to begin manufacturing. The time it takes to acquire the wood "
"is recorded as material availability downtime."
msgstr ""
"*Skameyka* ishlab chiqarish uchun 20 birlik *yog'och* kerak bo'ladi. "
"Skameykaning 10 birligi uchun ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasi (MO) tasdiqlanadi, "
"lekin ishlab chiqarishni boshlash uchun zaxirada yetarli yog'och yo'q. "
"Yog'ochni olish uchun ketgan vaqt material mavjudligi bo'yicha bekor turish "
"vaqti sifatida qayd etiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:134
msgid "Equipment failure"
msgstr "Uskuna nosozligi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:136
msgid ""
"Equipment failure signifies any period of time when a work center is "
"unusable due to maintenance issues with its equipment. This can be due to "
"equipment breaking down, or when a work center is shut down for scheduled "
"maintenance. In these cases, a work center can be blocked using "
"a :doc:`maintenance request <../../maintenance/maintenance_requests>`."
msgstr ""
"Uskuna nosozligi ish markazi o'z uskunasidagi texnik xizmat muammolari "
"tufayli foydalanib bo'lmaydigan har qanday vaqt oralig'ini bildiradi. Bu "
"uskunaning buzilishi yoki ish markazi rejalashtirilgan texnik xizmat uchun "
"to'xtatilgani sababli bo'lishi mumkin. Bunday hollarda ish "
"markazini :doc:`texnik xizmat so'rovi <../../maintenance/"
"maintenance_requests>` yordamida bloklash mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:142
msgid ""
"The drill at a *drill station* work center breaks down, causing the work "
"center to be unusable. A maintenance request is created to fix the drill, "
"and the work center is blocked from receiving work orders. It takes two "
"hours to fix the drill, and make the work center available again. This two-"
"hour period is recorded as equipment failure downtime."
msgstr ""
"*Parmalash stansiyasi* ish markazidagi parma buzilib, ish markazidan "
"foydalanib bo'lmay qoladi. Parmani tuzatish uchun texnik xizmat so'rovi "
"yaratiladi va ish markazi ish buyurtmalarini qabul qilishdan bloklanadi. "
"Parmani tuzatish va ish markazini yana ishga tayyor holga keltirish uchun "
"ikki soat vaqt ketadi. Bu ikki soatlik davr uskuna nosozligi bo'yicha bekor "
"turish vaqti sifatida qayd etiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:148
msgid "|OEE| reporting"
msgstr "|OEE| hisoboti"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:150
msgid ""
"To view |OEE| reporting metrics for every work center, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Reporting --> Overall Equipment "
"Effectiveness`. This page shows the metrics for each work center with |OEE| "
"data."
msgstr ""
"Har bir ish markazi uchun |OEE| hisobot ko'rsatkichlarini ko'rish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Reporting --> Overall Equipment "
"Effectiveness` yo'lidan o'ting. Bu sahifada |OEE| ma'lumotlariga ega har bir "
"ish markazining ko'rsatkichlari ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:154
msgid ""
"Alternatively, to see |OEE| reporting metrics for a single work center, "
"navigate to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --> Work "
"Centers`, and select a work center. At the top of the work center's form, "
"click the :icon:`fa-pie-chart` :guilabel:`OEE` smart button."
msgstr ""
"Shuningdek, bitta ish markazi uchun |OEE| hisobot ko'rsatkichlarini ko'rish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --> Work Centers` "
"yo'lidan o'ting va ish markazini tanlang. Ish markazi formasining yuqori "
"qismidagi :icon:`fa-pie-chart` :guilabel:`OEE` smart tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:158
msgid ""
"By default, the main |OEE| reporting page shows data in a bar chart, while "
"the page for a specific work center shows it in a pie chart. To select a "
"different chart type on either page, click the :icon:`fa-bar-"
"chart` :guilabel:`(bar chart)`, :icon:`fa-line-chart` :guilabel:`(line "
"chart)`, or :icon:`fa-pie-chart` :guilabel:`(pie chart)` button above the "
"displayed chart."
msgstr ""
"Standart holatda asosiy |OEE| hisobot sahifasi ma'lumotlarni ustunli "
"diagrammada ko'rsatadi, muayyan ish markazining sahifasi esa ularni doiraviy "
"diagrammada ko'rsatadi. Har qaysi sahifada boshqa diagramma turini tanlash "
"uchun ko'rsatilgan diagramma ustidagi :icon:`fa-bar-chart` :guilabel:`(bar "
"chart)`, :icon:`fa-line-chart` :guilabel:`(line chart)` yoki :icon:`fa-pie-"
"chart` :guilabel:`(pie chart)` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:163
msgid ""
"It is also possible to see |OEE| data in a pivot view, or a list displaying "
"each time entry, by clicking the :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`(pivot "
"view)` or :icon:`oi-view-list` :guilabel:`(list view)` buttons at the top-"
"right corner of the page."
msgstr ""
"Shuningdek, sahifaning yuqori o'ng burchagidagi :icon:`oi-view-"
"pivot` :guilabel:`(pivot view)` yoki :icon:`oi-view-list` :guilabel:`(list "
"view)` tugmalarini bosish orqali |OEE| ma'lumotlarini pivot ko'rinishida "
"yoki har bir vaqt yozuvini ko'rsatuvchi ro'yxatda ko'rish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/oee.rst:None
msgid "The dashboard of the OEE report."
msgstr "OEE hisobotining boshqaruv paneli."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:3
msgid "Production analysis"
msgstr "Ishlab chiqarish tahlili"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:8
msgid ""
"The *Production Analysis* report provides statistics about products "
"manufactured using Odoo's *Manufacturing* app. The report is useful when "
"trying to understand production costs, manufacturing durations, and other "
"important statistics about manufactured products."
msgstr ""
"*Ishlab chiqarish tahlili* hisoboti Odoo *Manufacturing* ilovasi yordamida "
"ishlab chiqarilgan mahsulotlar haqidagi statistikani taqdim etadi. Bu "
"hisobot ishlab chiqarish xarajatlari, ishlab chiqarish davomiyliklari va "
"ishlab chiqarilgan mahsulotlar haqidagi boshqa muhim statistikani "
"tushunishga harakat qilganda foydalidir."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:12
msgid ""
"To open the Production Analysis report, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Reporting --> Production Analysis`."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish tahlili hisobotini ochish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Reporting --> Production "
"Analysis` yo'lidan o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:16
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Production Analysis` report is one of many reports available "
"across the Odoo app suite. This documentation only covers the measures "
"specific to the :guilabel:`Production Analysis` report, along with a few use "
"case examples."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Production Analysis` hisoboti Odoo ilovalar to'plamida mavjud "
"bo'lgan ko'plab hisobotlardan biridir. Bu hujjat faqat :guilabel:`Production "
"Analysis` hisobotiga xos o'lchovlarni, shuningdek bir nechta foydalanish "
"holati misollarini qamrab oladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:20
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:21
msgid ""
"For a full overview of the basic features available in most Odoo reports, "
"see the documentation on :doc:`reporting essentials <../../../essentials/"
"reporting>`."
msgstr ""
"Aksariyat Odoo hisobotlarida mavjud bo'lgan asosiy funksiyalarning to'liq "
"sharhi uchun :doc:`hisobot asoslari <../../../essentials/reporting>` "
"hujjatiga qarang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:24
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:25
msgid "Measures"
msgstr "O'lchovlar"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:26
msgid ""
"*Measures* are the datasets that can be selected in "
"the :guilabel:`Production Analysis` report. Each dataset represents a "
"specific statistic about |MOs| in the database. Choose a measure by clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Measures` :icon:`fa-caret-down` button, and selecting one of "
"the options from the drop-down menu:"
msgstr ""
"*O'lchovlar* :guilabel:`Production Analysis` hisobotida tanlanishi mumkin "
"bo'lgan ma'lumotlar to'plamlaridir. Har bir ma'lumotlar to'plami ma'lumotlar "
"bazasidagi |MOs| haqidagi muayyan statistikani "
"ifodalaydi. :guilabel:`Measures` :icon:`fa-caret-down` tugmasini bosib, "
"ochiluvchi menyudan variantlardan birini tanlash orqali o'lchovni tanlang:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:31
msgid ""
"The options displayed in the :guilabel:`Measures` :icon:`fa-caret-down` drop-"
"down menu, and the order they appear in, differ depending on the filters, "
"groupings, and comparisons enabled in the :guilabel:`Search...` bar. By "
"default, the available measures appear as follows:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Measures` :icon:`fa-caret-down` ochiluvchi menyusida "
"ko'rsatiladigan variantlar va ularning paydo bo'lish "
"tartibi :guilabel:`Search...` panelida yoqilgan filtrlar, guruhlashlar va "
"taqqoslashlarga qarab farq qiladi. Standart holatda mavjud o'lchovlar "
"quyidagicha ko'rinadi:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Average Employee Cost/Unit`: the average cost paid to employees "
"to produce one unit of the product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Average Employee Cost/Unit`: mahsulotning bir birligini ishlab "
"chiqarish uchun xodimlarga to'langan o'rtacha xarajat."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:37
msgid ""
":guilabel:`By-Products Total Cost`: the total value of all by-products "
"created by manufacturing the product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`By-Products Total Cost`: mahsulotni ishlab chiqarish natijasida "
"yaratilgan barcha qo'shimcha mahsulotlarning umumiy qiymati."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:39
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Component Cost/Unit`: the average cost of the components required "
"to produce one unit of the product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Component Cost/Unit`: mahsulotning bir birligini ishlab chiqarish "
"uchun zarur bo'lgan komponentlarning o'rtacha xarajati."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Cost/Unit`: the average cost of producing one unit of the "
"product, including component, employee, operation, and subcontracting costs."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cost/Unit`: mahsulotning bir birligini ishlab chiqarishning "
"o'rtacha xarajati, jumladan komponent, xodim, operatsiya va subpudrat "
"xarajatlari."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:43
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Duration of Operations/Unit`: the average total duration of "
"operations required to produce one unit of the product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Duration of Operations/Unit`: mahsulotning bir birligini ishlab "
"chiqarish uchun zarur bo'lgan operatsiyalarning o'rtacha umumiy davomiyligi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:45
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Quantity Demanded`: the total number of units of the product "
"included in |MOs|."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Quantity Demanded`: |MOs| tarkibiga kiritilgan mahsulot "
"birliklarining umumiy soni."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:46
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Quantity Produced`: the total number of units of the product that "
"have actually been produced."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Quantity Produced`: haqiqatda ishlab chiqarilgan mahsulot "
"birliklarining umumiy soni."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:48
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Total Component Cost`: the total amount spent on the product's "
"components, across every |MO| for the product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Total Component Cost`: mahsulot uchun har bir |MO| bo'yicha "
"mahsulot komponentlariga sarflangan umumiy summa."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:50
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Total Cost`: the total amount spent manufacturing every unit of "
"the product produced so far."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Total Cost`: hozirgacha ishlab chiqarilgan mahsulotning har bir "
"birligini ishlab chiqarishga sarflangan umumiy summa."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:52
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Total Duration of Operations`: the cumulative duration of every "
"operation completed while manufacturing the product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Total Duration of Operations`: mahsulotni ishlab chiqarish "
"davomida bajarilgan har bir operatsiyaning jami davomiyligi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:54
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Total Employee Cost`: the cumulative amount paid to employees to "
"manufacture the product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Total Employee Cost`: mahsulotni ishlab chiqarish uchun "
"xodimlarga to'langan jami summa."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:56
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Total Operation Cost`: the cumulative amount spent on operations "
"required to produce the product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Total Operation Cost`: mahsulotni ishlab chiqarish uchun zarur "
"bo'lgan operatsiyalarga sarflangan jami summa."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:58
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Total Operation Cost/Unit`: the average cost of the operations "
"required to produce one unit of the product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Total Operation Cost/Unit`: mahsulotning bir birligini ishlab "
"chiqarish uchun zarur bo'lgan operatsiyalarning o'rtacha xarajati."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:60
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Total Subcontracting Cost`: the cumulative amount paid to "
"subcontractors to produce the product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Total Subcontracting Cost`: mahsulotni ishlab chiqarish uchun "
"subpudratchilarga to'langan jami summa."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:62
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Total Subcontracting Cost/Unit`: the average cost of engaging a "
"subcontractor to produce one unit of the product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Total Subcontracting Cost/Unit`: mahsulotning bir birligini "
"ishlab chiqarish uchun subpudratchini jalb qilishning o'rtacha xarajati."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:64
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Yield Percentage (%)`: the total quantity of the product produced "
"versus the total quantity demanded, represented as a percentage."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Yield Percentage (%)`: ishlab chiqarilgan mahsulotning umumiy "
"miqdori talab qilingan umumiy miqdorga nisbatan, foiz sifatida ifodalanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:66
msgid ":guilabel:`Count`: the total count of |MOs| created for the product."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Count`: mahsulot uchun yaratilgan |MOs| ning umumiy soni."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:69
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:51
msgid ""
"Only one measure can be selected at a time when one of the :icon:`fa-area-"
"chart` :guilabel:`(graph view)` options is enabled. However, multiple "
"measures, and varying group-by criteria (on the x and y axes), can be "
"selected when using the :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`(pivot table)`."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-area-chart` :guilabel:`(graph view)` variantlaridan biri yoqilgan "
"bo'lsa, bir vaqtning o'zida faqat bitta o'lchovni tanlash mumkin. "
"Biroq, :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`(pivot table)` dan foydalanilganda "
"bir nechta o'lchovlarni va turli guruhlash mezonlarini (x va y o'qlarida) "
"tanlash mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:75
msgid "Use case: compare products"
msgstr "Foydalanish holati: mahsulotlarni taqqoslash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:77
msgid ""
"One of the best uses for the :guilabel:`Production Analysis` report is "
"comparing statistics about two or more products. This is accomplished by "
"entering the products into the :guilabel:`Search...` bar, then selecting the "
"necessary measure, filter, and grouping, to see the desired data."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Production Analysis` hisobotining eng yaxshi qo'llanilishlaridan "
"biri ikki yoki undan ortiq mahsulot haqidagi statistikani taqqoslashdir. Bu "
"mahsulotlarni :guilabel:`Search...` paneliga kiritish, so'ngra kerakli "
"ma'lumotlarni ko'rish uchun zarur o'lchov, filtr va guruhlashni tanlash "
"orqali amalga oshiriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:82
msgid ""
"Toy manufacturer *Tommy's Toys* is trying to reduce their manufacturing "
"operation costs. To accomplish this, they have decided to identify redundant "
"products and cease manufacturing the ones with higher operational costs."
msgstr ""
"O'yinchoq ishlab chiqaruvchisi *Tommy's Toys* ishlab chiqarish operatsiya "
"xarajatlarini kamaytirishga harakat qilmoqda. Buning uchun ular ortiqcha "
"mahsulotlarni aniqlab, operatsion xarajatlari yuqoriroq bo'lganlarini ishlab "
"chiqarishni to'xtatishga qaror qilishdi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:86
msgid ""
"Two of the toys that have been singled out for analysis are the *pogo stick* "
"and *moon shoes*. Tommy's Toys believes these two toys are so similar that "
"they can stop manufacturing one, without significantly impacting their "
"product offering."
msgstr ""
"Tahlil uchun ajratib olingan o'yinchoqlardan ikkitasi *pogo tayoq* va *oy "
"poyabzali*dir. Tommy's Toys bu ikki o'yinchoq shu qadar o'xshashki, ulardan "
"birini ishlab chiqarishni to'xtatish mahsulot assortimentiga sezilarli "
"ta'sir ko'rsatmaydi, deb hisoblaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:90
msgid ""
"To compare operation costs for the toys, business analyst Mike opens "
"the :menuselection:`Manufacturing` app, and navigates to "
"the :guilabel:`Production Analysis` page. In the :guilabel:`Search...` bar, "
"he enters the names of both products. Then, he opens "
"the :guilabel:`Search...` bar drop-down menu, and clicks :guilabel:`Product` "
"in the :guilabel:`Group By` section."
msgstr ""
"O'yinchoqlarning operatsiya xarajatlarini taqqoslash uchun biznes-tahlilchi "
"Mike :menuselection:`Manufacturing` ilovasini ochadi "
"va :guilabel:`Production Analysis` sahifasiga o'tadi. :guilabel:`Search...` "
"paneliga u ikkala mahsulot nomini kiritadi. So'ngra u :guilabel:`Search...` "
"paneli ochiluvchi menyusini ochadi va :guilabel:`Group By` "
"bo'limida :guilabel:`Product` ni bosadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:96
msgid ""
"Below the :guilabel:`Search...` bar, Mike clicks on "
"the :guilabel:`Measures` :icon:`fa-caret-down` drop-down menu, and selects "
"the :guilabel:`Total Operation Cost/Unit` option. Finally, he selects "
"the :icon:`fa-bar-chart` :guilabel:`(bar chart)` graph type."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Search...` paneli ostida Mike :guilabel:`Measures` :icon:`fa-"
"caret-down` ochiluvchi menyusini bosadi va :guilabel:`Total Operation Cost/"
"Unit` variantini tanlaydi. Nihoyat, u :icon:`fa-bar-chart` :guilabel:`(bar "
"chart)` grafik turini tanlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:100
msgid ""
"With these options selected, the :guilabel:`Production Analysis` report "
"shows a bar chart for the current year, with one bar for each product, "
"signifying the average operation cost for one unit of the product."
msgstr ""
"Bu variantlar tanlanganda, :guilabel:`Production Analysis` hisoboti joriy "
"yil uchun ustunli diagrammani ko'rsatadi, unda har bir mahsulot uchun bitta "
"ustun bo'lib, u mahsulotning bir birligi uchun o'rtacha operatsiya "
"xarajatini bildiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:104
msgid ""
"With this data, Mike is able to see that the average operation cost for the "
"moon shoes is almost twice the cost of the pogo stick. Using this insight, "
"Tommy's Toys decides to cease production of moon shoes, thus lowering their "
"average cost of manufacturing operations."
msgstr ""
"Bu ma'lumotlar yordamida Mike oy poyabzalining o'rtacha operatsiya xarajati "
"pogo tayoq xarajatidan deyarli ikki baravar yuqori ekanini ko'radi. Bu "
"xulosadan foydalanib, Tommy's Toys oy poyabzalini ishlab chiqarishni "
"to'xtatishga qaror qiladi va shu tariqa ishlab chiqarish operatsiyalarining "
"o'rtacha xarajatini pasaytiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:0
msgid ""
"The bar chart comparing the operation costs of the pogo stick and moon shoes."
msgstr ""
"Pogo tayoq va oy poyabzalining operatsiya xarajatlarini taqqoslovchi ustunli "
"diagramma."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:113
msgid "Use case: compare time periods"
msgstr "Foydalanish holati: vaqt davrlarini solishtirish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:115
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Production Analysis` report can also be used to compare data "
"for two different time periods. This is accomplished using the options in "
"the :guilabel:`Comparison` section of the :guilabel:`Search...` bar."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Production Analysis` hisobotidan ikki xil vaqt davri "
"ma'lumotlarini solishtirish uchun ham foydalanish mumkin. "
"Bu :guilabel:`Search...` panelidagi :guilabel:`Comparison` bo'limidagi "
"parametrlar yordamida amalga oshiriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:120
msgid ""
"Furniture company *Fanny's Furnishings* wants to compare their production "
"costs for the first and second quarters of 2024, to see which products they "
"spent the most money producing in each quarter."
msgstr ""
"*Fanny's Furnishings* mebel kompaniyasi 2024-yilning birinchi va ikkinchi "
"choraklari uchun ishlab chiqarish xarajatlarini solishtirib, har bir "
"chorakda qaysi mahsulotlarni ishlab chiqarishga eng ko'p pul sarflaganini "
"ko'rmoqchi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:124
msgid ""
"To compare the two time periods, shop floor supervisor Adam opens "
"the :menuselection:`Manufacturing` app, and navigates to "
"the :guilabel:`Production Analysis` page. He begins by selecting "
"the :icon:`fa-pie-chart` :guilabel:`(pie chart)` graph type option at the "
"top of the page."
msgstr ""
"Ikki vaqt davrini solishtirish uchun ishlab chiqarish maydoni nazoratchisi "
"Adam :menuselection:`Manufacturing` ilovasini ochadi "
"va :guilabel:`Production Analysis` sahifasiga o'tadi. U sahifaning yuqori "
"qismidagi :icon:`fa-pie-chart` :guilabel:`(pie chart)` grafik turi "
"parametrini tanlashdan boshlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:130
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Comparison` feature is meant to be used with the :icon:`fa-"
"pie-chart` :guilabel:`(pie chart)` graph type, or the :icon:`oi-view-"
"pivot` :guilabel:`(pivot)` view."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Comparison` funksiyasi :icon:`fa-pie-chart` :guilabel:`(pie "
"chart)` grafik turi yoki :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`(pivot)` "
"ko'rinishi bilan ishlatish uchun mo'ljallangan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:133
msgid ""
"A :guilabel:`Comparison` option can still be selected with the other view "
"types enabled, but doing so does not change the way data is displayed on the "
"report."
msgstr ""
"Boshqa ko'rinish turlari yoqilgan holda ham :guilabel:`Comparison` "
"parametrini tanlash mumkin, ammo bu hisobotda ma'lumotlarning ko'rsatilish "
"usulini o'zgartirmaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:136
msgid ""
"Next, Adam selects the :guilabel:`Total Cost` option from "
"the :guilabel:`Measures` :icon:`fa-caret-down` drop-down menu. This option "
"displays the total amount spent producing each product."
msgstr ""
"Keyin, Adam :guilabel:`Measures` :icon:`fa-caret-down` ochiluvchi "
"menyusidan :guilabel:`Total Cost` parametrini tanlaydi. Bu parametr har bir "
"mahsulotni ishlab chiqarishga sarflangan umumiy summani ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:140
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Search...` bar drop-down menu, he leaves "
"the :guilabel:`2024` filter enabled in the :guilabel:`End Date` section, and "
"enables the :guilabel:`Q2` filter as well. With both of these time periods "
"selected, the pie chart shows data for the second quarter of 2024."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Search...` paneli ochiluvchi menyusida u :guilabel:`End Date` "
"bo'limidagi :guilabel:`2024` filtrini yoqilgan holda qoldiradi "
"va :guilabel:`Q2` filtrini ham yoqadi. Ushbu ikkala vaqt davri tanlangan "
"holda, doiraviy diagramma 2024-yilning ikkinchi choragi uchun ma'lumotlarni "
"ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:144
msgid ""
"Finally, Adam selects the :guilabel:`End Date: Previous Period` option in "
"the :guilabel:`Comparison` section of the :guilabel:`Search...` bar. Doing "
"so causes the pie chart to be split into an inner circle, and an outer ring."
msgstr ""
"Nihoyat, Adam :guilabel:`Search...` panelidagi :guilabel:`Comparison` "
"bo'limida :guilabel:`End Date: Previous Period` parametrini tanlaydi. Buning "
"natijasida doiraviy diagramma ichki doira va tashqi halqaga bo'linadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:148
msgid ""
"The outer ring shows data for the selected time period, quarter two of 2024. "
"The inner circle shows data for the previous time period, quarter one of "
"2024."
msgstr ""
"Tashqi halqa tanlangan vaqt davri, ya'ni 2024-yilning ikkinchi choragi uchun "
"ma'lumotlarni ko'rsatadi. Ichki doira oldingi vaqt davri, ya'ni 2024-yilning "
"birinchi choragi uchun ma'lumotlarni ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:152
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`End Date: Previous Year` is selected instead of :guilabel:`End "
"Date: Previous Period`, the inner circle shows data for the selected time "
"period, one *year* previous."
msgstr ""
"Agar :guilabel:`End Date: Previous Period` o'rniga :guilabel:`End Date: "
"Previous Year` tanlansa, ichki doira tanlangan vaqt davridan bir *yil* "
"oldingi ma'lumotlarni ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:155
msgid ""
"In the case of this example, it would show data for quarter two of 2023."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu misolda u 2023-yilning ikkinchi choragi uchun ma'lumotlarni ko'rsatgan "
"bo'lardi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:157
msgid ""
"Using this report, Adam can see that the products with the highest total "
"cost for quarter two are the *bicycle* and *tricycle*. On the other hand, in "
"quarter one, the *roller skates* had the highest total cost."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu hisobotdan foydalanib, Adam ikkinchi chorakda eng yuqori umumiy "
"xarajatga ega mahsulotlar *velosiped* va *uch g'ildirakli velosiped* "
"ekanligini ko'rishi mumkin. Boshqa tomondan, birinchi chorakda *rolikli "
"konkilar* eng yuqori umumiy xarajatga ega bo'lgan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/production_analysis.rst:0
msgid ""
"The pie chart view of the Production Analysis report, with a comparison "
"filter enabled."
msgstr ""
"Solishtirish filtri yoqilgan holdagi Production Analysis hisobotining "
"doiraviy diagramma ko'rinishi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor.rst:5
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:60
msgid "Shop Floor"
msgstr "Shop Floor"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:3
msgid "Shop Floor overview"
msgstr "Shop Floor umumiy ko'rinishi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:8
msgid ""
"The *Shop Floor* module is a companion module to the *Manufacturing* app. "
"*Shop Floor* provides a visual interface for processing manufacturing orders "
"(MOs) and work orders. It also allows manufacturing employees to track the "
"amount of time spent working on manufacturing and work orders."
msgstr ""
"*Shop Floor* moduli *Manufacturing* ilovasiga hamroh moduldir. *Shop Floor* "
"ishlab chiqarish buyurtmalari (MO) va ish buyurtmalarini qayta ishlash uchun "
"vizual interfeys taqdim etadi. Shuningdek, u ishlab chiqarish xodimlariga "
"ishlab chiqarish va ish buyurtmalari ustida ishlashga sarflangan vaqtni "
"kuzatish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:12
msgid ""
"The *Shop Floor* module is :ref:`installed <general/install>` alongside the "
"*Manufacturing* app."
msgstr ""
"*Shop Floor* moduli *Manufacturing* ilovasi bilan birga :ref:`o'rnatiladi "
"<general/install>`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:15
msgid "Access Shop Floor"
msgstr "Shop Floor'ga kirish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:17
msgid "*Shop Floor* can be opened in the following ways:"
msgstr "*Shop Floor* quyidagi usullar bilan ochilishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:19
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Shop Floor` module icon from the main Odoo dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Asosiy Odoo boshqaruv panelidan :guilabel:`Shop Floor` moduli belgisini "
"bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:20
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`oi-view-kanban` :guilabel:`Shop Floor` smart button on a "
"manufacturing order. This will open the manufacturing order in the *Shop "
"Floor* module."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasidagi :icon:`oi-view-kanban` :guilabel:`Shop "
"Floor` aqlli tugmasini bosing. Bu ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasini *Shop Floor* "
"modulida ochadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:24
msgid "Activating work centers"
msgstr "Ish markazlarini faollashtirish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:26
msgid ""
"When *Shop Floor* is opened on a workstation, it is possible to select work "
"centers to assign to it."
msgstr ""
"*Shop Floor* ish stansiyasida ochilganda, unga tayinlash uchun ish "
"markazlarini tanlash mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:28
msgid ""
"Open the *Shop Floor* app from either the main Odoo dashboard or from "
"the :icon:`oi-view-kanban` :guilabel:`Shop Floor` smart button on a "
"manufacturing order."
msgstr ""
"*Shop Floor* ilovasini asosiy Odoo boshqaruv panelidan yoki ishlab chiqarish "
"buyurtmasidagi :icon:`oi-view-kanban` :guilabel:`Shop Floor` aqlli "
"tugmasidan oching."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:31
msgid ""
"If it is the workstation's first time opening *Shop Floor*, click "
"the :guilabel:`Activate your Work Centers` button that appears, and an "
"*Activate your Work Centers* pop-up window loads."
msgstr ""
"Agar ish stansiyasi *Shop Floor*'ni birinchi marta ochayotgan bo'lsa, paydo "
"bo'lgan :guilabel:`Activate your Work Centers` tugmasini bosing, shunda "
"*Activate your Work Centers* qalqib chiquvchi oynasi yuklanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:34
msgid ""
"Select the work centers to assign to the workstation by clicking the "
"respective checkboxes, then click :guilabel:`Confirm`."
msgstr ""
"Tegishli katakchalarni bosish orqali ish stansiyasiga tayinlanadigan ish "
"markazlarini tanlang, keyin :guilabel:`Confirm` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:None
msgid "Select at least one work center to assign to the workstation."
msgstr "Ish stansiyasiga tayinlash uchun kamida bitta ish markazini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:41
msgid "Installing Shop Floor on a workstation"
msgstr "Shop Floor'ni ish stansiyasiga o'rnatish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:43
msgid ""
"*Shop Floor* can be installed in the Chrome browser of a workstation to "
"limit its access to other Odoo applications."
msgstr ""
"*Shop Floor* ish stansiyasining boshqa Odoo ilovalariga kirishini cheklash "
"uchun uning Chrome brauzeriga o'rnatilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:46
msgid ""
"First, open the *Shop Floor* app from either the main Odoo dashboard or from "
"the :icon:`oi-view-kanban` :guilabel:`Shop Floor` smart button on a "
"manufacturing order."
msgstr ""
"Avval *Shop Floor* ilovasini asosiy Odoo boshqaruv panelidan yoki ishlab "
"chiqarish buyurtmasidagi :icon:`oi-view-kanban` :guilabel:`Shop Floor` aqlli "
"tugmasidan oching."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:49
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-navicon` :guilabel:`(menu)` icon, then click :icon:`fa-"
"arrow-circle-down` :guilabel:`Install App`. A new window will open. Click "
"the :guilabel:`Install` button to install the app in the workstation's "
"browser."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-navicon` :guilabel:`(menu)` belgisini bosing, keyin :icon:`fa-"
"arrow-circle-down` :guilabel:`Install App` tugmasini bosing. Yangi oyna "
"ochiladi. Ilovani ish stansiyasining brauzeriga o'rnatish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Install` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:54
msgid "Navigation"
msgstr "Navigatsiya"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:56
msgid ""
"*Shop Floor* is broken down into three main views, which can be selected "
"from the navigation bar at the top of the module:"
msgstr ""
"*Shop Floor* uchta asosiy ko'rinishga bo'lingan bo'lib, ularni modulning "
"yuqori qismidagi navigatsiya panelidan tanlash mumkin:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:59
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Overview`: *Shop Floor*'s main dashboard and displays information "
"cards for |MOs|. Learn more about the Overview in the :ref:`manufacturing/"
"shop_floor/overview` documentation."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Overview`: *Shop Floor*'ning asosiy boshqaruv paneli bo'lib, |"
"MOs| uchun axborot kartalarini ko'rsatadi. Overview haqida batafsil "
"ma'lumotni :ref:`manufacturing/shop_floor/overview` hujjatidan bilib oling."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:62
msgid ""
":guilabel:`My WO`: shows information cards for all work orders assigned to "
"the employee whose profile is currently active in the operator panel on the "
"left side of the module. This view functions largely the same as the views "
"for each work center, but it only shows work orders assigned to the active "
"employee."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`My WO`: modulning chap tomonidagi operator panelida profili "
"hozirda faol bo'lgan xodimga tayinlangan barcha ish buyurtmalari uchun "
"axborot kartalarini ko'rsatadi. Bu ko'rinish asosan har bir ish markazi "
"uchun ko'rinishlar kabi ishlaydi, lekin u faqat faol xodimga tayinlangan ish "
"buyurtmalarini ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:66
msgid ""
"Each work center has a dedicated view that displays information cards for "
"the work orders assigned to it. Learn more about these views in "
"the :ref:`manufacturing/shop_floor/work-centers` documentation. Select a "
"work center to see the work orders assigned to it. The view for each work "
"center organizes work orders, based on the scheduled dates of their "
"corresponding |MOs|."
msgstr ""
"Har bir ish markazining unga tayinlangan ish buyurtmalari uchun axborot "
"kartalarini ko'rsatadigan alohida ko'rinishi mavjud. Ushbu ko'rinishlar "
"haqida batafsil ma'lumotni :ref:`manufacturing/shop_floor/work-centers` "
"hujjatidan bilib oling. Unga tayinlangan ish buyurtmalarini ko'rish uchun "
"ish markazini tanlang. Har bir ish markazi uchun ko'rinish ish "
"buyurtmalarini ularning tegishli |MOs|'lari rejalashtirilgan sanalari "
"asosida tartibga soladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:72
msgid ""
"To isolate an |MO| or work order, so that no other orders appear, search the "
"reference number of the |MO| in the :guilabel:`Search` bar at the top of the "
"module. This search filter remains active while switching between the "
"different module views."
msgstr ""
"|MO| yoki ish buyurtmasini boshqa buyurtmalar ko'rinmasligi uchun ajratib "
"olish maqsadida, modulning yuqori qismidagi :guilabel:`Search` panelida |"
"MO|'ning ma'lumotnoma raqamini qidiring. Bu qidiruv filtri turli modul "
"ko'rinishlari o'rtasida almashish paytida faol bo'lib qoladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:76
msgid ""
"On the left side of the module is the :ref:`manufacturing/shop_floor/"
"operator-panel`, which shows all of the employees currently signed in to "
"*Shop Floor* and allows new employees to sign in. The operator panel is "
"always available in the module, regardless of the selected view."
msgstr ""
"Modulning chap tomonida :ref:`manufacturing/shop_floor/operator-panel` "
"joylashgan bo'lib, u hozirda *Shop Floor*'ga kirgan barcha xodimlarni "
"ko'rsatadi va yangi xodimlarga kirish imkonini beradi. Operator paneli "
"tanlangan ko'rinishdan qat'i nazar, modulda har doim mavjud."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:83
msgid "Overview view"
msgstr "Overview ko'rinishi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:85
msgid ""
"By default, the *Overview* is displayed when opening *Shop Floor*. This "
"shows an information card for every |MO| that is *ready to start*. An |MO| "
"is considered ready to start once it has been confirmed, and all required "
"components are available."
msgstr ""
"Standart holatda *Shop Floor* ochilganda *Overview* ko'rsatiladi. Bu "
"*boshlashga tayyor* bo'lgan har bir |MO| uchun axborot kartasini ko'rsatadi. "
"|MO| tasdiqlangandan va barcha zarur komponentlar mavjud bo'lgandan so'ng "
"boshlashga tayyor deb hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:89
msgid ""
"To view every confirmed |MO| regardless of readiness, click the :icon:`oi-"
"close` :guilabel:`(remove)` icon on the :guilabel:`MO Ready` filter to "
"remove it from the :guilabel:`Search` bar."
msgstr ""
"Tayyorlikdan qat'i nazar, har bir tasdiqlangan |MO|'ni ko'rish "
"uchun :guilabel:`MO Ready` filtridagi :icon:`oi-close` :guilabel:`(remove)` "
"belgisini bosib, uni :guilabel:`Search` panelidan olib tashlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:94
msgid "MO information card"
msgstr "MO axborot kartasi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:96
msgid ""
"Each |MO| information card on the *Overview* displays all of the relevant "
"details of the associated |MO|, and also provides employees with options for "
"processing the |MO|."
msgstr ""
"*Overview*'dagi har bir |MO| axborot kartasi tegishli |MO|'ning barcha muhim "
"tafsilotlarini ko'rsatadi, shuningdek xodimlarga |MO|'ni qayta ishlash uchun "
"variantlarni taqdim etadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:99
msgid ""
"The header for an |MO| card shows the |MO| number, the product and number of "
"units being produced, and the |MO| status. If work on the MO has not yet "
"begun, the status is :guilabel:`Confirmed`. When work has begun, the status "
"updates to :guilabel:`In Progress`."
msgstr ""
"|MO| kartasining sarlavhasi |MO| raqamini, ishlab chiqarilayotgan mahsulot "
"va birliklar sonini hamda |MO| holatini ko'rsatadi. Agar MO ustida ish hali "
"boshlanmagan bo'lsa, holat :guilabel:`Confirmed` bo'ladi. Ish boshlanganda, "
"holat :guilabel:`In Progress` ga yangilanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:103
msgid ""
"The main body of an |MO| card shows a line for each completed work order, if "
"any, followed by the current work order to be completed. Completed work "
"orders appear in grey with a :icon:`fa-check` :guilabel:`(checkmark)` icon "
"next to it. The current work order is indicated by a :icon:`oi-chevron-"
"right` :guilabel:`(right chevron)` button that opens the view for the work "
"center to which the order is assigned."
msgstr ""
"|MO| kartasining asosiy qismi, agar mavjud bo'lsa, har bir bajarilgan ish "
"buyurtmasi uchun qatorni, so'ngra bajarilishi kerak bo'lgan joriy ish "
"buyurtmasini ko'rsatadi. Bajarilgan ish buyurtmalari kulrang bo'lib, "
"yonida :icon:`fa-check` :guilabel:`(checkmark)` belgisi bilan ko'rinadi. "
"Joriy ish buyurtmasi buyurtma tayinlangan ish markazi ko'rinishini "
"ochadigan :icon:`oi-chevron-right` :guilabel:`(right chevron)` tugmasi bilan "
"belgilanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:109
msgid ""
"If a lot or serial number is required for the product, below the current "
"work order is a line titled :guilabel:`Register Production`, which records "
"lot or serial numbers for the units produced. Click the :guilabel:`Register "
"Production` line to specify a lot or serial number for the produced units, "
"then click :guilabel:`Validate`."
msgstr ""
"Agar mahsulot uchun partiya yoki seriya raqami talab qilinsa, joriy ish "
"buyurtmasi ostida ishlab chiqarilgan birliklar uchun partiya yoki seriya "
"raqamlarini qayd etadigan :guilabel:`Register Production` deb nomlangan "
"qator bo'ladi. Ishlab chiqarilgan birliklar uchun partiya yoki seriya "
"raqamini ko'rsatish uchun :guilabel:`Register Production` qatorini bosing, "
"keyin :guilabel:`Validate` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:114
msgid ""
"The footer of the |MO| card displays a :guilabel:`Close Production` button. "
"This is used to close the |MO| once production is completed. However, if any "
"quality checks are required for the |MO| as a whole (not the work orders "
"within it), a :guilabel:`Quality Checks` button appears instead. "
"Clicking :guilabel:`Quality Checks` opens a pop-up window where any required "
"quality checks can be completed."
msgstr ""
"|MO| kartasining pastki qismida :guilabel:`Close Production` tugmasi "
"ko'rsatiladi. Bu ishlab chiqarish tugagandan so'ng |MO|'ni yopish uchun "
"ishlatiladi. Biroq, agar butun |MO| uchun (undagi ish buyurtmalari uchun "
"emas) biror sifat tekshiruvi talab qilinsa, uning o'rniga :guilabel:`Quality "
"Checks` tugmasi paydo bo'ladi. :guilabel:`Quality Checks` tugmasini bosish "
"barcha zarur sifat tekshiruvlarini bajarish mumkin bo'lgan qalqib chiquvchi "
"oynani ochadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:119
msgid ""
"After clicking :guilabel:`Close Production`, the |MO| card disappears and "
"the work order is closed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Close Production` tugmasini bosgandan so'ng, |MO| kartasi "
"yo'qoladi va ish buyurtmasi yopiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:121
msgid ""
"On the right side of the footer is a :icon:`fa-ellipsis-"
"v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` button, which opens an *Options* pop-up "
"window with additional options for the |MO|:"
msgstr ""
"Pastki qismning o'ng tomonida :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical "
"ellipsis)` tugmasi joylashgan bo'lib, u |MO| uchun qo'shimcha variantlarga "
"ega *Options* qalqib chiquvchi oynasini ochadi:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:124
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Register Production / Serial`: Record lots of serial numbers for "
"the units produced."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Register Production / Serial`: Ishlab chiqarilgan birliklar uchun "
"partiya yoki seriya raqamlarini qayd eting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:125
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:208
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Scrap`: Send components to a scrap location when they are found "
"to be defective. Learn more about the scrap order form in :ref:`inventory/"
"scrap-from-stock`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Scrap`: Komponentlar nuqsonli deb topilganda ularni chiqit joyiga "
"yuboring. Chiqit buyurtmasi formasi haqida batafsil "
"ma'lumotni :ref:`inventory/scrap-from-stock` bo'limidan bilib oling."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:127
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Add Work Order`: Add an additional work order to the |MO|. "
"Specify the operation after which the work order should be inserted, a "
"title, the work center at which it should take place, and the expected "
"duration. Optionally assign a start date and the employee who should "
"complete it."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Add Work Order`: |MO|'ga qo'shimcha ish buyurtmasini qo'shing. "
"Ish buyurtmasi qaysi operatsiyadan keyin kiritilishi kerakligini, "
"sarlavhani, u amalga oshirilishi kerak bo'lgan ish markazini va kutilayotgan "
"davomiylikni ko'rsating. Ixtiyoriy ravishda boshlanish sanasini va uni "
"bajarishi kerak bo'lgan xodimni tayinlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:130
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Add Component`: Add an additional component to the |MO|. Select "
"products to add to the work order, then click the :guilabel:`Back to "
"ShopFloor` button."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Add Component`: |MO|'ga qo'shimcha komponent qo'shing. Ish "
"buyurtmasiga qo'shiladigan mahsulotlarni tanlang, keyin :guilabel:`Back to "
"ShopFloor` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:134
msgid ""
"Additional components are consumed in the *Shop Floor* module, but their "
"stock moves will not be validated until the |MO| is closed."
msgstr ""
"Qo'shimcha komponentlar *Shop Floor* modulida sarflanadi, lekin ularning "
"zaxira harakatlari |MO| yopilmaguncha tasdiqlanmaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:137
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Add By-product`: Add a product that will be created as a "
"byproduct of this work order. This displays when the :guilabel:`By-Products` "
"setting is enabled in the *Manufacturing* app."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Add By-product`: Ushbu ish buyurtmasining qo'shimcha mahsuloti "
"sifatida yaratiladigan mahsulotni qo'shing. Bu *Manufacturing* "
"ilovasida :guilabel:`By-Products` sozlamasi yoqilganda ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:139
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Open Manufacturing Order`: opens the |MO| in the *Manufacturing* "
"app."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Open Manufacturing Order`: |MO|'ni *Manufacturing* ilovasida "
"ochadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:140
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Log Note`: Enter a note that will be visible in the *Shop Floor* "
"module and throughout all steps on the shop floor."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Log Note`: *Shop Floor* modulida va ishlab chiqarish maydonidagi "
"barcha bosqichlarda ko'rinadigan eslatmani kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:None
msgid "An information card for an MO on the Overview of the Shop Floor module."
msgstr "Shop Floor moduli Overview sahifasidagi MO uchun axborot kartasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:149
msgid "Work center views"
msgstr "Ish markazi ko'rinishlari"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:151
msgid ""
"The work center views list a number next to them. This number is the "
"quantity of work orders currently *ready to start* in the work center. A "
"work order is considered ready to start when the |MO| it is a part of is "
"ready to start, and any preceding work orders have been completed."
msgstr ""
"Ish markazi ko'rinishlari yonida raqam ko'rsatiladi. Bu raqam ish markazida "
"hozirda *boshlashga tayyor* bo'lgan ish buyurtmalari miqdorini bildiradi. "
"Ish buyurtmasi o'zi tegishli bo'lgan |MO| boshlashga tayyor bo'lganda va "
"undan oldingi barcha ish buyurtmalari bajarilganda boshlashga tayyor deb "
"hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:155
msgid ""
"By default, the view for each work center shows an information card for "
"every work order assigned to it that is ready to start."
msgstr ""
"Standart holatda, har bir ish markazining ko'rinishida unga biriktirilgan va "
"boshlashga tayyor bo'lgan har bir ish buyurtmasi uchun ma'lumot kartasi "
"ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:158
msgid ""
"To view every confirmed work order assigned to a work center regardless of "
"readiness, click the :icon:`oi-close` :guilabel:`(remove)` icon on "
"the :guilabel:`MO Ready` filter to remove it from the search bar."
msgstr ""
"Ish markaziga biriktirilgan har bir tasdiqlangan ish buyurtmasini "
"tayyorligidan qat'i nazar ko'rish uchun :guilabel:`MO Ready` "
"filtridagi :icon:`oi-close` :guilabel:`(remove)` belgisini bosib, uni "
"qidiruv panelidan olib tashlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:163
msgid "Managing work centers"
msgstr "Ish markazlarini boshqarish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:165
msgid ""
"Work center views can be toggled on or off by clicking the :guilabel:`Add` "
"icon in the navigation bar, selecting or deselecting them on the pop-up "
"window that appears, and then clicking :guilabel:`Confirm`."
msgstr ""
"Ish markazi ko'rinishlarini navigatsiya panelidagi :guilabel:`Add` belgisini "
"bosib, paydo bo'lgan qalqib chiquvchi oynada ularni tanlash yoki tanlovdan "
"chiqarish, so'ngra :guilabel:`Confirm` tugmasini bosish orqali yoqish yoki "
"o'chirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:170
msgid "Work order information card"
msgstr "Ish buyurtmasi ma'lumot kartasi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:172
msgid ""
"The work order information cards on a work center's view show all of the "
"relevant details of the associated work order and also provide employees "
"with options for processing it."
msgstr ""
"Ish markazi ko'rinishidagi ish buyurtmasi ma'lumot kartalari tegishli ish "
"buyurtmasining barcha muhim tafsilotlarini ko'rsatadi hamda xodimlarga uni "
"qayta ishlash uchun imkoniyatlar taqdim etadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:175
msgid ""
"The header for a work order card shows the reference number of the |MO| that "
"the work order is a part of, the product and number of units being produced. "
"Click the :guilabel:`Start` button to start work on a work order. When work "
"has begun, the status updates to display a timer showing the total time the "
"work order has been worked on. The instructions for each work order open "
"automatically when the timer starts."
msgstr ""
"Ish buyurtmasi kartasining sarlavhasida ish buyurtmasi tegishli bo'lgan |MO| "
"ning mos raqami, mahsulot va ishlab chiqarilayotgan birliklar soni "
"ko'rsatiladi. Ish buyurtmasi bo'yicha ishni boshlash uchun :guilabel:`Start` "
"tugmasini bosing. Ish boshlangach, holat yangilanib, ish buyurtmasi ustida "
"ishlangan umumiy vaqtni ko'rsatuvchi taymer paydo bo'ladi. Taymer ishga "
"tushganda har bir ish buyurtmasining ko'rsatmalari avtomatik ravishda "
"ochiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:181
msgid ""
"The main body of a work order card shows a line for each step required to "
"complete the work order. Work order steps can be completed by clicking the "
"button for the line, then following the instructions on the pop-up window "
"that appears."
msgstr ""
"Ish buyurtmasi kartasining asosiy qismida ish buyurtmasini bajarish uchun "
"zarur bo'lgan har bir qadam uchun alohida qator ko'rsatiladi. Ish buyurtmasi "
"qadamlarini qator tugmasini bosib, so'ngra paydo bo'lgan qalqib chiquvchi "
"oynadagi ko'rsatmalarga amal qilib bajarish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:185
msgid ""
"If the work order being processed is the final work order for the |MO|, "
"a :guilabel:`Close Production` button appears on the footer of the work "
"order card. Clicking :guilabel:`Close Production` closes both the work order "
"and the |MO|, unless a quality check is required for the Production` button "
"appears on the footer of the work order card. Click the :guilabel:`Close "
"Production` to close both the work order and the |MO|, unless a quality "
"check is required for the |MO|. In this case, the quality check must be "
"completed from the |MO| card before the |MO| can be closed."
msgstr ""
"Agar qayta ishlanayotgan ish buyurtmasi |MO| uchun oxirgi ish buyurtmasi "
"bo'lsa, ish buyurtmasi kartasining pastki qismida :guilabel:`Close "
"Production` tugmasi paydo bo'ladi. :guilabel:`Close Production` tugmasini "
"bosish ish buyurtmasini ham, |MO| ni ham yopadi, agar |MO| uchun sifat "
"tekshiruvi talab qilinmasa. Ish buyurtmasini ham, |MO| ni ham yopish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Close Production` tugmasini bosing, agar |MO| uchun sifat "
"tekshiruvi talab qilinmasa. Bunday holatda, |MO| yopilishidan oldin sifat "
"tekshiruvi |MO| kartasidan bajarilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:193
msgid ""
"Alternatively, if the |MO| requires the completion of additional work "
"orders, a :guilabel:`Mark as Done` button appears instead. "
"Clicking :guilabel:`Mark as Done` marks the current work order as completed, "
"and causes the next work order to appear on the view for the work center it "
"is assigned Done` button appears instead. Click :guilabel:`Mark as Done` to "
"mark the current work order as completed, and the next work order appears on "
"the view for the work center it is assigned to."
msgstr ""
"Aks holda, agar |MO| qo'shimcha ish buyurtmalarining bajarilishini talab "
"qilsa, uning o'rniga :guilabel:`Mark as Done` tugmasi paydo "
"bo'ladi. :guilabel:`Mark as Done` tugmasini bosish joriy ish buyurtmasini "
"bajarilgan deb belgilaydi va keyingi ish buyurtmasi u biriktirilgan ish "
"markazining ko'rinishida paydo bo'ladi. Joriy ish buyurtmasini bajarilgan "
"deb belgilash uchun :guilabel:`Mark as Done` tugmasini bosing, shunda "
"keyingi ish buyurtmasi u biriktirilgan ish markazining ko'rinishida paydo "
"bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:200
msgid ""
"After clicking :guilabel:`Close Production` or :guilabel:`Mark as Done`, the "
"work order card fades away. When the work order card disappears completely, "
"the work order is marked as :guilabel:`Finished` on the |MO|."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Close Production` yoki :guilabel:`Mark as Done` tugmasi "
"bosilgandan so'ng, ish buyurtmasi kartasi asta-sekin yo'qoladi. Ish "
"buyurtmasi kartasi butunlay yo'qolganda, ish buyurtmasi |MO| "
"da :guilabel:`Finished` deb belgilanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:204
msgid ""
"On the right side of the footer is a :icon:`fa-ellipsis-"
"v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` button, which opens a pop-up window with "
"additional options for the work order:"
msgstr ""
"Pastki qismning o'ng tomonida :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical "
"ellipsis)` tugmasi joylashgan bo'lib, u ish buyurtmasi uchun qo'shimcha "
"imkoniyatlarga ega qalqib chiquvchi oynani ochadi:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:207
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Register Production/Serial`: Record a lot or serial numbers for "
"the units produced."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Register Production/Serial`: Ishlab chiqarilgan birliklar uchun "
"partiya (lot) yoki seriya raqamlarini qayd etish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:210
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Modify Routing`: Move the work order to another work center or "
"add another work order."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Modify Routing`: Ish buyurtmasini boshqa ish markaziga ko'chirish "
"yoki boshqa ish buyurtmasi qo'shish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:211
msgid ":guilabel:`Add Component`: Adds an additional component to the |MO|."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Add Component`: |MO| ga qo'shimcha komponent qo'shadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:212
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Open Manufacturing Order`: Open the associated |MO| in the "
"*Manufacturing* app."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Open Manufacturing Order`: Tegishli |MO| ni *Manufacturing* "
"ilovasida ochish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:213
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Update instructions`: Propose a change to the work order's "
"instructions or steps."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Update instructions`: Ish buyurtmasining ko'rsatmalari yoki "
"qadamlariga o'zgartirish taklif qilish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:214
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Create a Quality Alert`: Open a quality alert form that can be "
"filled out to alert a quality team about a potential issue."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Create a Quality Alert`: Sifat jamoasini yuzaga kelishi mumkin "
"bo'lgan muammo haqida ogohlantirish uchun to'ldirilishi mumkin bo'lgan sifat "
"ogohlantirishi formasini ochish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:216
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Request Maintenance`: Create a maintenance request for the work "
"center."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Request Maintenance`: Ish markazi uchun texnik xizmat so'rovini "
"yaratish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:217
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Block`: Stop all work on the immediate operation and block future "
"work orders from being started until the work order is unblocked."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Block`: Joriy operatsiyadagi barcha ishlarni to'xtatish va ish "
"buyurtmasi blokdan chiqarilgunga qadar kelgusi ish buyurtmalarining "
"boshlanishini bloklash."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:None
msgid "An information card for a work order in the Shop Floor module."
msgstr "Shop Floor modulidagi ish buyurtmasi uchun ma'lumot kartasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:226
msgid "Operator panel"
msgstr "Operator paneli"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:228
msgid ""
"The operator panel is used to manage the employees who are signed in to the "
"*Shop Floor* module. The panel displays the name and profile picture of "
"every employee currently signed in across all database instances."
msgstr ""
"Operator paneli *Shop Floor* moduliga kirgan xodimlarni boshqarish uchun "
"ishlatiladi. Panelda barcha ma'lumotlar bazasi nusxalari bo'ylab hozirda "
"tizimga kirgan har bir xodimning ismi va profil rasmi ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:232
msgid ""
"To interact with *Shop Floor* as a specific employee, click the employee's "
"name to activate their profile. Inactive profiles appear with their names "
"and profile pictures greyed out."
msgstr ""
"*Shop Floor* bilan muayyan xodim sifatida ishlash uchun xodimning ismini "
"bosib, uning profilini faollashtiring. Nofaol profillarning ismlari va "
"profil rasmlari xira rangda ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:235
msgid ""
"When an employee is selected in the operator panel, they can begin working "
"on a work order by clicking the work order's heading. If an employee is "
"working on one or more work orders, the work order titles appear under their "
"name, as well as a timer showing how long they've been working on each order."
msgstr ""
"Xodim operator panelida tanlangach, u ish buyurtmasining sarlavhasini bosib, "
"ish buyurtmasi ustida ishlashni boshlashi mumkin. Agar xodim bir yoki bir "
"nechta ish buyurtmasi ustida ishlayotgan bo'lsa, ish buyurtmalarining "
"nomlari uning ismi ostida, shuningdek, har bir buyurtma ustida qancha vaqt "
"ishlaganini ko'rsatuvchi taymer bilan birga ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:240
msgid ""
"To add new employees to the operator panel, click the :guilabel:`Edit "
"Operators` button at the bottom of the panel. Then, select employees from "
"the *Edit Operators* pop-up window. Click :guilabel:`Done` to save the list "
"of operators."
msgstr ""
"Operator paneliga yangi xodimlarni qo'shish uchun panelning pastki "
"qismidagi :guilabel:`Edit Operators` tugmasini bosing. So'ngra, *Edit "
"Operators* qalqib chiquvchi oynasidan xodimlarni tanlang. Operatorlar "
"ro'yxatini saqlash uchun :guilabel:`Done` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:244
msgid ""
"To remove an employee from the operator panel, click the :guilabel:`Edit "
"Operators` button, deselect the employee, then click :guilabel:`Done`."
msgstr ""
"Xodimni operator panelidan olib tashlash uchun :guilabel:`Edit Operators` "
"tugmasini bosing, xodimni tanlovdan chiqaring, so'ngra :guilabel:`Done` "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:None
msgid ""
"The operator panel of the Shop Floor module, showing four employees signed "
"in."
msgstr ""
"Shop Floor modulining operator paneli, tizimga kirgan to'rt nafar xodimni "
"ko'rsatmoqda."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:251
msgid "MO/WO prioritization"
msgstr "MO/WO ustuvorligini belgilash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:253
msgid ""
"The *Shop Floor* module prioritizes orders based on their *scheduled date*, "
"set in the |MO|. An order can be moved to the top of the list by clicking "
"the :icon:`fa-star-o` :guilabel:`(star)` icon in the |MO| form. |MOs| and "
"work orders scheduled sooner are more highly prioritized and appear before "
"orders which are scheduled further out."
msgstr ""
"*Shop Floor* moduli buyurtmalarni |MO| da belgilangan *rejalashtirilgan "
"sana* asosida ustuvorlik bo'yicha tartiblaydi. Buyurtmani |MO| "
"formasidagi :icon:`fa-star-o` :guilabel:`(star)` belgisini bosish orqali "
"ro'yxatning yuqorisiga ko'chirish mumkin. Ertaroq rejalashtirilgan |MOs| va "
"ish buyurtmalari yuqoriroq ustuvorlikka ega bo'lib, kechroq rejalashtirilgan "
"buyurtmalardan oldin ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:258
msgid ""
"To specify the scheduled date on an |MO|, begin by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Operations --> Manufacturing "
"Orders`, and click :guilabel:`New` to create a new |MO|."
msgstr ""
"|MO| da rejalashtirilgan sanani belgilash uchun "
"avval :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Operations --> Manufacturing "
"Orders` yo'lidan o'ting va yangi |MO| yaratish uchun :guilabel:`New` "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:261
msgid ""
"To learn more about the fields on the |MO| form, see :ref:`manufacturing/"
"basic_setup/create-mo`."
msgstr ""
"|MO| formasidagi maydonlar haqida ko'proq ma'lumot olish "
"uchun :ref:`manufacturing/basic_setup/create-mo` bo'limiga qarang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:263
msgid ""
"Click on the :guilabel:`Scheduled Date` field to open a calendar popover "
"window. By default, the :guilabel:`Scheduled Date` field and its "
"corresponding pop-up window show the current date and time."
msgstr ""
"Kalendar oynasini ochish uchun :guilabel:`Scheduled Date` maydonini bosing. "
"Standart holatda, :guilabel:`Scheduled Date` maydoni va unga tegishli qalqib "
"chiquvchi oyna joriy sana va vaqtni ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:266
msgid ""
"Use the calendar to select the date on which processing should begin for the "
"|MO|. In the two fields at the bottom of the popover window, enter the hour "
"and minute at which processing should begin, using the 24-hour clock format."
msgstr ""
"|MO| uchun qayta ishlash boshlanishi kerak bo'lgan sanani tanlash uchun "
"kalendardan foydalaning. Oynaning pastki qismidagi ikkita maydonga qayta "
"ishlash boshlanishi kerak bo'lgan soat va daqiqani 24 soatlik vaqt formatida "
"kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:270
msgid ""
"Finally, click :guilabel:`Apply` at the bottom of the popover window to set "
"the date and time for the :guilabel:`Scheduled Date` field. Then, click "
"the :guilabel:`Confirm` button at the top of the |MO| to confirm it."
msgstr ""
"Nihoyat, :guilabel:`Scheduled Date` maydoni uchun sana va vaqtni belgilash "
"uchun oynaning pastki qismidagi :guilabel:`Apply` tugmasini bosing. So'ngra, "
"|MO| ni tasdiqlash uchun uning yuqori qismidagi :guilabel:`Confirm` "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:274
msgid ""
"Once the |MO| is confirmed, it appears in the *Shop Floor* module, as long "
"is it has the :guilabel:`Ready` status, which means all components are "
"available."
msgstr ""
"|MO| tasdiqlangach, u :guilabel:`Ready` holatiga ega bo'lsa, ya'ni barcha "
"komponentlar mavjud bo'lsa, *Shop Floor* modulida paydo bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:277
msgid ""
"On the Odoo dashboard, click on the :menuselection:`Shop Floor` module to "
"open it. The *Overview* of the dashboard displays *Ready* |MOs|, organized "
"in order of priority on their |MO| form, then their scheduled dates."
msgstr ""
"Odoo boshqaruv panelida :menuselection:`Shop Floor` modulini ochish uchun "
"uni bosing. Boshqaruv panelining *Overview* qismida *Ready* holatidagi |MOs| "
"ko'rsatiladi, ular avval |MO| formasidagi ustuvorlik, so'ngra "
"rejalashtirilgan sanalari bo'yicha tartiblanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:None
msgid "The Overview dashboard with prioritized orders appearing first."
msgstr ""
"Ustuvor buyurtmalar birinchi bo'lib ko'rsatilgan Overview boshqaruv paneli."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:285
msgid "Three |MOs| are confirmed for a *Table* product:"
msgstr "*Table* mahsuloti uchun uchta |MOs| tasdiqlangan:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:287
msgid "WH/MO/00018 has a :guilabel:`Scheduled Date` of March 31."
msgstr "WH/MO/00018 ning :guilabel:`Scheduled Date` qiymati — 31-mart."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:288
msgid "WH/MO/00019 has a :guilabel:`Scheduled Date` of April 9."
msgstr "WH/MO/00019 ning :guilabel:`Scheduled Date` qiymati — 9-aprel."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:289
msgid "WH/MO/00020 has a :guilabel:`Scheduled Date` of April 3."
msgstr "WH/MO/00020 ning :guilabel:`Scheduled Date` qiymati — 3-aprel."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:291
msgid ""
"On the *Overview* of the *Shop Floor* module, the cards for each |MO| appear "
"in this order: WH/MO/00018, WH/MO/00020, WH/MO/00019."
msgstr ""
"*Shop Floor* modulining *Overview* qismida har bir |MO| uchun kartalar "
"quyidagi tartibda ko'rsatiladi: WH/MO/00018, WH/MO/00020, WH/MO/00019."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:None
msgid "MOs in the Shop Floor module, ordered by their scheduled date."
msgstr ""
"Shop Floor modulida rejalashtirilgan sanalari bo'yicha tartiblangan MOlar."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_overview.rst:297
msgid ""
"Each |MO| requires one work order, carried out at :guilabel:`Assembly 1`. "
"Clicking on the :guilabel:`Assembly 1` button at the top of the screen opens "
"the view for the work center, which displays one card for each work order, "
"appearing in the same order as their corresponding |MOs|."
msgstr ""
"Har bir |MO| :guilabel:`Assembly 1` da bajariladigan bitta ish buyurtmasini "
"talab qiladi. Ekranning yuqori qismidagi :guilabel:`Assembly 1` tugmasini "
"bosish ish markazining ko'rinishini ochadi, unda har bir ish buyurtmasi "
"uchun bittadan karta tegishli |MOs| bilan bir xil tartibda ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:3
msgid "Shop Floor time tracking"
msgstr "Shop Floor da vaqtni kuzatish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:9
msgid ""
"By signing in to the Odoo *Shop Floor* module as *operators*, employees are "
"able to track the amount of time they spend working on each work order. Odoo "
"tracks the time it takes to complete each work order as well as the time "
"each operator spends on each work order."
msgstr ""
"Odoo *Shop Floor* moduliga *operatorlar* sifatida kirish orqali xodimlar har "
"bir ish buyurtmasi ustida ishlashga sarflagan vaqtlarini kuzatishlari "
"mumkin. Odoo har bir ish buyurtmasini bajarish uchun ketgan vaqtni hamda har "
"bir operatorning har bir ish buyurtmasiga sarflagan vaqtini kuzatib boradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:16
msgid "Manage operators"
msgstr "Operatorlarni boshqarish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:18
msgid ""
"When the *Shop Floor* module is first opened, the employee profile that is "
"signed in to the database is automatically signed in as an operator."
msgstr ""
"*Shop Floor* moduli birinchi marta ochilganda, ma'lumotlar bazasiga kirgan "
"xodim profili avtomatik ravishda operator sifatida tizimga kiritiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:21
msgid ""
"All operators for the current session are listed in the operator panel on "
"the left side of the screen. While the panel can list multiple employee "
"profiles, only one employee can be active at once. The active profile "
"highlighted in the operator panel is used for :ref:`time tracking "
"<manufacturing/shop_floor/track-work-order-duration>`."
msgstr ""
"Joriy seans uchun barcha operatorlar ekranning chap tomonidagi operator "
"panelida ro'yxatlanadi. Panelda bir nechta xodim profillari ro'yxatlanishi "
"mumkin bo'lsa-da, bir vaqtning o'zida faqat bitta xodim faol bo'lishi "
"mumkin. Operator panelida ajratib ko'rsatilgan faol profil :ref:`vaqtni "
"kuzatish <manufacturing/shop_floor/track-work-order-duration>` uchun "
"ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:None
msgid "The operator panel in the Shop Floor module."
msgstr "Shop Floor modulidagi operator paneli."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:30
msgid "Add an operator"
msgstr "Operator qo'shish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:32
msgid ""
"To add employees to the operator panel, click the :guilabel:`Edit Operators` "
"button at the bottom of the panel. In the *Edit Operators* pop-up window, "
"select the employees that should be added as operators for the current "
"session, then click :guilabel:`Done`."
msgstr ""
"Operator paneliga xodimlarni qo'shish uchun panelning pastki "
"qismidagi :guilabel:`Edit Operators` tugmasini bosing. *Edit Operators* "
"qalqib chiquvchi oynasida joriy seans uchun operator sifatida qo'shilishi "
"kerak bo'lgan xodimlarni tanlang, so'ngra :guilabel:`Done` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:None
msgid "The Edit Operators pop-up window with four operators selected."
msgstr "To'rtta operator tanlangan Edit Operators qalqib chiquvchi oynasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:40
msgid "Switch profiles"
msgstr "Profillarni almashtirish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:42
msgid ""
"To sign in to *Shop Floor* as a different employee, click their name in the "
"operator panel to sign in using their profile. If a |PIN| has not been set "
"for the employee, the profile is signed in automatically. If a |PIN| has "
"been set for the employee, an :guilabel:`Enter your pin` pop-up window "
"appears. Enter the code using the number pad or keyboard, then "
"click :guilabel:`Confirm` to sign in to the *Shop Floor* module."
msgstr ""
"*Shop Floor* ga boshqa xodim sifatida kirish uchun operator panelida uning "
"ismini bosib, uning profili orqali tizimga kiring. Agar xodim uchun |PIN| "
"o'rnatilmagan bo'lsa, profil avtomatik ravishda tizimga kiritiladi. Agar "
"xodim uchun |PIN| o'rnatilgan bo'lsa, :guilabel:`Enter your pin` qalqib "
"chiquvchi oynasi paydo bo'ladi. Kodni raqamlar paneli yoki klaviatura "
"yordamida kiriting, so'ngra *Shop Floor* moduliga kirish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Confirm` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:49
msgid ""
"Each employee can be assigned a PIN, which must be entered when signing in "
"to the *Shop Floor* module. Badges can also be generated and printed for "
"checking in and out with *Kiosk Mode* in the **Attendances** app. See "
"the :ref:`employee settings section <employees/hr-attn-pos>` to learn more."
msgstr ""
"Har bir xodimga PIN biriktirilishi mumkin bo'lib, u *Shop Floor* moduliga "
"kirishda kiritilishi kerak. Shuningdek, **Attendances** ilovasidagi *Kiosk "
"Mode* yordamida kelish va ketishni qayd etish uchun beyjlar yaratilishi va "
"chop etilishi mumkin. Ko'proq ma'lumot olish uchun :ref:`xodim sozlamalari "
"bo'limiga <employees/hr-attn-pos>` qarang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:55
msgid "Remove an operator"
msgstr "Operatorni olib tashlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:57
msgid ""
"To remove employees from the operator panel, click the :guilabel:`Edit "
"Operators` button, and click the profiles that should be removed from the "
"panel. Confirm that the profiles have been unchecked, then "
"click :guilabel:`Done`."
msgstr ""
"Xodimlarni operator panelidan olib tashlash uchun :guilabel:`Edit Operators` "
"tugmasini bosing va paneldan olib tashlanishi kerak bo'lgan profillarni "
"bosing. Profillar belgisi olib tashlanganiga ishonch hosil qiling, "
"so'ngra :guilabel:`Done` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:64
msgid "Track work order duration"
msgstr "Ish buyurtmasi davomiyligini kuzatish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:66
msgid ""
"To track the time spent on a work order, select the work center where the "
"work order is scheduled to be carried out. This can be done by selecting the "
"work center from the top of the page in the *Shop Floor* module or by "
"clicking the name of the work center in the form for the manufacturing order "
"(MO) that the work order is a part of."
msgstr ""
"Ish buyurtmasiga sarflangan vaqtni kuzatish uchun ish buyurtmasi bajarilishi "
"rejalashtirilgan ish markazini tanlang. Buni *Shop Floor* modulida "
"sahifaning yuqori qismidan ish markazini tanlash orqali yoki ish buyurtmasi "
"tarkibiga kiruvchi ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasi (MO) formasida ish markazi "
"nomini bosish orqali amalga oshirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:71
msgid ""
"When work begins, click the :guilabel:`Start` button on the work order card "
"to start tracking the duration. The :guilabel:`Start` button is replaced by "
"a timer which displays the total duration that all operators have spent on "
"the work order."
msgstr ""
"Ish boshlanganda, davomiylikni kuzatishni boshlash uchun ish buyurtmasi "
"kartasidagi :guilabel:`Start` tugmasini bosing. :guilabel:`Start` tugmasi "
"o'rnida barcha operatorlar ish buyurtmasiga sarflagan umumiy davomiylikni "
"ko'rsatuvchi taymer paydo bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:None
msgid "A work order card with an active timer."
msgstr "Faol taymerga ega ish buyurtmasi kartasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:79
msgid "View active profile work orders"
msgstr "Faol profilning ish buyurtmalarini ko'rish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:81
msgid ""
"The operator panel displays the work center location and individual time "
"spent for each work order an operator is working on. This timer only "
"reflects work done during the current session, even if the operator has "
"previously worked on the work order."
msgstr ""
"Operator paneli operator ishlayotgan har bir ish buyurtmasi uchun ish "
"markazi joylashuvini va alohida sarflangan vaqtni ko'rsatadi. Ushbu taymer "
"faqat joriy seans davomida bajarilgan ishni aks ettiradi, hatto operator "
"ilgari ushbu ish buyurtmasi ustida ishlagan bo'lsa ham."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:85
msgid ""
"Operators can work on multiple work orders simultaneously and track their "
"time for each. Click :guilabel:`My WO` at the top of the page to see all of "
"the work orders the active profile is working on."
msgstr ""
"Operatorlar bir vaqtning o'zida bir nechta ish buyurtmalari ustida ishlashi "
"va har biri uchun vaqtini kuzatishi mumkin. Faol profil ishlayotgan barcha "
"ish buyurtmalarini ko'rish uchun sahifaning yuqori qismidagi :guilabel:`My "
"WO` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:None
msgid "An employee card in the operator panel, showing two work order timers."
msgstr ""
"Operator panelidagi xodim kartasi, ikkita ish buyurtmasi taymerini "
"ko'rsatmoqda."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:93
msgid "Pause and stop timer"
msgstr "Taymerni pauza qilish va to'xtatish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:95
msgid ""
"To pause the timer on a work order, click the work order card a second time."
msgstr ""
"Ish buyurtmasidagi taymerni pauza qilish uchun ish buyurtmasi kartasini "
"ikkinchi marta bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:97
msgid ""
"Once a work order is complete, click the :guilabel:`Mark as Done` button at "
"the bottom of the work order card, and it disappears from the work center "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Ish buyurtmasi yakunlangach, ish buyurtmasi kartasining pastki "
"qismidagi :guilabel:`Mark as Done` tugmasini bosing, shunda u ish markazi "
"sahifasidan yo'qoladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:101
msgid ""
"If there are no additional work orders for the |MO|, the button "
"says :guilabel:`Close Production` instead. Clicking :guilabel:`Close "
"Production` marks the entire |MO| as *Done* and removes it from the *Shop "
"Floor* module."
msgstr ""
"Agar |MO| uchun qo'shimcha ish buyurtmalari bo'lmasa, tugmada uning "
"o'rniga :guilabel:`Close Production` yozuvi ko'rsatiladi. :guilabel:`Close "
"Production` tugmasini bosish butun |MO| ni *Done* deb belgilaydi va uni "
"*Shop Floor* modulidan olib tashlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:105
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Close Production` button is always visible on the "
"manufacturing order card in the :guilabel:`Overview` tab."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Close Production` tugmasi har doim :guilabel:`Overview` "
"varag'idagi ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasi kartasida ko'rinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:112
msgid "View work order duration"
msgstr "Ish buyurtmasi davomiyligini ko'rish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:115
msgid "By individual work order"
msgstr "Alohida ish buyurtmasi bo'yicha"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:117
msgid ""
"To view the duration of a work order, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Operations --> Work Orders`."
msgstr ""
"Ish buyurtmasi davomiyligini ko'rish uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app "
"--> Operations --> Work Orders` yo'lidan o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:120
msgid ""
"By default, the search bar has a filter applied to display incomplete work "
"orders only. To view work orders that have been completed and marked as "
"*Done*, remove the filter from the search bar by clicking on the :icon:`oi-"
"close` :guilabel:`(Remove)` button on the right side of the filter."
msgstr ""
"Standart holatda qidiruv panelida faqat tugallanmagan ish buyurtmalarini "
"ko'rsatish uchun filtr qo'llangan bo'ladi. Yakunlangan va *Done* deb "
"belgilangan ish buyurtmalarini ko'rish uchun filtrning o'ng "
"tomonidagi :icon:`oi-close` :guilabel:`(Remove)` tugmasini bosib, filtrni "
"qidiruv panelidan olib tashlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:124
msgid ""
"The actual time it took to complete each work order is displayed in "
"the :guilabel:`Real Duration` column. This value represents the total time "
"spent on the work order by all operators who worked on it. It includes time "
"tracked in the *Shop Floor* module as well as time tracked in the work order "
"form or the :guilabel:`Work Orders` tab of the |MO|."
msgstr ""
"Har bir ish buyurtmasini yakunlash uchun sarflangan haqiqiy "
"vaqt :guilabel:`Real Duration` ustunida ko'rsatiladi. Ushbu qiymat ish "
"buyurtmasi ustida ishlagan barcha operatorlar sarflagan umumiy vaqtni "
"ifodalaydi. U *Shop Floor* modulida kuzatilgan vaqtni, shuningdek ish "
"buyurtmasi formasida yoki |MO| ning :guilabel:`Work Orders` varag'ida "
"kuzatilgan vaqtni o'z ichiga oladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:129
msgid ""
"To view detailed time tracking information, select a work order. In the work "
"order form, go to the :guilabel:`Time Tracking` tab to see a detailed list "
"of all operators who have worked on the work order and the amount of time "
"they spent on it."
msgstr ""
"Vaqtni kuzatish bo'yicha batafsil ma'lumotni ko'rish uchun ish buyurtmasini "
"tanlang. Ish buyurtmasi formasida ish buyurtmasi ustida ishlagan barcha "
"operatorlarning batafsil ro'yxatini va ular sarflagan vaqt miqdorini ko'rish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Time Tracking` varag'iga o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:134
msgid "By manufacturing order"
msgstr "Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasi bo'yicha"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:136
msgid ""
"To view the duration of all work orders in a specific |MO|, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Operations --> Manufacturing "
"Orders`."
msgstr ""
"Muayyan |MO| dagi barcha ish buyurtmalarining davomiyligini ko'rish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Operations --> Manufacturing "
"Orders` yo'lidan o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:139
msgid ""
"By default, the search bar has a filter applied to display incomplete |MOs| "
"only. To view |MOs| that have been completed and marked as *Done*, remove "
"the filter from the search bar by clicking on the :icon:`oi-"
"close` :guilabel:`(Remove)` button on the right side of the filter."
msgstr ""
"Standart holatda qidiruv panelida faqat tugallanmagan |MOs| ni ko'rsatish "
"uchun filtr qo'llangan bo'ladi. Yakunlangan va *Done* deb belgilangan |MOs| "
"ni ko'rish uchun filtrning o'ng tomonidagi :icon:`oi-"
"close` :guilabel:`(Remove)` tugmasini bosib, filtrni qidiruv panelidan olib "
"tashlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/shop_floor/shop_floor_tracking.rst:143
msgid ""
"Select an |MO|. In the |MO| form, go to the :guilabel:`Work Orders` tab to "
"see a list of all work orders included in the |MO|. To view details for a "
"specific work order, click anywhere on the entry line and the work order "
"form opens."
msgstr ""
"|MO| ni tanlang. |MO| formasida |MO| tarkibiga kiruvchi barcha ish "
"buyurtmalari ro'yxatini ko'rish uchun :guilabel:`Work Orders` varag'iga "
"o'ting. Muayyan ish buyurtmasi tafsilotlarini ko'rish uchun yozuv qatorining "
"istalgan joyini bosing, shunda ish buyurtmasi formasi ochiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:5
msgid "Subcontracting"
msgstr "Subpudrat"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:9
msgid ""
"In manufacturing, *subcontracting* is the process of a company engaging a "
"third-party manufacturer, or subcontractor, to manufacture products that are "
"then sold by the contracting company."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarishda *subpudrat* — bu kompaniyaning uchinchi tomon ishlab "
"chiqaruvchisi, ya'ni subpudratchini jalb qilib, keyinchalik buyurtmachi "
"kompaniya tomonidan sotiladigan mahsulotlarni ishlab chiqarish jarayonidir."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:12
msgid ""
"Subcontracting provides a variety of benefits for both the contracting "
"company and the subcontractor."
msgstr ""
"Subpudrat buyurtmachi kompaniya uchun ham, subpudratchi uchun ham turli "
"afzalliklar beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:15
msgid ""
"For the contracting company, subcontracting allows them to sell a wide "
"variety of manufactured products, without having to worry about investing in "
"and maintaining the equipment and labor required to handle the manufacturing "
"themselves."
msgstr ""
"Buyurtmachi kompaniya uchun subpudrat ishlab chiqarishni o'zlari amalga "
"oshirish uchun zarur bo'lgan uskuna va ishchi kuchiga sarmoya kiritish hamda "
"ularni saqlab turish haqida qayg'urmasdan, keng turdagi ishlab chiqarilgan "
"mahsulotlarni sotish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:19
msgid ""
"This helps contracting companies stay flexible throughout economic cycles, "
"as they can easily increase or decrease their engagements with "
"subcontractors, as necessitated by the current moment. It also means they "
"are able to focus on tasks they excel at, while delegating more specialized "
"work to subcontractors."
msgstr ""
"Bu buyurtmachi kompaniyalarga iqtisodiy sikllar davomida moslashuvchan "
"bo'lib qolishga yordam beradi, chunki ular joriy vaziyat taqozosiga ko'ra "
"subpudratchilar bilan hamkorlikni osongina kengaytirishi yoki qisqartirishi "
"mumkin. Bu shuningdek, ular yaxshi bajaradigan vazifalarga e'tibor "
"qaratishi, ko'proq ixtisoslashgan ishlarni esa subpudratchilarga topshirishi "
"mumkinligini anglatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:24
msgid ""
"On the other side of the relationship, subcontracting allows subcontractors "
"to specialize in more niche areas of production, which might not be as "
"profitable outside the bounds of a subcontracting engagement. In certain "
"arrangements, it also provides them with the flexibility to choose which "
"projects they accept or decline, and how many they work on at any given time."
msgstr ""
"Munosabatlarning boshqa tomonida esa subpudrat subpudratchilarga ishlab "
"chiqarishning torroq sohalarida ixtisoslashish imkonini beradi, bu esa "
"subpudrat hamkorligi doirasidan tashqarida uncha foydali bo'lmasligi mumkin. "
"Ayrim kelishuvlarda bu ularga qaysi loyihalarni qabul qilish yoki rad etish "
"va istalgan vaqtda nechta loyiha ustida ishlashni tanlash "
"moslashuvchanligini ham beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:29
msgid ""
"In Odoo, companies can configure their subcontracting workflows based on a "
"variety of different factors, including how components are sourced, and what "
"happens to finished products once they are manufactured."
msgstr ""
"Odoo da kompaniyalar o'zlarining subpudrat ish jarayonlarini turli "
"omillarga, jumladan komponentlar qanday ta'minlanishiga va tayyor "
"mahsulotlar ishlab chiqarilgandan keyin ular bilan nima sodir bo'lishiga "
"asoslanib sozlashi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:35
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:3
msgid "Basic subcontracting"
msgstr "Oddiy subpudrat"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:35
msgid ""
"Subcontract products without supplying the subcontractor with components."
msgstr ""
"Subpudratchini komponentlar bilan ta'minlamasdan mahsulotlarni subpudratga "
"berish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:40
msgid "Resupply subcontractor"
msgstr "Subpudratchini qayta ta'minlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:40
msgid ""
"Ship components to a subcontractor each time a PO for a subcontracted "
"product is confirmed."
msgstr ""
"Subpudrat mahsuloti uchun xarid buyurtmasi (PO) tasdiqlangan har safar "
"subpudratchiga komponentlarni jo'natish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:45
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:3
msgid "Dropship to subcontractor"
msgstr "Subpudratchiga dropshipping"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:45
msgid ""
"Dropship components to a subcontractor each time a PO for a subcontracted "
"product is confirmed."
msgstr ""
"Subpudrat mahsuloti uchun xarid buyurtmasi (PO) tasdiqlangan har safar "
"komponentlarni subpudratchiga dropshipping orqali yetkazish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:54
msgid ""
"To enable subcontracting in Odoo, navigate to :menuselection:`Manufacturing "
"app --> Configuration --> Settings`, and tick the checkbox next to "
"the :guilabel:`Subcontracting` setting, under the :guilabel:`Operations` "
"heading. Then, click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo da subpudratni yoqish uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings` yo'lidan o'ting va :guilabel:`Operations` "
"sarlavhasi ostidagi :guilabel:`Subcontracting` sozlamasi yonidagi katakchani "
"belgilang. So'ngra :guilabel:`Save` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:None
msgid "The Subcontracting setting in the manufacturing app."
msgstr "Ishlab chiqarish ilovasidagi Subcontracting sozlamasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:62
msgid ""
"With subcontracting enabled, a few different features become available in "
"Odoo:"
msgstr ""
"Subpudrat yoqilganda, Odoo da bir nechta turli funksiyalar mavjud bo'ladi:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:64
msgid ""
"On bills of materials (BoMs), the *BoM Type* field now includes a "
"*Subcontracting* option. Enabling the *Subcontracting* |BoM| type designates "
"the |BoM|'s product as a subcontracted product, which means Odoo knows that "
"it is produced by a subcontractor, and not by the company that owns the Odoo "
"database."
msgstr ""
"Materiallar ro'yxatlarida (BoM) *BoM Type* maydoni endi *Subcontracting* "
"variantini o'z ichiga oladi. *Subcontracting* |BoM| turini yoqish |BoM| "
"mahsulotini subpudrat mahsuloti sifatida belgilaydi, ya'ni Odoo uni Odoo "
"ma'lumotlar bazasiga egalik qiluvchi kompaniya emas, balki subpudratchi "
"ishlab chiqarishini biladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:68
msgid ""
"Two subcontracting routes become available in the *Inventory* app, and can "
"be assigned to specific products, on the *Inventory* tab of their product "
"pages:"
msgstr ""
"*Inventory* ilovasida ikkita subpudrat marshruti mavjud bo'ladi va ularni "
"mahsulot sahifalarining *Inventory* varag'ida muayyan mahsulotlarga "
"tayinlash mumkin:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:71
msgid "*Resupply Subcontractor on Order*"
msgstr "*Resupply Subcontractor on Order*"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:72
msgid "*Dropship Subcontractor on Order*"
msgstr "*Dropship Subcontractor on Order*"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:75
msgid "Subcontracting workflows"
msgstr "Subpudrat ish jarayonlari"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:77
msgid ""
"In Odoo, there are three subcontracting workflows, the main difference "
"between them being *how* the subcontractor obtains the necessary components:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo da uchta subpudrat ish jarayoni mavjud bo'lib, ular orasidagi asosiy "
"farq subpudratchi zarur komponentlarni *qanday* olishidadir:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:80
msgid ""
"In the *basic* subcontracting workflow, the subcontractor is fully "
"responsible for obtaining the components. This workflow is outlined in "
"the :doc:`subcontracting/subcontracting_basic` documentation."
msgstr ""
"*Oddiy* subpudrat ish jarayonida komponentlarni olish uchun subpudratchi "
"to'liq javobgar hisoblanadi. Ushbu ish jarayoni :doc:`subcontracting/"
"subcontracting_basic` hujjatida bayon etilgan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:83
msgid ""
"In the *Resupply Subcontractor on Order* workflow, the contracting company "
"sends the components from their warehouse to the subcontractor. This "
"workflow is outlined in the :doc:`subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply` "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"*Resupply Subcontractor on Order* ish jarayonida buyurtmachi kompaniya "
"komponentlarni o'z omboridan subpudratchiga jo'natadi. Ushbu ish "
"jarayoni :doc:`subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply` hujjatida bayon "
"etilgan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:86
msgid ""
"In the *Dropship Subcontractor on Order* workflow, the contracting company "
"purchases the components from a vendor, and has them delivered directly to "
"the subcontractor. This workflow is outlined in the :doc:`subcontracting/"
"subcontracting_dropship` documentation."
msgstr ""
"*Dropship Subcontractor on Order* ish jarayonida buyurtmachi kompaniya "
"komponentlarni yetkazib beruvchidan sotib oladi va ularni to'g'ridan-to'g'ri "
"subpudratchiga yetkazib berishni tashkil qiladi. Ushbu ish "
"jarayoni :doc:`subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship` hujjatida bayon "
"etilgan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:90
msgid ""
"In addition to how a subcontractor obtains components, it is also necessary "
"to consider why a product is being subcontracted, as well as what happens to "
"products once they are manufactured by the subcontractor."
msgstr ""
"Subpudratchi komponentlarni qanday olishidan tashqari, mahsulot nima uchun "
"subpudratga berilayotganini, shuningdek mahsulotlar subpudratchi tomonidan "
"ishlab chiqarilgandan keyin ular bilan nima sodir bo'lishini ham hisobga "
"olish zarur."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:94
msgid ""
"In terms of why a product is being subcontracted, the two main reasons are "
"to fulfill a customer order, or to replenish the quantity of stock on-hand."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulot nima uchun subpudratga berilayotgani nuqtai nazaridan, ikkita "
"asosiy sabab — mijoz buyurtmasini bajarish yoki mavjud zaxira miqdorini "
"to'ldirishdir."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:97
msgid ""
"In terms of what happens to products once they are manufactured, they can "
"either be shipped to the contracting company, or dropshipped directly to an "
"end customer."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulotlar ishlab chiqarilgandan keyin ular bilan nima sodir bo'lishi "
"nuqtai nazaridan, ular buyurtmachi kompaniyaga jo'natilishi yoki to'g'ridan-"
"to'g'ri yakuniy mijozga dropshipping orqali yetkazilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:100
msgid ""
"Each of the three subcontracting workflows described above can be configured "
"to facilitate any of these possibilities, and the methods for doing so are "
"outlined in their respective documentation."
msgstr ""
"Yuqorida tavsiflangan uchta subpudrat ish jarayonining har birini ushbu "
"imkoniyatlarning istalganini amalga oshirish uchun sozlash mumkin va buni "
"bajarish usullari ularning tegishli hujjatlarida bayon etilgan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:104
msgid "Subcontracted product valuation"
msgstr "Subpudrat mahsulotini baholash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:106
msgid ""
"The valuation of a subcontracted product depends upon a few different "
"variables:"
msgstr ""
"Subpudrat mahsulotini baholash bir nechta turli o'zgaruvchilarga bog'liq:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:108
msgid ""
"The cost of the required components, if provided by the contracting company; "
"from here on referred to as `C`."
msgstr ""
"Zarur komponentlarning tannarxi, agar ular buyurtmachi kompaniya tomonidan "
"taqdim etilsa; bundan keyin `C` deb yuritiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:110
msgid ""
"The price paid to the subcontractor for the service of manufacturing the "
"subcontracted product; from here on referred to as `M`."
msgstr ""
"Subpudrat mahsulotini ishlab chiqarish xizmati uchun subpudratchiga "
"to'lanadigan narx; bundan keyin `M` deb yuritiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:112
msgid ""
"The cost of shipping components to the subcontractor, and having them "
"shipped back to the contracting company; from here on referred to as `S`."
msgstr ""
"Komponentlarni subpudratchiga jo'natish va ularni buyurtmachi kompaniyaga "
"qaytarib jo'natish xarajatlari; bundan keyin `S` deb yuritiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:114
msgid ""
"The cost of dropshipping, if the components are shipped by the subcontractor "
"to the end customer; from here on referred to as `D`."
msgstr ""
"Dropshipping xarajatlari, agar komponentlar subpudratchi tomonidan yakuniy "
"mijozga jo'natilsa; bundan keyin `D` deb yuritiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:116
msgid ""
"Any other associated costs, like import taxes, etc.; from here on referred "
"to as `x`."
msgstr ""
"Boshqa har qanday bog'liq xarajatlar, masalan, import soliqlari va h.k.; "
"bundan keyin `x` deb yuritiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:118
msgid ""
"Therefore, the total valuation of a subcontracted product (`P`) can be "
"represented by the following equation:"
msgstr ""
"Shunday qilib, subpudrat mahsulotining umumiy baholanishini (`P`) quyidagi "
"tenglama bilan ifodalash mumkin:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:121
msgid ""
"P = C + M + S + D + x\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"P = C + M + S + D + x\n"
"\n"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting.rst:124
msgid ""
"It is important to note that not every subcontracted product valuation will "
"include all of these variables. For example, if the product is not "
"dropshipped to the end customer, then there is no need to factor in the cost "
"of dropshipping."
msgstr ""
"Shuni ta'kidlash muhimki, har bir subpudrat mahsulot qiymatini baholash "
"ushbu o'zgaruvchilarning barchasini o'z ichiga olavermaydi. Masalan, agar "
"mahsulot yakuniy mijozga dropshipping orqali yetkazilmasa, dropshipping "
"xarajatini hisobga olish shart emas."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:10
msgid ""
"In basic subcontracting, a company's product is produced entirely by a "
"subcontractor. The product is first purchased from the subcontractor, who "
"acquires their own components, manufactures the final product, then delivers "
"the final product to the company's warehouse."
msgstr ""
"Oddiy subpudratda kompaniya mahsuloti to'liq subpudratchi tomonidan ishlab "
"chiqariladi. Mahsulot avval subpudratchidan sotib olinadi; subpudratchi o'z "
"komponentlarini o'zi topadi, yakuniy mahsulotni ishlab chiqaradi, so'ngra "
"yakuniy mahsulotni kompaniya omboriga yetkazib beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:14
msgid ""
"The following document covers how to configure a subcontracted product and "
"trigger the subcontracting process."
msgstr ""
"Quyidagi hujjatda subpudrat mahsulotini qanday sozlash va subpudrat "
"jarayonini qanday ishga tushirish yoritilgan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:18
msgid ""
"This document uses the term *company* to refer to the internal company "
"requiring subcontracted goods and the term *subcontractor* to refer to the "
"external vendor handling the outsourced production of the subcontracted "
"goods."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu hujjatda *kompaniya* atamasi subpudrat tovarlariga muhtoj ichki "
"kompaniyani, *subpudratchi* atamasi esa subpudrat tovarlarining tashqi "
"ishlab chiqarilishini amalga oshiruvchi tashqi yetkazib beruvchini anglatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:25
msgid ""
"To use subcontracting, a company must first configure products with "
"a :ref:`vendor pricelist <purchase/products/pricelist>` as well as "
"a :ref:`subcontracting-type BoM <manufacturing/workflows/"
"subcontracting_basic/bom-config>`."
msgstr ""
"Subpudratdan foydalanish uchun kompaniya avval mahsulotlarni :ref:`yetkazib "
"beruvchi narxlari ro'yxati <purchase/products/pricelist>` "
"hamda :ref:`subpudrat turidagi BoM <manufacturing/workflows/"
"subcontracting_basic/bom-config>` bilan sozlashi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:29
msgid ""
"The pricelist allows the company to purchase the product from the vendor "
"(subcontractor) through a |PO|, while the |BoM| allows the product to be "
"manufactured externally by the subcontractor."
msgstr ""
"Narxlar ro'yxati kompaniyaga mahsulotni yetkazib beruvchidan "
"(subpudratchidan) |PO| orqali sotib olish imkonini beradi, |BoM| esa "
"mahsulotni subpudratchi tomonidan tashqarida ishlab chiqarish imkonini "
"beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:35
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:52
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:37
msgid "Configure product vendor"
msgstr "Mahsulot yetkazib beruvchisini sozlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:37
msgid ""
"To configure a product's vendor for basic subcontracting, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Products --> Products`. Then, select a "
"product or create a new one."
msgstr ""
"Oddiy subpudrat uchun mahsulot yetkazib beruvchisini sozlash "
"uchun :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Products --> Products` yo'lidan "
"o'ting. So'ngra mahsulotni tanlang yoki yangisini yarating."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:40
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:42
msgid ""
"On the product form, click the *Purchase* tab and add the product's "
"subcontractor as a vendor by clicking :guilabel:`Add a line`. Select the "
"subcontractor using the :guilabel:`Vendor` drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulot formasida *Purchase* varag'ini bosing va :guilabel:`Add a line` "
"tugmasini bosib, mahsulot subpudratchisini yetkazib beruvchi sifatida "
"qo'shing. :guilabel:`Vendor` ochiluvchi menyusidan foydalanib subpudratchini "
"tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:44
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:61
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:46
msgid ""
"Then, enter the price of the product in the :guilabel:`Unit Price` field."
msgstr "So'ngra :guilabel:`Unit Price` maydoniga mahsulot narxini kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:46
msgid ""
"Finally, set a :doc:`Lead Time <../../inventory/warehouses_storage/"
"replenishment/lead_times>` for the product in the corresponding field to "
"specify the number of days for the subcontractor to produce and deliver the "
"final product."
msgstr ""
"Nihoyat, subpudratchi yakuniy mahsulotni ishlab chiqarishi va yetkazib "
"berishi uchun zarur kunlar sonini belgilash maqsadida mahsulot uchun "
"tegishli maydonda :doc:`Lead Time <../../inventory/warehouses_storage/"
"replenishment/lead_times>` ni belgilang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:51
msgid ""
"Since companies are only responsible for purchasing and receiving the final "
"product, they do not need to additionally configure manufacturing lead times "
"on a |BoM|. Instead, provide only a single :guilabel:`Lead Time` on the "
"vendor pricelist that factors in both the subcontractor's manufacturing and "
"delivery time."
msgstr ""
"Kompaniyalar faqat yakuniy mahsulotni sotib olish va qabul qilish uchun "
"javobgar bo'lgani sababli, ular |BoM| da qo'shimcha ravishda ishlab "
"chiqarish muddatlarini sozlashlari shart emas. Buning o'rniga, yetkazib "
"beruvchi narxlari ro'yxatida subpudratchining ishlab chiqarish va yetkazib "
"berish vaqtini birgalikda hisobga oladigan yagona :guilabel:`Lead Time` ni "
"belgilang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:59
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:76
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:62
msgid "Configure BoM"
msgstr "BoM ni sozlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:61
msgid ""
"After specifying the vendor, configure a subcontracting-type |BoM| for the "
"product. Click the :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` smart button on the product "
"form. Then, select the desired |BoM| or :ref:`create a new one "
"<manufacturing/basic_setup/bom-setup>`."
msgstr ""
"Yetkazib beruvchini belgilagandan so'ng, mahsulot uchun subpudrat turidagi |"
"BoM| ni sozlang. Mahsulot formasidagi :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` aqlli "
"tugmasini bosing. So'ngra kerakli |BoM| ni tanlang yoki :ref:`yangisini "
"yarating <manufacturing/basic_setup/bom-setup>`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:66
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:83
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:69
msgid ""
"Alternatively, navigate to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Products --"
"> Bills of Materials`, and select the |BoM| for the subcontracted product."
msgstr ""
"Muqobil ravishda, :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Products --> Bills "
"of Materials` yo'lidan o'ting va subpudrat mahsuloti uchun |BoM| ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:69
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`BoM Type` field, select :guilabel:`Subcontracting`. In the "
"resulting :guilabel:`Subcontractors` field, add one or more subcontractors."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`BoM Type` maydonida :guilabel:`Subcontracting` ni tanlang. Paydo "
"bo'lgan :guilabel:`Subcontractors` maydoniga bir yoki bir nechta "
"subpudratchini qo'shing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:72
msgid ""
"Because the components and manufacturing are both handled by the "
"subcontractor, there is no need to list any components in the *Components* "
"tab of the |BoM|."
msgstr ""
"Komponentlar ham, ishlab chiqarish ham subpudratchi tomonidan amalga "
"oshirilgani uchun |BoM| ning *Components* varag'ida hech qanday "
"komponentlarni ko'rsatish shart emas."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:None
msgid "Bill of Materials configuration for subcontracting in Odoo."
msgstr "Odoo'da subpudrat uchun materiallar ro'yxati (BoM) sozlamasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:81
msgid "Basic subcontracting workflow"
msgstr "Oddiy subpudrat ish jarayoni"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:83
msgid ""
"The basic subcontracting workflow begins by :ref:`creating a PO "
"<subcontracting_basic/workflow/create_po>` to purchase the product from the "
"subcontractor (1)."
msgstr ""
"Oddiy subpudrat ish jarayoni mahsulotni subpudratchidan sotib olish "
"uchun :ref:`PO yaratishdan <subcontracting_basic/workflow/create_po>` "
"boshlanadi (1)."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:86
msgid ""
"The company then confirms the |PO|, which creates a receipt to transfer the "
"final product (2). The subcontractor manufactures the product and delivers "
"it back to the company when done."
msgstr ""
"So'ngra kompaniya |PO| ni tasdiqlaydi, bu esa yakuniy mahsulotni ko'chirish "
"uchun qabul qilish hujjatini yaratadi (2). Subpudratchi mahsulotni ishlab "
"chiqaradi va tayyor bo'lgach, uni kompaniyaga qaytarib yetkazib beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:89
msgid ""
"Once the product has been produced and received, the company :ref:`validates "
"the receipt <subcontracting_basic/workflow/validate_receipt>` (5) to "
"trigger :ref:`inventory moves <subcontracting_basic/workflow/track-"
"inventory>` from the subcontractor to the company's stock (3, 4)."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulot ishlab chiqarilib qabul qilingandan so'ng, kompaniya :ref:`qabul "
"qilishni tasdiqlaydi <subcontracting_basic/workflow/validate_receipt>` (5), "
"bu esa subpudratchidan kompaniya zaxirasiga :ref:`zaxira harakatlarini "
"<subcontracting_basic/workflow/track-inventory>` ishga tushiradi (3, 4)."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:None
msgid "Basic subcontracting workflow diagram in Odoo."
msgstr "Odoo'dagi oddiy subpudrat ish jarayoni diagrammasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:100
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:109
msgid "Create and confirm PO"
msgstr "PO yaratish va tasdiqlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:102
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:155
msgid ""
"To create a |PO| for the subcontracted product, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Purchase app --> Orders --> Purchase Orders`, and "
"click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"Subpudrat mahsuloti uchun |PO| yaratish uchun :menuselection:`Purchase app --"
"> Orders --> Purchase Orders` yo'lidan o'ting va :guilabel:`New` tugmasini "
"bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:105
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:158
msgid ""
"Begin filling out the |PO| by selecting a subcontractor from "
"the :guilabel:`Vendor` drop-down menu. In the :guilabel:`Products` tab, "
"click :guilabel:`Add a product` to create a new product line. Select the "
"subcontracted product in the :guilabel:`Product` field, and enter the "
"quantity in the :guilabel:`Quantity` field."
msgstr ""
"|PO| ni to'ldirishni :guilabel:`Vendor` ochiluvchi menyusidan subpudratchini "
"tanlashdan boshlang. :guilabel:`Products` varag'ida yangi mahsulot qatorini "
"yaratish uchun :guilabel:`Add a product` tugmasini "
"bosing. :guilabel:`Product` maydonida subpudrat mahsulotini tanlang "
"va :guilabel:`Quantity` maydoniga miqdorni kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:110
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:163
msgid ""
"After adding the product, the :guilabel:`Expected Arrival` field is updated "
"with the finished product's expected delivery date, as configured earlier "
"with the vendor's *Lead Time*."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulot qo'shilgandan so'ng, :guilabel:`Expected Arrival` maydoni, avvalroq "
"yetkazib beruvchining *Lead Time* qiymati bilan sozlanganidek, tayyor "
"mahsulotning kutilayotgan yetkazib berish sanasi bilan yangilanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:113
msgid ""
"Finally, click :guilabel:`Confirm Order` to confirm the |PO|. A receipt is "
"automatically created, and a :guilabel:`Receipt` smart button appears at the "
"top of the form."
msgstr ""
"Nihoyat, |PO| ni tasdiqlash uchun :guilabel:`Confirm Order` tugmasini "
"bosing. Qabul qilish avtomatik ravishda yaratiladi va forma "
"yuqorisida :guilabel:`Receipt` aqlli tugmasi paydo bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:121
msgid ""
"After the order is confirmed, the subcontractor manufactures the product and "
"delivers the finished good back to the company."
msgstr ""
"Buyurtma tasdiqlangandan so'ng, subpudratchi mahsulotni ishlab chiqaradi va "
"tayyor mahsulotni kompaniyaga qaytarib yetkazib beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:124
msgid ""
"To receive the finished product from the subcontractor, click "
"the :guilabel:`Receive` button on the |PO|, or click the :guilabel:`Receipt` "
"smart button at the top of the page. Then, click :guilabel:`Validate` to "
"enter the incoming shipment into inventory."
msgstr ""
"Tayyor mahsulotni subpudratchidan qabul qilish uchun |PO| "
"dagi :guilabel:`Receive` tugmasini bosing yoki sahifa "
"yuqorisidagi :guilabel:`Receipt` aqlli tugmasini bosing. So'ngra kiruvchi "
"jo'natmani zaxiraga kiritish uchun :guilabel:`Validate` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:129
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:229
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:152
msgid ""
"If :doc:`multi-step inventory flows <../../inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"daily_operations>` are enabled, additional transfers must be validated to "
"enter the incoming product into stock."
msgstr ""
"Agar :doc:`ko'p bosqichli zaxira oqimlari <../../inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/daily_operations>` yoqilgan bo'lsa, kiruvchi mahsulotni "
"zaxiraga kiritish uchun qo'shimcha ko'chirishlar tasdiqlanishi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:135
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:235
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:158
msgid "Track inventory moves"
msgstr "Zaxira harakatlarini kuzatish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:137
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:237
msgid ""
"After validating a receipt, Odoo automatically generates inventory moves to "
"track the movement of subcontracted products between :doc:`locations <../../"
"inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations>`. To view "
"these inventory moves, navigate to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Reporting --> Moves History`."
msgstr ""
"Qabul qilish tasdiqlangandan so'ng, Odoo subpudrat "
"mahsulotlarining :doc:`joylashuvlar <../../inventory/warehouses_storage/"
"inventory_management/use_locations>` o'rtasidagi harakatini kuzatish uchun "
"avtomatik ravishda zaxira harakatlarini yaratadi. Ushbu zaxira harakatlarini "
"ko'rish uchun :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Reporting --> Moves History` "
"yo'lidan o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:142
msgid ""
"To track inventory movement in subcontracting, Odoo sends any product "
"components to a dedicated location called *Subcontracting*. Another location "
"called *Production* then consumes the components and produces the finished "
"good. Once produced, the good then moves back to the *Subcontracting* "
"location before finally entering the company's stock when the receipt is "
"validated."
msgstr ""
"Subpudratdagi zaxira harakatini kuzatish uchun Odoo har qanday mahsulot "
"komponentlarini *Subcontracting* deb nomlangan maxsus joyga yuboradi. "
"So'ngra *Production* deb nomlangan boshqa joy komponentlarni iste'mol qiladi "
"va tayyor mahsulotni ishlab chiqaradi. Ishlab chiqarilgach, mahsulot avval "
"*Subcontracting* joyiga qaytadi, so'ngra qabul qilish tasdiqlanganda nihoyat "
"kompaniya zaxirasiga kiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:None
msgid "Moves History page to see subcontracting moves in Odoo."
msgstr "Odoo'da subpudrat harakatlarini ko'rish uchun Moves History sahifasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_basic.rst:151
msgid ""
"Because no components are sent in basic subcontracting, there is no movement "
"from the *Subcontracting* location to the *Production* location."
msgstr ""
"Oddiy subpudratda hech qanday komponentlar yuborilmagani uchun "
"*Subcontracting* joyidan *Production* joyiga harakat bo'lmaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:12
msgid ""
"In the *Dropship to Subcontractor* workflow, a company purchases the "
"components of a product from a vendor, who delivers them directly to the "
"subcontractor for manufacturing. The subcontractor then ships the finished "
"product back to the company."
msgstr ""
"*Dropship to Subcontractor* ish jarayonida kompaniya mahsulot "
"komponentlarini yetkazib beruvchidan sotib oladi, u esa ularni ishlab "
"chiqarish uchun to'g'ridan-to'g'ri subpudratchiga yetkazib beradi. So'ngra "
"subpudratchi tayyor mahsulotni kompaniyaga qaytarib jo'natadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:16
msgid ""
"The following documentation covers how to configure a subcontracted product "
"and walk through the *Dropship to Subcontractor* workflow."
msgstr ""
"Quyidagi hujjatda subpudrat mahsulotini qanday sozlash va *Dropship to "
"Subcontractor* ish jarayonini bosqichma-bosqich o'tish yoritilgan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:20
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:17
msgid ""
"This document uses the term *company* to refer to the internal company "
"requiring subcontracted goods, and the term *subcontractor* to refer to the "
"external vendor handling the outsourced production of the subcontracted "
"goods."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu hujjatda *kompaniya* atamasi subpudrat tovarlariga muhtoj ichki "
"kompaniyani, *subpudratchi* atamasi esa subpudrat tovarlarining tashqi "
"ishlab chiqarilishini amalga oshiruvchi tashqi yetkazib beruvchini anglatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:29
msgid ""
"To use the *Dropship to Subcontractor* workflow, companies must first "
"configure subcontracted products with a :ref:`vendor pricelist <purchase/"
"products/pricelist>` and a :ref:`subcontracting-type BoM <manufacturing/"
"subcontracting_dropship/config/bom-config>` specifying the product's "
"components. Companies must then :ref:`configure each component "
"<manufacturing/subcontracting_dropship/config/component-config>` by "
"specifying a dropship vendor and an appropriate route."
msgstr ""
"*Dropship to Subcontractor* ish jarayonidan foydalanish uchun kompaniyalar "
"avval subpudrat mahsulotlarini :ref:`yetkazib beruvchi narxlari ro'yxati "
"<purchase/products/pricelist>` va mahsulot komponentlarini "
"ko'rsatuvchi :ref:`subpudrat turidagi BoM <manufacturing/"
"subcontracting_dropship/config/bom-config>` bilan sozlashlari kerak. So'ngra "
"kompaniyalar dropship yetkazib beruvchisini va tegishli marshrutni "
"ko'rsatish orqali :ref:`har bir komponentni sozlashlari <manufacturing/"
"subcontracting_dropship/config/component-config>` kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:36
msgid ""
"The pricelist allows the company to purchase the product from the vendor "
"(subcontractor) through a |PO|. The |BoM| allows the product to be "
"manufactured externally by the subcontractor. :doc:`Routes <../../inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes>` are applied to each "
"component in order to be properly sent from the dropshipping vendor to the "
"subcontractor."
msgstr ""
"Narxlar ro'yxati kompaniyaga mahsulotni yetkazib beruvchidan "
"(subpudratchidan) |PO| orqali sotib olish imkonini beradi. |BoM| mahsulotni "
"subpudratchi tomonidan tashqarida ishlab chiqarish imkonini beradi. Har bir "
"komponent dropshipping yetkazib beruvchisidan subpudratchiga to'g'ri "
"yuborilishi uchun ularga :doc:`Marshrutlar <../../inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes>` qo'llaniladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:42
msgid ""
"In order to configure product components for dropshipping, make sure that "
"the *Dropshipping* feature is enabled in the Odoo settings."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulot komponentlarini dropshipping uchun sozlash uchun Odoo sozlamalarida "
"*Dropshipping* funksiyasi yoqilganligiga ishonch hosil qiling."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:45
msgid ""
"To do so, navigate to either the **Inventory** or **Purchase** app, then "
"click :menuselection:`Configuration --> Settings`. Finally, in the "
"*Logistics* section, enable the :guilabel:`Dropshipping` setting."
msgstr ""
"Buning uchun **Inventory** yoki **Purchase** ilovasiga o'ting, "
"so'ngra :menuselection:`Configuration --> Settings` ni bosing. Nihoyat, "
"*Logistics* bo'limida :guilabel:`Dropshipping` sozlamasini yoqing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:54
msgid ""
"To configure a product's vendor for dropship subcontracting, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Products --> Products`, and select a "
"product, or :doc:`create a new one <../../inventory/product_management/"
"configure/type>`."
msgstr ""
"Dropship subpudrati uchun mahsulot yetkazib beruvchisini sozlash "
"uchun :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Products --> Products` yo'lidan "
"o'ting va mahsulotni tanlang yoki :doc:`yangisini yarating <../../inventory/"
"product_management/configure/type>`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:58
msgid ""
"On the product form, click the *Purchase* tab and add the product's "
"subcontractor as a vendor by clicking :guilabel:`Add a line`. Select the "
"subcontractor in the :guilabel:`Vendor` drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulot formasida *Purchase* varag'ini bosing va :guilabel:`Add a line` "
"tugmasini bosib, mahsulot subpudratchisini yetkazib beruvchi sifatida "
"qo'shing. :guilabel:`Vendor` ochiluvchi menyusida subpudratchini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:63
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:48
msgid ""
"Finally, set a :doc:`Lead Time <../../inventory/warehouses_storage/"
"replenishment/lead_times>` for the product in the corresponding field to "
"specify the number of days for the subcontractor to receive components, "
"produce the product, and deliver the finished good."
msgstr ""
"Nihoyat, subpudratchi komponentlarni qabul qilishi, mahsulotni ishlab "
"chiqarishi va tayyor mahsulotni yetkazib berishi uchun zarur kunlar sonini "
"belgilash maqsadida mahsulot uchun tegishli maydonda :doc:`Lead Time <../../"
"inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times>` ni belgilang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:68
msgid ""
"Companies do not need to configure manufacturing lead times on a |BoM|. "
"Instead, provide only a single :guilabel:`Lead Time` on the vendor "
"pricelist, factoring in the duration for the subcontractor to receive the "
"components from the dropship vendor, manufacture the product, and deliver "
"the finished good back to the company."
msgstr ""
"Kompaniyalar |BoM| da ishlab chiqarish muddatlarini sozlashlari shart emas. "
"Buning o'rniga, yetkazib beruvchi narxlari ro'yxatida subpudratchi "
"komponentlarni dropship yetkazib beruvchisidan qabul qilishi, mahsulotni "
"ishlab chiqarishi va tayyor mahsulotni kompaniyaga qaytarib yetkazib berishi "
"uchun ketadigan vaqtni hisobga oladigan yagona :guilabel:`Lead Time` ni "
"belgilang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:78
msgid ""
"After specifying the vendor, configure a subcontracting-type |BoM| for the "
"product. To start, click the :icon:`fa-flask` :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` "
"smart button on the product's page. Then, select the desired |BoM| or create "
"a new one."
msgstr ""
"Yetkazib beruvchini belgilagandan so'ng, mahsulot uchun subpudrat turidagi |"
"BoM| ni sozlang. Boshlash uchun mahsulot sahifasidagi :icon:`fa-"
"flask` :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` aqlli tugmasini bosing. So'ngra kerakli "
"|BoM| ni tanlang yoki yangisini yarating."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:86
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`BoM Type` field, select the :guilabel:`Subcontracting` "
"option. Then, add one or more subcontractors in "
"the :guilabel:`Subcontractors` field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`BoM Type` maydonida :guilabel:`Subcontracting` variantini "
"tanlang. So'ngra :guilabel:`Subcontractors` maydoniga bir yoki bir nechta "
"subpudratchini qo'shing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:89
msgid ""
"Finally, make sure that all necessary components are specified on "
"the :guilabel:`Components` tab. To add a new component, click :guilabel:`Add "
"a line`, select the component in the :guilabel:`Component` drop-down menu, "
"and specify the required quantity in the :guilabel:`Quantity` field."
msgstr ""
"Nihoyat, barcha zarur komponentlar :guilabel:`Components` varag'ida "
"ko'rsatilganligiga ishonch hosil qiling. Yangi komponent qo'shish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Add a line` tugmasini bosing, :guilabel:`Component` "
"ochiluvchi menyusidan komponentni tanlang va :guilabel:`Quantity` maydonida "
"kerakli miqdorni ko'rsating."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:None
msgid "The BoM of a product with components dropshipped to the subcontractor."
msgstr ""
"Komponentlari subpudratchiga dropship orqali yetkaziladigan mahsulotning BoM "
"hujjati."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:99
msgid "Configure components"
msgstr "Komponentlarni sozlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:101
msgid ""
"When dropshipping to subcontractors, each component of a product must have a "
"specified vendor and have the *Dropship* route enabled. This allows the "
"components to be properly dropshipped from the vendor to the subcontractor."
msgstr ""
"Subpudratchilarga dropshipping qilinganda, mahsulotning har bir komponenti "
"uchun yetkazib beruvchi ko'rsatilgan va *Dropship* marshruti yoqilgan "
"bo'lishi kerak. Bu komponentlarning yetkazib beruvchidan subpudratchiga "
"to'g'ri dropship qilinishini ta'minlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:105
msgid ""
"To specify a component's vendor, select the component's name in "
"the :guilabel:`Components` tab, and click the :icon:`oi-arrow-"
"right` :guilabel:`(Internal link)` arrow."
msgstr ""
"Komponent yetkazib beruvchisini ko'rsatish uchun :guilabel:`Components` "
"varag'ida komponent nomini tanlang va :icon:`oi-arrow-"
"right` :guilabel:`(Internal link)` strelkasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:109
msgid ""
"Alternatively, navigate to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Products --> "
"Products` and select the component."
msgstr ""
"Muqobil ravishda, :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Products --> Products` "
"yo'lidan o'ting va komponentni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:112
msgid ""
"On the component product form, click the :guilabel:`Purchase` tab. Add a "
"vendor by clicking :guilabel:`Add a line`. Then, select the vendor in "
"the :guilabel:`Vendor` field."
msgstr ""
"Komponent mahsulot formasida :guilabel:`Purchase` varag'ini "
"bosing. :guilabel:`Add a line` tugmasini bosib, yetkazib beruvchi qo'shing. "
"So'ngra :guilabel:`Vendor` maydonida yetkazib beruvchini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:115
msgid ""
"Next, to configure the route, click on the *Inventory* tab and select "
"the :guilabel:`Dropship` route in the *Routes* section."
msgstr ""
"Keyin, marshrutni sozlash uchun *Inventory* varag'ini bosing va *Routes* "
"bo'limida :guilabel:`Dropship` marshrutini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:118
msgid ""
"Repeat the process for every component dropshipped to the subcontractor."
msgstr ""
"Subpudratchiga dropship qilinadigan har bir komponent uchun jarayonni "
"takrorlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:None
msgid "Route for a component to be dropshipped to a subcontractor."
msgstr "Subpudratchiga dropship qilinadigan komponent uchun marshrut."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:128
msgid ""
"The *Dropship to Subcontractor* workflow begins by :ref:`creating a PO "
"<manufacturing/subcontracting-dropship/workflow/create-po>` to purchase the "
"product from the subcontractor (1)."
msgstr ""
"*Dropship to Subcontractor* ish jarayoni subpudratchidan mahsulotni xarid "
"qilish uchun :ref:`PO yaratishdan <manufacturing/subcontracting-dropship/"
"workflow/create-po>` boshlanadi (1)."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:132
msgid ""
"The company then confirms the *subcontractor* |PO| (2). This creates an |"
"RfQ| to purchase the components from the vendor, as well as a receipt to "
"transfer the final product."
msgstr ""
"So'ngra kompaniya *subpudratchi* |PO| ni tasdiqlaydi (2). Bu yetkazib "
"beruvchidan komponentlarni xarid qilish uchun |RfQ| hamda yakuniy mahsulotni "
"ko'chirish uchun qabul qilish (receipt) hujjatini yaratadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:135
msgid ""
"Next, the company :ref:`confirms the RfQ <manufacturing/subcontracting-"
"dropship/workflow/confirm-rfq>`, turning it into a *vendor* |PO| and "
"creating a dropship order to send the components from the vendor to the "
"subcontractor (3). Once the company :ref:`validates the dropship "
"<manufacturing/subcontracting-dropship/workflow/validate-dropship>` order, "
"the subcontractor begins to manufacture the final product with the "
"components and ships it to the company when done."
msgstr ""
"Keyin kompaniya :ref:`RfQ ni tasdiqlaydi <manufacturing/subcontracting-"
"dropship/workflow/confirm-rfq>`, uni *yetkazib beruvchi* |PO| ga aylantiradi "
"va komponentlarni yetkazib beruvchidan subpudratchiga jo'natish uchun "
"dropship buyurtmasini yaratadi (3). Kompaniya :ref:`dropship buyurtmasini "
"tasdiqlagach <manufacturing/subcontracting-dropship/workflow/validate-"
"dropship>`, subpudratchi komponentlar bilan yakuniy mahsulotni ishlab "
"chiqarishni boshlaydi va tugagach uni kompaniyaga jo'natadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:142
msgid ""
"Once the product has been produced and received, the company :ref:`validates "
"the receipt <manufacturing/subcontracting-dropship/workflow/process-"
"receipt>` (6) to trigger :ref:`inventory moves <manufacturing/subcontracting-"
"dropship/workflow/track-inventory>` from the subcontractor to the company's "
"stock (4, 5)."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulot ishlab chiqarilib qabul qilingach, kompaniya subpudratchidan "
"kompaniya zaxirasiga :ref:`zaxira harakatlarini <manufacturing/"
"subcontracting-dropship/workflow/track-inventory>` ishga tushirish "
"uchun :ref:`qabul qilishni tasdiqlaydi <manufacturing/subcontracting-"
"dropship/workflow/process-receipt>` (6) (4, 5)."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:None
msgid "Diagram of dropship to subcontractor workflow."
msgstr "Subpudratchiga dropship ish jarayonining diagrammasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:153
msgid "Create and confirm subcontractor PO"
msgstr "Subpudratchi PO sini yaratish va tasdiqlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:166
msgid ""
"Finally, click :guilabel:`Confirm Order` to confirm the |PO|. A receipt is "
"automatically created, and a :icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Receipt` smart "
"button appears at the top of the form. In addition, a separate |RfQ| is "
"automatically created to purchase the components from the dropship vendor."
msgstr ""
"Nihoyat, |PO| ni tasdiqlash uchun :guilabel:`Confirm Order` tugmasini "
"bosing. Qabul qilish (receipt) avtomatik ravishda yaratiladi va forma "
"yuqorisida :icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Receipt` smart tugmasi paydo bo'ladi. "
"Bundan tashqari, dropship yetkazib beruvchisidan komponentlarni xarid qilish "
"uchun alohida |RfQ| avtomatik ravishda yaratiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:171
msgid ""
"This |RfQ| is **not** automatically linked to the |PO|. It must be accessed "
"separately on the *Requests for Quotation* page."
msgstr ""
"Bu |RfQ| |PO| ga avtomatik ravishda **bog'lanmaydi**. Unga *Requests for "
"Quotation* sahifasida alohida kirish kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:177
msgid "Confirm vendor RfQ"
msgstr "Yetkazib beruvchi RfQ sini tasdiqlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:179
msgid ""
"To confirm the vendor |RfQ|, navigate to :menuselection:`Purchase app --> "
"Orders --> Requests for Quotation`. Select the newly-created |RfQ| for the "
"appropriate vendor."
msgstr ""
"Yetkazib beruvchi |RfQ| sini tasdiqlash uchun :menuselection:`Purchase app --"
"> Orders --> Requests for Quotation` yo'lidan o'ting. Tegishli yetkazib "
"beruvchi uchun yangi yaratilgan |RfQ| ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:182
msgid ""
"On the |RfQ|, the :guilabel:`Deliver To` field reads :guilabel:`Dropship "
"Subcontractor`, and the :guilabel:`Dropship Address` field shows the name of "
"the subcontractor to whom components are being dropshipped."
msgstr ""
"|RfQ| da :guilabel:`Deliver To` maydonida :guilabel:`Dropship Subcontractor` "
"yozilgan bo'ladi, :guilabel:`Dropship Address` maydonida esa komponentlar "
"dropship qilinayotgan subpudratchining nomi ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:186
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Confirm Order` to confirm the purchase of components from "
"the vendor. Doing so turns the |RfQ| into a *vendor* |PO|. A :icon:`fa-"
"truck` :guilabel:`Dropship` smart button appears at the top of the vendor |"
"PO|."
msgstr ""
"Yetkazib beruvchidan komponentlar xaridini tasdiqlash "
"uchun :guilabel:`Confirm Order` tugmasini bosing. Shunda |RfQ| *yetkazib "
"beruvchi* |PO| ga aylanadi. Yetkazib beruvchi |PO| sining "
"yuqorisida :icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Dropship` smart tugmasi paydo bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:191
msgid ""
"Simultaneously, a :icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Resupply` smart button appears "
"at the top of the *subcontractor* |PO| created earlier. In dropship "
"subcontracting, this smart button links to the dropship order."
msgstr ""
"Bir vaqtning o'zida, avvalroq yaratilgan *subpudratchi* |PO| sining "
"yuqorisida :icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Resupply` smart tugmasi paydo "
"bo'ladi. Dropship subpudratida bu smart tugma dropship buyurtmasiga "
"bog'lanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:None
msgid "Vendor RfQ for the dropshipped components of a subcontracted product."
msgstr ""
"Subpudrat mahsulotining dropship qilinadigan komponentlari uchun yetkazib "
"beruvchi RfQ si."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:201
msgid "Validate dropship order"
msgstr "Dropship buyurtmasini tasdiqlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:203
msgid ""
"Once the components have been delivered to the subcontractor by the dropship "
"vendor, click the :icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Dropship` smart button on the "
"vendor |PO| to open the dropship order."
msgstr ""
"Komponentlar dropship yetkazib beruvchisi tomonidan subpudratchiga yetkazib "
"berilgach, dropship buyurtmasini ochish uchun yetkazib beruvchi |PO| "
"sidagi :icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Dropship` smart tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:207
msgid ""
"The dropship order can also be opened from the *subcontractor* |PO|. "
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Purchase app --> Orders --> Purchase Orders`, "
"select the |PO|, then click the :icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Resupply` smart "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Dropship buyurtmasini *subpudratchi* |PO| sidan ham ochish "
"mumkin. :menuselection:`Purchase app --> Orders --> Purchase Orders` "
"yo'lidan o'ting, |PO| ni tanlang, so'ngra :icon:`fa-"
"truck` :guilabel:`Resupply` smart tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:211
msgid ""
"Finally, click the :guilabel:`Validate` button at the top to confirm that "
"the subcontractor has received the components. The subcontractor then begins "
"manufacturing the final product."
msgstr ""
"Nihoyat, subpudratchi komponentlarni qabul qilganini tasdiqlash uchun "
"yuqoridagi :guilabel:`Validate` tugmasini bosing. Shundan so'ng subpudratchi "
"yakuniy mahsulotni ishlab chiqarishni boshlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:219
msgid ""
"After the subcontractor completes production, the finished product is "
"shipped to the company."
msgstr ""
"Subpudratchi ishlab chiqarishni yakunlagach, tayyor mahsulot kompaniyaga "
"jo'natiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:221
msgid ""
"To receive the product into stock, navigate to :menuselection:`Purchase app "
"--> Orders --> Purchase Orders`, and select the *subcontractor* |PO|."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulotni zaxiraga qabul qilish uchun :menuselection:`Purchase app --> "
"Orders --> Purchase Orders` yo'lidan o'ting va *subpudratchi* |PO| ni "
"tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:224
msgid ""
"At the top of the |PO|, click the :guilabel:`Receive Products` button, or "
"click the :icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Receipt` smart button. Then, "
"click :guilabel:`Validate` to enter the incoming shipment into inventory."
msgstr ""
"|PO| ning yuqorisida :guilabel:`Receive Products` tugmasini bosing "
"yoki :icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Receipt` smart tugmasini bosing. So'ngra, "
"kelayotgan yukni zaxiraga kiritish uchun :guilabel:`Validate` tugmasini "
"bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:242
msgid ""
"In the *Dropship to Subcontractor* workflow, product components are first "
"sent from the vendors to a dedicated location called *Subcontracting*. "
"Another location called *Production* then consumes the components and "
"produces the finished good. Once produced, the good then moves back to the "
"*Subcontracting* location before finally entering the contractor's stock "
"when the receipt is validated."
msgstr ""
"*Dropship to Subcontractor* ish jarayonida mahsulot komponentlari avval "
"yetkazib beruvchilardan *Subcontracting* deb nomlangan maxsus joyga "
"jo'natiladi. So'ngra *Production* deb nomlangan boshqa joy komponentlarni "
"iste'mol qilib, tayyor mahsulotni ishlab chiqaradi. Ishlab chiqarilgach, "
"mahsulot avval *Subcontracting* joyiga qaytadi va qabul qilish "
"tasdiqlanganda nihoyat pudratchining zaxirasiga kiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_dropship.rst:None
msgid "Moves History for the dropship to subcontractor workflow."
msgstr "Subpudratchiga dropship ish jarayoni uchun harakatlar tarixi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:3
msgid "Resupply subcontracting"
msgstr "To'ldirish (resupply) subpudrati"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:10
msgid ""
"In resupply subcontracting, a company supplies the components of its product "
"to a subcontractor, who manufactures the product, then delivers the finished "
"product to the company's warehouse."
msgstr ""
"To'ldirish (resupply) subpudratida kompaniya o'z mahsulotining "
"komponentlarini subpudratchiga yetkazib beradi, subpudratchi mahsulotni "
"ishlab chiqaradi, so'ngra tayyor mahsulotni kompaniya omboriga yetkazib "
"beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:13
msgid ""
"This document covers how to configure a subcontracted product and walk "
"through the resupply subcontracting process."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu hujjat subpudrat mahsulotini qanday sozlashni va to'ldirish (resupply) "
"subpudrati jarayonini bosqichma-bosqich ko'rib chiqadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:26
msgid ""
"To use the resupply subcontractor workflow, companies must first configure "
"products with a :ref:`vendor pricelist <purchase/products/pricelist>` and a "
"subcontracting-type |BoM| specifying the product's components."
msgstr ""
"To'ldirish subpudrati ish jarayonidan foydalanish uchun kompaniyalar avval "
"mahsulotlarni :ref:`yetkazib beruvchi narxlar ro'yxati <purchase/products/"
"pricelist>` va mahsulot komponentlarini ko'rsatuvchi subpudrat turidagi |"
"BoM| bilan sozlashi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:30
msgid ""
"The pricelist allows the company to purchase the product from the "
"subcontractor through a |PO|. The |BoM| allows the product to be "
"manufactured externally by the subcontractor and automatically configures "
"the components to be resupplied by the company."
msgstr ""
"Narxlar ro'yxati kompaniyaga mahsulotni subpudratchidan |PO| orqali xarid "
"qilish imkonini beradi. |BoM| mahsulotni subpudratchi tomonidan tashqarida "
"ishlab chiqarish imkonini beradi va komponentlarni kompaniya tomonidan "
"to'ldirib turiladigan qilib avtomatik ravishda sozlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:39
msgid ""
"To configure a product's vendor for resupply subcontracting, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Products --> Products`, and select a "
"product, or create a new one."
msgstr ""
"To'ldirish subpudrati uchun mahsulotning yetkazib beruvchisini sozlash "
"uchun :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Products --> Products` yo'lidan "
"o'ting va mahsulotni tanlang yoki yangisini yarating."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:53
msgid ""
"Since contractors are not responsible for manufacturing the final product, "
"there is no need to configure manufacturing lead times on a |BoM|. Instead, "
"provide only a single :guilabel:`Lead Time` on the vendor pricelist, "
"factoring in the duration for the subcontractor to receive the components "
"from the contractor, manufacture the product, and deliver the finished goods "
"back to the company."
msgstr ""
"Pudratchilar yakuniy mahsulotni ishlab chiqarishga mas'ul bo'lmagani uchun, |"
"BoM| da ishlab chiqarish muddatlarini sozlash shart emas. Buning o'rniga, "
"yetkazib beruvchi narxlar ro'yxatida faqat bitta :guilabel:`Lead Time` "
"ko'rsating, bunda subpudratchining pudratchidan komponentlarni qabul qilish, "
"mahsulotni ishlab chiqarish va tayyor mahsulotlarni kompaniyaga qaytarib "
"yetkazib berish uchun ketadigan vaqtni hisobga oling."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:64
msgid ""
"After specifying the vendor, configure a subcontracting-type |BoM| for the "
"product. To start, click the :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` smart button on "
"the product's page. Then, select the desired |BoM| or create a new one."
msgstr ""
"Yetkazib beruvchini ko'rsatgandan so'ng, mahsulot uchun subpudrat turidagi |"
"BoM| ni sozlang. Boshlash uchun mahsulot sahifasidagi :guilabel:`Bill of "
"Materials` smart tugmasini bosing. So'ngra kerakli |BoM| ni tanlang yoki "
"yangisini yarating."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:72
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`BoM Type` field, select the :guilabel:`Subcontracting` "
"option. Then, add one or more subcontractors in "
"the :guilabel:`Subcontractors` field below."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`BoM Type` maydonida :guilabel:`Subcontracting` variantini "
"tanlang. So'ngra, pastdagi :guilabel:`Subcontractors` maydoniga bir yoki bir "
"nechta subpudratchini qo'shing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:75
msgid ""
"Finally, add all necessary components in the *Components* tab. To add a new "
"component, click :guilabel:`Add a line`. Then, select "
"the  :guilabel:`Component` using the drop-down menu , and specify the "
"required :guilabel:`Quantity` in the corresponding field."
msgstr ""
"Nihoyat, *Components* varag'ida barcha zarur komponentlarni qo'shing. Yangi "
"komponent qo'shish uchun :guilabel:`Add a line` tugmasini bosing. So'ngra, "
"ochiluvchi menyu yordamida :guilabel:`Component` ni tanlang va tegishli "
"maydonda kerakli :guilabel:`Quantity` ni ko'rsating."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:None
msgid "BoM for a resupply subcontracting product."
msgstr "To'ldirish subpudrati mahsuloti uchun BoM."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:87
msgid ""
"The resupply subcontracting workflow begins by :ref:`creating a PO "
"<manufacturing/subcontracting_resupply/workflow/create-po>` to purchase the "
"product from the subcontractor (1)."
msgstr ""
"To'ldirish subpudrati ish jarayoni subpudratchidan mahsulotni xarid qilish "
"uchun :ref:`PO yaratishdan <manufacturing/subcontracting_resupply/workflow/"
"create-po>` boshlanadi (1)."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:91
msgid ""
"The company then confirms the |PO|, which creates both a resupply order to "
"transfer the components and a receipt to receive the final product (2) from "
"the subcontractor."
msgstr ""
"So'ngra kompaniya |PO| ni tasdiqlaydi, bu esa komponentlarni ko'chirish "
"uchun to'ldirish buyurtmasini hamda yakuniy mahsulotni subpudratchidan qabul "
"qilish uchun qabul qilish (receipt) hujjatini yaratadi (2)."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:94
msgid ""
"Next, the company :ref:`validates the transfer <manufacturing/"
"subcontracting_resupply/workflow/validate-resupply>` of components to the "
"subcontractor (3). The subcontractor begins producing the product."
msgstr ""
"Keyin kompaniya komponentlarni subpudratchiga :ref:`ko'chirishni tasdiqlaydi "
"<manufacturing/subcontracting_resupply/workflow/validate-resupply>` (3). "
"Subpudratchi mahsulotni ishlab chiqarishni boshlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:98
msgid ""
"Once the product has been produced and received, the company :ref:`validates "
"the receipt <manufacturing/subcontracting_resupply/workflow/process-"
"receipt>` (6) to trigger :ref:`inventory moves <manufacturing/"
"subcontracting_resupply/workflow/track-inventory>` from the subcontractor to "
"the company's stock (4, 5)."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulot ishlab chiqarilib qabul qilingach, kompaniya subpudratchidan "
"kompaniya zaxirasiga :ref:`zaxira harakatlarini <manufacturing/"
"subcontracting_resupply/workflow/track-inventory>` ishga tushirish "
"uchun :ref:`qabul qilishni tasdiqlaydi <manufacturing/"
"subcontracting_resupply/workflow/process-receipt>` (6) (4, 5)."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:None
msgid "Diagram of resupply subcontracting workflow in Odoo MRP Subcontracting."
msgstr ""
"Odoo MRP Subcontracting dasturidagi to'ldirish subpudrati ish jarayonining "
"diagrammasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:111
msgid ""
"To create a |PO| for the subcontracted product, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Purchase app --> Orders --> Purchase Orders` and "
"click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"Subpudrat mahsuloti uchun |PO| yaratish uchun :menuselection:`Purchase app --"
"> Orders --> Purchase Orders` yo'lidan o'ting va :guilabel:`New` tugmasini "
"bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:114
msgid ""
"Begin filling out the |PO| by selecting a subcontractor from "
"the :guilabel:`Vendor` drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"|PO| ni to'ldirishni :guilabel:`Vendor` ochiluvchi menyusidan subpudratchini "
"tanlashdan boshlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:116
msgid ""
"In the *Products* tab, click :guilabel:`Add a product` and select the "
"subcontracted product. Next, enter the :guilabel:`Quantity` in the "
"corresponding field."
msgstr ""
"*Products* varag'ida :guilabel:`Add a product` tugmasini bosing va subpudrat "
"mahsulotini tanlang. Keyin, tegishli maydonga :guilabel:`Quantity` ni "
"kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:119
msgid ""
"After adding the product, the :guilabel:`Expected Arrival` field is updated "
"with the finished product's expected delivery date, as configured earlier "
"with the vendor *Lead Time*."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulot qo'shilgandan so'ng, :guilabel:`Expected Arrival` maydoni avvalroq "
"yetkazib beruvchi *Lead Time* bilan sozlanganidek, tayyor mahsulotning "
"kutilayotgan yetkazib berish sanasi bilan yangilanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:122
msgid ""
"Finally, click :guilabel:`Confirm Order` to confirm the |PO|. A receipt and "
"a resupply order are automatically created, accessible via the :icon:`fa-"
"truck` :guilabel:`Receipt` and :icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Resupply` smart "
"buttons at the top of the form."
msgstr ""
"Nihoyat, |PO| ni tasdiqlash uchun :guilabel:`Confirm Order` tugmasini "
"bosing. Qabul qilish (receipt) va to'ldirish buyurtmasi avtomatik ravishda "
"yaratiladi, ularga forma yuqorisidagi :icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Receipt` "
"va :icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Resupply` smart tugmalari orqali kirish "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:129
msgid "Validate resupply order"
msgstr "To'ldirish buyurtmasini tasdiqlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:131
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Resupply` smart button at the top of "
"the |PO| to open the resupply order, and click :guilabel:`Validate` to "
"confirm that the components have been sent to the subcontractor."
msgstr ""
"To'ldirish buyurtmasini ochish uchun |PO| yuqorisidagi :icon:`fa-"
"truck` :guilabel:`Resupply` smart tugmasini bosing va komponentlar "
"subpudratchiga jo'natilganini tasdiqlash uchun :guilabel:`Validate` "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:135
msgid ""
"Alternatively, open the **Inventory** app, and on the :guilabel:`Resupply "
"Subcontractor` card, click the :guilabel:`(#) To Process` button. Select the "
"relevant resupply order, then click :guilabel:`Validate` to confirm that the "
"components have been sent to the subcontractor."
msgstr ""
"Yoki **Inventory** ilovasini oching va :guilabel:`Resupply Subcontractor` "
"kartochkasida :guilabel:`(#) To Process` tugmasini bosing. Tegishli "
"to'ldirish buyurtmasini tanlang, so'ngra komponentlar subpudratchiga "
"jo'natilganini tasdiqlash uchun :guilabel:`Validate` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:144
msgid ""
"After the resupply order is confirmed, the subcontractor manufactures the "
"product and delivers the finished good back to the company."
msgstr ""
"To'ldirish buyurtmasi tasdiqlangandan so'ng, subpudratchi mahsulotni ishlab "
"chiqaradi va tayyor mahsulotni kompaniyaga qaytarib yetkazib beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:147
msgid ""
"To receive the finished product from the subcontractor, click "
"the :guilabel:`Receive Products` button on the |PO|, or click the :icon:`fa-"
"truck` :guilabel:`Receipt` smart button at the top of the page. Then, "
"click :guilabel:`Validate` to enter the incoming shipment into inventory."
msgstr ""
"Tayyor mahsulotni subpudratchidan qabul qilish uchun |PO| "
"dagi :guilabel:`Receive Products` tugmasini bosing yoki sahifa "
"yuqorisidagi :icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Receipt` smart tugmasini bosing. "
"So'ngra, kelayotgan yukni zaxiraga kiritish uchun :guilabel:`Validate` "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:160
msgid ""
"After validating the receipt, Odoo automatically generates inventory moves "
"to track the movement of subcontracted products between :doc:`locations "
"<../../inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations>`. To "
"view these inventory moves, navigate to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Reporting --> Moves History`."
msgstr ""
"Qabul qilish tasdiqlangandan so'ng, Odoo subpudrat "
"mahsulotlarining :doc:`joylar <../../inventory/warehouses_storage/"
"inventory_management/use_locations>` orasidagi harakatini kuzatish uchun "
"zaxira harakatlarini avtomatik ravishda yaratadi. Ushbu zaxira harakatlarini "
"ko'rish uchun :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Reporting --> Moves History` "
"yo'lidan o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:165
msgid ""
"In resupply subcontracting, Odoo first transfers any product components to a "
"dedicated location called *Subcontracting*. Another location called "
"*Production* then consumes the components and produces the finished good. "
"Once produced, the good then moves back to the *Subcontracting* location "
"before finally entering the company's stock when the receipt is validated."
msgstr ""
"To'ldirish subpudratida Odoo avval barcha mahsulot komponentlarini "
"*Subcontracting* deb nomlangan maxsus joyga ko'chiradi. So'ngra *Production* "
"deb nomlangan boshqa joy komponentlarni iste'mol qilib, tayyor mahsulotni "
"ishlab chiqaradi. Ishlab chiqarilgach, mahsulot avval *Subcontracting* "
"joyiga qaytadi va qabul qilish tasdiqlanganda nihoyat kompaniya zaxirasiga "
"kiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply.rst:None
msgid "Moves History of resupply subcontracting in Odoo MRP Subcontracting."
msgstr ""
"Odoo MRP Subcontracting dasturidagi to'ldirish subpudratining harakatlar "
"tarixi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows.rst:5
msgid "Workflows"
msgstr "Ish jarayonlari"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/byproducts.rst:3
msgid "By-Products"
msgstr "Qo'shimcha mahsulotlar"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/byproducts.rst:9
msgid ""
"When manufacturing certain products, it is common to be left with residual "
"materials, in addition to the finished product. These materials are known as "
"*by-products*. By specifying the by-products created during manufacturing on "
"a product's bill of materials (BoM), the quantity of by-products on-hand is "
"tracked by Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Ayrim mahsulotlarni ishlab chiqarishda, tayyor mahsulotdan tashqari, qoldiq "
"materiallar qolishi odatiy holdir. Bu materiallar *qo'shimcha mahsulotlar* "
"deb ataladi. Ishlab chiqarish davomida hosil bo'ladigan qo'shimcha "
"mahsulotlarni mahsulotning materiallar ro'yxatida (BoM) ko'rsatish orqali, "
"mavjud qo'shimcha mahsulotlar miqdori Odoo tomonidan kuzatib boriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/byproducts.rst:15
msgid ""
"Manufacturing a *rocking chair* requires ten pieces of wood. During "
"production, five pieces of *scrap wood* are created, in addition to the "
"rocking chair. By designating the scrap wood as a by-product on the rocking "
"chair's |BoM|, Odoo tracks the on-hand count of scrap wood, as well as the "
"quantity of rocking chairs produced."
msgstr ""
"*Tebranadigan kreslo* ishlab chiqarish uchun o'nta yog'och bo'lagi kerak "
"bo'ladi. Ishlab chiqarish davomida, tebranadigan kreslodan tashqari, beshta "
"*yog'och qoldig'i* hosil bo'ladi. Yog'och qoldig'ini tebranadigan kreslo |"
"BoM| ida qo'shimcha mahsulot sifatida belgilash orqali, Odoo yog'och "
"qoldig'ining mavjud sonini hamda ishlab chiqarilgan tebranadigan kreslolar "
"miqdorini kuzatib boradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/byproducts.rst:23
msgid ""
"To specify by-products on a product's |BoM|, the *By-Products* setting "
"**must** be enabled. To do so, navigate to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app "
"--> Configuration --> Settings`, and tick the :guilabel:`By-Products` "
"checkbox, located under the :guilabel:`Operations` heading. Then, "
"click :guilabel:`Save` to apply the change."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulot |BoM| ida qo'shimcha mahsulotlarni ko'rsatish uchun *By-Products* "
"sozlamasi yoqilgan bo'lishi **shart**. Buning "
"uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --> Settings` "
"yo'lidan o'ting va :guilabel:`Operations` sarlavhasi ostida "
"joylashgan :guilabel:`By-Products` katagini belgilang. So'ngra, o'zgarishni "
"qo'llash uchun :guilabel:`Save` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/byproducts.rst:None
msgid "The By-Products setting on the Manufacturing app settings page."
msgstr "Manufacturing ilovasi sozlamalari sahifasidagi By-Products sozlamasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/byproducts.rst:32
msgid ""
"With the :guilabel:`By-Products` setting enabled, a :guilabel:`By-products` "
"tab appears on product |BoMs|."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`By-Products` sozlamasi yoqilganda, mahsulot |BoMs| "
"larida :guilabel:`By-products` varag'i paydo bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/byproducts.rst:36
msgid "Add byproduct to BoM"
msgstr "BoM ga qo'shimcha mahsulot qo'shish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/byproducts.rst:38
msgid ""
"To add by-products to a |BoM|, navigate to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app "
"--> Products --> Bills of Materials`, and select a |BoM|."
msgstr ""
"|BoM|ga yon mahsulotlarni qo'shish uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --"
"> Products --> Bills of Materials` yo'lidan o'ting va |BoM|ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/byproducts.rst:41
msgid ""
"On the |BoM|, select the :guilabel:`By-products` tab. Click :guilabel:`Add a "
"line`, and select the by-product in the :guilabel:`By-product` drop-down "
"field. In the :guilabel:`Quantity` field, enter the quantity of the by-"
"product produced during manufacturing."
msgstr ""
"|BoM|da :guilabel:`By-products` varag'ini tanlang. :guilabel:`Add a line` "
"tugmasini bosing va :guilabel:`By-product` ochiluvchi maydonida yon "
"mahsulotni tanlang. :guilabel:`Quantity` maydoniga ishlab chiqarish "
"jarayonida hosil bo'ladigan yon mahsulot miqdorini kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/byproducts.rst:45
msgid ""
"If the by-product is produced during a specific operation of a manufacturing "
"order (MO), select the operation in the :guilabel:`Produced in Operation` "
"field. For example, if a scrap wood by-product is produced during an "
"*Assemble* operation, select that operation in the :guilabel:`Produced in "
"Operation` field."
msgstr ""
"Agar yon mahsulot ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasining (MO) muayyan operatsiyasi "
"davomida hosil bo'lsa, operatsiyani :guilabel:`Produced in Operation` "
"maydonida tanlang. Masalan, agar chiqit yog'och yon mahsuloti *Assemble* "
"operatsiyasi davomida hosil bo'lsa, o'sha operatsiyani :guilabel:`Produced "
"in Operation` maydonida tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/byproducts.rst:None
msgid ""
"The By-Products tab on a BoM, configured with a \"Scrap Wood\" by-product."
msgstr ""
"\"Scrap Wood\" yon mahsuloti bilan sozlangan BoM-dagi By-Products varag'i."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/byproducts.rst:55
msgid "Manufacture by-product"
msgstr "Yon mahsulotni ishlab chiqarish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/byproducts.rst:57
msgid ""
"When an |MO| is completed and marked as *Done*, Odoo registers the quantity "
"of by-products created during the manufacturing process. To create a new |"
"MO|, navigate to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Operations --> "
"Manufacturing Orders`, and click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"|MO| tugallanib, *Done* deb belgilanganda, Odoo ishlab chiqarish jarayonida "
"yaratilgan yon mahsulotlar miqdorini ro'yxatga oladi. Yangi |MO| yaratish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Operations --> Manufacturing "
"Orders` yo'lidan o'ting va :guilabel:`New` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/byproducts.rst:61
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Bill of Material` field, select a |BoM| on which by-"
"products have been specified. After doing so, the :guilabel:`Product` field "
"auto-populates with the corresponding product. Click :guilabel:`Confirm` to "
"confirm the |MO|."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Bill of Material` maydonida yon mahsulotlar ko'rsatilgan |BoM|ni "
"tanlang. Shundan so'ng :guilabel:`Product` maydoni tegishli mahsulot bilan "
"avtomatik to'ldiriladi. |MO|ni tasdiqlash uchun :guilabel:`Confirm` "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/byproducts.rst:65
msgid ""
"When manufacturing is completed, click the :guilabel:`Produce All` button at "
"the top of the |MO|. After doing so, inventory counts update to reflect the "
"quantity of by-product(s) produced, as well as the quantity of the product."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish tugagach, |MO| yuqorisidagi :guilabel:`Produce All` "
"tugmasini bosing. Shundan so'ng zaxira hisoblari ishlab chiqarilgan yon "
"mahsulot(lar) miqdorini, shuningdek mahsulot miqdorini aks ettirish uchun "
"yangilanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/byproducts.rst:69
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Product Moves` smart button at the top of the |MO| page "
"to see the movements of components and products. Each by-product is listed "
"on the resulting :guilabel:`Inventory Moves` page, with the :guilabel:`From` "
"column displaying the virtual production location, and the :guilabel:`To` "
"column displaying the location where the by-product is stored."
msgstr ""
"Komponentlar va mahsulotlar harakatlarini ko'rish uchun |MO| sahifasi "
"yuqorisidagi :guilabel:`Product Moves` aqlli tugmasini bosing. Har bir yon "
"mahsulot ochilgan :guilabel:`Inventory Moves` sahifasida ro'yxatlanadi, "
"bunda :guilabel:`From` ustunida virtual ishlab chiqarish "
"joyi, :guilabel:`To` ustunida esa yon mahsulot saqlanadigan joy ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/byproducts.rst:None
msgid "The Product Moves page for an MO with by-products."
msgstr "Yon mahsulotlarga ega MO uchun Product Moves sahifasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:3
msgid "Continuous product improvement"
msgstr "Mahsulotni uzluksiz takomillashtirish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:13
msgid ""
"*Continuous improvement* is a general philosophy intended to help "
"individuals and organizations constantly improve themselves and the work "
"they produce."
msgstr ""
"*Uzluksiz takomillashtirish* — bu shaxslar va tashkilotlarga o'zlarini hamda "
"ular yaratayotgan ishni doimiy ravishda yaxshilashga yordam berishga "
"mo'ljallangan umumiy falsafadir."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:16
msgid ""
"There are a variety of different methodologies that fall under the umbrella "
"of continuous improvement. These include kaizen, six sigma, and lean, among "
"others. While the specific steps of each method differ, their goal remains "
"the same: implement a process by which improvement is a perpetual goal, "
"rather than a one-time accomplishment."
msgstr ""
"Uzluksiz takomillashtirish doirasiga kiruvchi turli xil metodologiyalar "
"mavjud. Bularga kaizen, olti sigma (six sigma), lean va boshqalar kiradi. "
"Har bir metodning aniq qadamlari farq qilsa-da, ularning maqsadi bir xil "
"bo'lib qoladi: takomillashtirish bir martalik yutuq emas, balki doimiy "
"maqsad bo'lgan jarayonni joriy etish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:21
msgid ""
"The sections below contain details about how Odoo can be used to implement "
"four general steps common to many of the most popular continuous improvement "
"strategies, with links to documentation about configuring the necessary "
"features. The final section details how a specific company might configure "
"these Odoo implementations within their organization."
msgstr ""
"Quyidagi bo'limlarda eng mashhur uzluksiz takomillashtirish "
"strategiyalarining ko'pchiligiga xos bo'lgan to'rtta umumiy qadamni joriy "
"etishda Odoo'dan qanday foydalanish mumkinligi haqida ma'lumotlar, "
"shuningdek zarur funksiyalarni sozlash bo'yicha hujjatlarga havolalar "
"keltirilgan. Yakuniy bo'limda muayyan kompaniya ushbu Odoo yechimlarini o'z "
"tashkilotida qanday sozlashi mumkinligi batafsil yoritilgan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:26
msgid ":ref:`manufacturing/workflows/ci-identify`"
msgstr ":ref:`manufacturing/workflows/ci-identify`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:27
msgid ":ref:`manufacturing/workflows/ci-suggest`"
msgstr ":ref:`manufacturing/workflows/ci-suggest`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:28
msgid ":ref:`manufacturing/workflows/ci-implement`"
msgstr ":ref:`manufacturing/workflows/ci-implement`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:29
msgid ":ref:`manufacturing/workflows/ci-review`"
msgstr ":ref:`manufacturing/workflows/ci-review`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:32
msgid ""
"Continuous improvement is not a one-size-fits-all methodology. While most "
"strategies include between four and six steps, proper implementation "
"requires developing a system tailored to the specific needs of each company."
msgstr ""
"Uzluksiz takomillashtirish hamma uchun bir xil bo'lgan metodologiya emas. "
"Ko'pchilik strategiyalar to'rttadan oltitagacha qadamni o'z ichiga olsa-da, "
"to'g'ri joriy etish har bir kompaniyaning o'ziga xos ehtiyojlariga "
"moslashtirilgan tizimni ishlab chiqishni talab qiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:36
msgid ""
"This is not a limitation, but rather a benefit, as it makes the methodology "
"flexible enough to adapt to almost any use case. Odoo, in particular, adapts "
"well to this flexibility, as it can be configured to meet the needs of "
"almost any workflow."
msgstr ""
"Bu cheklov emas, aksincha afzallik, chunki bu metodologiyani deyarli har "
"qanday foydalanish holatiga moslasha oladigan darajada moslashuvchan qiladi. "
"Xususan, Odoo bu moslashuvchanlikka yaxshi mos keladi, chunki u deyarli har "
"qanday ish jarayoni ehtiyojlarini qondirish uchun sozlanishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:40
msgid ""
"As such, it is important to remember the content below only provides "
"*examples* of how Odoo *might* be used. They should be viewed as more of a "
"starting point, rather than a concrete outline that every organization must "
"follow."
msgstr ""
"Shu sababli, quyidagi kontent Odoo'dan qanday foydalanish *mumkinligi* "
"haqida faqat *misollar* keltirishini yodda tutish muhim. Ular har bir "
"tashkilot amal qilishi shart bo'lgan aniq reja sifatida emas, balki ko'proq "
"boshlang'ich nuqta sifatida qaralishi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:47
msgid "Identify problems"
msgstr "Muammolarni aniqlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:49
msgid ""
"Before improvement can begin, it is necessary to determine where improvement "
"is necessary. This is where identifying problems comes into play. Two of the "
"best Odoo apps for identifying problems with products or processes are "
"*Helpdesk* and *Quality*."
msgstr ""
"Takomillashtirish boshlanishidan oldin, takomillashtirish qayerda "
"zarurligini aniqlash lozim. Aynan shu yerda muammolarni aniqlash o'z rolini "
"o'ynaydi. Mahsulotlar yoki jarayonlardagi muammolarni aniqlash uchun eng "
"yaxshi Odoo ilovalaridan ikkitasi — *Helpdesk* va *Quality*."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:54
msgid "Helpdesk"
msgstr "Helpdesk"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:56
msgid ""
"The *Helpdesk* app is useful for receiving feedback from outside of the "
"organization, like from clients or customers. This is accomplished by "
"implementing one (or more) of the methods for :doc:`receiving tickets "
"<../../../services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets>`, including email "
"aliases, live chat conversations, and website forms."
msgstr ""
"*Helpdesk* ilovasi tashkilotdan tashqaridan, masalan mijozlardan, fikr-"
"mulohaza olish uchun foydalidir. Bunga :doc:`chiptalarni qabul qilish "
"<../../../services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets>` usullaridan "
"bittasini (yoki bir nechtasini), jumladan elektron pochta taxalluslari, "
"jonli chat suhbatlari va veb-sayt formalarini joriy etish orqali erishiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:61
msgid ""
"Using these methods, customers can submit feedback about problems, which is "
"then reviewed by a member of a :doc:`helpdesk team <../../../services/"
"helpdesk>`. Depending on the outcome of the review, the team member may "
"decide to take further action to ensure the issue is addressed. This can "
"include creating a :doc:`quality alert <../../quality/quality_management/"
"quality_alerts>`."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu usullardan foydalanib, mijozlar muammolar haqida fikr-mulohaza "
"yuborishi mumkin, keyin bu :doc:`helpdesk jamoasi <../../../services/"
"helpdesk>` a'zosi tomonidan ko'rib chiqiladi. Ko'rib chiqish natijasiga "
"qarab, jamoa a'zosi muammo hal etilishini ta'minlash uchun qo'shimcha chora "
"ko'rishga qaror qilishi mumkin. Bu :doc:`sifat ogohlantirishi <../../quality/"
"quality_management/quality_alerts>` yaratishni o'z ichiga olishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:67
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:93
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/quality.rst:7
msgid "Quality"
msgstr "Quality"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:69
msgid ""
"The *Quality* app is useful for receiving feedback from *within* the "
"organization, like from employees."
msgstr ""
"*Quality* ilovasi tashkilot *ichidan*, masalan xodimlardan, fikr-mulohaza "
"olish uchun foydalidir."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:72
msgid ""
"One method for accomplishing this is to set up a :doc:`quality control point "
"<../../quality/quality_management/quality_control_points>` (QCP). A |QCP| is "
"used to automatically create quality checks at regular intervals, prompting "
"employees to inspect, and confirm, the quality of a product."
msgstr ""
"Bunga erishish usullaridan biri :doc:`sifat nazorati nuqtasi <../../quality/"
"quality_management/quality_control_points>` (QCP) o'rnatishdir. |QCP| "
"muntazam oraliqlarda avtomatik ravishda sifat tekshiruvlarini yaratish uchun "
"ishlatiladi va xodimlarni mahsulot sifatini tekshirish hamda tasdiqlashga "
"undaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:77
msgid ""
"If an issue is found, an employee can then create a :doc:`quality alert "
"<../../quality/quality_management/quality_alerts>` to notify a quality team. "
"Quality alerts can also be created independent of a |QCP|, in the event that "
"an employee discovers an issue without being prompted to check for one. This "
"is a great way for customer support employees to notify a quality team of an "
"issue brought to their attention by a customer ticket."
msgstr ""
"Agar muammo topilsa, xodim sifat jamoasini xabardor qilish uchun :doc:`sifat "
"ogohlantirishi <../../quality/quality_management/quality_alerts>` yaratishi "
"mumkin. Sifat ogohlantirishlari |QCP|dan mustaqil ravishda ham yaratilishi "
"mumkin — xodim tekshirishga undalmagan holda muammoni aniqlagan hollarda. Bu "
"mijozlarni qo'llab-quvvatlash xodimlari uchun mijoz chiptasi orqali "
"e'tiborlariga yetkazilgan muammo haqida sifat jamoasini xabardor qilishning "
"ajoyib usulidir."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:86
msgid "Suggest improvements"
msgstr "Takomillashtirishlarni taklif qilish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:88
msgid ""
"Once a problem is identified, the next step is to put forward ideas for how "
"to address the problem. As with identifying problems, the *Quality app* is "
"also useful for suggesting improvements. In addition, the *PLM* (*Product "
"Lifecycle Management*) app can be used for this purpose, as well."
msgstr ""
"Muammo aniqlangach, keyingi qadam muammoni qanday hal qilish bo'yicha "
"g'oyalarni ilgari surishdir. Muammolarni aniqlashda bo'lgani kabi, *Quality "
"app* takomillashtirishlarni taklif qilish uchun ham foydalidir. Bundan "
"tashqari, *PLM* (*Product Lifecycle Management*) ilovasidan ham shu maqsadda "
"foydalanish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:95
msgid ""
"When creating a :doc:`quality alert <../../quality/quality_management/"
"quality_alerts>` to bring an issue to the attention of a quality team, "
"the :guilabel:`Corrective Actions` and :guilabel:`Preventive Actions` tabs "
"can be used to provide feedback about how the issue can be addressed."
msgstr ""
"Muammoni sifat jamoasi e'tiboriga yetkazish uchun :doc:`sifat ogohlantirishi "
"<../../quality/quality_management/quality_alerts>` "
"yaratishda, :guilabel:`Corrective Actions` va :guilabel:`Preventive Actions` "
"varaqlaridan muammoni qanday hal qilish mumkinligi haqida fikr bildirish "
"uchun foydalanish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:100
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Corrective Actions` tab is used to suggest a method for "
"fixing items affected by the issue. For example, `Screw the bolts on "
"tighter, so the seat stays in place`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Corrective Actions` varag'i muammodan zarar ko'rgan buyumlarni "
"tuzatish usulini taklif qilish uchun ishlatiladi. Masalan, `Screw the bolts "
"on tighter, so the seat stays in place`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:103
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Preventive Actions` tab is used to suggest a method for "
"preventing the issue from occurring in the future. For example, `Do not "
"tighten the screws too much, or they will be stripped`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Preventive Actions` varag'i muammoning kelajakda yuzaga "
"kelishining oldini olish usulini taklif qilish uchun ishlatiladi. Masalan, "
"`Do not tighten the screws too much, or they will be stripped`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:107
msgid ""
"The quality team that reviews the alert sees these suggested actions, and "
"can take them into account when deciding how to address the issue."
msgstr ""
"Ogohlantirishni ko'rib chiquvchi sifat jamoasi ushbu taklif qilingan chora-"
"tadbirlarni ko'radi va muammoni qanday hal qilishni belgilashda ularni "
"inobatga olishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:111
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:132
msgid "PLM"
msgstr "PLM"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:113
msgid ""
"The |PLM| app is used to manage the lifecycle of a product from its "
"introduction through each successive version. As such, it is useful for "
"testing ideas for product improvements."
msgstr ""
"|PLM| ilovasi mahsulotning hayotiy siklini uning joriy etilishidan boshlab "
"har bir keyingi versiyagacha boshqarish uchun ishlatiladi. Shu sababli, u "
"mahsulotni takomillashtirish g'oyalarini sinab ko'rish uchun foydalidir."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:116
msgid ""
"Using :doc:`engineering change orders <../../plm/manage_changes/"
"engineering_change_orders>`, product management teams can create new "
"iterations of product |BoMs|, adding or removing specific components or "
"operations, as needed. The products created using these |BoMs| are put "
"through a review process to confirm the effectiveness of the changes."
msgstr ""
":doc:`muhandislik o'zgarishi buyurtmalari <../../plm/manage_changes/"
"engineering_change_orders>`dan foydalanib, mahsulot boshqaruvi jamoalari "
"zarur bo'lganda muayyan komponentlarni yoki operatsiyalarni qo'shib yoki "
"olib tashlab, mahsulot |BoMs|ning yangi iteratsiyalarini yaratishi mumkin. "
"Ushbu |BoMs| yordamida yaratilgan mahsulotlar o'zgarishlar samaradorligini "
"tasdiqlash uchun ko'rib chiqish jarayonidan o'tkaziladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:124
msgid "Implement strategies"
msgstr "Strategiyalarni joriy etish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:126
msgid ""
"Implementing strategies involves putting the proposed solutions from the "
"suggest improvements step into action. The |PLM| app continues to be useful "
"during this step, as it can be configured to make |BoM| updates. The *Field "
"Service* app can also be used by certain companies to make improvements to "
"products that have already been sold to customers."
msgstr ""
"Strategiyalarni joriy etish takomillashtirishlarni taklif qilish qadamida "
"ilgari surilgan yechimlarni amalga oshirishni anglatadi. |PLM| ilovasi bu "
"qadamda ham foydali bo'lib qoladi, chunki uni |BoM| yangilanishlarini amalga "
"oshirish uchun sozlash mumkin. Ayrim kompaniyalar mijozlarga allaqachon "
"sotilgan mahsulotlarni takomillashtirish uchun *Field Service* ilovasidan "
"ham foydalanishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:134
msgid ""
"Once |BoM| changes have gone through the proper review process, they can be "
"approved, and the updated |BoM| put into use. This is accomplished by "
"configuring one of the |ECO| review stages to :ref:`apply the changes <plm/"
"eco/apply-changes>` made to the |BoM|, at which point the updated |BoM| "
"becomes available for new |MOs|."
msgstr ""
"|BoM| o'zgarishlari tegishli ko'rib chiqish jarayonidan o'tgach, ular "
"tasdiqlanishi va yangilangan |BoM| foydalanishga kiritilishi mumkin. Bunga |"
"ECO| ko'rib chiqish bosqichlaridan birini |BoM|ga kiritilgan "
"o'zgarishlarni :ref:`qo'llash <plm/eco/apply-changes>` uchun sozlash orqali "
"erishiladi, shundan so'ng yangilangan |BoM| yangi |MOs| uchun mavjud bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:139
msgid ""
"Product |BoMs| can continue to be updated, as needed. The :doc:`version "
"control <../../plm/manage_changes/version_control>` features of the |PLM| "
"app allow for easy management of all versions of a given |BoM|."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulot |BoMs| zarur bo'lganda yangilanishda davom etishi mumkin. |PLM| "
"ilovasining :doc:`versiyalarni nazorat qilish <../../plm/manage_changes/"
"version_control>` funksiyalari berilgan |BoM|ning barcha versiyalarini oson "
"boshqarish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:144
msgid "Field Service"
msgstr "Field Service"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:146
msgid ""
"The |PLM| app is a great way to make changes to product |BoMs|. However, "
"these changes only affect products produced using the new |BoM|. If a "
"defective product has already been sold to a customer, it may be necessary "
"to repair (or update) that product."
msgstr ""
"|PLM| ilovasi mahsulot |BoMs|ga o'zgartirishlar kiritishning ajoyib "
"usulidir. Biroq, bu o'zgarishlar faqat yangi |BoM| yordamida ishlab "
"chiqarilgan mahsulotlarga ta'sir qiladi. Agar nuqsonli mahsulot allaqachon "
"mijozga sotilgan bo'lsa, o'sha mahsulotni ta'mirlash (yoki yangilash) zarur "
"bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:150
msgid ""
"In such a case, the *Field Service* app can be used to schedule :doc:`onsite "
"interventions <../../../services/field_service/creating_tasks>`. These "
"interventions allow service technicians (or other employees) to be sent to a "
"customer's location to address an issue with a product."
msgstr ""
"Bunday holatda, *Field Service* ilovasidan :doc:`joyida aralashuvlar "
"<../../../services/field_service/creating_tasks>`ni rejalashtirish uchun "
"foydalanish mumkin. Ushbu aralashuvlar servis texniklarini (yoki boshqa "
"xodimlarni) mahsulot bilan bog'liq muammoni hal qilish uchun mijoz manziliga "
"yuborish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:158
msgid "Review actions"
msgstr "Chora-tadbirlarni ko'rib chiqish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:160
msgid ""
"Reviewing actions is where the \"continuous\" part of continuous improvement "
"comes into play, as it allows an organization to evaluate the decisions made "
"in the previous steps. As such, this step is, essentially, returning to the "
"beginning of the process, so that additional problems can be identified and "
"addressed."
msgstr ""
"Chora-tadbirlarni ko'rib chiqish — uzluksiz takomillashtirishning "
"\"uzluksiz\" qismi namoyon bo'ladigan bosqich, chunki u tashkilotga oldingi "
"qadamlarda qabul qilingan qarorlarni baholash imkonini beradi. Shu sababli, "
"bu qadam, mohiyatan, qo'shimcha muammolarni aniqlash va hal qilish uchun "
"jarayonning boshiga qaytishdir."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:165
msgid ""
"This means that the *Helpdesk* and *Quality* apps should be used again to "
"receive customer and employee feedback. Another app that may be useful at "
"this stage is the *Surveys* app."
msgstr ""
"Bu *Helpdesk* va *Quality* ilovalaridan mijozlar va xodimlarning fikr-"
"mulohazalarini olish uchun yana foydalanish kerakligini anglatadi. Bu "
"bosqichda foydali bo'lishi mumkin bo'lgan yana bir ilova — *Surveys* ilovasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:169
msgid "Surveys"
msgstr "Surveys"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:171
msgid ""
"After implementing changes to a product or process, it may be wise to "
"solicit customers for their feedback directly, rather than waiting to hear "
"from them of their own volition. This may bring to light feedback that "
"customers may have otherwise neglected to share."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulot yoki jarayonga o'zgartirishlar kiritilgandan so'ng, mijozlardan o'z "
"xohishi bilan fikr bildirishini kutish o'rniga, ulardan to'g'ridan-to'g'ri "
"fikr-mulohaza so'rash oqilona bo'lishi mumkin. Bu mijozlar aks holda baham "
"ko'rmasligi mumkin bo'lgan fikr-mulohazalarni yuzaga chiqarishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:175
msgid ""
"One of the best ways to accomplish this is through the :doc:`Surveys "
"<../../../marketing/surveys>` app. Creating a survey, and sending it to "
"customers who receive an updated product, increases the likelihood of "
"receiving relevant feedback about the product."
msgstr ""
"Bunga erishishning eng yaxshi usullaridan biri :doc:`Surveys <../../../"
"marketing/surveys>` ilovasi orqalidir. So'rovnoma yaratish va uni "
"yangilangan mahsulotni olgan mijozlarga yuborish mahsulot haqida tegishli "
"fikr-mulohaza olish ehtimolini oshiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:179
msgid "Example workflow: coat rack product improvement"
msgstr "Namuna ish jarayoni: kiyim ilgichi mahsulotini takomillashtirish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:182
msgid ""
"*Wood Hut* is a manufacturer of fine wood products. They are committed to "
"manufacturing products of the highest-possible quality, and are always "
"looking for ways to improve the products they sell, along with the processes "
"used to create them."
msgstr ""
"*Wood Hut* — nafis yog'och mahsulotlari ishlab chiqaruvchisi. Ular imkon "
"qadar eng yuqori sifatli mahsulotlar ishlab chiqarishga sodiq bo'lib, "
"sotayotgan mahsulotlarini hamda ularni yaratishda qo'llaniladigan "
"jarayonlarni yaxshilash yo'llarini doimo izlaydilar."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:186
msgid ""
"Wood Hut uses the Odoo platform to manage every element of their production, "
"fulfillment, and customer satisfaction processes. They have developed a "
"custom product improvement workflow that incorporates the Helpdesk, Quality, "
"PLM, and Manufacturing apps."
msgstr ""
"Wood Hut ishlab chiqarish, buyurtmalarni bajarish va mijozlar mamnuniyati "
"jarayonlarining har bir elementini boshqarish uchun Odoo platformasidan "
"foydalanadi. Ular Helpdesk, Quality, PLM va Manufacturing ilovalarini o'z "
"ichiga olgan maxsus mahsulotni takomillashtirish ish jarayonini ishlab "
"chiqishgan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:190
msgid ""
"One of Wood Hut's most popular products is their *coat rack*. It's made "
"entirely of oak, and customers describe it as \"sleek and elegant.\" "
"However, recent customer feedback about the coat rack has brought attention "
"to quality issues that necessitate revising the current manufacturing "
"process."
msgstr ""
"Wood Hut'ning eng mashhur mahsulotlaridan biri — ularning *kiyim ilgichi*. U "
"butunlay eman yog'ochidan yasalgan bo'lib, mijozlar uni \"nafis va "
"zamonaviy\" deb ta'riflaydilar. Biroq, kiyim ilgichi haqidagi so'nggi mijoz "
"fikr-mulohazalari joriy ishlab chiqarish jarayonini qayta ko'rib chiqishni "
"taqozo etadigan sifat muammolariga e'tibor qaratdi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:195
msgid ""
"The product revision workflow begins when the customer service team receives "
"a ticket in the Helpdesk app from a customer having problems with the coat "
"rack she purchased. The customer, Abigail Peterson, has found that her coat "
"rack falls over when more than five coats are hanging from it. This is a "
"major issue, as the coat rack has enough dowels for six coats."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulotni qayta ko'rib chiqish ish jarayoni mijozlarga xizmat ko'rsatish "
"jamoasi Helpdesk ilovasida o'zi sotib olgan kiyim ilgichi bilan muammolarga "
"duch kelgan mijozdan chipta olganida boshlanadi. Mijoz Abigail Peterson "
"kiyim ilgichiga beshtadan ortiq kiyim osilganda uning ag'darilib ketishini "
"aniqlagan. Bu jiddiy muammo, chunki kiyim ilgichida oltita kiyim uchun "
"yetarli ilgaklar bor."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:None
msgid "A Helpdesk ticket about an issue with the coat rack product."
msgstr ""
"Kiyim ilgichi mahsuloti bilan bog'liq muammo haqidagi Helpdesk chiptasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:204
msgid ""
"Marc, the customer service employee assigned to the helpdesk ticket, opens "
"the Quality app, and creates a new quality alert. He tags the *Production "
"Quality Team* and assigns Julie Andreson as the quality employee responsible "
"for the alert."
msgstr ""
"Helpdesk chiptasiga tayinlangan mijozlarga xizmat ko'rsatish xodimi Marc "
"Quality ilovasini ochadi va yangi sifat ogohlantirishi yaratadi. U "
"*Production Quality Team*ni belgilaydi va Julie Andresonni ogohlantirish "
"uchun mas'ul sifat xodimi sifatida tayinlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:208
msgid ""
"Julie reviews the alert, and consults with her team about the best course of "
"action. They decide that it is necessary to revise the product's |BoM| to "
"prevent the issue from occurring in the future, which Julie notes in "
"the :guilabel:`Corrective Actions` tab of the quality alert."
msgstr ""
"Julie ogohlantirishni ko'rib chiqadi va eng yaxshi harakat yo'nalishi haqida "
"o'z jamoasi bilan maslahatlashadi. Ular muammoning kelajakda yuzaga "
"kelishining oldini olish uchun mahsulot |BoM|ini qayta ko'rib chiqish zarur "
"degan qarorga kelishadi, buni Julie sifat "
"ogohlantirishining :guilabel:`Corrective Actions` varag'ida qayd etadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:None
msgid "A quality alert created about the issue with the coat rack product."
msgstr ""
"Kiyim ilgichi mahsulotidagi muammo haqida yaratilgan sifat ogohlantirishi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:216
msgid ""
"Then, Julie messages product engineer, Joe Kazan in the chatter of the "
"quality alert to bring it to his attention. Joe opens the |PLM| app and "
"creates a new |ECO|, noting the problem with the coat rack, and suggesting "
"that a change to the product's |BoM| may be necessary."
msgstr ""
"So'ngra Julie sifat ogohlantirishining chatter bo'limida mahsulot muhandisi "
"Joe Kazanga xabar yuborib, uning e'tiborini bu masalaga qaratadi. Joe |PLM| "
"ilovasini ochadi va yangi |ECO| yaratadi, unda kiyim ilgichidagi muammoni "
"qayd etadi hamda mahsulotning |BoM| hujjatiga o'zgartirish kiritish zarur "
"bo'lishi mumkinligini taklif qiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:None
msgid "An ECO created to update the coat rack product's BoM."
msgstr ""
"Kiyim ilgichi mahsulotining BoM hujjatini yangilash uchun yaratilgan ECO."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:224
msgid ""
"Joe clicks :guilabel:`Start Revision`, and then the :guilabel:`Revision` "
"smart button to open version two of the coat rack's |BoM|. This |BoM| was "
"created alongside the |ECO|, and remains archived until it is approved."
msgstr ""
"Joe :guilabel:`Start Revision` tugmasini, so'ngra kiyim ilgichi |BoM| "
"hujjatining ikkinchi versiyasini ochish uchun :guilabel:`Revision` smart "
"tugmasini bosadi. Bu |BoM| |ECO| bilan birga yaratilgan bo'lib, "
"tasdiqlangunga qadar arxivda qoladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:228
msgid ""
"After some testing, Joe discovers that adding a metal *support rod* to the "
"coat rack strengthens it, allowing the rack to hold six or more coats "
"without falling over. He updates the |BoM| to include the support rod as one "
"of the components, and adds an extra operation to make sure it is installed "
"during the manufacturing process. Finally, he leaves a message in the "
"chatter of the |ECO|, letting his manager, Jose, know that it is ready for "
"review."
msgstr ""
"Bir necha sinovlardan so'ng Joe kiyim ilgichiga metall *tayanch sterjeni* "
"qo'shish uni mustahkamlashini va ilgich olti yoki undan ortiq kiyimni "
"ag'darilmasdan ushlab tura olishini aniqlaydi. U tayanch sterjenini "
"komponentlardan biri sifatida qo'shish uchun |BoM| hujjatini yangilaydi va "
"ishlab chiqarish jarayonida u o'rnatilishini ta'minlash uchun qo'shimcha "
"operatsiya qo'shadi. Nihoyat, u |ECO| ning chatter bo'limida xabar qoldirib, "
"menejeri Josega uning ko'rib chiqishga tayyor ekanligini bildiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:None
msgid "The coat rack BoM, updated to add an extra component and operation."
msgstr ""
"Qo'shimcha komponent va operatsiya qo'shish uchun yangilangan kiyim ilgichi "
"BoM hujjati."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:238
msgid ""
"Jose reviews the changes, and confirms they are an effective method for "
"addressing the problem with the coat rack. He moves the |ECO| to the "
"*Approved* stage, which makes version two of the coat rack |BoM| the current "
"version."
msgstr ""
"Jose o'zgarishlarni ko'rib chiqadi va ular kiyim ilgichidagi muammoni hal "
"qilishning samarali usuli ekanligini tasdiqlaydi. U |ECO| ni *Approved* "
"bosqichiga o'tkazadi, natijada kiyim ilgichi |BoM| hujjatining ikkinchi "
"versiyasi joriy versiyaga aylanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:242
msgid ""
"Now, each time an |MO| is created to produce a coat rack, the updated |BoM| "
"is automatically selected. Wood Hut begins producing the improved coat rack, "
"and customer feedback confirms that the new version has addressed the "
"problem with its predecessor."
msgstr ""
"Endi har safar kiyim ilgichini ishlab chiqarish uchun |MO| yaratilganda, "
"yangilangan |BoM| avtomatik ravishda tanlanadi. Wood Hut takomillashtirilgan "
"kiyim ilgichini ishlab chiqarishni boshlaydi va mijozlar fikr-mulohazalari "
"yangi versiya avvalgi versiyadagi muammoni hal qilganini tasdiqlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_improvement.rst:246
msgid ""
"Using the Odoo platform, Wood Hut has implemented an end-to-end product "
"improvement process. Since the essential elements of this process (customer "
"feedback, quality control, etc.) are always functioning, it can be reused to "
"continuously update products and processes."
msgstr ""
"Odoo platformasidan foydalanib, Wood Hut mahsulotni takomillashtirishning "
"to'liq jarayonini joriy qildi. Bu jarayonning asosiy elementlari (mijozlar "
"fikr-mulohazalari, sifat nazorati va h.k.) doimo ishlab turgani sababli, "
"undan mahsulotlar va jarayonlarni uzluksiz yangilash uchun qayta foydalanish "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:3
msgid "Manufacture with lots and serial numbers"
msgstr "Partiyalar va seriya raqamlari bilan ishlab chiqarish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:8
msgid ""
"In Odoo, *lot numbers* and *serial numbers* are used to identify and track "
"products in Odoo. Serial numbers are used to assign unique numbers to "
"individual products, while lot numbers are used to assign a single number to "
"multiple units of a specific product."
msgstr ""
"Odoo tizimida *partiya raqamlari* va *seriya raqamlari* mahsulotlarni "
"aniqlash va kuzatish uchun ishlatiladi. Seriya raqamlari alohida "
"mahsulotlarga noyob raqamlar berish uchun, partiya raqamlari esa muayyan "
"mahsulotning bir nechta birligiga yagona raqam berish uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:12
msgid ""
"When manufacturing products tracked using lots or serial numbers, Odoo "
"requires the lot or serial number to be assigned to each product before "
"manufacturing can be completed. This ensures that each product is properly "
"tracked from the moment it enters inventory."
msgstr ""
"Partiyalar yoki seriya raqamlari orqali kuzatiladigan mahsulotlarni ishlab "
"chiqarishda Odoo ishlab chiqarish yakunlanishidan oldin har bir mahsulotga "
"partiya yoki seriya raqami berilishini talab qiladi. Bu har bir mahsulot "
"zaxiraga kirgan paytdan boshlab to'g'ri kuzatilishini ta'minlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:17
msgid "Configure products for tracking"
msgstr "Mahsulotlarni kuzatish uchun sozlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:19
msgid ""
"By default, Odoo tracks the quantity of each product on hand, but does not "
"track individual units of a product. Lot or serial number tracking must be "
"enabled for each product individually."
msgstr ""
"Standart holatda Odoo har bir mahsulotning mavjud miqdorini kuzatadi, ammo "
"mahsulotning alohida birliklarini kuzatmaydi. Partiya yoki seriya raqami "
"bo'yicha kuzatuv har bir mahsulot uchun alohida yoqilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:22
msgid ""
"To track a product using lots or serial numbers, begin by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Settings`, then scroll "
"down to the :guilabel:`Traceability` section, and tick the :guilabel:`Lots & "
"Serial Numbers` checkbox. Finally, click :guilabel:`Save` to save the change."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulotni partiyalar yoki seriya raqamlari orqali kuzatish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Settings` yo'lidan "
"o'ting, so'ngra pastga :guilabel:`Traceability` bo'limiga "
"tushib, :guilabel:`Lots & Serial Numbers` katagini belgilang. Nihoyat, "
"o'zgarishni saqlash uchun :guilabel:`Save` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:26
msgid ""
"Next, click on :menuselection:`Products --> Products`, and select a product "
"to track. Make sure the :guilabel:`Track Inventory` checkbox is ticked in "
"the :guilabel:`General Information` tab. Since lot and serial number "
"functionality is enabled, a drop-down menu appears next to the ticked "
"checkbox."
msgstr ""
"Keyin :menuselection:`Products --> Products` yo'lidan o'ting va "
"kuzatiladigan mahsulotni tanlang. :guilabel:`General Information` "
"varag'ida :guilabel:`Track Inventory` katagi belgilanganligiga ishonch hosil "
"qiling. Partiya va seriya raqami funksiyasi yoqilgani sababli, belgilangan "
"katak yonida ochiluvchi menyu paydo bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:30
msgid ""
"Click on the :guilabel:`Track Inventory` drop-down menu. By "
"default, :guilabel:`By Quantity` is selected, which only tracks the quantity "
"on hand. Select :guilabel:`By Lots` to track the product using lot numbers, "
"or :guilabel:`By Unique Serial Number` to track the product using serial "
"numbers."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Track Inventory` ochiluvchi menyusini bosing. Standart "
"holatda :guilabel:`By Quantity` tanlangan bo'lib, u faqat mavjud miqdorni "
"kuzatadi. Mahsulotni partiya raqamlari orqali kuzatish uchun :guilabel:`By "
"Lots` ni yoki seriya raqamlari orqali kuzatish uchun :guilabel:`By Unique "
"Serial Number` ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:35
msgid ""
":doc:`Lots <../../inventory/product_management/product_tracking/"
"lots>` :doc:`Serial numbers <../../inventory/product_management/"
"product_tracking/serial_numbers>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Partiyalar <../../inventory/product_management/product_tracking/"
"lots>` :doc:`Seriya raqamlari <../../inventory/product_management/"
"product_tracking/serial_numbers>`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:39
msgid "Lot number manufacturing"
msgstr "Partiya raqami bilan ishlab chiqarish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:41
msgid ""
"To manufacture a product tracked with lots, begin by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders`. "
"Click :guilabel:`New` to create a new manufacturing order (MO)."
msgstr ""
"Partiyalar orqali kuzatiladigan mahsulotni ishlab chiqarish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders` "
"yo'lidan o'ting. Yangi ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasini (MO) yaratish "
"uchun :guilabel:`New` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:45
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Product` field, select a product tracked using lots, and "
"enter the desired :guilabel:`Quantity`. Click :guilabel:`Confirm` to confirm "
"the |MO|."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Product` maydonida partiyalar orqali kuzatiladigan mahsulotni "
"tanlang va kerakli :guilabel:`Quantity` qiymatini kiriting. |MO| ni "
"tasdiqlash uchun :guilabel:`Confirm` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:48
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:76
msgid ""
"Once the |MO| is confirmed, a :guilabel:`Lot/Serial Number` field appears in "
"the top section of the |MO| form. By default, this field is empty."
msgstr ""
"|MO| tasdiqlangach, |MO| formasining yuqori qismida :guilabel:`Lot/Serial "
"Number` maydoni paydo bo'ladi. Standart holatda bu maydon bo'sh bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:51
msgid ""
"To populate the :guilabel:`Lot/Serial Number` field with a lot number, click "
"the :icon:`fa-plus-square-o` :guilabel:`(plus)` icon to the right of the "
"field. Doing so automatically generates a lot, using the next available "
"number, and enters it in the field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Lot/Serial Number` maydonini partiya raqami bilan to'ldirish "
"uchun maydonning o'ng tomonidagi :icon:`fa-plus-square-o` :guilabel:`(plus)` "
"belgisini bosing. Bu keyingi mavjud raqamdan foydalanib, avtomatik ravishda "
"partiya yaratadi va uni maydonga kiritadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:55
msgid ""
"Alternatively, click on the :guilabel:`Lot/Serial Number` field and select "
"an existing lot number, or manually enter a new lot number and "
"click :guilabel:`Create \"#\"` in the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Muqobil ravishda, :guilabel:`Lot/Serial Number` maydonini bosing va mavjud "
"partiya raqamini tanlang yoki yangi partiya raqamini qo'lda kiriting va "
"ochiluvchi menyuda :guilabel:`Create \"#\"` ni bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:None
msgid "The \"Lot/Serial Number\" field on an MO."
msgstr "MO dagi \"Lot/Serial Number\" maydoni."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:61
msgid ""
"Either of these methods assign the product(s) in the |MO| a lot number "
"before production is finished. It is also possible to complete production "
"and close the |MO| by clicking :guilabel:`Produce All`, without assigning a "
"lot number. Doing so automatically generates and assigns a lot, using the "
"next available number."
msgstr ""
"Bu usullarning har biri ishlab chiqarish tugashidan oldin |MO| dagi "
"mahsulot(lar)ga partiya raqamini biriktiradi. Shuningdek, partiya raqamini "
"biriktirmasdan, :guilabel:`Produce All` tugmasini bosish orqali ishlab "
"chiqarishni yakunlash va |MO| ni yopish ham mumkin. Bunda keyingi mavjud "
"raqamdan foydalanib, avtomatik ravishda partiya yaratiladi va biriktiriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:67
msgid "Serial number manufacturing"
msgstr "Seriya raqami bilan ishlab chiqarish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:69
msgid ""
"To manufacture a product tracked with serial numbers, begin by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders`. "
"Click :guilabel:`New` to create a new |MO|."
msgstr ""
"Seriya raqamlari orqali kuzatiladigan mahsulotni ishlab chiqarish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders` "
"yo'lidan o'ting. Yangi |MO| yaratish uchun :guilabel:`New` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:73
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Product` field, select a product tracked using serial "
"numbers, and enter the desired :guilabel:`Quantity`. "
"Click :guilabel:`Confirm` to confirm the |MO|."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Product` maydonida seriya raqamlari orqali kuzatiladigan "
"mahsulotni tanlang va kerakli :guilabel:`Quantity` qiymatini kiriting. |MO| "
"ni tasdiqlash uchun :guilabel:`Confirm` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:79
msgid ""
"The rest of the manufacturing process depends on how many units the |MO| "
"contains."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish jarayonining qolgan qismi |MO| nechta birlikni o'z ichiga "
"olishiga bog'liq."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:82
msgid "Manufacture single unit"
msgstr "Bitta birlikni ishlab chiqarish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:84
msgid ""
"If a single unit of the product is being manufactured, "
"clicking :guilabel:`Produce All` closes the |MO|, and automatically "
"generates and assigns the next available serial number, which appears in "
"the :guilabel:`Lot/Serial Number` field."
msgstr ""
"Agar mahsulotning bitta birligi ishlab chiqarilayotgan "
"bo'lsa, :guilabel:`Produce All` tugmasini bosish |MO| ni yopadi va keyingi "
"mavjud seriya raqamini avtomatik ravishda yaratib biriktiradi, "
"u :guilabel:`Lot/Serial Number` maydonida ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:88
msgid ""
"To assign a serial number without closing the |MO|, enter a number manually "
"in the :guilabel:`Lot/Serial Number` field, and click :guilabel:`Create "
"\"#\"`, or click the :icon:`fa-plus-square-o` :guilabel:`(plus)` icon to the "
"right of the field to auto-fill it with the next available number."
msgstr ""
"|MO| ni yopmasdan seriya raqamini biriktirish uchun :guilabel:`Lot/Serial "
"Number` maydoniga raqamni qo'lda kiriting va :guilabel:`Create \"#\"` ni "
"bosing yoki maydonni keyingi mavjud raqam bilan avtomatik to'ldirish uchun "
"uning o'ng tomonidagi :icon:`fa-plus-square-o` :guilabel:`(plus)` belgisini "
"bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:97
msgid "Manufacture multiple units"
msgstr "Bir nechta birlikni ishlab chiqarish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:100
msgid ""
"When manufacturing a product tracked using serial numbers, an |MO| can be "
"created for multiple units. However, when serial numbers are assigned to "
"each unit, either at the end of production or before, the |MO| is split into "
"multiple |MOs|, each containing one unit of the product."
msgstr ""
"Seriya raqamlari orqali kuzatiladigan mahsulotni ishlab chiqarishda |MO| bir "
"nechta birlik uchun yaratilishi mumkin. Biroq, ishlab chiqarish oxirida yoki "
"undan oldin har bir birlikka seriya raqamlari biriktirilganda, |MO| bir "
"nechta |MOs| ga bo'linadi, ularning har biri mahsulotning bitta birligini "
"o'z ichiga oladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:104
msgid ""
"Each of the split |MOs| is identified by a numerical tag added to the end of "
"the original |MO| number."
msgstr ""
"Bo'lingan |MOs| ning har biri asl |MO| raqamining oxiriga qo'shilgan raqamli "
"teg orqali aniqlanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:108
msgid ""
"|MO| `WH/MO/00109` contains two units of a `Chair`, a product tracked using "
"serial numbers. A serial number is assigned to each unit of the chair. This "
"causes the |MO| to be split into two |MOs|, each containing one unit of the "
"chair. The |MOs| are titled `WH/MO/00109-001` and `WH/MO/00109-002`."
msgstr ""
"|MO| `WH/MO/00109` seriya raqamlari orqali kuzatiladigan `Chair` "
"mahsulotining ikkita birligini o'z ichiga oladi. Stulning har bir birligiga "
"seriya raqami biriktiriladi. Bu |MO| ning ikkita |MOs| ga bo'linishiga olib "
"keladi, ularning har biri stulning bitta birligini o'z ichiga oladi. |MOs| "
"`WH/MO/00109-001` va `WH/MO/00109-002` deb nomlanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:113
msgid ""
"To assign serial numbers to each unit of an |MO|, click :guilabel:`Produce "
"All` to open the :guilabel:`Batch Production` pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"|MO| ning har bir birligiga seriya raqamlarini biriktirish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Batch Production` qalqib chiquvchi oynasini ochish "
"maqsadida :guilabel:`Produce All` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:116
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`First Lot/SN` field of the pop-up window is auto-filled with "
"the next available serial number. The :guilabel:`Number of SN` field "
"defaults to the number of units being manufactured. The values of either "
"field can be changed manually."
msgstr ""
"Qalqib chiquvchi oynaning :guilabel:`First Lot/SN` maydoni keyingi mavjud "
"seriya raqami bilan avtomatik to'ldiriladi. :guilabel:`Number of SN` maydoni "
"standart holatda ishlab chiqarilayotgan birliklar soniga teng bo'ladi. Har "
"ikkala maydonning qiymatlarini qo'lda o'zgartirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:120
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Generate` to generate the specified number of serial "
"numbers, beginning with the number entered in the :guilabel:`First Lot/SN` "
"field. The serial numbers are displayed in the text box at the bottom of the "
"pop-up window, and can be manually changed after generation."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`First Lot/SN` maydoniga kiritilgan raqamdan boshlab, ko'rsatilgan "
"miqdordagi seriya raqamlarini yaratish uchun :guilabel:`Generate` tugmasini "
"bosing. Seriya raqamlari qalqib chiquvchi oynaning pastki qismidagi matn "
"maydonida ko'rsatiladi va yaratilgandan so'ng qo'lda o'zgartirilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:124
msgid ""
"To assign serial numbers without completing production, click "
"the :guilabel:`Prepare MO` button. Doing so splits the |MO| into individual |"
"MOs|, one for each unit in the original |MO|. Each |MO| is left open, and "
"can be closed individually."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarishni yakunlamasdan seriya raqamlarini biriktirish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Prepare MO` tugmasini bosing. Bu |MO| ni alohida |MOs| ga "
"bo'ladi — asl |MO| dagi har bir birlik uchun bittadan. Har bir |MO| ochiq "
"qoladi va alohida yopilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:128
msgid ""
"To assign serial numbers and complete production, click "
"the :guilabel:`Produce` button. Doing so splits the |MO| into individual |"
"MOs|, one for each unit in the original |MO|. All of the |MOs| are closed, "
"since production is complete."
msgstr ""
"Seriya raqamlarini biriktirish va ishlab chiqarishni yakunlash "
"uchun :guilabel:`Produce` tugmasini bosing. Bu |MO| ni alohida |MOs| ga "
"bo'ladi — asl |MO| dagi har bir birlik uchun bittadan. Ishlab chiqarish "
"yakunlangani sababli barcha |MOs| yopiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:None
msgid ""
"The \"Batch Production\" pop-up window, from which serial numbers can be "
"assigned."
msgstr ""
"Seriya raqamlarini biriktirish mumkin bo'lgan \"Batch Production\" qalqib "
"chiquvchi oynasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:135
msgid ""
"After clicking :guilabel:`Prepare MO` or :guilabel:`Produce`, "
"the :menuselection:`Manufacturing` app automatically shows the first of the "
"split |MOs| (ex. `WH/MO/00109-001`). To view and access the rest the split |"
"MOs|, click the :guilabel:`Backorders` smart button at the top of the screen."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Prepare MO` yoki :guilabel:`Produce` tugmasi "
"bosilgach, :menuselection:`Manufacturing` ilovasi avtomatik ravishda "
"bo'lingan |MOs| ning birinchisini ko'rsatadi (masalan, `WH/MO/00109-001`). "
"Bo'lingan qolgan |MOs| ni ko'rish va ularga kirish uchun ekranning yuqori "
"qismidagi :guilabel:`Backorders` smart tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:3
msgid "Manufacturing backorders"
msgstr "Ishlab chiqarish qoldiq buyurtmalari (backorder)"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:7
msgid ""
"In some cases, the full quantity of a manufacturing order cannot be produced "
"immediately. When this happens, Odoo *Manufacturing* allows for the "
"manufacturing of partial quantities of the order and creates a *backorder* "
"for the remaining amount."
msgstr ""
"Ba'zi hollarda ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasining to'liq miqdorini darhol "
"ishlab chiqarish imkoni bo'lmaydi. Bunday holatda Odoo *Manufacturing* "
"buyurtmaning qisman miqdorini ishlab chiqarishga imkon beradi va qolgan "
"miqdor uchun *qoldiq buyurtma (backorder)* yaratadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:11
msgid ""
"In the *Manufacturing* app, creating a backorder splits the original "
"manufacturing order into two orders. The reference tag for each order is the "
"tag used for the original order, followed by a hyphen and then an additional "
"number to indicate that it's a backorder."
msgstr ""
"*Manufacturing* ilovasida qoldiq buyurtma yaratish asl ishlab chiqarish "
"buyurtmasini ikkita buyurtmaga bo'ladi. Har bir buyurtmaning ma'lumotnoma "
"tegi asl buyurtma uchun ishlatilgan teg bo'lib, uning ortidan defis va "
"qoldiq buyurtma ekanligini bildiruvchi qo'shimcha raqam qo'yiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:16
msgid ""
"A company creates a manufacturing order with the reference tag *WH/MO/"
"00175*, for 10 units of *Product X*. After starting work on the "
"manufacturing order, the employee working the production line realizes there "
"are only enough components in stock to produce five units of the product."
msgstr ""
"Kompaniya *Product X* mahsulotining 10 birligi uchun *WH/MO/00175* "
"ma'lumotnoma tegi bilan ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasini yaratadi. Ishlab "
"chiqarish buyurtmasi ustida ish boshlangach, ishlab chiqarish liniyasida "
"ishlayotgan xodim zaxirada mahsulotning faqat besh birligini ishlab "
"chiqarishga yetarli komponentlar borligini payqaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:20
msgid ""
"Instead of waiting for additional stock of the components, they manufacture "
"five units and create a backorder for the remaining five. This splits the "
"manufacturing order into two separate orders: *WH/MO/00175-001* and *WH/MO/"
"00175-002*."
msgstr ""
"Komponentlarning qo'shimcha zaxirasini kutish o'rniga, ular besh birlikni "
"ishlab chiqaradi va qolgan beshtasi uchun qoldiq buyurtma yaratadi. Bu "
"ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasini ikkita alohida buyurtmaga bo'ladi: *WH/MO/"
"00175-001* va *WH/MO/00175-002*."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:24
msgid ""
"Order *001* contains the five units that have been manufactured, and is "
"immediately marked as :guilabel:`Done`. Order *002* contains the five units "
"that still need to be manufactured and is marked as :guilabel:`In Progress`. "
"Once the remaining components are available, the employee returns to order "
"*002* and manufactures the remaining units before closing the order."
msgstr ""
"*001* buyurtmasi ishlab chiqarilgan besh birlikni o'z ichiga oladi va "
"darhol :guilabel:`Done` deb belgilanadi. *002* buyurtmasi hali ishlab "
"chiqarilishi kerak bo'lgan besh birlikni o'z ichiga oladi va :guilabel:`In "
"Progress` deb belgilanadi. Qolgan komponentlar mavjud bo'lgach, xodim *002* "
"buyurtmasiga qaytadi va buyurtmani yopishdan oldin qolgan birliklarni ishlab "
"chiqaradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:30
msgid "Create a manufacturing backorder"
msgstr "Ishlab chiqarish qoldiq buyurtmasini yaratish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:32
msgid ""
"To create a backorder for part of a manufacturing order, begin by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders`. "
"Select a manufacturing order with a quantity of two or more or create one by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Create`."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasining bir qismi uchun qoldiq buyurtma yaratish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders` "
"yo'lidan o'ting. Miqdori ikki yoki undan ortiq bo'lgan ishlab chiqarish "
"buyurtmasini tanlang yoki :guilabel:`Create` tugmasini bosib yangisini "
"yarating."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:36
msgid ""
"If a new manufacturing order is created, select a product from "
"the :guilabel:`Product` drop-down menu and enter a quantity of two or more "
"in the :guilabel:`Quantity` field, then click :guilabel:`Confirm` to confirm "
"the order."
msgstr ""
"Agar yangi ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasi yaratilsa, :guilabel:`Product` "
"ochiluvchi menyusidan mahsulotni tanlang va :guilabel:`Quantity` maydoniga "
"ikki yoki undan ortiq miqdorni kiriting, so'ngra buyurtmani tasdiqlash "
"uchun :guilabel:`Confirm` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:40
msgid ""
"After manufacturing the quantity that is being produced immediately, enter "
"that number in the :guilabel:`Quantity` field at the top of the "
"manufacturing order."
msgstr ""
"Darhol ishlab chiqarilayotgan miqdorni ishlab chiqargandan so'ng, bu raqamni "
"ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasining yuqori qismidagi :guilabel:`Quantity` "
"maydoniga kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:None
msgid "The quantity field on a manufacturing order."
msgstr "Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasidagi miqdor maydoni."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:47
msgid ""
"Next, click :guilabel:`Validate`, and a :guilabel:`You produced less than "
"initial demand` pop-up window appears, from which a backorder can be "
"created. Click :guilabel:`Create Backorder` to split the manufacturing order "
"into two separate orders, with the reference tags *WH/MO/XXXXX-001* and *WH/"
"MO/XXXXX-002*."
msgstr ""
"Keyin :guilabel:`Validate` tugmasini bosing, shunda :guilabel:`You produced "
"less than initial demand` qalqib chiquvchi oynasi paydo bo'ladi, undan "
"qoldiq buyurtma yaratish mumkin. Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasini *WH/MO/"
"XXXXX-001* va *WH/MO/XXXXX-002* ma'lumotnoma teglari bilan ikkita alohida "
"buyurtmaga bo'lish uchun :guilabel:`Create Backorder` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:None
msgid ""
"The Create Backorder button on the \"You produced less than initial demand\" "
"pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"\"You produced less than initial demand\" qalqib chiquvchi oynasidagi Create "
"Backorder tugmasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:56
msgid ""
"Order *001* contains the items that have been manufactured, and is closed "
"immediately. Order *002* is the backorder that contains the items that have "
"yet to be manufactured, and remains open, to be completed at a later date."
msgstr ""
"*001* buyurtmasi ishlab chiqarilgan mahsulotlarni o'z ichiga oladi va darhol "
"yopiladi. *002* buyurtmasi hali ishlab chiqarilmagan mahsulotlarni o'z "
"ichiga olgan qoldiq buyurtma bo'lib, keyinroq yakunlanishi uchun ochiq "
"qoladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:60
msgid ""
"Once the remaining units can be manufactured, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders`, "
"and then select the backorder manufacturing order. If all of the remaining "
"units are manufactured immediately, simply click :guilabel:`Validate` to "
"close the order."
msgstr ""
"Qolgan birliklarni ishlab chiqarish imkoni "
"bo'lgach, :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing "
"Orders` yo'lidan o'ting va qoldiq buyurtma bo'lgan ishlab chiqarish "
"buyurtmasini tanlang. Agar qolgan barcha birliklar darhol ishlab chiqarilsa, "
"buyurtmani yopish uchun shunchaki :guilabel:`Validate` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:65
msgid ""
"If only some of the remaining units are manufactured immediately, create "
"another backorder for the remainder by following the steps detailed in this "
"section."
msgstr ""
"Agar qolgan birliklarning faqat bir qismi darhol ishlab chiqarilsa, ushbu "
"bo'limda batafsil bayon etilgan qadamlarni bajarib, qolgan qismi uchun yana "
"bir qoldiq buyurtma yarating."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:69
msgid "Create a backorder in Shop Floor"
msgstr "Shop Floor da qoldiq buyurtma (backorder) yaratish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:71
msgid ""
"Backorders for manufacturing orders can also be created from the *Shop "
"Floor* module."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmalari uchun qoldiq buyurtmalarni *Shop Floor* "
"modulidan ham yaratish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:74
msgid ""
"In order to use the *Shop Floor* module, the *Work Orders* setting must be "
"enabled. To do so, navigate to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, enable the :guilabel:`Work Orders` checkbox, "
"and then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"*Shop Floor* modulidan foydalanish uchun *Work Orders* sozlamasi yoqilgan "
"bo'lishi kerak. Buning uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Configuration "
"--> Settings` yo'lidan o'ting, :guilabel:`Work Orders` katagini yoqing va "
"keyin :guilabel:`Save` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:78
msgid ""
"To create a backorder from the *Shop Floor* module, begin by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders`. "
"Select an |MO| for multiple units of a product, for which a backorder needs "
"to be created."
msgstr ""
"*Shop Floor* modulidan qoldiq buyurtma yaratish uchun "
"avval :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders` "
"yo'lidan o'ting. Qoldiq buyurtma yaratilishi kerak bo'lgan, mahsulotning bir "
"nechta birligi uchun ochilgan |MO| ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:82
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/quality/quality_check_types/pass_fail_check.rst:121
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/quality/quality_check_types/picture_check.rst:133
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/quality/quality_management/quality_checks.rst:146
msgid ""
"On the |MO|, select the :guilabel:`Work Orders` tab, and then click "
"the :guilabel:`Open Work Order (external link icon)` button on the line of "
"the work order to be processed. On the resulting :guilabel:`Work Orders` pop-"
"up window, click the :guilabel:`Open Shop Floor` button to open the *Shop "
"Floor* module."
msgstr ""
"|MO| da :guilabel:`Work Orders` varag'ini tanlang, so'ngra qayta ishlanishi "
"kerak bo'lgan ish buyurtmasi qatoridagi :guilabel:`Open Work Order (external "
"link icon)` tugmasini bosing. Ochilgan :guilabel:`Work Orders` qalqib "
"chiquvchi oynasida *Shop Floor* modulini ochish uchun :guilabel:`Open Shop "
"Floor` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:87
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/quality/quality_check_types/instructions_check.rst:80
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/quality/quality_check_types/pass_fail_check.rst:126
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/quality/quality_management/quality_checks.rst:155
msgid ""
"When accessed from a specific work order, the *Shop Floor* module opens to "
"the page for the work center where the order is configured to be processed, "
"and isolates the work order's card so that no other cards are shown."
msgstr ""
"Muayyan ish buyurtmasidan ochilganda, *Shop Floor* moduli buyurtma qayta "
"ishlanishi uchun sozlangan ish markazining sahifasini ochadi va boshqa "
"kartalar ko'rinmasligi uchun ish buyurtmasining kartasini alohida ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:91
msgid ""
"Complete the steps on the work order's card until the :guilabel:`Register "
"Production` step is reached, and then click on it to open "
"the :guilabel:`Register Production` pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"Ish buyurtmasi kartasidagi qadamlarni :guilabel:`Register Production` "
"qadamiga yetguncha bajaring, so'ngra :guilabel:`Register Production` qalqib "
"chiquvchi oynasini ochish uchun uni bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:95
msgid ""
"Do **not** click the :guilabel:`# Units` button on the right side of the "
"step. Doing so automatically registers the full amount of units as having "
"been produced."
msgstr ""
"Qadamning o'ng tomonidagi :guilabel:`# Units` tugmasini **bosmang**. Bu "
"tugma bosilsa, birliklarning to'liq miqdori ishlab chiqarilgan deb avtomatik "
"ro'yxatga olinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:98
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Register Production` pop-up window, enter the number of "
"units produced in the :guilabel:`Quantity` field. Make sure the number "
"entered is *less* than the number of units listed to the right of the field. "
"Then, click :guilabel:`Validate`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Register Production` qalqib chiquvchi oynasida ishlab chiqarilgan "
"birliklar sonini :guilabel:`Quantity` maydoniga kiriting. Kiritilgan son "
"maydonning o'ng tomonida ko'rsatilgan birliklar sonidan *kamroq* ekanligiga "
"ishonch hosil qiling. So'ngra :guilabel:`Validate` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:None
msgid "The Register Production pop-up window in the Shop Floor module."
msgstr "Shop Floor modulidagi Register Production qalqib chiquvchi oynasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:106
msgid ""
"The pop-up window disappears and the :guilabel:`# Units` button on the work "
"order's card updates to reflect the number of units produced, as a fraction "
"of the number of units for which the |MO| was originally created."
msgstr ""
"Qalqib chiquvchi oyna yopiladi va ish buyurtmasi kartasidagi :guilabel:`# "
"Units` tugmasi ishlab chiqarilgan birliklar sonini, |MO| dastlab yaratilgan "
"birliklar sonining ulushi sifatida aks ettirgan holda yangilanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:110
msgid ""
"Next, click the :guilabel:`Mark as Done` button at the bottom-right of the "
"work order's card. The work order card begins to fade away. Once it "
"disappears completely, a new work order card appears, titled with the "
"original |MO|'s reference number with a `-002` tag added to the end of it."
msgstr ""
"Keyin ish buyurtmasi kartasining pastki o'ng qismidagi :guilabel:`Mark as "
"Done` tugmasini bosing. Ish buyurtmasi kartasi asta-sekin yo'qola boshlaydi. "
"U butunlay yo'qolgach, dastlabki |MO| ning referens raqami oxiriga `-002` "
"tegi qo'shilgan nom bilan yangi ish buyurtmasi kartasi paydo bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:114
msgid ""
"This new reference number represents the backorder |MO|. The original |MO|'s "
"reference number now appears with a `-001` tag added to the end of it to "
"distinguish it from the backorder |MO|."
msgstr ""
"Bu yangi referens raqami qoldiq buyurtma |MO| ni bildiradi. Dastlabki |MO| "
"ning referens raqami endi uni qoldiq buyurtma |MO| dan farqlash uchun "
"oxiriga `-001` tegi qo'shilgan holda ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:117
msgid ""
"If the original |MO| has no remaining work orders, it can be closed by "
"selecting the :guilabel:`All` filter in the top navigation of the *Shop "
"Floor* module, and then clicking :guilabel:`Close Production` at the bottom "
"of the |MO|'s card."
msgstr ""
"Agar dastlabki |MO| da qolgan ish buyurtmalari bo'lmasa, uni *Shop Floor* "
"modulining yuqori navigatsiyasidagi :guilabel:`All` filtrini tanlab, so'ngra "
"|MO| kartasining pastidagi :guilabel:`Close Production` tugmasini bosish "
"orqali yopish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:121
msgid ""
"If the original |MO| has remaining work orders that must be completed before "
"it can be closed, cards for these work orders appear on the *Shop Floor* "
"pages for the work centers where they are configured to be carried out. They "
"can be processed as normal, and additional backorders can be created from "
"their work order cards using the instructions detailed in this section."
msgstr ""
"Agar dastlabki |MO| da uni yopishdan oldin bajarilishi kerak bo'lgan ish "
"buyurtmalari qolgan bo'lsa, bu ish buyurtmalarining kartalari ular "
"bajarilishi uchun sozlangan ish markazlarining *Shop Floor* sahifalarida "
"paydo bo'ladi. Ular odatdagidek qayta ishlanishi mumkin, va ushbu bo'limda "
"batafsil bayon etilgan ko'rsatmalar yordamida ularning ish buyurtmasi "
"kartalaridan qo'shimcha qoldiq buyurtmalar yaratish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:126
msgid ""
"Once the current work order for the backorder |MO| is ready to be processed, "
"this can also be completed as normal, and an additional backorder can be "
"created from its work order card by following the instructions detailed in "
"this section."
msgstr ""
"Qoldiq buyurtma |MO| ning joriy ish buyurtmasi qayta ishlashga tayyor "
"bo'lgach, u ham odatdagidek bajarilishi mumkin, va ushbu bo'limda batafsil "
"bayon etilgan ko'rsatmalarga amal qilib, uning ish buyurtmasi kartasidan "
"qo'shimcha qoldiq buyurtma yaratish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:130
msgid ""
"After the final work order for the backorder |MO| has been completed, the |"
"MO| can be closed by clicking the :guilabel:`Close Production` button at the "
"bottom of the work order's card."
msgstr ""
"Qoldiq buyurtma |MO| ning oxirgi ish buyurtmasi bajarilgandan so'ng, |MO| ni "
"ish buyurtmasi kartasining pastidagi :guilabel:`Close Production` tugmasini "
"bosish orqali yopish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:3
msgid "Scrap during manufacturing"
msgstr "Ishlab chiqarish davomida chiqitga chiqarish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:7
msgid ""
"During the manufacturing process, scrapping components or finished products "
"may be necessary when items are damaged, defective, or no longer usable."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish jarayonida buyumlar shikastlangan, nuqsonli yoki endi "
"yaroqsiz bo'lganda, komponentlarni yoki tayyor mahsulotlarni chiqitga "
"chiqarish zarur bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:10
msgid ""
"Tracking scrapped materials helps manufacturers monitor waste, identify "
"process issues, and account for production costs."
msgstr ""
"Chiqitga chiqarilgan materiallarni kuzatib borish ishlab chiqaruvchilarga "
"isrofni nazorat qilish, jarayondagi muammolarni aniqlash va ishlab chiqarish "
"xarajatlarini hisobga olishda yordam beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:13
msgid ""
"In Odoo, scrapped items are removed from physical inventory and moved to a "
"virtual location called *Virtual Locations/Scrap*. This location is not a "
"physical space—it is a way to log and track losses without affecting real "
"stock levels."
msgstr ""
"Odoo da chiqitga chiqarilgan buyumlar jismoniy zaxiradan olib tashlanadi va "
"*Virtual Locations/Scrap* deb nomlangan virtual joyga ko'chiriladi. Bu joy "
"jismoniy makon emas — u haqiqiy zaxira darajalariga ta'sir qilmasdan "
"yo'qotishlarni qayd etish va kuzatish usulidir."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:18
msgid ""
":doc:`Location types <../../inventory/warehouses_storage/"
"inventory_management>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Joy turlari <../../inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management>`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:21
msgid ""
"Scrap orders can be viewed by navigating to :menuselection:`Inventory --> "
"Operations --> Scrap`. Each scrap order shows the date and time the order "
"was created, along with the product and quantity that was scrapped."
msgstr ""
"Chiqit buyurtmalarini :menuselection:`Inventory --> Operations --> Scrap` "
"yo'lidan o'tib ko'rish mumkin. Har bir chiqit buyurtmasida buyurtma "
"yaratilgan sana va vaqt, shuningdek chiqitga chiqarilgan mahsulot va miqdor "
"ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:25
msgid ""
"To view the total quantity of each item scrapped, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Locations`, then remove "
"the :guilabel:`Internal` filter from the :guilabel:`Search...` bar to "
"display all virtual locations. From the list, select the :guilabel:`Virtual "
"Locations/Scrap` location."
msgstr ""
"Chiqitga chiqarilgan har bir buyumning umumiy miqdorini ko'rish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Locations` yo'lidan "
"o'ting, so'ngra barcha virtual joylarni ko'rsatish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Search...` panelidan :guilabel:`Internal` filtrini olib "
"tashlang. Ro'yxatdan :guilabel:`Virtual Locations/Scrap` joyini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:33
msgid "Navigate to the scrap window"
msgstr "Chiqit oynasiga o'tish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:35
msgid ""
"Scrapping can be done in either the **Manufacturing** app or the **Shop "
"Floor** module, depending on the task."
msgstr ""
"Chiqitga chiqarish vazifaga qarab **Manufacturing** ilovasida yoki **Shop "
"Floor** modulida amalga oshirilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:38
msgid "**Manufacturing** app allows:"
msgstr "**Manufacturing** ilovasi quyidagilarga imkon beradi:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:40
msgid "Scrapping finished products (only if the |MO| is in the *Done* stage)."
msgstr ""
"Tayyor mahsulotlarni chiqitga chiqarish (faqat |MO| *Done* bosqichida "
"bo'lsa)."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:41
msgid ""
"Scrapping components (while the |MO| is in the *Draft* or *Confirmed* stage)."
msgstr ""
"Komponentlarni chiqitga chiqarish (|MO| *Draft* yoki *Confirmed* bosqichida "
"bo'lganda)."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:43
msgid "**Shop Floor** allows:"
msgstr "**Shop Floor** quyidagilarga imkon beradi:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:45
msgid "Scrapping only components."
msgstr "Faqat komponentlarni chiqitga chiqarish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:48
msgid "Manufacturing app"
msgstr "Manufacturing ilovasi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:50
msgid ""
"To scrap a product from the **Manufacturing** app, go "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders` "
"and select the desired |MO|."
msgstr ""
"**Manufacturing** ilovasidan mahsulotni chiqitga chiqarish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders` "
"yo'lidan o'ting va kerakli |MO| ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:53
msgid ""
"On the |MO|, click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon, then "
"choose :guilabel:`Scrap` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"|MO| da :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` belgisini bosing, so'ngra "
"ochiluvchi menyudan :guilabel:`Scrap` ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:None
msgid "MO with the cog's drop-down menu revealed, to show the Scrap option."
msgstr ""
"Scrap opsiyasini ko'rsatish uchun tishli g'ildirakning ochiluvchi menyusi "
"ochilgan MO."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:62
msgid ""
"In **Shop Floor**, only components can be scrapped. Navigate to the desired |"
"MO| card, and then tap the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon and in "
"the :guilabel:`What do you want to do?` pop-up window, "
"select :guilabel:`Scrap`."
msgstr ""
"**Shop Floor** da faqat komponentlarni chiqitga chiqarish mumkin. Kerakli |"
"MO| kartasiga o'ting, so'ngra :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` belgisini "
"bosing va :guilabel:`What do you want to do?` qalqib chiquvchi "
"oynasida :guilabel:`Scrap` ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:None
msgid "Scrap pop-up window in the Shop Floor app."
msgstr "Shop Floor ilovasidagi Scrap qalqib chiquvchi oynasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:70
msgid "Scrap pop-up window"
msgstr "Scrap qalqib chiquvchi oynasi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:72
msgid ""
"After opening the :guilabel:`Scrap Products` pop-up window using one of the "
"methods :ref:`detailed above <manufacturing/management/scrap-window>`, "
"select the component or finished product being scrapped, from "
"the :guilabel:`Product` drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Yuqorida batafsil bayon etilgan <manufacturing/management/scrap-"
"window>` usullardan biri yordamida :guilabel:`Scrap Products` qalqib "
"chiquvchi oynasini ochgandan so'ng, :guilabel:`Product` ochiluvchi "
"menyusidan chiqitga chiqarilayotgan komponent yoki tayyor mahsulotni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:76
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Quantity` field, enter the quantity being scrapped."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Quantity` maydoniga chiqitga chiqarilayotgan miqdorni kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:78
msgid ""
"By default, the :guilabel:`Source Location` field is set to the warehouse's "
"pre-production location, while the :guilabel:`Scrap Location` field is set "
"to the :guilabel:`Virtual Locations/Scrap` location. If either the source or "
"scrap location should be changed, select a different location from their "
"respective drop-down menus."
msgstr ""
"Standart holatda :guilabel:`Source Location` maydoni omborning ishlab "
"chiqarishdan oldingi joyiga, :guilabel:`Scrap Location` maydoni "
"esa :guilabel:`Virtual Locations/Scrap` joyiga o'rnatilgan bo'ladi. Agar "
"manba yoki chiqit joyini o'zgartirish kerak bo'lsa, tegishli ochiluvchi "
"menyulardan boshqa joyni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:83
msgid ""
"Enable the :guilabel:`Replenish Scrapped Quantities` checkbox if a picking "
"order should be created to replace the scrapped component upon confirmation "
"of the scrap order. This option should only be enabled for warehouses "
"with :doc:`two-step <../basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing>` or :doc:`three-"
"step <../basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing>` manufacturing enabled, since "
"components are not picked as part of the :doc:`one-step <../basic_setup/"
"one_step_manufacturing>` manufacturing process."
msgstr ""
"Chiqit buyurtmasi tasdiqlanganda chiqitga chiqarilgan komponentni "
"almashtirish uchun yig'ish buyurtmasi yaratilishi kerak "
"bo'lsa, :guilabel:`Replenish Scrapped Quantities` katagini yoqing. Bu opsiya "
"faqat :doc:`ikki bosqichli <../basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing>` "
"yoki :doc:`uch bosqichli <../basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing>` ishlab "
"chiqarish yoqilgan omborlar uchun yoqilishi kerak, chunki :doc:`bir "
"bosqichli <../basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing>` ishlab chiqarish "
"jarayonida komponentlar yig'ib olinmaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:None
msgid "The Scrap pop-up window."
msgstr "Scrap qalqib chiquvchi oynasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:93
msgid ""
"After filling out the :guilabel:`Scrap Products` pop-up window, click "
"the :guilabel:`Scrap Products` button. After one or more scrap orders have "
"been created, a :guilabel:`Scraps` smart button appears at the top of the "
"screen. Click it to view a list of all scrap orders for the |MO|."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Scrap Products` qalqib chiquvchi oynasini to'ldirgandan "
"so'ng, :guilabel:`Scrap Products` tugmasini bosing. Bir yoki bir nechta "
"chiqit buyurtmasi yaratilgandan so'ng, ekranning yuqori "
"qismida :guilabel:`Scraps` aqlli tugmasi paydo bo'ladi. |MO| ning barcha "
"chiqit buyurtmalari ro'yxatini ko'rish uchun uni bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:3
msgid "Split and merge manufacturing orders"
msgstr "Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmalarini bo'lish va birlashtirish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:5
msgid ""
"In Odoo *Manufacturing*, it is possible to create manufacturing orders for a "
"single unit of an item, or multiple units of the same item. In some cases, "
"it may be necessary to split a manufacturing order that contains multiple "
"units into two or more orders, or to merge two or more orders into a single "
"order."
msgstr ""
"Odoo *Manufacturing* da buyumning bitta birligi yoki bir xil buyumning bir "
"nechta birligi uchun ishlab chiqarish buyurtmalarini yaratish mumkin. Ba'zi "
"hollarda bir nechta birlikni o'z ichiga olgan ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasini "
"ikki yoki undan ortiq buyurtmaga bo'lish, yoki ikki yoki undan ortiq "
"buyurtmani bitta buyurtmaga birlashtirish zarur bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:11
msgid ""
"A manufacturing order can only contain one unit of a product, or multiple "
"units of a single product that all use the same Bill of Materials (BoM). As "
"a result, it is only possible to merge manufacturing orders when every order "
"contains the same product being manufactured with the same BoM."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasi faqat mahsulotning bitta birligini yoki barchasi "
"bir xil materiallar ro'yxatidan (BoM) foydalanadigan bitta mahsulotning bir "
"nechta birligini o'z ichiga olishi mumkin. Natijada, ishlab chiqarish "
"buyurtmalarini faqat har bir buyurtma bir xil BoM bilan ishlab "
"chiqarilayotgan bir xil mahsulotni o'z ichiga olgan holdagina birlashtirish "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:17
msgid "Split manufacturing orders"
msgstr "Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmalarini bo'lish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:19
msgid ""
"To split a manufacturing order into multiple orders, begin by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders`, "
"then select a manufacturing order. At the top of the page, next to "
"the :guilabel:`New` button, the manufacturing order's reference number "
"appears with a :guilabel:`⚙️ (settings)` button next to it."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasini bir nechta buyurtmaga bo'lish uchun "
"avval :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders` "
"yo'lidan o'ting, so'ngra ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasini tanlang. Sahifaning "
"yuqori qismida, :guilabel:`New` tugmasi yonida ishlab chiqarish "
"buyurtmasining referens raqami va uning yonida :guilabel:`⚙️ (settings)` "
"tugmasi ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:24
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`⚙️ (settings)` button to open the general settings for "
"the manufacturing order, then select :guilabel:`Split`."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasining umumiy sozlamalarini ochish "
"uchun :guilabel:`⚙️ (settings)` tugmasini bosing, so'ngra :guilabel:`Split` "
"ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:None
msgid "The Settings and Split buttons on a manufacturing order."
msgstr "Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasidagi Settings va Split tugmalari."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:31
msgid ""
"After selecting :guilabel:`Split`, a :guilabel:`Split production` pop-up "
"window appears. In the :guilabel:`Split #` field, enter the number of "
"manufacturing orders that the original order should be split into, then "
"click outside of the field. A table appears below, with a line for each new "
"manufacturing order that will be created by the split. In "
"the :guilabel:`Quantity To Produce` column, enter the number of units that "
"will be assigned to each new manufacturing order. Finally, "
"click :guilabel:`Split` to split the manufacturing order."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Split` tanlangandan so'ng, :guilabel:`Split production` qalqib "
"chiquvchi oynasi paydo bo'ladi. :guilabel:`Split #` maydoniga dastlabki "
"buyurtma nechta ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasiga bo'linishi kerakligini "
"kiriting, so'ngra maydonning tashqarisini bosing. Pastda bo'lish natijasida "
"yaratiladigan har bir yangi ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasi uchun alohida "
"qatorga ega jadval paydo bo'ladi. :guilabel:`Quantity To Produce` ustuniga "
"har bir yangi ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasiga biriktiriladigan birliklar "
"sonini kiriting. Nihoyat, ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasini bo'lish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Split` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:None
msgid "The Split production pop-up window for a manufacturing order."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasi uchun Split production qalqib chiquvchi oynasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:42
msgid ""
"After clicking :guilabel:`Split`, the original manufacturing order is split "
"into the number of orders that was specified in the :guilabel:`Split #` "
"field. The reference numbers for the new manufacturing orders are the "
"reference number for the original order with *-###* tags added to the end."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Split` bosilgandan so'ng, dastlabki ishlab chiqarish "
"buyurtmasi :guilabel:`Split #` maydonida ko'rsatilgan sondagi buyurtmalarga "
"bo'linadi. Yangi ishlab chiqarish buyurtmalarining referens raqamlari "
"dastlabki buyurtma referens raqamining oxiriga *-###* teglari qo'shilgan "
"ko'rinishda bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:48
msgid ""
"Manufacturing order *WH/MO/00012* is split into three separate orders. The "
"reference numbers for the new orders are *WH/MO/00012-001*, *WH/MO/"
"00012-002*, and *WH/MO/00012-003*."
msgstr ""
"*WH/MO/00012* ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasi uchta alohida buyurtmaga "
"bo'linadi. Yangi buyurtmalarning referens raqamlari *WH/MO/00012-001*, *WH/"
"MO/00012-002* va *WH/MO/00012-003* bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:52
msgid "Merge manufacturing orders"
msgstr "Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmalarini birlashtirish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:54
msgid ""
"To merge two or more manufacturing orders into a single order, begin by "
"navigating to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing "
"Orders`. Select the manufacturing orders that will be merged by activating "
"the checkbox to the left of the name of each order."
msgstr ""
"Ikki yoki undan ortiq ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasini bitta buyurtmaga "
"birlashtirish uchun avval :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> "
"Manufacturing Orders` yo'lidan o'ting. Har bir buyurtma nomining chap "
"tomonidagi katakchani belgilash orqali birlashtiriladigan ishlab chiqarish "
"buyurtmalarini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:None
msgid ""
"Select manufacturing orders that will be merged by clicking the checkbox for "
"each."
msgstr ""
"Birlashtiriladigan ishlab chiqarish buyurtmalarini har birining katakchasini "
"bosish orqali tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:62
msgid ""
"Once all manufacturing orders have been selected, click "
"the :guilabel:`Actions` button at the top of the page, then "
"select :guilabel:`Merge` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Barcha ishlab chiqarish buyurtmalari tanlangandan so'ng, sahifaning yuqori "
"qismidagi :guilabel:`Actions` tugmasini bosing, so'ngra ochiluvchi "
"menyudan :guilabel:`Merge` ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:None
msgid "The Actions and Merge buttons on the Manufacturing Orders page."
msgstr "Manufacturing Orders sahifasidagi Actions va Merge tugmalari."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:69
msgid ""
"The selected manufacturing orders are merged into a single order. The "
"reference number for the new manufacturing order is the next sequential "
"number that has *not* already been assigned to an order."
msgstr ""
"Tanlangan ishlab chiqarish buyurtmalari bitta buyurtmaga birlashtiriladi. "
"Yangi ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasining ma'lumotnoma raqami sifatida biror "
"buyurtmaga hali biriktirilmagan *keyingi* ketma-ket raqam olinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:73
msgid ""
"The last reference number used for a manufacturing order was *WH/MO/00012*. "
"Two manufacturing orders, *WH/MO/00008* and *WH/MO/00009*, are merged into a "
"single order. The reference number for the manufacturing order created by "
"the merger is *WH/MO/00013*."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasi uchun ishlatilgan oxirgi ma'lumotnoma raqami *WH/"
"MO/00012* edi. Ikkita ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasi, *WH/MO/00008* va *WH/MO/"
"00009*, bitta buyurtmaga birlashtiriladi. Birlashtirish natijasida "
"yaratilgan ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasining ma'lumotnoma raqami *WH/MO/00013* "
"bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:77
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Source` field for the manufacturing order created by the "
"merger, the reference numbers of the manufacturing orders that were merged "
"are listed."
msgstr ""
"Birlashtirish natijasida yaratilgan ishlab chiqarish "
"buyurtmasining :guilabel:`Source` maydonida birlashtirilgan ishlab chiqarish "
"buyurtmalarining ma'lumotnoma raqamlari ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/split_merge.rst:81
msgid ""
"Manufacturing orders *WH/MO/00009* and *WH/MO/00010* are merged to create "
"*WH/MO/00011*. The source field for *WH/MO/00011* lists both *WH/MO/00009* "
"and *WH/MO/00010*."
msgstr ""
"*WH/MO/00009* va *WH/MO/00010* ishlab chiqarish buyurtmalari birlashtirilib, "
"*WH/MO/00011* yaratiladi. *WH/MO/00011* uchun manba maydonida *WH/MO/00009* "
"ham, *WH/MO/00010* ham ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:3
msgid "Unbuild orders"
msgstr "Qismlarga ajratish buyurtmalari"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:7
msgid ""
"In some cases, it is necessary to dismantle manufactured products into their "
"individual components. This may be required if too many units of a product "
"were built, or if the components of one product must be reclaimed to use in "
"the manufacturing of another."
msgstr ""
"Ayrim hollarda ishlab chiqarilgan mahsulotlarni alohida komponentlarga "
"ajratish zarur bo'ladi. Bu mahsulotning juda ko'p birligi ishlab "
"chiqarilganda yoki bir mahsulotning komponentlarini boshqa mahsulotni ishlab "
"chiqarishda ishlatish uchun qaytarib olish kerak bo'lganda talab qilinishi "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:11
msgid ""
"In Odoo *Manufacturing*, products can be dismantled, and their components "
"returned to inventory, using *unbuild orders*. By using unbuild orders to "
"accomplish this task, inventory counts for the finished product and its "
"components remain accurate, based on the quantity of products dismantled, "
"and the quantity of components reclaimed."
msgstr ""
"Odoo *Manufacturing* ilovasida mahsulotlarni *qismlarga ajratish "
"buyurtmalari (unbuild orders)* yordamida ajratish va ularning "
"komponentlarini zaxiraga qaytarish mumkin. Bu vazifani bajarish uchun "
"qismlarga ajratish buyurtmalaridan foydalanilganda, tayyor mahsulot va uning "
"komponentlari bo'yicha zaxira hisoblari ajratilgan mahsulotlar miqdori va "
"qaytarib olingan komponentlar miqdoriga asoslanib aniq bo'lib qoladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:17
msgid "Create unbuild order"
msgstr "Qismlarga ajratish buyurtmasini yaratish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:19
msgid ""
"A new unbuild order can be created by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Operations --> Unbuild Orders`, and "
"clicking :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"Yangi qismlarga ajratish buyurtmasini yaratish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Operations --> Unbuild Orders` "
"yo'lidan o'ting va :guilabel:`New` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:22
msgid ""
"Begin filling out the new unbuild order by selecting a :guilabel:`Product` "
"to unbuild. After doing so, the :guilabel:`Bill of Material` field auto-"
"populates with the corresponding bill of materials (BoM). If a different |"
"BoM| should be used, click on the :guilabel:`Bill of Material` field, and "
"select it from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Yangi qismlarga ajratish buyurtmasini to'ldirishni "
"ajratiladigan :guilabel:`Product` ni tanlashdan boshlang. Shundan "
"so'ng :guilabel:`Bill of Material` maydoni tegishli materiallar ro'yxati "
"(BoM) bilan avtomatik to'ldiriladi. Agar boshqa |BoM| ishlatilishi kerak "
"bo'lsa, :guilabel:`Bill of Material` maydonini bosing va uni ochiluvchi "
"menyudan tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:27
msgid ""
"Alternatively, a specific |BoM| can be selected in the :guilabel:`Bill of "
"Material` field before selecting a product, which causes the corresponding "
"product to auto-populate in the :guilabel:`Product` field."
msgstr ""
"Muqobil ravishda, mahsulotni tanlashdan oldin :guilabel:`Bill of Material` "
"maydonida muayyan |BoM| ni tanlash mumkin, bu esa tegishli "
"mahsulotning :guilabel:`Product` maydonida avtomatik to'ldirilishiga olib "
"keladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:31
msgid ""
"Next, specify the :guilabel:`Quantity` of the product that is being unbuilt."
msgstr ""
"Keyin, qismlarga ajratilayotgan mahsulotning :guilabel:`Quantity` qiymatini "
"belgilang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:33
msgid ""
"If the product being unbuilt was originally manufactured in a specific "
"manufacturing order (MO), select it in the :guilabel:`Manufacturing Order` "
"field."
msgstr ""
"Agar qismlarga ajratilayotgan mahsulot dastlab muayyan ishlab chiqarish "
"buyurtmasi (MO) doirasida ishlab chiqarilgan bo'lsa, "
"uni :guilabel:`Manufacturing Order` maydonida tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:36
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Source Location` field, select the location where the "
"product being unbuilt is currently stored."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Source Location` maydonida qismlarga ajratilayotgan mahsulot "
"hozirda saqlanayotgan joyni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:39
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Destination Location` field, select the location where the "
"reclaimed components are stored after the unbuild order is completed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Destination Location` maydonida qismlarga ajratish buyurtmasi "
"bajarilgandan so'ng qaytarib olingan komponentlar saqlanadigan joyni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:42
msgid ""
"If the *Lots & Serial Numbers* feature is enabled in the settings of the "
"*Inventory* app, a :guilabel:`Lot/Serial Number` field appears on the "
"unbuild order, which can be used to specify the lot(s) or serial number(s) "
"of the product being unbuilt, if any are assigned."
msgstr ""
"Agar *Inventory* ilovasi sozlamalarida *Lots & Serial Numbers* funksiyasi "
"yoqilgan bo'lsa, qismlarga ajratish buyurtmasida :guilabel:`Lot/Serial "
"Number` maydoni paydo bo'ladi. Undan qismlarga ajratilayotgan mahsulotning "
"partiyasi (lot) yoki seriya raqam(lar)ini, agar ular biriktirilgan bo'lsa, "
"belgilash uchun foydalanish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:46
msgid ""
"If the Odoo database has been configured with multiple companies, "
"a :guilabel:`Company` field appears on the unbuild order, which can be used "
"to specify the company that owns the product being unbuilt."
msgstr ""
"Agar Odoo ma'lumotlar bazasi bir nechta kompaniya bilan sozlangan bo'lsa, "
"qismlarga ajratish buyurtmasida :guilabel:`Company` maydoni paydo bo'ladi. "
"Undan qismlarga ajratilayotgan mahsulot egasi bo'lgan kompaniyani belgilash "
"uchun foydalanish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:50
msgid ""
"Finally, once the product has been unbuilt, click the :guilabel:`Unbuild` "
"button at the top of the order to confirm that it has been completed."
msgstr ""
"Nihoyat, mahsulot qismlarga ajratilgach, buyurtma bajarilganini tasdiqlash "
"uchun buyurtmaning yuqori qismidagi :guilabel:`Unbuild` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:None
msgid "A filled-out unbuild order."
msgstr "To'ldirilgan qismlarga ajratish buyurtmasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:58
msgid ""
"While it is possible to create unbuild orders for products that have zero "
"(or fewer) units on-hand, this is not advised, since it can lead to "
"inventory inconsistencies."
msgstr ""
"Mavjud birliklari nol (yoki undan kam) bo'lgan mahsulotlar uchun qismlarga "
"ajratish buyurtmalarini yaratish mumkin bo'lsa-da, bu tavsiya etilmaydi, "
"chunki bu zaxira nomuvofiqliklariga olib kelishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:61
msgid ""
"If an unbuild order is created for a product with zero (or fewer) units on-"
"hand, a pop-up window appears, warning the user that there is an "
"insufficient quantity to unbuild."
msgstr ""
"Agar mavjud birliklari nol (yoki undan kam) bo'lgan mahsulot uchun qismlarga "
"ajratish buyurtmasi yaratilsa, qalqib chiquvchi oyna paydo bo'lib, "
"foydalanuvchini qismlarga ajratish uchun miqdor yetarli emasligi haqida "
"ogohlantiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:64
msgid ""
"To ignore the warning, and proceed with the unbuild order, "
"click :guilabel:`Confirm` at the bottom of the pop-up window. To return to "
"the unconfirmed unbuild order, click :guilabel:`Discard`, instead."
msgstr ""
"Ogohlantirishni e'tiborsiz qoldirib, qismlarga ajratish buyurtmasini davom "
"ettirish uchun qalqib chiquvchi oynaning pastki "
"qismidagi :guilabel:`Confirm` tugmasini bosing. Tasdiqlanmagan qismlarga "
"ajratish buyurtmasiga qaytish uchun esa :guilabel:`Discard` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:0
msgid ""
"The insufficient quantity pop-up that appears after trying to confirm an "
"unbuild order\n"
"for a product with zero or fewer units on hand."
msgstr ""
"Mavjud birliklari nol yoki undan kam bo'lgan mahsulot uchun qismlarga "
"ajratish buyurtmasini\n"
"tasdiqlashga urinilgandan so'ng paydo bo'ladigan miqdor yetarli emasligi "
"haqidagi qalqib chiquvchi oyna."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:73
msgid ""
"After completing an unbuild order, inventory counts automatically update, "
"based on the quantity of products unbuilt, and the quantity of components "
"reclaimed."
msgstr ""
"Qismlarga ajratish buyurtmasi bajarilgandan so'ng, zaxira hisoblari "
"qismlarga ajratilgan mahsulotlar miqdori va qaytarib olingan komponentlar "
"miqdoriga asoslanib avtomatik yangilanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:77
msgid ""
"A `Coat Rack` product is comprised of one `Wooden Pole` component and six "
"`Wooden Dowel` components."
msgstr ""
"`Coat Rack` mahsuloti bitta `Wooden Pole` komponenti va oltita `Wooden "
"Dowel` komponentidan tashkil topgan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:80
msgid ""
"An unbuild order is created for one unit of the `Coat Rack`. Once the order "
"is completed, the on-hand quantity of `Coat Racks` decreases by one, while "
"the on-hand quantities of `Wooden Poles` and `Wooden Dowels` increase by one "
"and six, respectively."
msgstr ""
"Bir dona `Coat Rack` uchun qismlarga ajratish buyurtmasi yaratiladi. "
"Buyurtma bajarilgach, `Coat Racks` ning mavjud miqdori bittaga kamayadi, "
"`Wooden Poles` va `Wooden Dowels` ning mavjud miqdorlari esa mos ravishda "
"bittaga va oltitaga oshadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:85
msgid "Scrap unusable components"
msgstr "Yaroqsiz komponentlarni chiqitga chiqarish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/unbuild_orders.rst:87
msgid ""
"In some cases, components may be unusable after the unbuilding process is "
"completed. To ensure that inventory counts accurately reflect the quantity "
"of usable components on-hand, any component that can no longer be used "
"should be removed from inventory using a :doc:`scrap order <../../inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/inventory_management/scrap_inventory>`."
msgstr ""
"Ayrim hollarda qismlarga ajratish jarayoni tugagandan so'ng komponentlar "
"yaroqsiz bo'lib qolishi mumkin. Zaxira hisoblari mavjud yaroqli komponentlar "
"miqdorini aniq aks ettirishini ta'minlash uchun endi ishlatib bo'lmaydigan "
"har qanday komponent :doc:`chiqit buyurtmasi <../../inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/inventory_management/scrap_inventory>` yordamida "
"zaxiradan chiqarilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:16
msgid ""
"In Odoo's *Manufacturing* app, the *master production schedule* (MPS) is "
"used to manually plan manufacturing orders (MOs) and purchase orders (POs), "
"based on forecasted quantities of products and components."
msgstr ""
"Odoo'ning *Manufacturing* ilovasida *asosiy ishlab chiqarish jadvali* (MPS) "
"mahsulotlar va komponentlarning prognoz qilingan miqdorlariga asoslanib, "
"ishlab chiqarish buyurtmalari (MO) va xarid buyurtmalarini (PO) qo'lda "
"rejalashtirish uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:20
msgid ""
"By considering the impact of confirmed |MOs| and |POs|, along with manually "
"adjusted demand forecasts, the |MPS| can be used to manage long-term product "
"replenishment. This ensures the continued availability of the necessary "
"products and components."
msgstr ""
"Tasdiqlangan |MOs| va |POs| ta'sirini, shuningdek qo'lda o'zgartirilgan "
"talab prognozlarini hisobga olgan holda, |MPS| dan mahsulotlarni uzoq "
"muddatli to'ldirishni boshqarish uchun foydalanish mumkin. Bu zarur "
"mahsulotlar va komponentlarning doimiy mavjudligini ta'minlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:24
msgid ""
"Since the |MPS| allows for manual intervention, it is useful for "
"replenishing products where the demand of existing sales orders (SOs) does "
"**not** reflect probable future demand."
msgstr ""
"|MPS| qo'lda aralashuvga imkon bergani sababli, u mavjud sotuv buyurtmalari "
"(SO) talabi ehtimoliy kelajakdagi talabni aks ettirmaydigan mahsulotlarni "
"to'ldirish uchun **juda** foydalidir."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:28
msgid ""
"A retail store sells artificial *Christmas trees* during the holiday season. "
"It is currently September, and the store has less than ten Christmas tree |"
"MOs| confirmed for the month of December."
msgstr ""
"Chakana savdo do'koni bayram mavsumida sun'iy *archa daraxtlari*ni sotadi. "
"Hozir sentyabr oyi va do'konda dekabr oyi uchun tasdiqlangan o'ntadan kam "
"archa daraxti |MOs| mavjud."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:32
msgid ""
"Despite the number of confirmed |MOs|, the procurement manager knows that "
"the demand for Christmas trees in December is going to be much higher, once "
"the holiday season starts. As a result, they manually enter a greater demand "
"in the |MPS|, so they can properly replenish the product in time for the "
"increase in customer demand."
msgstr ""
"Tasdiqlangan |MOs| soniga qaramay, ta'minot menejeri bayram mavsumi "
"boshlanishi bilan dekabrda archa daraxtlariga bo'lgan talab ancha yuqori "
"bo'lishini biladi. Natijada, u |MPS| ga kattaroq talabni qo'lda kiritadi, "
"shunda mijozlar talabining oshishiga o'z vaqtida tayyorgarlik ko'rib, "
"mahsulotni to'g'ri to'ldirishi mumkin bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:38
msgid ""
"It is essential to remember that the |MPS| is a **MANUAL** tool. Adding a "
"product to the |MPS| does not cause it to be manufactured or purchased "
"automatically. The |MPS| simply suggests the amount of the product that "
"should be replenished, but requires user input to create the |MOs| or |POs| "
"that are used to replenish it."
msgstr ""
"|MPS| **QO'LDA** ishlatiladigan vosita ekanligini yodda tutish muhim. "
"Mahsulotni |MPS| ga qo'shish uning avtomatik ravishda ishlab chiqarilishi "
"yoki sotib olinishiga olib kelmaydi. |MPS| faqat to'ldirilishi kerak bo'lgan "
"mahsulot miqdorini taklif qiladi, lekin uni to'ldirish uchun ishlatiladigan |"
"MOs| yoki |POs| ni yaratish uchun foydalanuvchi kiritishini talab qiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:43
msgid ""
"For this reason, it is recommended that the |MPS| **NOT** be used alongside "
"reordering rules for the same product. Because reordering rules are an "
"automated workflow, they conflict with the manual replenishment method of |"
"MPS|. Using both, in unison, can lead to inaccurate forecasts and the "
"creation of unnecessary replenishment orders."
msgstr ""
"Shu sababli, |MPS| ni bir xil mahsulot uchun qayta buyurtma qoidalari bilan "
"birga **ISHLATMASLIK** tavsiya etiladi. Qayta buyurtma qoidalari "
"avtomatlashtirilgan ish jarayoni bo'lgani uchun, ular |MPS| ning qo'lda "
"to'ldirish usuli bilan ziddiyatga kirishadi. Ikkalasini birgalikda ishlatish "
"noaniq prognozlarga va keraksiz to'ldirish buyurtmalarining yaratilishiga "
"olib kelishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:49
msgid "Enable and configure |MPS|"
msgstr "|MPS| ni yoqish va sozlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:51
msgid ""
"To use the |MPS| feature, navigate to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, and tick the :guilabel:`Master Production "
"Schedule` checkbox in the :guilabel:`Planning` section. Finally, "
"click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"|MPS| funksiyasidan foydalanish uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings` yo'lidan o'ting va :guilabel:`Planning` "
"bo'limidagi :guilabel:`Master Production Schedule` katagini belgilang. "
"Nihoyat, :guilabel:`Save` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:55
msgid ""
"After enabling the :guilabel:`Master Production Schedule` feature, two new "
"fields appear under it on the :guilabel:`Settings` page: :guilabel:`Time "
"Range` and :guilabel:`Number of Columns`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Master Production Schedule` funksiyasi yoqilgandan "
"so'ng, :guilabel:`Settings` sahifasida uning ostida ikkita yangi maydon "
"paydo bo'ladi: :guilabel:`Time Range` va :guilabel:`Number of Columns`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:58
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Time Range` field is used to select the period of time over "
"which planning takes place, and offers three "
"options: :guilabel:`Monthly`, :guilabel:`Weekly`, and :guilabel:`Daily`. For "
"example, if :guilabel:`Monthly` is selected, the |MPS| plans the production "
"requirements of products and components on a monthly basis."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Time Range` maydoni rejalashtirish amalga oshiriladigan vaqt "
"davrini tanlash uchun ishlatiladi va uchta variantni taklif "
"qiladi: :guilabel:`Monthly`, :guilabel:`Weekly` va :guilabel:`Daily`. "
"Masalan, agar :guilabel:`Monthly` tanlansa, |MPS| mahsulotlar va "
"komponentlarning ishlab chiqarish talablarini oylik asosda rejalashtiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:63
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Number of Columns` field is used to specify the quantity of "
"the selected :guilabel:`Time Range` units shown on the |MPS| page. For "
"example, if the :guilabel:`Time Range` field is set to :guilabel:`Monthly`, "
"and `12` is entered in the :guilabel:`Number of Columns` field, the |MPS| "
"shows one column for the next 12 months, starting with the current month."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Number of Columns` maydoni |MPS| sahifasida ko'rsatiladigan "
"tanlangan :guilabel:`Time Range` birliklari sonini belgilash uchun "
"ishlatiladi. Masalan, agar :guilabel:`Time Range` "
"maydoni :guilabel:`Monthly` ga o'rnatilgan bo'lsa va :guilabel:`Number of "
"Columns` maydoniga `12` kiritilsa, |MPS| joriy oydan boshlab keyingi 12 oy "
"uchun bittadan ustun ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:68
msgid ""
"If the values of the :guilabel:`Time Range` or :guilabel:`Number of Columns` "
"fields are altered, click :guilabel:`Save` again to save the changes."
msgstr ""
"Agar :guilabel:`Time Range` yoki :guilabel:`Number of Columns` "
"maydonlarining qiymatlari o'zgartirilsa, o'zgarishlarni saqlash uchun "
"yana :guilabel:`Save` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:None
msgid "The MPS setting in the Manufacturing app's settings."
msgstr "Manufacturing ilovasi sozlamalaridagi MPS sozlamasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:75
msgid "|MPS| dashboard"
msgstr "|MPS| boshqaruv paneli"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:77
msgid ""
"To open the |MPS|, navigate to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> "
"Planning --> Master Production Schedule`. The |MPS| view appears as follows:"
msgstr ""
"|MPS| ni ochish uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Planning --> "
"Master Production Schedule` yo'lidan o'ting. |MPS| ko'rinishi quyidagicha "
"namoyon bo'ladi:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:None
msgid "The Master Production Schedule in the Manufacturing app."
msgstr "Manufacturing ilovasidagi asosiy ishlab chiqarish jadvali."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:83
msgid ""
"The grey column on the left side of the screen shows a section for every "
"product added to the |MPS|, with each product section being broken down into "
"smaller rows. The information shown in the rows depends on the filters "
"selected in the :guilabel:`Search...` bar drop-down menu at the top of the "
"page. The default categories that appear in the rows are:"
msgstr ""
"Ekranning chap tomonidagi kulrang ustun |MPS| ga qo'shilgan har bir mahsulot "
"uchun bo'limni ko'rsatadi, har bir mahsulot bo'limi esa kichikroq qatorlarga "
"bo'linadi. Qatorlarda ko'rsatiladigan ma'lumotlar sahifaning yuqori "
"qismidagi :guilabel:`Search...` paneli ochiluvchi menyusida tanlangan "
"filtrlarga bog'liq. Qatorlarda paydo bo'ladigan standart toifalar "
"quyidagilardir:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:88
msgid ""
":guilabel:`[Product] by [unit]` :icon:`fa-area-chart`: the forecasted stock "
"quantity at the beginning of each time period. :guilabel:`[Product]` "
"and :icon:`fa-area-chart` are selectable buttons which open the product's "
"page, or the forecast report for the product, respectively."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`[Product] by [unit]` :icon:`fa-area-chart`: har bir vaqt davri "
"boshidagi prognoz qilingan zaxira miqdori. :guilabel:`[Product]` "
"va :icon:`fa-area-chart` tanlanadigan tugmalar bo'lib, ular mos ravishda "
"mahsulot sahifasini yoki mahsulot uchun prognoz hisobotini ochadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:91
msgid ""
":guilabel:`- Forecasted Demand`: the demand forecast, which is entered "
"manually. This represents an estimate of the demand for the product during "
"each time period."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`- Forecasted Demand`: qo'lda kiritiladigan talab prognozi. Bu har "
"bir vaqt davri davomida mahsulotga bo'lgan talabning taxminiy bahosini "
"ifodalaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:93
msgid ""
":guilabel:`- Indirect Demand Forecast`: while this is a default category, it "
"**only** appears for products that are components of other products. It "
"represents the demand for the component from existing MOs."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`- Indirect Demand Forecast`: bu standart toifa bo'lsa-da, u "
"**faqat** boshqa mahsulotlarning komponentlari bo'lgan mahsulotlar uchun "
"paydo bo'ladi. U mavjud MO lardan komponentga bo'lgan talabni ifodalaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:96
msgid ""
":guilabel:`+ Suggested Replenishment`: the quantity of the product that is "
"suggested to be replenished through |MOs| or |POs|. To the right of the "
"category title is a :guilabel:`Replenish` button, which is used to manually "
"replenish the product, based on the quantity suggested to be replenished."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`+ Suggested Replenishment`: |MOs| yoki |POs| orqali to'ldirilishi "
"taklif qilinadigan mahsulot miqdori. Toifa sarlavhasining o'ng "
"tomonida :guilabel:`Replenish` tugmasi joylashgan bo'lib, u to'ldirilishi "
"taklif qilingan miqdorga asoslanib mahsulotni qo'lda to'ldirish uchun "
"ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:0
msgid "The Replenish button on the \"+ Suggested Replenishment\" row."
msgstr "\"+ Suggested Replenishment\" qatoridagi Replenish tugmasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:104
msgid "The \"Replenish\" button on the \"+ Suggested Replenishment\" row."
msgstr "\"+ Suggested Replenishment\" qatoridagi \"Replenish\" tugmasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:106
msgid ""
":guilabel:`= Forecasted Stock`: the quantity of the product forecasted to be "
"in stock at the end of each time period, assuming that suggested "
"replenishment numbers are fulfilled."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`= Forecasted Stock`: taklif qilingan to'ldirish raqamlari "
"bajariladi deb hisoblaganda, har bir vaqt davri oxirida zaxirada bo'lishi "
"prognoz qilingan mahsulot miqdori."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:109
msgid "Altogether, these default categories form an equation:"
msgstr "Umuman olganda, ushbu standart toifalar tenglamani hosil qiladi:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:111
msgid ""
"\\text{Forecasted Demand} + \\text{Suggested Replenishment} = "
"\\text{Forecasted Stock}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\text{Forecasted Demand} + \\text{Suggested Replenishment} = "
"\\text{Forecasted Stock}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:114
msgid ""
"In the case of components, the :guilabel:`Indirect Demand Forecast` is taken "
"into account as well."
msgstr ""
"Komponentlar holatida :guilabel:`Indirect Demand Forecast` ham hisobga "
"olinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:116
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`- Forecasted Demand` and :guilabel:`+ Suggested "
"Replenishment` fields can be edited for any of the time periods to the right "
"of the product column. Doing so changes the equation, and updates the value "
"displayed in the :guilabel:`Forecasted Stock` field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`- Forecasted Demand` va :guilabel:`+ Suggested Replenishment` "
"maydonlarini mahsulot ustunining o'ng tomonidagi istalgan vaqt davri uchun "
"tahrirlash mumkin. Bu tenglamani o'zgartiradi va :guilabel:`Forecasted "
"Stock` maydonida ko'rsatilgan qiymatni yangilaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:120
msgid ""
"Changing the value in the :guilabel:`+ Suggested Replenishment` field also "
"makes an :icon:`fa-times` :guilabel:`(reset)` button appear to the left of "
"the field. Click the :icon:`fa-times` :guilabel:`(reset)` button next to the "
"field to reset its value back to the one calculated by the |MPS|."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`+ Suggested Replenishment` maydonidagi qiymatni o'zgartirish "
"maydonning chap tomonida :icon:`fa-times` :guilabel:`(reset)` tugmasining "
"paydo bo'lishiga ham olib keladi. Maydon qiymatini |MPS| tomonidan "
"hisoblangan qiymatga qaytarish uchun maydon yonidagi :icon:`fa-"
"times` :guilabel:`(reset)` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:126
msgid ""
"While the |MPS| can be used with only the default categories enabled, it is "
"advisable to also enable the :guilabel:`Actual Demand` category. This is "
"done by clicking the :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(down arrow)` on the "
"right side of the :guilabel:`Search...` bar, and enabling "
"the :guilabel:`Actual Demand` option under the :guilabel:`Rows` header."
msgstr ""
"|MPS| dan faqat standart toifalar yoqilgan holda foydalanish mumkin bo'lsa-"
"da, :guilabel:`Actual Demand` toifasini ham yoqish tavsiya etiladi. Buning "
"uchun :guilabel:`Search...` panelining o'ng tomonidagi :icon:`fa-caret-"
"down` :guilabel:`(down arrow)` tugmasini bosing va :guilabel:`Rows` "
"sarlavhasi ostidagi :guilabel:`Actual Demand` variantini yoqing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:131
msgid ""
"With the :guilabel:`Actual Demand` option enabled, the :guilabel:`- "
"Forecasted Demand` category changes to the :guilabel:`- Actual / Forecasted "
"Demand` category. In addition to the manually entered forecasted demand, "
"this category also displays the confirmed demand for the product, which is "
"based on confirmed |SOs|."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Actual Demand` varianti yoqilganda, :guilabel:`- Forecasted "
"Demand` toifasi :guilabel:`- Actual / Forecasted Demand` toifasiga "
"o'zgaradi. Qo'lda kiritilgan prognoz qilingan talabdan tashqari, ushbu toifa "
"tasdiqlangan |SOs| ga asoslangan mahsulotga bo'lgan tasdiqlangan talabni ham "
"ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:136
msgid ""
"Each column to the right of the products column lists one unit of the time "
"period selected in the *Time Range* field on the *Manufacturing* app "
"*Settings* page (ex. months). The number of time period columns corresponds "
"to the value entered in the *Number of Columns* field."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulotlar ustunining o'ng tomonidagi har bir ustun *Manufacturing* "
"ilovasining *Settings* sahifasidagi *Time Range* maydonida tanlangan vaqt "
"davrining bitta birligini ko'rsatadi (masalan, oylar). Vaqt davri "
"ustunlarining soni *Number of Columns* maydoniga kiritilgan qiymatga mos "
"keladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:140
msgid ""
"The first time period column represents the current time period. For "
"example, if the |MPS| is configured to use months, the first column displays "
"data for the current month. On this first column, the :guilabel:`+ Suggested "
"Replenishment` field appears in one of five colors:"
msgstr ""
"Birinchi vaqt davri ustuni joriy vaqt davrini ifodalaydi. Masalan, agar |"
"MPS| oylardan foydalanishga sozlangan bo'lsa, birinchi ustunda joriy oy "
"uchun ma'lumotlar ko'rsatiladi. Ushbu birinchi ustunda :guilabel:`+ "
"Suggested Replenishment` maydoni besh rangdan birida ko'rinadi:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:144
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Green`: a replenishment order must be generated to keep stock at "
"the :guilabel:`Safety Stock Target`, based on the configured :doc:`lead "
"times <../../inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Green`: sozlangan :doc:`yetkazib berish muddatlari <../../"
"inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times>` asosida "
"zaxirani :guilabel:`Safety Stock Target` darajasida saqlash uchun to'ldirish "
"buyurtmasi yaratilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:147
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Gray`: a replenishment order has already been generated to keep "
"stock at the :guilabel:`Safety Stock Target`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Gray`: zaxirani :guilabel:`Safety Stock Target` darajasida "
"saqlash uchun to'ldirish buyurtmasi allaqachon yaratilgan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:149
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Orange`: a replenishment order has already been generated, but "
"the quantity it was created for is not enough to keep stock at "
"the :guilabel:`Safety Stock Target`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Orange`: to'ldirish buyurtmasi allaqachon yaratilgan, ammo u "
"yaratilgan miqdor zaxirani :guilabel:`Safety Stock Target` darajasida "
"saqlash uchun yetarli emas."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:151
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Red`: a replenishment order has already been generated, but the "
"quantity it was created for puts the amount of stock above "
"the :guilabel:`Safety Stock Target`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Red`: to'ldirish buyurtmasi allaqachon yaratilgan, ammo u "
"yaratilgan miqdor zaxira hajmini :guilabel:`Safety Stock Target` darajasidan "
"yuqoriga chiqaradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:154
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`+ Suggested Replenishment` field appears white, if no "
"replenishment order has been generated, and it is not necessary to generate "
"one at the current moment."
msgstr ""
"Agar hech qanday to'ldirish buyurtmasi yaratilmagan bo'lsa va hozirgi vaqtda "
"uni yaratish shart bo'lmasa, :guilabel:`+ Suggested Replenishment` maydoni "
"oq rangda ko'rinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:158
msgid "Add a product"
msgstr "Mahsulot qo'shish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:160
msgid ""
"To use |MPS| to manage the replenishment of a product, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Planning --> Master Production "
"Schedule`. At the top of the |MPS| page, click :guilabel:`Add a Product` to "
"open the :guilabel:`Add a Product` pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulotni to'ldirishni boshqarish uchun |MPS| dan foydalanish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Planning --> Master Production "
"Schedule` yo'lidan o'ting. |MPS| sahifasining yuqori qismida :guilabel:`Add "
"a Product` qalqib chiquvchi oynasini ochish uchun :guilabel:`Add a Product` "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:165
msgid ""
"Products **must** be properly configured to be replenished through the |MPS|."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulotlar |MPS| orqali to'ldirilishi uchun to'g'ri sozlangan bo'lishi "
"**shart**."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:167
msgid ""
"In the case of manufactured products, the *Manufacture* route must be "
"selected in the *Routes* section of the *Inventory* tab, on the product's "
"form."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqariladigan mahsulotlar uchun mahsulot formasidagi *Inventory* "
"varag'ining *Routes* bo'limida *Manufacture* marshruti tanlangan bo'lishi "
"kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:170
msgid ""
"In the case of products that are purchased, the *Buy* route must be selected "
"in the *Routes* section of the *Inventory* tab, on the product's form. "
"Additionally, a vendor and the price they sell the product for must also be "
"specified on the *Purchase* tab."
msgstr ""
"Xarid qilinadigan mahsulotlar uchun mahsulot formasidagi *Inventory* "
"varag'ining *Routes* bo'limida *Buy* marshruti tanlangan bo'lishi kerak. "
"Bundan tashqari, *Purchase* varag'ida yetkazib beruvchi va u mahsulotni "
"sotadigan narx ham ko'rsatilgan bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:174
msgid ""
"On the pop-up window, select the product to add in the :guilabel:`Product` "
"drop-down menu. If the product is replenished through manufacturing, select "
"the product's |BoM| in the :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` field."
msgstr ""
"Qalqib chiquvchi oynada :guilabel:`Product` ochiluvchi menyusidan "
"qo'shiladigan mahsulotni tanlang. Agar mahsulot ishlab chiqarish orqali "
"to'ldirilsa, :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` maydonida mahsulotning |BoM| ni "
"tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:179
msgid ""
"Selecting a BoM when adding a product to the |MPS| also adds any components "
"listed on the BoM. If it is not necessary to manage the replenishment of "
"components through the |MPS|, simply leave the :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` "
"field blank."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulotni |MPS| ga qo'shishda BoM ni tanlash BoM da ko'rsatilgan barcha "
"komponentlarni ham qo'shadi. Agar komponentlarni to'ldirishni |MPS| orqali "
"boshqarish shart bo'lmasa, :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` maydonini shunchaki "
"bo'sh qoldiring."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:183
msgid ""
"If the database is configured with multiple warehouses, "
"a :guilabel:`Production Warehouse` field appears on the :guilabel:`Add a "
"Product` pop-up window. Use this field to specify which warehouse the "
"product is replenished to."
msgstr ""
"Agar ma'lumotlar bazasi bir nechta omborlar bilan sozlangan "
"bo'lsa, :guilabel:`Add a Product` qalqib chiquvchi "
"oynasida :guilabel:`Production Warehouse` maydoni paydo bo'ladi. Mahsulot "
"qaysi omborga to'ldirilishini ko'rsatish uchun ushbu maydondan foydalaning."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:187
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Safety Stock Target` field, specify the minimum quantity "
"of the product that should be kept available for orders at all times. For "
"example, if there should always be 20 units of the product available for "
"order fulfillment, enter `20` in the :guilabel:`Safety Stock Target` field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Safety Stock Target` maydonida har doim buyurtmalar uchun mavjud "
"bo'lishi kerak bo'lgan mahsulotning minimal miqdorini ko'rsating. Masalan, "
"agar buyurtmalarni bajarish uchun har doim mahsulotning 20 birligi mavjud "
"bo'lishi kerak bo'lsa, :guilabel:`Safety Stock Target` maydoniga `20` "
"kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:192
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Minimum to Replenish` field, enter the minimum product "
"quantity for orders created to replenish the product. For example, if `5` is "
"entered in this field, replenishment orders for the product include a "
"minimum of five units."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Minimum to Replenish` maydoniga mahsulotni to'ldirish uchun "
"yaratiladigan buyurtmalar uchun minimal mahsulot miqdorini kiriting. "
"Masalan, agar ushbu maydonga `5` kiritilsa, mahsulot uchun to'ldirish "
"buyurtmalari kamida besh birlikni o'z ichiga oladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:196
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Maximum to Replenish` field, enter the maximum product "
"quantity for orders created to replenish the product. For example, if `100` "
"is entered in this field, replenishment orders for the product include a "
"maximum of 100 units."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Maximum to Replenish` maydoniga mahsulotni to'ldirish uchun "
"yaratiladigan buyurtmalar uchun maksimal mahsulot miqdorini kiriting. "
"Masalan, agar ushbu maydonga `100` kiritilsa, mahsulot uchun to'ldirish "
"buyurtmalari ko'pi bilan 100 birlikni o'z ichiga oladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:200
msgid ""
"Finally, click :guilabel:`Save` to add the product to the |MPS|. The product "
"now appears on the |MPS| page each time it is opened. If a |BoM| was "
"selected in the :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` field of the :guilabel:`Add a "
"Product` pop-up window, any components listed on the |BoM| appear on the "
"page, as well."
msgstr ""
"Nihoyat, mahsulotni |MPS| ga qo'shish uchun :guilabel:`Save` tugmasini "
"bosing. Endi mahsulot |MPS| sahifasi har safar ochilganda ko'rinadi. "
"Agar :guilabel:`Add a Product` qalqib chiquvchi oynasining :guilabel:`Bill "
"of Materials` maydonida |BoM| tanlangan bo'lsa, |BoM| da ko'rsatilgan barcha "
"komponentlar ham sahifada ko'rinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:None
msgid "The Add a Product pop-up window in the MPS."
msgstr "MPS dagi Add a Product qalqib chiquvchi oynasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:209
msgid "Edit a product"
msgstr "Mahsulotni tahrirlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:211
msgid ""
"After adding a product to the |MPS|, it may be necessary to change the "
"replenishment values entered on the :guilabel:`Add a Product` pop-up window. "
"To do so, click the :guilabel:`# ≤…≤ #` button to the immediate right of "
"the :guilabel:`Replenish` button, on the :guilabel:`+ Suggested "
"Replenishment` row, below the product's name."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulotni |MPS| ga qo'shgandan so'ng, :guilabel:`Add a Product` qalqib "
"chiquvchi oynasida kiritilgan to'ldirish qiymatlarini o'zgartirish kerak "
"bo'lishi mumkin. Buning uchun mahsulot nomi ostidagi :guilabel:`+ Suggested "
"Replenishment` qatorida, :guilabel:`Replenish` tugmasining bevosita o'ng "
"tomonidagi :guilabel:`# ≤…≤ #` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:217
msgid ""
"The first and second number displayed on the :guilabel:`# ≤…≤ #` button "
"correspond to the values entered in the :guilabel:`Minimum to Replenish` "
"and :guilabel:`Maximum to Replenish` fields when adding the product to the |"
"MPS|."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`# ≤…≤ #` tugmasida ko'rsatilgan birinchi va ikkinchi raqam "
"mahsulotni |MPS| ga qo'shishda :guilabel:`Minimum to Replenish` "
"va :guilabel:`Maximum to Replenish` maydonlariga kiritilgan qiymatlarga mos "
"keladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:221
msgid ""
"For example, if `5` was entered in the :guilabel:`Minimum to Replenish` "
"field, and `100` was entered in the :guilabel:`Maximum to Replenish` field, "
"the button appears as :guilabel:`5 ≤…≤ 100`."
msgstr ""
"Masalan, agar :guilabel:`Minimum to Replenish` maydoniga `5` "
"va :guilabel:`Maximum to Replenish` maydoniga `100` kiritilgan bo'lsa, "
"tugma :guilabel:`5 ≤…≤ 100` ko'rinishida ko'rinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:225
msgid ""
"Clicking the :guilabel:`# ≤…≤ #` button opens the :guilabel:`Edit Production "
"Schedule` pop-up window. This pop-up window is the same as "
"the :guilabel:`Add a Product` pop-up window, except that "
"the :guilabel:`Product` and :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` fields cannot be "
"edited."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`# ≤…≤ #` tugmasini bosish :guilabel:`Edit Production Schedule` "
"qalqib chiquvchi oynasini ochadi. Ushbu qalqib chiquvchi oyna :guilabel:`Add "
"a Product` qalqib chiquvchi oynasi bilan bir xil, faqat :guilabel:`Product` "
"va :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` maydonlarini tahrirlab bo'lmaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:229
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Edit Production Schedule` pop-up window, enter the desired "
"values in the :guilabel:`Safety Stock Target`, :guilabel:`Minimum to "
"Replenish`, and :guilabel:`Maximum to Replenish` fields. Then, "
"click :guilabel:`Save` to save the changes."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Edit Production Schedule` qalqib chiquvchi "
"oynasida :guilabel:`Safety Stock Target`, :guilabel:`Minimum to Replenish` "
"va :guilabel:`Maximum to Replenish` maydonlariga kerakli qiymatlarni "
"kiriting. Keyin o'zgarishlarni saqlash uchun :guilabel:`Save` tugmasini "
"bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:234
msgid "Remove a product"
msgstr "Mahsulotni olib tashlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:236
msgid ""
"To remove a product from the |MPS|, tick the checkbox to the left of its "
"name. Then, click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions` button at the top "
"of the screen, and select :guilabel:`Delete` from the resulting drop-down "
"menu. Finally, click :guilabel:`Ok` on the :guilabel:`Confirmation` pop-up "
"window."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulotni |MPS| dan olib tashlash uchun uning nomi chap tomonidagi "
"belgilash katagini belgilang. Keyin ekranning yuqori qismidagi :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`Actions` tugmasini bosing va ochilgan ochiluvchi "
"menyudan :guilabel:`Delete` ni tanlang. Nihoyat, :guilabel:`Confirmation` "
"qalqib chiquvchi oynasida :guilabel:`Ok` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:241
msgid ""
"Deleting a product from the |MPS| removes it, along with all of its data. If "
"the product is re-added, its replenishment values must be reconfigured."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulotni |MPS| dan o'chirish uni barcha ma'lumotlari bilan birga olib "
"tashlaydi. Agar mahsulot qayta qo'shilsa, uning to'ldirish qiymatlari qayta "
"sozlanishi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:245
msgid "|MPS| replenishment"
msgstr "|MPS| orqali to'ldirish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:247
msgid "Products in the |MPS| can be replenished in one of three ways:"
msgstr "|MPS| dagi mahsulotlarni uch usuldan biri bilan to'ldirish mumkin:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:249
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Replenish` button at the top of the screen to generate "
"replenishment orders for every product below its :guilabel:`Safety Stock "
"Target` for the current month."
msgstr ""
"Joriy oy uchun :guilabel:`Safety Stock Target` darajasidan past bo'lgan har "
"bir mahsulot uchun to'ldirish buyurtmalarini yaratish uchun ekranning yuqori "
"qismidagi :guilabel:`Replenish` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:251
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Replenish` button on the right side of the :guilabel:`+ "
"Suggested Replenishment` row of a specific product, to generate a "
"replenishment order for that specific product."
msgstr ""
"Muayyan mahsulot uchun to'ldirish buyurtmasini yaratish uchun o'sha "
"mahsulotning :guilabel:`+ Suggested Replenishment` qatorining o'ng "
"tomonidagi :guilabel:`Replenish` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:254
msgid ""
"Tick the checkbox to the left of the product name of one or more products. "
"Then, click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions` button at the top of the "
"screen, and select :guilabel:`Replenish` from the resulting drop-down menu. "
"Doing so generates a replenishment order for each selected product."
msgstr ""
"Bir yoki bir nechta mahsulot nomining chap tomonidagi belgilash katagini "
"belgilang. Keyin ekranning yuqori qismidagi :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`Actions` tugmasini bosing va ochilgan ochiluvchi "
"menyudan :guilabel:`Replenish` ni tanlang. Shunday qilinganda har bir "
"tanlangan mahsulot uchun to'ldirish buyurtmasi yaratiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:259
msgid ""
"The type of replenishment order generated corresponds to the route selected "
"on the *Inventory* tab of the product's form:"
msgstr ""
"Yaratilgan to'ldirish buyurtmasining turi mahsulot formasining *Inventory* "
"varag'ida tanlangan marshrutga mos keladi:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:262
msgid ""
"If the *Buy* route is selected, an |RfQ| is generated to replenish the "
"product. |RfQs| can be selected by navigating to "
"the :menuselection:`Purchase` app. Any |RfQ| generated by the |MPS| "
"lists :guilabel:`MPS` in its :guilabel:`Source Document` field."
msgstr ""
"Agar *Buy* marshruti tanlangan bo'lsa, mahsulotni to'ldirish uchun |RfQ| "
"yaratiladi. |RfQs| ni :menuselection:`Purchase` ilovasiga o'tish orqali "
"tanlash mumkin. |MPS| tomonidan yaratilgan har qanday |RfQ| "
"ning :guilabel:`Source Document` maydonida :guilabel:`MPS` ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:265
msgid ""
"If the *Manufacture* route is selected, an |MO| is generated to replenish "
"the product. |MOs| can be selected by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Operations --> Manufacturing "
"Orders`. Any |MO| generated by the |MPS| lists :guilabel:`MPS` in "
"its :guilabel:`Source Document` field."
msgstr ""
"Agar *Manufacture* marshruti tanlangan bo'lsa, mahsulotni to'ldirish uchun |"
"MO| yaratiladi. |MOs| ni :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Operations --"
"> Manufacturing Orders` yo'lidan o'tish orqali tanlash mumkin. |MPS| "
"tomonidan yaratilgan har qanday |MO| ning :guilabel:`Source Document` "
"maydonida :guilabel:`MPS` ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:3
msgid "Work center time off"
msgstr "Ish markazining ishlamaydigan vaqti"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:7
msgid ""
"In Odoo, *work centers* are used to carry out manufacturing operations at "
"specific locations. However, if a work center cannot be used for some "
"reason, work orders begin to pile up at the work center until it is "
"operational again."
msgstr ""
"Odoo da *ish markazlari* muayyan joylarda ishlab chiqarish operatsiyalarini "
"bajarish uchun ishlatiladi. Biroq, agar ish markazidan biror sababga ko'ra "
"foydalanib bo'lmasa, ish buyurtmalari u yana ishga tushguncha ish markazida "
"to'plana boshlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:11
msgid ""
"As a result, it is necessary to make the work center unavailable in Odoo so "
"new work orders are routed to alternative work centers that are operational. "
"Using Odoo's **Time Off** app, it is possible to designate a work center as "
"being unavailable for a set period of time. Doing so ensures manufacturing "
"operations can continue until the impacted work center is available again."
msgstr ""
"Natijada, yangi ish buyurtmalari ishlayotgan muqobil ish markazlariga "
"yo'naltirilishi uchun Odoo da ish markazini mavjud emas deb belgilash zarur. "
"Odoo ning **Time Off** ilovasidan foydalanib, ish markazini belgilangan vaqt "
"davomida mavjud emas deb belgilash mumkin. Shunday qilinganda ta'sirlangan "
"ish markazi yana mavjud bo'lguncha ishlab chiqarish operatsiyalari davom "
"etishi ta'minlanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:19
msgid ""
"Before a work center can be designated as unavailable, the Odoo platform "
"must be properly configured. First, it is necessary to "
"enable :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`. This allows the *Time Off* "
"smart button to appear on each work center's *Working Hours* page."
msgstr ""
"Ish markazini mavjud emas deb belgilashdan oldin, Odoo platformasi to'g'ri "
"sozlangan bo'lishi kerak. Avvalo, :ref:`dasturchi rejimini <developer-mode>` "
"yoqish zarur. Bu *Time Off* aqlli tugmasining har bir ish markazining "
"*Working Hours* sahifasida paydo bo'lishini ta'minlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:23
msgid ""
"Next, install the **Time Off** app. This is the app used for managing time "
"off for all resources within Odoo, including employees and work centers."
msgstr ""
"Keyin **Time Off** ilovasini o'rnating. Bu Odoo dagi barcha resurslar, "
"jumladan xodimlar va ish markazlari uchun ishlamaydigan vaqtni boshqarishda "
"ishlatiladigan ilova."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:26
msgid ""
"To do so, navigate to the :menuselection:`Apps` app, then search `Time Off` "
"in the search bar. The card for the :guilabel:`Time Off` app should be the "
"only one that appears on the page. Click the :guilabel:`Install` button on "
"the card to install the app."
msgstr ""
"Buning uchun :menuselection:`Apps` ilovasiga o'ting, so'ngra qidiruv "
"panelida `Time Off` ni qidiring. Sahifada faqat :guilabel:`Time Off` "
"ilovasining kartasi ko'rinishi kerak. Ilovani o'rnatish uchun "
"kartadagi :guilabel:`Install` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:30
msgid ""
"The last step is to properly configure work centers. For this workflow, it "
"is necessary to have at least two work centers: one that is made "
"unavailable, and a second that receives the work orders that the other "
"cannot accept. If no second work center is configured, Odoo cannot route "
"work orders away from the unavailable work center, and they pile up in its "
"queue."
msgstr ""
"Oxirgi qadam — ish markazlarini to'g'ri sozlash. Ushbu ish jarayoni uchun "
"kamida ikkita ish markazi bo'lishi zarur: biri mavjud emas deb "
"belgilanadigan, ikkinchisi esa boshqasi qabul qila olmaydigan ish "
"buyurtmalarini qabul qiladigan. Agar ikkinchi ish markazi sozlanmagan "
"bo'lsa, Odoo ish buyurtmalarini mavjud bo'lmagan ish markazidan boshqa "
"yo'nalishga yo'naltira olmaydi va ular uning navbatida to'planib qoladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:35
msgid ""
"To create a work center, navigate to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> "
"Configuration --> Work Centers --> New`."
msgstr ""
"Ish markazini yaratish uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> "
"Configuration --> Work Centers --> New` yo'lidan o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:39
msgid ""
"For a full guide to work center creation, refer to the documentation "
"on :doc:`work centers <../advanced_configuration/using_work_centers>`."
msgstr ""
"Ish markazini yaratish bo'yicha to'liq qo'llanma uchun :doc:`ish markazlari "
"<../advanced_configuration/using_work_centers>` hujjatlariga murojaat qiling."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:42
msgid ""
"Make sure both work centers have the same equipment listed under "
"the :guilabel:`Equipment` tab. This ensures operations carried out at one "
"work center can also be performed at the other."
msgstr ""
"Ikkala ish markazining :guilabel:`Equipment` varag'ida bir xil uskunalar "
"ro'yxati borligiga ishonch hosil qiling. Bu bitta ish markazida "
"bajariladigan operatsiyalarni ikkinchisida ham bajarish mumkinligini "
"ta'minlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:45
msgid ""
"On the work center that is made unavailable, select the second work center "
"from the :guilabel:`Alternative Workcenters` drop-down menu. Now, Odoo knows "
"to send work orders to the second work center when the first is unavailable "
"for any reason."
msgstr ""
"Mavjud emas deb belgilanadigan ish markazida :guilabel:`Alternative "
"Workcenters` ochiluvchi menyusidan ikkinchi ish markazini tanlang. Endi Odoo "
"birinchisi biror sababga ko'ra mavjud bo'lmaganda ish buyurtmalarini "
"ikkinchi ish markaziga yuborishni biladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:None
msgid "A work center form configured with an alternative work center."
msgstr "Muqobil ish markazi bilan sozlangan ish markazi formasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:54
msgid "Add time off for a work center"
msgstr "Ish markazi uchun ishlamaydigan vaqt qo'shish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:56
msgid ""
"With configuration completed, time off can now be assigned to a work center. "
"Begin by navigating to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --"
"> Work Centers`, and selecting the affected work center. Click the :icon:`oi-"
"arrow-right` :guilabel:`(Internal link)` button on the right side of "
"the :guilabel:`Working Hours` drop-down menu, to open the working hours page "
"for the work center."
msgstr ""
"Sozlash tugallangach, endi ish markaziga ishlamaydigan vaqtni tayinlash "
"mumkin. :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --> Work "
"Centers` yo'lidan o'tib, ta'sirlangan ish markazini tanlashdan boshlang. Ish "
"markazining ish soatlari sahifasini ochish uchun :guilabel:`Working Hours` "
"ochiluvchi menyusining o'ng tomonidagi :icon:`oi-arrow-"
"right` :guilabel:`(Internal link)` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:None
msgid "The Working Hours \"External link\" button on the work center form."
msgstr "Ish markazi formasidagi Working Hours \"External link\" tugmasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:65
msgid ""
"The working hours page displays the standard working hours for the work "
"center. With developer mode activated, a :icon:`fa-plane` :guilabel:`Time "
"Off` smart button appears at the top of the page. Click it to open "
"the :guilabel:`Resource Time Off` page."
msgstr ""
"Ish soatlari sahifasida ish markazining standart ish soatlari ko'rsatiladi. "
"Dasturchi rejimi yoqilgan holda sahifaning yuqori qismida :icon:`fa-"
"plane` :guilabel:`Time Off` aqlli tugmasi paydo bo'ladi. :guilabel:`Resource "
"Time Off` sahifasini ochish uchun uni bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:69
msgid ""
"On this page, click :guilabel:`New` to configure a new time-off entry. On "
"the time-off form, note the :guilabel:`Reason` for the work center closure "
"(e.g. broken equipment, maintenance, etc.), select the affected work center "
"as the :guilabel:`Resource`, and choose a :guilabel:`Start Date` "
"and :guilabel:`End Date` to specify the period during which the work center "
"is unavailable."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu sahifada yangi ishlamaydigan vaqt yozuvini sozlash "
"uchun :guilabel:`New` tugmasini bosing. Ishlamaydigan vaqt formasida ish "
"markazining yopilish :guilabel:`Reason` ini qayd eting (masalan, buzilgan "
"uskuna, texnik xizmat va h.k.), ta'sirlangan ish "
"markazini :guilabel:`Resource` sifatida tanlang hamda ish markazi mavjud "
"bo'lmaydigan davrni belgilash uchun :guilabel:`Start Date` va :guilabel:`End "
"Date` ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:None
msgid "The \"Resource Time Off\" form."
msgstr "\"Resource Time Off\" formasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:79
msgid "Alternative work center planning"
msgstr "Muqobil ish markazini rejalashtirish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:81
msgid ""
"Once a work center is within its specified time-off period, work orders sent "
"to it can be automatically routed to an alternative work center using the "
"*Plan* button."
msgstr ""
"Ish markazi belgilangan ishlamaydigan vaqt davrida bo'lganda, unga "
"yuborilgan ish buyurtmalarini *Plan* tugmasi yordamida avtomatik ravishda "
"muqobil ish markaziga yo'naltirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:84
msgid ""
"Begin by creating a new manufacturing order (MO), by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders "
"--> New`. On the |MO| form, specify a :guilabel:`Product` that uses the "
"unavailable work center for one of its operations. Click :guilabel:`Confirm` "
"to confirm the |MO|."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders --"
"> New` yo'lidan o'tib, yangi ishlab chiqarish buyurtmasini (MO) yaratishdan "
"boshlang. |MO| formasida operatsiyalaridan biri uchun mavjud bo'lmagan ish "
"markazidan foydalanadigan :guilabel:`Product` ni ko'rsating. |MO| ni "
"tasdiqlash uchun :guilabel:`Confirm` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:89
msgid ""
"On the confirmed |MO|, select the :guilabel:`Work Orders` tab. By default, "
"the unavailable work center is specified in the :guilabel:`Work Center` "
"column. There is also a :guilabel:`Plan` button at the top left of the page."
msgstr ""
"Tasdiqlangan |MO| da :guilabel:`Work Orders` varag'ini tanlang. Standart "
"holatda mavjud bo'lmagan ish markazi :guilabel:`Work Center` ustunida "
"ko'rsatilgan. Shuningdek, sahifaning yuqori chap qismida :guilabel:`Plan` "
"tugmasi ham mavjud."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:93
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Plan`, and the work center listed in the :guilabel:`Work "
"Center` column of the :guilabel:`Work Orders` tab is automatically changed "
"to the alternative work center."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Plan` tugmasini bosing, shunda :guilabel:`Work Orders` "
"varag'ining :guilabel:`Work Center` ustunida ko'rsatilgan ish markazi "
"avtomatik ravishda muqobil ish markaziga o'zgartiriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:100
msgid ""
"Before clicking \"Plan\", the work order is scheduled at \"Main Assembly "
"Line\"."
msgstr ""
"\"Plan\" tugmasi bosilishidan oldin ish buyurtmasi \"Main Assembly Line\" da "
"rejalashtirilgan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:100
msgid ""
"Before clicking :guilabel:`Plan`, the work order is scheduled "
"at :guilabel:`Main Assembly Line`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Plan` tugmasi bosilishidan oldin ish buyurtmasi :guilabel:`Main "
"Assembly Line` da rejalashtirilgan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:106
msgid ""
"After clicking \"Plan\", the work order is rescheduled at \"Alternative "
"Assembly Line\"."
msgstr ""
"\"Plan\" tugmasi bosilgandan so'ng ish buyurtmasi \"Alternative Assembly "
"Line\" da qayta rejalashtiriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:106
msgid ""
"After clicking :guilabel:`Plan`, the work order is rescheduled "
"at :guilabel:`Alternative Assembly Line`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Plan` tugmasi bosilgandan so'ng ish "
"buyurtmasi :guilabel:`Alternative Assembly Line` da qayta rejalashtiriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/work_center_time_off.rst:109
msgid ""
"Once the time-off period for the unavailable work center ends, Odoo "
"recognizes the work center is available again. At this point, clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Plan` button does not route work orders to an alternative "
"work center unless the first one is at capacity."
msgstr ""
"Mavjud bo'lmagan ish markazining dam olish davri tugagach, Odoo ish markazi "
"yana mavjud ekanligini aniqlaydi. Shu paytdan boshlab, :guilabel:`Plan` "
"tugmasini bosish ish buyurtmalarini muqobil ish markaziga yo'naltirmaydi, "
"agar birinchisi to'liq band bo'lmasa."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm.rst:8
msgid "Product lifecycle management"
msgstr "Mahsulot hayotiy tsiklini boshqarish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm.rst:10
msgid ""
"Odoo's *Product Lifecycle Management*, or *PLM* offers a systematic approach "
"for testing, collaboration, and iteration of products across concept "
"development, design, manufacturing, marketing, and post-launch support "
"stages."
msgstr ""
"Odoo'ning *Product Lifecycle Management*, ya'ni *PLM* ilovasi mahsulotlarni "
"kontseptsiya ishlab chiqish, dizayn, ishlab chiqarish, marketing va "
"chiqarilgandan keyingi qo'llab-quvvatlash bosqichlarida sinovdan o'tkazish, "
"hamkorlik qilish va takomillashtirish uchun tizimli yondashuvni taklif etadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm.rst:14
msgid ""
"With approvals, key stakeholders can review changes before implementation."
msgstr ""
"Tasdiqlashlar yordamida asosiy manfaatdor tomonlar o'zgarishlarni joriy "
"etishdan oldin ko'rib chiqishlari mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm.rst:17
msgid "Install PLM"
msgstr "PLM ni o'rnatish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm.rst:19
msgid ""
"Despite being used to iterate on **Manufacturing** bills of materials, "
"**PLM** is *not* installed by default when installing the **Manufacturing** "
"app. It must be installed separately to take advantage of its benefits."
msgstr ""
"**Manufacturing** materiallar ro'yxatlarini takomillashtirish uchun "
"ishlatilishiga qaramay, **PLM** ilovasi **Manufacturing** ilovasi "
"o'rnatilganda standart tarzda *avtomatik ravishda* o'rnatilmaydi. Uning "
"afzalliklaridan foydalanish uchun uni alohida o'rnatish kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm.rst:23
msgid ""
"To install **PLM**, open the **Apps** app. Search for `PLM`, then "
"click :guilabel:`Install` on the :guilabel:`Product Lifecycle Management "
"(PLM)` card."
msgstr ""
"**PLM** ni o'rnatish uchun **Apps** ilovasini oching. `PLM` deb qidiring, "
"so'ngra :guilabel:`Product Lifecycle Management (PLM)` "
"kartasidagi :guilabel:`Install` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm.rst:27
msgid ""
"Adding or removing apps can affect other apps and modify subscription costs. "
"See :doc:`../general/apps_modules` to learn more."
msgstr ""
"Ilovalarni qo'shish yoki olib tashlash boshqa ilovalarga ta'sir qilishi va "
"obuna narxlarini o'zgartirishi mumkin. Batafsil ma'lumot uchun :doc:`../"
"general/apps_modules` sahifasiga qarang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes.rst:3
msgid "Change management"
msgstr "O'zgarishlarni boshqarish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:10
msgid "ECO types and stages"
msgstr "ECO turlari va bosqichlari"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:12
msgid ""
"Engineering change orders (ECOs) are categorized by the type of change they "
"represent and their statuses are tracked via stages. Both |ECO| types and "
"stages are defined by the user and can be customized to the specific needs "
"of a business or industry."
msgstr ""
"Muhandislik o'zgarish buyurtmalari (ECO) ular ifodalaydigan o'zgarish turi "
"bo'yicha tasniflanadi va ularning holatlari bosqichlar orqali kuzatiladi. |"
"ECO| turlari ham, bosqichlari ham foydalanuvchi tomonidan belgilanadi va "
"biznes yoki sohaning muayyan ehtiyojlariga moslashtirilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:17
msgid "ECO types"
msgstr "ECO turlari"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:19
msgid ""
"Each |ECO| type separates |ECOs| into different projects in "
"the :guilabel:`PLM Overview`, ensuring collaborators and stakeholders only "
"view and assist with relevant |BOM| improvements."
msgstr ""
"Har bir |ECO| turi |ECOs| larni :guilabel:`PLM Overview` da turli "
"loyihalarga ajratadi, bu esa hamkorlar va manfaatdor tomonlar faqat o'ziga "
"tegishli |BOM| takomillashtirishlarini ko'rishi va ularga yordam berishini "
"ta'minlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:23
msgid ""
"An electronic chip manufacturer uses five |ECO| types: `New Product "
"Introduction`, `BOM Updates`, `Component Change`, `Product Improvement`, and "
"`Firmware Update`. In their configuration, engineers can spend time "
"exclusively on |ECOs| in the `Component Change` and `Firmware Update` types, "
"while designers see |ECOs| in the `New Product Introduction` type, allowing "
"each discipline to focus only on those changes that require their domain "
"expertise."
msgstr ""
"Elektron chip ishlab chiqaruvchisi beshta |ECO| turidan foydalanadi: `New "
"Product Introduction`, `BOM Updates`, `Component Change`, `Product "
"Improvement` va `Firmware Update`. Ularning konfiguratsiyasida muhandislar "
"faqat `Component Change` va `Firmware Update` turlaridagi |ECOs| lar bilan "
"shug'ullanishlari mumkin, dizaynerlar esa `New Product Introduction` "
"turidagi |ECOs| larni ko'radilar, bu esa har bir yo'nalishga faqat o'z soha "
"tajribasini talab qiladigan o'zgarishlarga e'tibor qaratish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:0
msgid "Example of several custom ECO types."
msgstr "Bir nechta maxsus ECO turlari namunasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:33
msgid "Create an ECO type"
msgstr "ECO turini yaratish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:35
msgid ""
"To access and manage ECO types, navigate to :menuselection:`PLM app --> "
"Configuration --> ECO Types`."
msgstr ""
"ECO turlariga kirish va ularni boshqarish uchun :menuselection:`PLM app --> "
"Configuration --> ECO Types` yo'lidan o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:38
msgid ""
"Create a new ECO type by clicking :guilabel:`New`. On the new :guilabel:`ECO "
"Types` form, fill in the following information:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`New` tugmasini bosib yangi ECO turini yarating. "
"Yangi :guilabel:`ECO Types` formasida quyidagi ma'lumotlarni to'ldiring:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Name`: the name of the |ECO| type, which will organize all of the "
"|ECOs| of this *type* in a project."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Name`: |ECO| turining nomi, u ushbu *tur* dagi barcha |ECOs| "
"larni bir loyihada tartibga soladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:43
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Email Alias`: if this optional field is filled, emails submitted "
"to this email address automatically generate |ECOs| in the left-most stage "
"of this |ECO| type."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Email Alias`: agar ushbu ixtiyoriy maydon to'ldirilsa, ushbu "
"elektron pochta manziliga yuborilgan xatlar avtomatik ravishda ushbu |ECO| "
"turining eng chap bosqichida |ECOs| larni yaratadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:47
msgid ""
"The `Formulation change` |ECO| type is used to organize and track related |"
"ECOs| in a single project. Configuring the :guilabel:`Email Alias` field "
"generates |ECOs| in the `Formulation change` project sent to the email "
"address, `pawlish-change@pawlished-glam.odoo.com`."
msgstr ""
"`Formulation change` |ECO| turi bir-biriga bog'liq |ECOs| larni bitta "
"loyihada tartibga solish va kuzatish uchun ishlatiladi. :guilabel:`Email "
"Alias` maydonini sozlash `pawlish-change@pawlished-glam.odoo.com` elektron "
"pochta manziliga yuborilgan xatlardan `Formulation change` loyihasida |ECOs| "
"larni yaratadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:0
msgid "Example of an ECO type."
msgstr "ECO turi namunasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:55
msgid "Edit ECO types"
msgstr "ECO turlarini tahrirlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:57
msgid ""
"Modify existing |ECO| type names and email aliases by navigating to "
"the :menuselection:`PLM app --> Configuration --> ECO Types` page. There, "
"click on the desired |ECO| type from the list."
msgstr ""
"Mavjud |ECO| turi nomlari va elektron pochta taxalluslarini o'zgartirish "
"uchun :menuselection:`PLM app --> Configuration --> ECO Types` sahifasiga "
"o'ting. U yerda ro'yxatdan kerakli |ECO| turini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:60
msgid ""
"On the form for each |ECO| type, edit the :guilabel:`Name` "
"or :guilabel:`Email Alias` fields."
msgstr ""
"Har bir |ECO| turi formasida :guilabel:`Name` yoki :guilabel:`Email Alias` "
"maydonlarini tahrirlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:65
msgid "Stages"
msgstr "Bosqichlar"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:67
msgid ""
"Within the :guilabel:`Engineering Change Orders` Kanban view for a specific |"
"ECO| type, *stages* are milestones used to identify the progress of the |"
"ECO| before the changes are ready to be applied. By default, Odoo uses "
"`New`, `In Progress`, `Validated`, and `Effective`, but these are fully "
"customizable to the specific life cycle of an |ECO| type."
msgstr ""
"Muayyan |ECO| turi uchun :guilabel:`Engineering Change Orders` kanban "
"ko'rinishida *bosqichlar* — o'zgarishlar qo'llanishga tayyor bo'lgunga qadar "
"|ECO| ning borishini aniqlash uchun ishlatiladigan bosqichlardir. Standart "
"holatda Odoo `New`, `In Progress`, `Validated` va `Effective` bosqichlaridan "
"foydalanadi, lekin ular |ECO| turining muayyan hayotiy tsikliga to'liq "
"moslashtirilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:None
msgid "Default stages for an ECO type."
msgstr "ECO turi uchun standart bosqichlar."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:76
msgid ""
"The `Effective` stage is folded by default to avoid listing every single |"
"ECO| that has gone into effect. See :ref:`Closing stage <plm/eco/closing-"
"stage>` for more on this configuration."
msgstr ""
"Kuchga kirgan har bir |ECO| ni ro'yxatda ko'rsatmaslik uchun `Effective` "
"bosqichi standart holatda yig'ilgan bo'ladi. Ushbu sozlama haqida batafsil "
"ma'lumot uchun :ref:`Yopish bosqichi <plm/eco/closing-stage>` bo'limiga "
"qarang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:79
msgid ""
":ref:`Verification stages <plm/eco/verification-stage>` require a designated "
"user to approve, ensuring that changes do not proceed until the |ECO| "
"changes have been reviewed by the appropriate stake holders. :ref:`Closing "
"stages<plm/eco/closing-stage>` that can apply changes put |BOM| and "
"operations changes into immediate effect, changing all pending and "
"future :abbr:`MO (Manufacturing orders)` to the latest |BOM| version."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Tekshirish bosqichlari <plm/eco/verification-stage>` belgilangan "
"foydalanuvchining tasdig'ini talab qiladi, bu esa |ECO| o'zgarishlari "
"tegishli manfaatdor tomonlar tomonidan ko'rib chiqilgunga qadar o'zgarishlar "
"davom etmasligini ta'minlaydi. O'zgarishlarni qo'llay oladigan :ref:`Yopish "
"bosqichlari<plm/eco/closing-stage>` |BOM| va operatsiya o'zgarishlarini "
"darhol kuchga kiritadi va barcha kutilayotgan hamda kelajakdagi :abbr:`MO "
"(Manufacturing orders)` larni eng so'nggi |BOM| versiyasiga o'zgartiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:86
msgid ""
"The most common practice is to have at least one *verification* stage, which "
"is a stage with a required approver, and one *closing* stage, which stores |"
"ECOs| that have been either cancelled or approved for use as the next "
"production |BOM|."
msgstr ""
"Eng keng tarqalgan amaliyot — kamida bitta *tekshirish* bosqichi, ya'ni "
"majburiy tasdiqlovchiga ega bosqich, va bitta *yopish* bosqichiga ega "
"bo'lishdir, unda bekor qilingan yoki keyingi ishlab chiqarish |BOM| sifatida "
"foydalanish uchun tasdiqlangan |ECOs| lar saqlanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:91
msgid ":doc:`Approvals<../management/approvals>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Tasdiqlashlar<../management/approvals>`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:96
msgid "Verification stages"
msgstr "Tekshirish bosqichlari"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:98
msgid ""
"To configure a verification stage, hover over the intended stage, and select "
"the :icon:`fa-gear` :guilabel:`(Actions)`. Then, click :guilabel:`Edit` to "
"open a pop-up window and check the box for :guilabel:`Allow to apply "
"changes`."
msgstr ""
"Tekshirish bosqichini sozlash uchun kerakli bosqich ustiga kursorni olib "
"boring va :icon:`fa-gear` :guilabel:`(Actions)` ni tanlang. So'ngra, qalqib "
"chiquvchi oynani ochish uchun :guilabel:`Edit` tugmasini bosing "
"va :guilabel:`Allow to apply changes` katagiga belgi qo'ying."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:102
msgid ""
"Next, add an approver in the :guilabel:`Approvers` section, by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Add a line`, and specifying the :guilabel:`Role` of the "
"reviewer, the :guilabel:`User`, and an :guilabel:`Approval Type` "
"of :guilabel:`Is required to approve`. See :ref:`more about approval types. "
"<plm/approvals/approval-type>`"
msgstr ""
"Keyin, :guilabel:`Approvers` bo'limida :guilabel:`Add a line` tugmasini "
"bosib tasdiqlovchini qo'shing va ko'rib chiquvchining :guilabel:`Role` "
"ini, :guilabel:`User` ni hamda :guilabel:`Is required to approve` "
"qiymatli :guilabel:`Approval Type` ni belgilang. :ref:`Tasdiqlash turlari "
"haqida batafsil ma'lumotga qarang. <plm/approvals/approval-type>`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:107
msgid ""
"The approver listed is automatically notified when |ECOs| are dropped in the "
"stage specified in the pop-up window. Once finished, click :guilabel:`Save & "
"Close`."
msgstr ""
"|ECOs| lar qalqib chiquvchi oynada ko'rsatilgan bosqichga tushirilganda "
"ro'yxatdagi tasdiqlovchi avtomatik ravishda xabardor qilinadi. "
"Tugatgach, :guilabel:`Save & Close` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:111
msgid ":doc:`../management/approvals`"
msgstr ":doc:`../management/approvals`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:116
msgid "Closing stages"
msgstr "Yopish bosqichlari"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:118
msgid ""
"Click an |ECO| type from :menuselection:`PLM app --> Overview` to open the "
"Kanban view of |ECOs| of this type."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu turdagi |ECOs| larning kanban ko'rinishini ochish "
"uchun :menuselection:`PLM app --> Overview` dan |ECO| turini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:121
msgid ""
"To configure a closing stage that applies |BOM|, edit the stage and tick the "
"boxes for :guilabel:`Folded in kanban view`, :guilabel:`Allow to apply "
"changes`, and :guilabel:`Final Stage`. When ECO cards are placed in a stage "
"that will *Allow to apply changes*, then any |BOM| and operations changes "
"validated in the |ECOs| will immediately be put into effect. To create a "
"cancelled stage, create or edit a stage and tick the boxes "
"for :guilabel:`Folded in kanban view` and :guilabel:`Final Stage`. |ECOs| in "
"this stage are removed from the pipeline, but will not make changes."
msgstr ""
"|BOM| ni qo'llaydigan yopish bosqichini sozlash uchun bosqichni tahrirlang "
"va :guilabel:`Folded in kanban view`, :guilabel:`Allow to apply changes` "
"va :guilabel:`Final Stage` kataklariga belgi qo'ying. ECO kartalari *Allow "
"to apply changes* imkoniyatiga ega bosqichga joylashtirilganda, |ECOs| larda "
"tasdiqlangan har qanday |BOM| va operatsiya o'zgarishlari darhol kuchga "
"kiradi. Bekor qilingan bosqichni yaratish uchun bosqichni yarating yoki "
"tahrirlang va :guilabel:`Folded in kanban view` hamda :guilabel:`Final "
"Stage` kataklariga belgi qo'ying. Ushbu bosqichdagi |ECOs| lar jarayondan "
"olib tashlanadi, lekin o'zgarishlar kiritmaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:130
msgid ""
"The closing stage, `Effective` is configured by checking "
"the :guilabel:`Folded in kanban view`, :guilabel:`Allow to apply changes`, "
"and :guilabel:`Final Stage` options"
msgstr ""
"`Effective` yopish bosqichi :guilabel:`Folded in kanban "
"view`, :guilabel:`Allow to apply changes` va :guilabel:`Final Stage` "
"parametrlariga belgi qo'yish orqali sozlanadi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/eco_type.rst:0
msgid "Configuration of the closing stage."
msgstr "Yopish bosqichini sozlash."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:3
msgid "Engineering change orders"
msgstr "Muhandislik o'zgarish buyurtmalari"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:12
msgid ""
"Utilize *engineering change orders* (*ECOs*) to track, implement, and revert "
"change versions made to products, and :doc:`bills of materials <../../"
"manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration>`."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulotlar va :doc:`materiallar ro'yxatlariga <../../manufacturing/"
"basic_setup/bill_configuration>` kiritilgan o'zgarish versiyalarini "
"kuzatish, joriy etish va bekor qilish uchun *muhandislik o'zgarish "
"buyurtmalari* (*ECOs*) dan foydalaning."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:15
msgid "Engineering change orders can be created:"
msgstr "Muhandislik o'zgarish buyurtmalari quyidagicha yaratilishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:17
msgid ":ref:`directly in the ECO type <plm/eco/create-eco>`."
msgstr ":ref:`to'g'ridan-to'g'ri ECO turida <plm/eco/create-eco>`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:18
msgid ""
"automatically from feedback submitted to the :ref:`ECO type's email alias "
"<plm/eco/eco-type>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ECO turining elektron pochta taxallusiga <plm/eco/eco-type>` "
"yuborilgan fikr-mulohazalardan avtomatik ravishda."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:23
msgid "Create ECO"
msgstr "ECO yaratish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:25
msgid ""
"To create a new |ECO|, begin by navigating to the **PLM** app. Then, select "
"the |ECO| type that should be used to track the progress of the change. On "
"the :guilabel:`Engineering Change Orders` page, click the :guilabel:`New` "
"button in the top-left corner."
msgstr ""
"Yangi |ECO| yaratish uchun avval **PLM** ilovasiga o'ting. So'ngra, "
"o'zgarishning borishini kuzatish uchun ishlatilishi kerak bo'lgan |ECO| "
"turini tanlang. :guilabel:`Engineering Change Orders` sahifasida yuqori chap "
"burchakdagi :guilabel:`New` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:30
msgid ""
":doc:`ECO types <eco_type>` categorize and organize change orders. Doing so "
"can ensure that employees only view the |ECOs| related to their "
"responsibilities, whether it involves new product introductions, targeted "
"product line updates, or regulatory compliance fulfillment."
msgstr ""
":doc:`ECO turlari <eco_type>` o'zgarish buyurtmalarini tasniflaydi va "
"tartibga soladi. Bu xodimlar faqat o'z mas'uliyatlariga tegishli |ECOs| "
"larni ko'rishini ta'minlaydi — bu yangi mahsulotlarni joriy etish, muayyan "
"mahsulot liniyasini yangilash yoki me'yoriy talablarga muvofiqlikni "
"ta'minlash bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:34
msgid "On the |ECO| form, fill in the following fields accordingly:"
msgstr "|ECO| formasida quyidagi maydonlarni tegishli ravishda to'ldiring:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:36
msgid ":guilabel:`Description` is a brief summary of the improvement."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Description` — takomillashtirishning qisqacha mazmuni."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:37
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Type`: specifies the |ECO| type project for organizing the |ECOs|."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Type`: |ECOs| larni tartibga solish uchun |ECO| turi loyihasini "
"belgilaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:38
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Apply on` determines if the |ECO| changes the :guilabel:`Bill of "
"Materials` or the :guilabel:`Product Only`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Apply on` |ECO| :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` ni "
"yoki :guilabel:`Product Only` ni o'zgartirishini aniqlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:40
msgid ":guilabel:`Product` indicates the product being improved."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Product` takomillashtirilayotgan mahsulotni ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bill of Materials` specifies the changed |BOM|. It auto-populates "
"if the product in :guilabel:`Product` field has an existing |BOM|. If "
"multiple |BOMs| exist, select the intended radio options from the drop-down "
"menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Bill of Materials` o'zgartirilgan |BOM| ni belgilaydi. "
"Agar :guilabel:`Product` maydonidagi mahsulotning mavjud |BOM| i bo'lsa, u "
"avtomatik to'ldiriladi. Agar bir nechta |BOMs| mavjud bo'lsa, ochiluvchi "
"menyudan kerakli variantni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:46
msgid ""
"A :guilabel:`Product` must be selected before :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` "
"options is available."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Bill of Materials` variantlari mavjud bo'lishidan "
"oldin :guilabel:`Product` tanlangan bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:49
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company` field is used in multi-company databases. Specify if the "
"change applies to products in a specific company, or leave blank if the "
"change applies to all companies."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Company` maydoni ko'p kompaniyali ma'lumotlar bazalarida "
"ishlatiladi. Agar o'zgarish muayyan kompaniyadagi mahsulotlarga tegishli "
"bo'lsa, uni ko'rsating, agar o'zgarish barcha kompaniyalarga tegishli "
"bo'lsa, bo'sh qoldiring."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:53
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company` is only available to specify with multiple companies "
"enabled. See :doc:`../../../general/companies/multi_company`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Company` faqat bir nechta kompaniya yoqilgan holatda "
"ko'rsatilishi mumkin. Qarang: :doc:`../../../general/companies/"
"multi_company`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:56
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Responsible` represents the assignee in charge of this |ECO|. "
"(Optional)"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Responsible` ushbu |ECO| uchun mas'ul bo'lgan tayinlangan shaxsni "
"bildiradi. (Ixtiyoriy)"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:57
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Effective` specifies when the |ECO| becomes live. "
"Choosing :guilabel:`As soon as possible` means the |ECO| applies to the "
"production |BOM| as soon as an authorized user :ref:`applies the changes "
"<plm/eco/apply-changes>`. :guilabel:`At Date` with a specific date selected "
"will only apply the |BOM| at that date, making it easier to track the "
"version history of the |BOM| in production."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Effective` |ECO| qachon kuchga kirishini "
"belgilaydi. :guilabel:`As soon as possible` variantini tanlash, vakolatli "
"foydalanuvchi :ref:`o'zgarishlarni qo'llashi <plm/eco/apply-changes>` "
"bilanoq |ECO| ishlab chiqarish |BOM| ga qo'llanilishini anglatadi. Muayyan "
"sana tanlangan :guilabel:`At Date` esa |BOM| ni faqat o'sha sanada "
"qo'llaydi, bu ishlab chiqarishdagi |BOM| ning versiyalar tarixini kuzatishni "
"osonlashtiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:62
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tags` are assigned to |ECOs| for prioritization and organization. "
"Create a new tag by typing the name in the field and "
"selecting :guilabel:`Create` from the drop-down menu. (Optional)"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tags` |ECOs| ga ustuvorlik berish va tartibga solish uchun "
"tayinlanadi. Yangi teg yaratish uchun maydonga nomini yozing va ochiluvchi "
"menyudan :guilabel:`Create` ni tanlang. (Ixtiyoriy)"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:65
msgid ""
"After filling out the |ECO| form, click the :guilabel:`Start Revision` "
"button to begin implementing the changes."
msgstr ""
"|ECO| formasini to'ldirgandan so'ng, o'zgarishlarni amalga oshirishni "
"boshlash uchun :guilabel:`Start Revision` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:68
msgid "By pressing :guilabel:`Start Revision`, three actions occur:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Start Revision` tugmasini bosish orqali uchta amal sodir bo'ladi:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:70
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Documents` smart button appears, storing the relevant files "
"of the |BOM|."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Documents` smart tugmasi paydo bo'lib, |BOM| ning tegishli "
"fayllarini saqlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:71
msgid ""
"A copy of the production |BOM| is stored in the newly-"
"appeared :guilabel:`Revision` smart button of the |ECO|. The next available "
"version number (e.g., `V2`, `V3`, ...) is also assigned to keep track of all "
"|BOM| versions."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish |BOM| ning nusxasi |ECO| ning yangi paydo "
"bo'lgan :guilabel:`Revision` smart tugmasida saqlanadi. Barcha |BOM| "
"versiyalarini kuzatib borish uchun keyingi mavjud versiya raqami (masalan, "
"`V2`, `V3`, ...) ham tayinlanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:74
msgid ""
"The stages of the |ECO| :guilabel:`Type` are displayed in the top-right "
"corner of the |ECO|."
msgstr ""
"|ECO| :guilabel:`Type` bosqichlari |ECO| ning yuqori o'ng burchagida "
"ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:77
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Revision` smart button is available **only** when "
"the :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` radio button is selected in "
"the :guilabel:`Apply on` field, and the :guilabel:`Start Revision` button "
"has been pressed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Revision` smart tugmasi **faqat** :guilabel:`Apply on` "
"maydonida :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` radio tugmasi tanlangan "
"va :guilabel:`Start Revision` tugmasi bosilgan holatda mavjud bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:None
msgid ""
"ECO with overview of stages in the top-right corner, and Revision smart "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Yuqori o'ng burchakda bosqichlar ko'rinishi va Revision smart tugmasi "
"bo'lgan ECO."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:85
msgid "Change components"
msgstr "Komponentlarni o'zgartirish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:87
msgid ""
"To modify the components in a |BOM|, click the :guilabel:`Revision` smart "
"button on an |ECO| to access the new version of the |BOM|. Odoo "
"distinguishes the non-production version of the |BOM| from the current "
"version, by flagging the test |BOM| with a large :guilabel:`Archived` tag."
msgstr ""
"|BOM| dagi komponentlarni o'zgartirish uchun |BOM| ning yangi versiyasiga "
"kirish maqsadida |ECO| dagi :guilabel:`Revision` smart tugmasini bosing. "
"Odoo sinov |BOM| ni katta :guilabel:`Archived` tegi bilan belgilash orqali |"
"BOM| ning ishlab chiqarishda bo'lmagan versiyasini joriy versiyadan ajratib "
"turadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:92
msgid ""
"After clicking the :guilabel:`Start Revision` button for an |ECO| for the "
"product, `[D_0045 Stool]`, make changes to the product's |BOM| by clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Revision` smart button. Doing so opens the archived |BOM|, "
"marked with a large red :guilabel:`Archived` flag."
msgstr ""
"`[D_0045 Stool]` mahsuloti uchun |ECO| da :guilabel:`Start Revision` "
"tugmasini bosgandan so'ng, :guilabel:`Revision` smart tugmasini bosish "
"orqali mahsulotning |BOM| iga o'zgarishlar kiriting. Bu katta "
"qizil :guilabel:`Archived` belgisi bilan belgilangan arxivlangan |BOM| ni "
"ochadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:0
msgid "Show the archived Bill of Materials."
msgstr "Arxivlangan materiallar ro'yxatini ko'rsatish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:99
msgid ""
"On the new |BOM|, in the :guilabel:`Components` tab, proceed to modify the "
"components list, by changing the :guilabel:`Quantity` of existing "
"components, adding new components using the :guilabel:`Add a line` button, "
"and removing components with the :guilabel:`🗑️ (trash)` icon."
msgstr ""
"Yangi |BOM| da, :guilabel:`Components` varag'ida, mavjud "
"komponentlarning :guilabel:`Quantity` qiymatini o'zgartirish, :guilabel:`Add "
"a line` tugmasi yordamida yangi komponentlar qo'shish va :guilabel:`🗑️ "
"(trash)` belgisi bilan komponentlarni olib tashlash orqali komponentlar "
"ro'yxatini o'zgartirishga o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:106
msgid ""
"In version two of the |BOM| for a keyboard, the component quantities are "
"reduced, and an additional component, `Stabilizers`, is added."
msgstr ""
"Klaviatura uchun |BOM| ning ikkinchi versiyasida komponent miqdorlari "
"kamaytirilgan va qo'shimcha komponent, `Stabilizers`, qo'shilgan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:0
msgid "A revised BOM"
msgstr "Qayta ko'rib chiqilgan BOM"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:113
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:162
msgid "Compare changes"
msgstr "O'zgarishlarni solishtirish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:115
msgid ""
"To compare a revised |BOM| to the previous version, navigate to the |ECO| "
"for that |BOM| in either of these ways:"
msgstr ""
"Qayta ko'rib chiqilgan |BOM| ni oldingi versiya bilan solishtirish uchun "
"quyidagi usullardan biri orqali o'sha |BOM| uchun |ECO| ga o'ting:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:118
msgid ""
"From the revised |BOM|, click the |ECO| name (for example, `ECO005: "
"Improve...`) in the breadcrumbs located in the top-left corner."
msgstr ""
"Qayta ko'rib chiqilgan |BOM| dan, yuqori chap burchakda joylashgan "
"breadcrumb'larda |ECO| nomini (masalan, `ECO005: Improve...`) bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:120
msgid ""
"From the :guilabel:`PLM Overview`, click the :guilabel:`Engineering Changes` "
"button on the :guilabel:`BOM Updates` Kanban card. Click the Kanban card for "
"the appropriate |ECO| to open it."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`PLM Overview` dan, :guilabel:`BOM Updates` Kanban "
"kartasidagi :guilabel:`Engineering Changes` tugmasini bosing. Tegishli |ECO| "
"ni ochish uchun uning Kanban kartasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:123
msgid ""
"On the |ECO| form, a new :guilabel:`BoM Changes` tab displays the "
"differences between the current |BOM| and the new version."
msgstr ""
"|ECO| formasida yangi :guilabel:`BoM Changes` varag'i joriy |BOM| va yangi "
"versiya o'rtasidagi farqlarni ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:126
msgid ""
"Blue text indicates new components added to the revised |BOM| that are not "
"in the production |BOM|. Black text represents updates shared by both |"
"BOMs|, while red text indicates components removed in the revised |BOM|."
msgstr ""
"Ko'k matn ishlab chiqarish |BOM| da mavjud bo'lmagan, qayta ko'rib chiqilgan "
"|BOM| ga qo'shilgan yangi komponentlarni bildiradi. Qora matn har ikkala |"
"BOMs| uchun umumiy bo'lgan yangilanishlarni ifodalaydi, qizil matn esa qayta "
"ko'rib chiqilgan |BOM| da olib tashlangan komponentlarni bildiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:130
msgid ""
"Changes and tests are encapsulated in the revised |BOM|, and do **not** "
"affect the |BOM| currently used in production. That is, until "
"the :ref:`changes are applied <plm/eco/apply-changes>`."
msgstr ""
"O'zgarishlar va sinovlar qayta ko'rib chiqilgan |BOM| ichida saqlanadi va "
"hozirda ishlab chiqarishda ishlatilayotgan |BOM| ga ta'sir **qilmaydi**. "
"Ya'ni, :ref:`o'zgarishlar qo'llanilguncha <plm/eco/apply-changes>`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:134
msgid ""
"View the summary of the differences between the current and revised keyboard "
"|BOMs| in the :guilabel:`BoM Changes` tab of the |ECO|."
msgstr ""
"Joriy va qayta ko'rib chiqilgan klaviatura |BOMs| o'rtasidagi farqlarning "
"qisqacha mazmunini |ECO| ning :guilabel:`BoM Changes` varag'ida ko'ring."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:0
msgid "View summary of component changes in the BoM Changes tab."
msgstr ""
"BoM Changes varag'ida komponent o'zgarishlarining qisqacha mazmunini ko'rish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:141
msgid "Change operations"
msgstr "Operatsiyalarni o'zgartirish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:143
msgid ""
"To modify the operations in a |BOM|, click the :guilabel:`Revision` smart "
"button on an |ECO| to access the archived, new version of the |BOM|."
msgstr ""
"|BOM| dagi operatsiyalarni o'zgartirish uchun |BOM| ning arxivlangan, yangi "
"versiyasiga kirish maqsadida |ECO| dagi :guilabel:`Revision` smart tugmasini "
"bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:146
msgid ""
"In the new |BOM| version, switch to the :guilabel:`Operations` tab to view "
"and edit |BOM| operations. To make changes, select each operation, which "
"opens the corresponding :guilabel:`Open: Operations` pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"Yangi |BOM| versiyasida, |BOM| operatsiyalarini ko'rish va tahrirlash "
"uchun :guilabel:`Operations` varag'iga o'ting. O'zgartirish kiritish uchun "
"har bir operatsiyani tanlang, bu tegishli :guilabel:`Open: Operations` "
"qalqib chiquvchi oynasini ochadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:151
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Operations` tab is *not* available by default. To enable it, "
"navigate to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`, and check the :guilabel:`Work Orders` box."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Operations` varag'i standart holatda mavjud *emas*. Uni yoqish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --> Settings` "
"yo'lidan o'ting va :guilabel:`Work Orders` katagini belgilang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:155
msgid ""
"Make changes to any of the fields in the :guilabel:`Open: Operations` pop-up "
"window, then click :guilabel:`Save` once completed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Open: Operations` qalqib chiquvchi oynasidagi istalgan maydonga "
"o'zgarishlar kiriting, so'ngra tugagach :guilabel:`Save` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:158
msgid ""
"Create new operations by clicking the :guilabel:`Add a line` button, and "
"remove new operations by clicking the :guilabel:`Archive Operation` button."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Add a line` tugmasini bosish orqali yangi operatsiyalar yarating "
"va :guilabel:`Archive Operation` tugmasini bosish orqali yangi "
"operatsiyalarni olib tashlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:164
msgid ""
"To compare a revised operations to the previous version, navigate to the |"
"ECO| for the |BOM| in either of these ways:"
msgstr ""
"Qayta ko'rib chiqilgan operatsiyalarni oldingi versiya bilan solishtirish "
"uchun quyidagi usullardan biri orqali |BOM| uchun |ECO| ga o'ting:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:167
msgid ""
"From the revised |BOM|, click the |ECO| name (for example, `ECO005: "
"Improve...`) in the breadcrumbs located in the top-left corner"
msgstr ""
"Qayta ko'rib chiqilgan |BOM| dan, yuqori chap burchakda joylashgan "
"breadcrumb'larda |ECO| nomini (masalan, `ECO005: Improve...`) bosing"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:169
msgid ""
"From the :guilabel:`PLM Overview`,  select the |ECO| type card, and then the "
"correct |ECO| from the Kanban view."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`PLM Overview` dan |ECO| turi kartasini, so'ngra kanban "
"ko'rinishidan kerakli |ECO| ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:172
msgid ""
"On the |ECO| form, a new :guilabel:`Operation Changes` tab displays the "
"differences between the current production |BOM| and the new version."
msgstr ""
"|ECO| formasida yangi :guilabel:`Operation Changes` varag'i joriy ishlab "
"chiqarish |BOM| va yangi versiya o'rtasidagi farqlarni ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:175
msgid ""
"Blue text indicates new operations added to the revised |BOM| that do not "
"yet exist in the production |BOM|. Black text represents updates shared by "
"both |BOMs|, while red text indicates operations removed in the revised |"
"BOM|."
msgstr ""
"Ko'k matn ishlab chiqarish |BOM| da hali mavjud bo'lmagan, qayta ko'rib "
"chiqilgan |BOM| ga qo'shilgan yangi operatsiyalarni bildiradi. Qora matn har "
"ikkala |BOMs| uchun umumiy bo'lgan yangilanishlarni ifodalaydi, qizil matn "
"esa qayta ko'rib chiqilgan |BOM| da olib tashlangan operatsiyalarni "
"bildiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:179
msgid ""
"Modifications to the |BOM| in an |ECO| will **not** affect the |BOM| used in "
"production. That is, until the :ref:`changes are applied <plm/eco/apply-"
"changes>`."
msgstr ""
"|ECO| dagi |BOM| ga kiritilgan o'zgartirishlar ishlab chiqarishda "
"ishlatiladigan |BOM| ga ta'sir **qilmaydi**. Ya'ni, :ref:`o'zgarishlar "
"qo'llanilguncha <plm/eco/apply-changes>`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:182
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Operation Changes` tab, each row of details, beneath the "
"columns in the table, reflect the following information:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Operation Changes` varag'ida, jadvaldagi ustunlar ostidagi har "
"bir tafsilotlar qatori quyidagi ma'lumotlarni aks ettiradi:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:185
msgid ":guilabel:`Operation`: Name of the operation that was modified."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Operation`: O'zgartirilgan operatsiyaning nomi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:186
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Step`: specifies the quality control point, visible when the "
"operation includes detailed instructions."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Step`: sifat nazorati nuqtasini belgilaydi, operatsiya batafsil "
"ko'rsatmalarni o'z ichiga olgan holatda ko'rinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:190
msgid ""
"To check for instructions, click the operation line item in "
"the :guilabel:`Operations` tab of a |BOM|. Then, in the :guilabel:`Open: "
"Operations` pop-up window, look for the :guilabel:`Instructions` smart "
"button displayed at the top."
msgstr ""
"Ko'rsatmalarni tekshirish uchun |BOM| ning :guilabel:`Operations` "
"varag'idagi operatsiya qatorini bosing. So'ngra, :guilabel:`Open: "
"Operations` qalqib chiquvchi oynasida, yuqorida "
"ko'rsatilgan :guilabel:`Instructions` smart tugmasini qidiring."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:195
msgid ""
"The `Assembly` :guilabel:`Operation` includes `10` "
"detailed :guilabel:`Instructions` to complete it."
msgstr ""
"`Assembly` :guilabel:`Operation` uni bajarish uchun `10` ta "
"batafsil :guilabel:`Instructions` ni o'z ichiga oladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:0
msgid ""
"Show Instructions smart button to check whether an operation has additional\n"
"instructions."
msgstr ""
"Operatsiyada qo'shimcha ko'rsatmalar bor-yo'qligini tekshirish uchun "
"Instructions smart tugmasini ko'rsatish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:202
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Step Type` details the type of quality control for further "
"instructions in the operation."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Step Type` operatsiyadagi qo'shimcha ko'rsatmalar uchun sifat "
"nazorati turini batafsil bayon qiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:204
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Type` corresponds with the colored text to specify how the "
"revised |BOM| differs from the production |BOM|. Operation change types can "
"be :guilabel:`Add`, :guilabel:`Remove`, or :guilabel:`Update`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Type` qayta ko'rib chiqilgan |BOM| ishlab chiqarish |BOM| dan "
"qanday farq qilishini belgilash uchun rangli matnga mos keladi. Operatsiya "
"o'zgarishi turlari :guilabel:`Add`, :guilabel:`Remove` "
"yoki :guilabel:`Update` bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:207
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Work Center` specifies the work center at which the operation is "
"performed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Work Center` operatsiya bajariladigan ish markazini belgilaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:208
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Manual Duration Change` refers to the change in "
"the :guilabel:`Default Duration` field in the :guilabel:`Open: Operations` "
"pop-up window, which specifies the expected time for completing the "
"operation."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Manual Duration Change` :guilabel:`Open: Operations` qalqib "
"chiquvchi oynasidagi :guilabel:`Default Duration` maydonidagi o'zgarishga "
"tegishli bo'lib, bu maydon operatsiyani bajarish uchun kutilayotgan vaqtni "
"belgilaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:213
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Operation Changes` tab compares the production |BOM| with the "
"revised |BOM| in the |ECO|."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Operation Changes` varag'i ishlab chiqarish |BOM| ni |ECO| dagi "
"qayta ko'rib chiqilgan |BOM| bilan solishtiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:216
msgid ""
"In the revised |BOM|, a new `Assembly` :guilabel:`Operation` at "
"the :guilabel:`Work Center` `Assembly Line 1` is added. In addition, the "
"expected duration of the operation is `20.00` minutes, as specified by "
"the :guilabel:`Manual Duration Change`."
msgstr ""
"Qayta ko'rib chiqilgan |BOM| da, `Assembly Line 1` :guilabel:`Work Center` "
"da yangi `Assembly` :guilabel:`Operation` qo'shilgan. Bundan "
"tashqari, :guilabel:`Manual Duration Change` da belgilanganidek, "
"operatsiyaning kutilayotgan davomiyligi `20.00` daqiqani tashkil qiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:220
msgid ""
"To supplement the `Assembly` operation, two quality control point "
"instructions are added:"
msgstr ""
"`Assembly` operatsiyasini to'ldirish uchun ikkita sifat nazorati nuqtasi "
"ko'rsatmalari qo'shiladi:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:222
msgid ""
"The first is the :guilabel:`Step` `QCP00039`, a :guilabel:`Step Type` "
"to :guilabel:`Register Production` of components."
msgstr ""
"Birinchisi :guilabel:`Step` `QCP00039` bo'lib, "
"komponentlarning :guilabel:`Register Production` uchun :guilabel:`Step Type` "
"hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:224
msgid ""
"The second :guilabel:`Step` is `QCP00034`, an `Instructions` :guilabel:`Step "
"Type` that provides additional assembly details."
msgstr ""
"Ikkinchi :guilabel:`Step` `QCP00034` bo'lib, qo'shimcha yig'ish "
"tafsilotlarini taqdim etuvchi `Instructions` :guilabel:`Step Type` "
"hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:0
msgid "Operation Changes tab in an |ECO|."
msgstr "|ECO| dagi Operation Changes varag'i."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:233
msgid "Apply changes"
msgstr "O'zgarishlarni qo'llash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:235
msgid ""
"After verifying the changes, move the |ECO| to a :ref:`verification stage "
"<plm/eco/stage-config>`, which are stages that require approval before the "
"revised changes can be applied to the production |BOM|."
msgstr ""
"O'zgarishlarni tekshirgandan so'ng, |ECO| ni :ref:`tasdiqlash bosqichiga "
"<plm/eco/stage-config>` o'tkazing, bular qayta ko'rib chiqilgan o'zgarishlar "
"ishlab chiqarish |BOM| ga qo'llanilishidan oldin tasdiqlashni talab "
"qiladigan bosqichlardir."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:239
msgid ""
"Once the approvers accept the changes, the :guilabel:`Apply Changes` button "
"becomes available. Click this button, and the |ECO| is automatically moved "
"to a closing stage. The changes are applied, which archives the original "
"production |BOM|, and the revised |BOM| becomes the new production |BOM|."
msgstr ""
"Tasdiqlovchilar o'zgarishlarni qabul qilgach, :guilabel:`Apply Changes` "
"tugmasi mavjud bo'ladi. Ushbu tugmani bosing, shunda |ECO| avtomatik "
"ravishda yopilish bosqichiga o'tkaziladi. O'zgarishlar qo'llaniladi, bu asl "
"ishlab chiqarish |BOM| ni arxivlaydi va qayta ko'rib chiqilgan |BOM| yangi "
"ishlab chiqarish |BOM| ga aylanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:244
msgid "Verify changes"
msgstr "O'zgarishlarni tekshirish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:246
msgid ""
"To ensure the changes are live, from the |ECO| where the :guilabel:`Apply "
"Changes` button was pressed, return to the revised |BOM| by clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Revision` smart button."
msgstr ""
"O'zgarishlar kuchga kirganligiga ishonch hosil qilish "
"uchun, :guilabel:`Apply Changes` tugmasi bosilgan |ECO| "
"dan :guilabel:`Revision` smart tugmasini bosib, qayta ko'rib chiqilgan |BOM| "
"ga qayting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:249
msgid ""
"On the revised |BOM|, the large red :guilabel:`Archived` flag is removed."
msgstr ""
"Qayta ko'rib chiqilgan |BOM| da katta qizil :guilabel:`Archived` belgisi "
"olib tashlanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:251
msgid ""
"To further verify the changes, check the production |BOM| by going "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Products --> Products` and select "
"the product."
msgstr ""
"O'zgarishlarni yanada tekshirish uchun :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> "
"Products --> Products` yo'lidan o'tib, mahsulotni tanlab, ishlab chiqarish |"
"BOM| ni tekshiring."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:254
msgid ""
"Then, on the product form, click the :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` smart "
"button, and select the |BOM| from the list. In the :guilabel:`Miscellaneous` "
"tab of the |BOM|, the :guilabel:`Version` field is updated to match the "
"version number shown on the :guilabel:`Revision` smart button of the latest |"
"ECO|."
msgstr ""
"So'ngra, mahsulot formasida :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` smart tugmasini "
"bosing va ro'yxatdan |BOM| ni tanlang. |BOM| ning :guilabel:`Miscellaneous` "
"varag'ida :guilabel:`Version` maydoni eng so'nggi |ECO| "
"ning :guilabel:`Revision` smart tugmasida ko'rsatilgan versiya raqamiga mos "
"ravishda yangilanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:260
msgid ""
"After applying the changes of the |ECO| for the :ref:`keyboard <plm/eco/"
"example-keyboard>`, view the version of the current keyboard |BOM| in "
"the :guilabel:`Miscellaneous` tab. Here, the :guilabel:`Version` number has "
"been updated to `2`, matching the `V2` that appears in "
"the :guilabel:`Revision` smart button of the |ECO|."
msgstr ""
":ref:`klaviatura <plm/eco/example-keyboard>` uchun |ECO| o'zgarishlarini "
"qo'llagandan so'ng, joriy klaviatura |BOM| "
"versiyasini :guilabel:`Miscellaneous` varag'ida ko'ring. Bu "
"yerda :guilabel:`Version` raqami `2` ga yangilangan bo'lib, |ECO| "
"ning :guilabel:`Revision` smart tugmasida ko'rinadigan `V2` ga mos keladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:0
msgid "View current BOM version in the Miscellaneous tab."
msgstr "Miscellaneous varag'ida joriy BOM versiyasini ko'rish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:269
msgid "View changes"
msgstr "O'zgarishlarni ko'rish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:271
msgid ""
"To review proposed changes, navigate to the :menuselection:`PLM app --> "
"Overview`. In the `BOM Updates` |ECO| type card, the :guilabel:`# "
"Engineering Changes` button represents the number of operational changes "
"created."
msgstr ""
"Taklif qilingan o'zgarishlarni ko'rib chiqish uchun :menuselection:`PLM app "
"--> Overview` yo'lidan o'ting. `BOM Updates` |ECO| turi "
"kartasida :guilabel:`# Engineering Changes` tugmasi yaratilgan operatsion "
"o'zgarishlar sonini ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:275
msgid ""
"Click on the :guilabel:`# Engineering Changes` button to open the Kanban "
"view of the |ECO| type. To view the suggestion, select an |ECO| in the `New` "
"stage."
msgstr ""
"|ECO| turining kanban ko'rinishini ochish uchun :guilabel:`# Engineering "
"Changes` tugmasini bosing. Taklifni ko'rish uchun `New` bosqichidagi |ECO| "
"ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:278
msgid ""
"On the |ECO|, view a summary of the proposed changes in "
"the :guilabel:`Operation Changes` tab. Click the :guilabel:`Revision` smart "
"button to navigate to the revised |BOM| and look into the proposed changes "
"in greater detail."
msgstr ""
"|ECO| da taklif qilingan o'zgarishlar xulosasini :guilabel:`Operation "
"Changes` varag'ida ko'ring. Qayta ko'rib chiqilgan |BOM| ga o'tish va taklif "
"qilingan o'zgarishlarni batafsilroq ko'rib chiqish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Revision` smart tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:283
msgid ""
"An operator suggested another check for broken components by adding a step "
"while performing the `Assemble switches` operation for the :abbr:`MO "
"(Manufacturing Order)` `WH/MO/00010` for the product, `Keyboard`."
msgstr ""
"Operator `Keyboard` mahsuloti uchun :abbr:`MO (Manufacturing Order)` `WH/MO/"
"00010` bo'yicha `Assemble switches` operatsiyasini bajarish paytida qadam "
"qo'shib, buzilgan komponentlarni yana bir bor tekshirishni taklif qildi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:287
msgid ""
"Then, this created |ECO| can be viewed by navigating to the `BOM Changes` "
"ECO type found in :menuselection:`PLM app --> Overview`."
msgstr ""
"So'ngra, bu yaratilgan |ECO| ni :menuselection:`PLM app --> Overview` da "
"joylashgan `BOM Changes` ECO turiga o'tish orqali ko'rish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:290
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Responsible` field is assigned to the operator who made the "
"suggestion, allowing the employee revising the |BOM| to seek further "
"clarification from the person who proposed the changes."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Responsible` maydoni taklifni bergan operatorga tayinlanadi, bu |"
"BOM| ni qayta ko'rib chiqayotgan xodimga o'zgarishlarni taklif qilgan "
"shaxsdan qo'shimcha aniqlik olish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:0
msgid "Find the new ECO in the \"BOM Changes\" ECO type, in the \"New\" stage."
msgstr "Yangi ECO ni \"BOM Changes\" ECO turida, \"New\" bosqichida toping."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:298
msgid ""
"On the revised |BOM|, switch to the :guilabel:`Operations` tab, and select "
"the :icon:`fa-list-ul` :guilabel:`(Show Instructions)` icon. Doing so opens "
"a list of :guilabel:`Steps` to perform the operation, with the newest "
"instruction titled `New Step Suggestion:`, followed by the user-entered "
"title. Click the line item to view the suggested changes."
msgstr ""
"Qayta ko'rib chiqilgan |BOM| da :guilabel:`Operations` varag'iga o'ting "
"va :icon:`fa-list-ul` :guilabel:`(Show Instructions)` belgisini tanlang. "
"Shunda operatsiyani bajarish uchun :guilabel:`Steps` ro'yxati ochiladi, unda "
"eng yangi ko'rsatma `New Step Suggestion:` deb nomlanib, undan keyin "
"foydalanuvchi kiritgan sarlavha keladi. Taklif qilingan o'zgarishlarni "
"ko'rish uchun qator elementini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:None
msgid "\"Show Instructions\" icon in the *Operations* tab of a BoM."
msgstr "BoM ning *Operations* varag'idagi \"Show Instructions\" belgisi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:307
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/quality/quality_management/quality_control_points.rst:3
msgid "Quality control points"
msgstr "Sifat nazorati nuqtalari"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:310
msgid ""
"The :doc:`Quality <../../quality>` app is required to configure quality "
"control points."
msgstr ""
"Sifat nazorati nuqtalarini sozlash uchun :doc:`Quality <../../quality>` "
"ilovasi talab qilinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:312
msgid ""
"On the :ref:`quality control point <quality/quality_management/quality-"
"control-points>` form, ensure the following form fields are accurately "
"filled out to give detailed instructions for operators:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`sifat nazorati nuqtasi <quality/quality_management/quality-control-"
"points>` formasida operatorlar uchun batafsil ko'rsatmalar berish maqsadida "
"quyidagi forma maydonlari to'g'ri to'ldirilganligiga ishonch hosil qiling:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:315
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Title`: rename to give a concise description of the new "
"instruction."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Title`: yangi ko'rsatmaning qisqacha tavsifini berish uchun qayta "
"nomlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:316
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Control per`: using the drop-down menu, determine whether this "
"instruction applies broadly for the :guilabel:`Product`, specifically for "
"this :guilabel:`Operation` *only*, or a particular :guilabel:`Quantity` of "
"the product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Control per`: ochiluvchi menyu yordamida ushbu ko'rsatma umumiy "
"tarzda :guilabel:`Product` uchun, *faqat* shu :guilabel:`Operation` uchun "
"yoki mahsulotning ma'lum bir :guilabel:`Quantity` miqdori uchun "
"qo'llanilishini aniqlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:319
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Type`: categorizes the control point type. From the drop-down "
"menu, select :guilabel:`Instructions` to detail an instruction for the "
"worker. To receive input from the workers, select the :guilabel:`Take a "
"Picture`, :guilabel:`Register Consumed Materials`, :guilabel:`Print Label`, "
"or other :ref:`quality check options <quality/quality_management/quality-"
"control-points>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Type`: nazorat nuqtasi turini turkumlaydi. Ishchi uchun "
"ko'rsatmani batafsil bayon qilish uchun ochiluvchi "
"menyudan :guilabel:`Instructions` ni tanlang. Ishchilardan ma'lumot olish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Take a Picture`, :guilabel:`Register Consumed "
"Materials`, :guilabel:`Print Label` yoki boshqa :ref:`sifat tekshiruvi "
"variantlarini <quality/quality_management/quality-control-points>` tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:326
msgid ""
":ref:`Configure quality control points <quality/quality_management/quality-"
"control-points>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Sifat nazorati nuqtalarini sozlash <quality/quality_management/quality-"
"control-points>`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:328
msgid ""
"Once the quality control point is configured, return to "
"the :guilabel:`Steps` list using the breadcrumbs. Finally, drag the last "
"quality control line item to its intended order of instructions."
msgstr ""
"Sifat nazorati nuqtasi sozlangandan so'ng, navigatsiya yo'li (breadcrumbs) "
"yordamida :guilabel:`Steps` ro'yxatiga qayting. Nihoyat, oxirgi sifat "
"nazorati qator elementini ko'rsatmalarning mo'ljallangan tartibiga sudrab "
"olib boring."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:332
msgid ""
"Drag and reorder the `Check for broken switches` instruction, by clicking "
"and dragging its :icon:`oi-draggable` :guilabel:`(draggable)` icon to move "
"it from the bottom to the second position."
msgstr ""
"`Check for broken switches` ko'rsatmasini pastdan ikkinchi o'ringa "
"ko'chirish uchun uning :icon:`oi-draggable` :guilabel:`(draggable)` "
"belgisini bosib, sudrab olib boring va tartibini o'zgartiring."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/engineering_change_orders.rst:0
msgid ""
"Drag and reorder instructions by selecting the \"draggable\" icon on the far "
"left."
msgstr ""
"Eng chapdagi \"draggable\" belgisini tanlash orqali ko'rsatmalarni sudrab, "
"tartibini o'zgartiring."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:3
msgid "Version control"
msgstr "Versiyalarni boshqarish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:10
msgid ""
"Use Odoo's *Product Lifecycle Management (PLM)* to manage previous versions "
"of bills of materials (BoMs). Store former assembly instructions, component "
"details, and past product design files while keeping the past details out of "
"the production |BOM|."
msgstr ""
"Materiallar ro'yxatlarining (BoM) oldingi versiyalarini boshqarish uchun "
"Odoo ning *Product Lifecycle Management (PLM)* ilovasidan foydalaning. Eski "
"yig'ish ko'rsatmalarini, komponent tafsilotlarini va o'tgan mahsulot dizayni "
"fayllarini saqlang, shu bilan birga o'tmish tafsilotlarini ishlab chiqarish |"
"BOM| dan tashqarida tuting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:14
msgid ""
"Easily revert to previous |BOM| versions, when needed. Additionally, use "
"*PLM* to trace which |BOM| version was active on specific dates for recalls "
"or customer complaints."
msgstr ""
"Kerak bo'lganda oldingi |BOM| versiyalariga osongina qayting. Bundan "
"tashqari, mahsulotni qaytarib olish yoki mijoz shikoyatlari uchun qaysi |"
"BOM| versiyasi muayyan sanalarda faol bo'lganligini kuzatish uchun *PLM* dan "
"foydalaning."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:17
msgid ""
"Every |BOM| version is stored in an *engineering change order* (ECO) for "
"organized testing and improvements without disrupting normal manufacturing "
"operations."
msgstr ""
"Har bir |BOM| versiyasi oddiy ishlab chiqarish operatsiyalarini buzmasdan "
"tartibli sinov va yaxshilashlar uchun *muhandislik o'zgarishi buyurtmasi* "
"(ECO) da saqlanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:21
msgid ":ref:`Engineering change order <plm/eco>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Muhandislik o'zgarishi buyurtmasi <plm/eco>`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:24
msgid "Current BoM version"
msgstr "Joriy BoM versiyasi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:26
msgid ""
"To see the current version of the |BOM| used in production, go "
"to :menuselection:`PLM app --> Master Data --> Bill of Materials`, and "
"select the desired |BOM| from the list. Then, switch to "
"the :guilabel:`Miscellaneous` tab, where the currently "
"live :guilabel:`Version` of the |BOM| is displayed."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarishda foydalanilayotgan |BOM| ning joriy versiyasini ko'rish "
"uchun :menuselection:`PLM app --> Master Data --> Bill of Materials` "
"yo'lidan o'ting va ro'yxatdan kerakli |BOM| ni tanlang. "
"So'ngra :guilabel:`Miscellaneous` varag'iga o'ting, u yerda |BOM| ning "
"hozirda amaldagi :guilabel:`Version` raqami ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:32
msgid ""
"|BOMs| can also be accessed from :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> "
"Products --> Bill of Materials`."
msgstr ""
"|BOMs| ga :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Products --> Bill of "
"Materials` orqali ham kirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:None
msgid "Show the current version BOM in the Misc tab."
msgstr "Misc varag'ida joriy BOM versiyasini ko'rsatish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:40
msgid "Version history"
msgstr "Versiyalar tarixi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:42
msgid ""
"To manage all former, current, and future versions of a |BOM|, begin by "
"navigating to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Products --> Bills of "
"Materials` and click the desired |BOM|."
msgstr ""
"|BOM| ning barcha oldingi, joriy va kelajakdagi versiyalarini boshqarish "
"uchun avval :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Products --> Bills of "
"Materials` yo'lidan o'ting va kerakli |BOM| ni bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:45
msgid ""
"From the |BOM| page, click the :guilabel:`ECO` smart button, and switch to "
"list view by selecting the :guilabel:`≣ (four horizontal lines)` icon on the "
"top right corner."
msgstr ""
"|BOM| sahifasidan :guilabel:`ECO` smart tugmasini bosing va yuqori o'ng "
"burchakdagi :guilabel:`≣ (four horizontal lines)` ikonkasini tanlab, ro'yxat "
"ko'rinishiga o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:49
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`ECO` smart button is visible on the |BOM| **only** if the "
"*PLM* app is installed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`ECO` smart tugmasi |BOM| sahifasida **faqat** *PLM* ilovasi "
"o'rnatilgan bo'lsa ko'rinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:None
msgid "Show ECO smart button on a BoM."
msgstr "BoM sahifasida ECO smart tugmasini ko'rsatish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:55
msgid ""
"In the list of |ECOs| for the product, navigate to the search bar at the "
"top, and click the :guilabel:`▼ (down arrow)` icon on the right to access a "
"drop-down menu of :guilabel:`Filters`."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulot uchun |ECOs| ro'yxatida yuqoridagi qidiruv paneliga o'ting "
"va :guilabel:`Filters` ochiluvchi menyusiga kirish uchun o'ng "
"tomondagi :guilabel:`▼ (down arrow)` ikonkasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:58
msgid ""
"Next, filter by :guilabel:`Done` |ECOs| to view: the revision history of the "
"|BOM|, the :guilabel:`Responsible` user who applied the change, and "
"the :guilabel:`Effective Date` of the |BOM|."
msgstr ""
"So'ngra, quyidagilarni ko'rish uchun :guilabel:`Done` |ECOs| bo'yicha "
"filtrlang: |BOM| ning tahrirlar tarixi, o'zgarishni "
"qo'llagan :guilabel:`Responsible` foydalanuvchi va |BOM| "
"ning :guilabel:`Effective Date` sanasi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:62
msgid ""
"Click each |ECO| to view the past components, operations, and design files "
"associated with the |BOM|."
msgstr ""
"|BOM| bilan bog'liq avvalgi komponentlar, operatsiyalar va dizayn fayllarini "
"ko'rish uchun har bir |ECO| ustiga bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:None
msgid "Display ECO revision history for a BoM for a product."
msgstr "Mahsulotning BoM uchun ECO tahrirlar tarixini ko'rsatish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:70
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Effective Date` field is empty, the :guilabel:`Effective` "
"date of the |ECO| is automatically set to :guilabel:`As soon as possible` "
"and no dates are recorded in the revision history of the |BOM|."
msgstr ""
"Agar :guilabel:`Effective Date` maydoni bo'sh bo'lsa, |ECO| "
"ning :guilabel:`Effective` sanasi avtomatik ravishda :guilabel:`As soon as "
"possible` qilib belgilanadi va |BOM| ning tahrirlar tarixida hech qanday "
"sana qayd etilmaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:0
msgid "List of BOM effective dates."
msgstr "BOM amal qilish sanalari ro'yxati."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:79
msgid ""
"A workaround for checking when the |BOM| went live is by navigating to the "
"chatter, and hovering over the time the |ECO| was moved to the :ref:`closing "
"stage <plm/eco/stage-config>`."
msgstr ""
"|BOM| qachon kuchga kirganini tekshirishning muqobil usuli — chatter "
"bo'limiga o'tib, |ECO| :ref:`yakunlash bosqichiga <plm/eco/stage-config>` "
"ko'chirilgan vaqt ustiga kursorni olib borishdir."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:83
msgid "Design files"
msgstr "Dizayn fayllari"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:85
msgid ""
"Attach computer-aided design (CAD) files, PDFs, images, or other design "
"material to the |BOM| itself."
msgstr ""
"Kompyuter yordamida loyihalash (CAD) fayllari, PDF fayllar, rasmlar yoki "
"boshqa dizayn materiallarini bevosita |BOM| ga biriktiring."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:88
msgid ""
"To do so, navigate to :menuselection:`PLM app --> Master Data --> Bill of "
"Materials`, and select the desired |BOM|. On the |BOM|, navigate to the "
"*chatter*, and click the :guilabel:`📎 (paperclip)` icon."
msgstr ""
"Buning uchun :menuselection:`PLM app --> Master Data --> Bill of Materials` "
"yo'lidan o'ting va kerakli |BOM| ni tanlang. |BOM| da *chatter* bo'limiga "
"o'ting va :guilabel:`📎 (paperclip)` ikonkasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:92
msgid ""
"The files associated with the |BOM| are displayed in the :guilabel:`Files` "
"section. To add more design files, select the :guilabel:`Attach files` "
"button."
msgstr ""
"|BOM| bilan bog'liq fayllar :guilabel:`Files` bo'limida ko'rsatiladi. "
"Ko'proq dizayn fayllarini qo'shish uchun :guilabel:`Attach files` tugmasini "
"tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:None
msgid "Show paperclip icon in the chatter to attach files to a BoM."
msgstr ""
"BoM ga fayllarni biriktirish uchun chatter'dagi qisqich ikonkasini "
"ko'rsatish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:100
msgid "Manage design files in an ECO"
msgstr "ECO da dizayn fayllarini boshqarish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:102
msgid ""
"Add, modify, and remove files in an |ECO|. Once the |ECO| is approved and "
"applied, the new files are automatically linked to the production |BOM|. "
"Archived files are removed from the |BOM|, but are still accessible in the |"
"ECO|."
msgstr ""
"|ECO| da fayllarni qo'shing, o'zgartiring va olib tashlang. |ECO| "
"tasdiqlanib qo'llangandan so'ng, yangi fayllar avtomatik ravishda ishlab "
"chiqarish |BOM| iga bog'lanadi. Arxivlangan fayllar |BOM| dan olib "
"tashlanadi, lekin |ECO| da hali ham mavjud bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:106
msgid ""
"To manage the design files in the |ECO|, begin by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`PLM app --> Changes` and choose the desired |ECO|. Next, "
"open the :guilabel:`Attachments` page by clicking the :guilabel:`Documents` "
"smart button."
msgstr ""
"|ECO| dagi dizayn fayllarini boshqarish uchun avval :menuselection:`PLM app "
"--> Changes` yo'lidan o'ting va kerakli |ECO| ni tanlang. "
"So'ngra, :guilabel:`Documents` smart tugmasini "
"bosib, :guilabel:`Attachments` sahifasini oching."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:110
msgid ""
"Hover over each attachment to reveal the :guilabel:`︙ (three vertical "
"dots)` icon. From there, choose whether "
"to :guilabel:`Edit`, :guilabel:`Remove`, or :guilabel:`Download` the file. "
"Any changes made to these files are contained within the |ECO|, and will "
"only apply to the production |BOM| once the :ref:`changes are applied <plm/"
"eco/apply-changes>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`︙ (three vertical dots)` ikonkasini ko'rish uchun har bir "
"biriktirma ustiga kursorni olib boring. U yerdan "
"faylni :guilabel:`Edit`, :guilabel:`Remove` yoki :guilabel:`Download` "
"qilishni tanlang. Ushbu fayllarga kiritilgan har qanday o'zgarishlar |ECO| "
"ichida saqlanadi va faqat :ref:`o'zgarishlar qo'llangandan <plm/eco/apply-"
"changes>` so'ng ishlab chiqarish |BOM| iga taalluqli bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:116
msgid ""
"In the `Create 60% keyboard` |ECO|, the design files are from the original "
"`100% keyboard` |BOM|. To replace the keyboard PDF, begin by selecting "
"the :guilabel:`Documents` smart button."
msgstr ""
"`Create 60% keyboard` |ECO| da dizayn fayllari asl `100% keyboard` |BOM| dan "
"olingan. Klaviatura PDF faylini almashtirish uchun "
"avval :guilabel:`Documents` smart tugmasini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:0
msgid "Show *Documents* smart button from an active ECO."
msgstr "Faol ECO dan *Documents* smart tugmasini ko'rsatish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:123
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Attachments` page, hover over the `100% keyboard "
"manual.pdf` design file, and click the :guilabel:`︙ (three vertical dots)` "
"icon. Then, click the :guilabel:`Remove` option to archive the file."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Attachments` sahifasida `100% keyboard manual.pdf` dizayn fayli "
"ustiga kursorni olib boring va :guilabel:`︙ (three vertical dots)` "
"ikonkasini bosing. So'ngra, faylni arxivlash uchun :guilabel:`Remove` "
"variantini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:127
msgid ""
"Next, on the same :guilabel:`Attachments` page, click the :guilabel:`Upload` "
"button to upload the new design file, named `60% keyboard manual`."
msgstr ""
"So'ngra, o'sha :guilabel:`Attachments` sahifasida `60% keyboard manual` "
"nomli yangi dizayn faylini yuklash uchun :guilabel:`Upload` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:0
msgid ""
"View of *Attachments* page from the *Documents* smart button. Displays one "
"archived and\n"
"one newly added attachment."
msgstr ""
"*Documents* smart tugmasi orqali ochilgan *Attachments* sahifasi ko'rinishi. "
"Bitta arxivlangan va\n"
"bitta yangi qo'shilgan biriktirmani ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:136
msgid ""
"Archived files are **not** permanently deleted — they can still be accessed "
"in the previous |ECO|, or as an archived file in the latest |ECO|, where the "
"archival occurred."
msgstr ""
"Arxivlangan fayllar butunlay **o'chirilmaydi** — ularga avvalgi |ECO| da "
"yoki arxivlash sodir bo'lgan eng so'nggi |ECO| da arxivlangan fayl sifatida "
"hali ham kirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:140
msgid "Apply rebase"
msgstr "Rebase qo'llash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:142
msgid ""
"Odoo simplifies merge conflict resolution for concurrent |ECOs| on the same "
"product."
msgstr ""
"Odoo bir xil mahsulot bo'yicha parallel |ECOs| dagi birlashtirish "
"ziddiyatlarini hal qilishni soddalashtiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:144
msgid ""
"Conflicts can occur when the production |BOM| is updated while other |ECOs| "
"are modifying the previous version. Differences between the new and previous "
"production |BOMs| are displayed in the :guilabel:`Previous Eco Bom Changes` "
"tab, visible only in this scenario."
msgstr ""
"Boshqa |ECOs| avvalgi versiyani o'zgartirayotgan paytda ishlab chiqarish |"
"BOM| yangilansa, ziddiyatlar yuzaga kelishi mumkin. Yangi va avvalgi ishlab "
"chiqarish |BOMs| orasidagi farqlar faqat shu holatda "
"ko'rinadigan :guilabel:`Previous Eco Bom Changes` varag'ida ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:148
msgid ""
"To resolve conflicts and retain |ECO| changes, click the :guilabel:`Apply "
"Rebase` button."
msgstr ""
"Ziddiyatlarni hal qilish va |ECO| o'zgarishlarini saqlab qolish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Apply Rebase` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:151
msgid ""
"Two |ECOs|, `ECO0011` and `ECO0012`, are created when the current |BOM| "
"version is `5`. In `ECO0011`, a new component, `Space stabilizer`, is added, "
"and the changes are applied. This means the current |BOM| version has become "
"`6`."
msgstr ""
"Joriy |BOM| versiyasi `5` bo'lganida ikkita |ECOs|, `ECO0011` va `ECO0012`, "
"yaratiladi. `ECO0011` da yangi komponent, `Space stabilizer`, qo'shiladi va "
"o'zgarishlar qo'llanadi. Bu joriy |BOM| versiyasi `6` bo'lganini bildiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:0
msgid "Apply changes to an ECO to update the production BOM."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish BOM ini yangilash uchun ECO ga o'zgarishlarni qo'llash."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:159
msgid ""
"This means `ECO0012` is modifying an outdated |BOM|. As shown in "
"the :guilabel:`Previous Eco Bom Changes` tab, the |BOM| is missing the "
"`Space stabilizer`."
msgstr ""
"Bu `ECO0012` eskirgan |BOM| ni o'zgartirayotganini "
"bildiradi. :guilabel:`Previous Eco Bom Changes` varag'ida ko'rsatilganidek, |"
"BOM| da `Space stabilizer` yetishmayapti."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:162
msgid ""
"To ensure the changes applied by `ECO0011` are kept when the changes occur "
"in `ECO0012`, click the :guilabel:`Apply Rebase` button to apply the "
"previous |ECO| changes, without affecting the changes already made to "
"`ECO0012`."
msgstr ""
"`ECO0012` da o'zgarishlar yuz berganda `ECO0011` tomonidan qo'llangan "
"o'zgarishlar saqlanib qolishini ta'minlash uchun :guilabel:`Apply Rebase` "
"tugmasini bosing — bu `ECO0012` ga allaqachon kiritilgan o'zgarishlarga "
"ta'sir qilmasdan, avvalgi |ECO| o'zgarishlarini qo'llaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/manage_changes/version_control.rst:0
msgid ""
"Click the *Apply Rebase* button to update the BOM to match the production "
"BOM."
msgstr ""
"BOM ni ishlab chiqarish BOM iga moslashtirish uchun *Apply Rebase* tugmasini "
"bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management.rst:3
msgid "Project management"
msgstr "Loyiha boshqaruvi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:3
msgid "Approvals"
msgstr "Tasdiqlashlar"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:10
msgid ""
"Notify stakeholders and managers automatically by assigning approvers to "
"stages of :ref:`engineering change orders <plm/eco>` (ECOs) under review. "
"Changes can only be applied after the assigned approver accepts them. "
"Approvals ensure reviews by team members, which prevents mistakes and "
"premature actions."
msgstr ""
"Ko'rib chiqilayotgan :ref:`muhandislik o'zgarish buyurtmalari <plm/eco>` "
"(ECO) bosqichlariga tasdiqlovchilarni tayinlash orqali manfaatdor tomonlar "
"va menejerlarni avtomatik ravishda xabardor qiling. O'zgarishlar faqat "
"tayinlangan tasdiqlovchi ularni qabul qilgandan so'ng qo'llanishi mumkin. "
"Tasdiqlashlar jamoa a'zolari tomonidan ko'rib chiqilishini ta'minlaydi, bu "
"esa xatolar va muddatidan oldingi harakatlarning oldini oladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:16
msgid ":ref:`Stage configuration <plm/eco/stage-config>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Bosqich konfiguratsiyasi <plm/eco/stage-config>`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:19
msgid "Add approvers"
msgstr "Tasdiqlovchilarni qo'shish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:21
msgid ""
"To add an approver, first go to the :menuselection:`PLM app`, and click on "
"the project card of an |ECO| type to open the Gantt view of the |ECOs|."
msgstr ""
"Tasdiqlovchini qo'shish uchun avval :menuselection:`PLM app` ilovasiga "
"o'ting va |ECOs| ning Gantt ko'rinishini ochish uchun |ECO| turi loyiha "
"kartochkasiga bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:24
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Engineering Change Orders` page, hover over the intended "
"stage, and select the :icon:`fa-gear` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon. Then, "
"click :guilabel:`Edit` to open a pop-up window."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Engineering Change Orders` sahifasida kerakli bosqich ustiga "
"kursorni olib boring va :icon:`fa-gear` :guilabel:`(Actions)` ikonkasini "
"tanlang. So'ngra, qalqib chiquvchi oynani ochish uchun :guilabel:`Edit` "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:28
msgid ""
"Approvers can be added to any stage, but they are most essential in the "
"*verification* stage, before the final *closing* stage which applies the |"
"ECO| and updates the :abbr:`BoM (Bill of Materials)`. This allows "
"stakeholders to control how and when changes are made."
msgstr ""
"Tasdiqlovchilarni istalgan bosqichga qo'shish mumkin, lekin ular |ECO| ni "
"qo'llaydigan va :abbr:`BoM (Bill of Materials)` ni yangilaydigan yakuniy "
"*yakunlash* bosqichidan oldingi *tekshirish* bosqichida eng muhim "
"hisoblanadi. Bu manfaatdor tomonlarga o'zgarishlar qanday va qachon "
"kiritilishini nazorat qilish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:32
msgid ""
"See the documentation about :ref:`stage types <plm/eco/stage-config>` for "
"more information."
msgstr ""
"Ko'proq ma'lumot uchun :ref:`bosqich turlari <plm/eco/stage-config>` "
"haqidagi hujjatlarga qarang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:34
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Edit` stage pop-up window, click the :guilabel:`Add a "
"line` button, located under :guilabel:`Approvals`. Then, type in the "
"position or title of the approver under :guilabel:`Role` (e.g. `Engineering "
"Manager`, `Quality Team`, etc.), and select the relevant :guilabel:`User` "
"from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Edit` bosqich qalqib chiquvchi oynasida :guilabel:`Approvals` "
"ostida joylashgan :guilabel:`Add a line` tugmasini bosing. "
"So'ngra, :guilabel:`Role` ostida tasdiqlovchining lavozimi yoki unvonini "
"kiriting (masalan, `Engineering Manager`, `Quality Team` va h.k.) va "
"ochiluvchi menyudan tegishli :guilabel:`User` ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:42
msgid "Approval types"
msgstr "Tasdiqlash turlari"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:44
msgid ""
"Next, set the :guilabel:`Approval Type` to :guilabel:`Is required to "
"approve`, :guilabel:`Approves, but the approval is optional`, "
"or :guilabel:`Comments only`."
msgstr ""
"So'ngra, :guilabel:`Approval Type` ni :guilabel:`Is required to "
"approve`, :guilabel:`Approves, but the approval is optional` "
"yoki :guilabel:`Comments only` qilib belgilang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:48
msgid ""
"Assign the `CTO`, \"Mitchell Admin,\" as a required approver for |ECOs| in "
"the `Validated` stage in the `New Product Introduction` |ECO| type."
msgstr ""
"`New Product Introduction` |ECO| turidagi `Validated` bosqichidagi |ECOs| "
"uchun `CTO`, \"Mitchell Admin\" ni majburiy tasdiqlovchi sifatida tayinlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:51
msgid ""
"Approvals from the quality and marketing teams are **not** required to apply "
"changes to the |ECO| because their :guilabel:`Approval Type` is set "
"to :guilabel:`Approves, but the approval is optional` "
"and :guilabel:`Comments only`, respectively."
msgstr ""
"Sifat va marketing jamoalarining tasdiqlashlari |ECO| ga o'zgarishlarni "
"qo'llash uchun **talab qilinmaydi**, chunki ularning :guilabel:`Approval "
"Type` mos ravishda :guilabel:`Approves, but the approval is optional` "
"va :guilabel:`Comments only` qilib belgilangan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:0
msgid ""
"Set an approver that \"Is required to approve\" ECOs in the \"Validated\" "
"stage."
msgstr ""
"\"Validated\" bosqichidagi ECO larni \"Is required to approve\" turidagi "
"tasdiqlovchini belgilash."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:59
msgid "Manage approvals"
msgstr "Tasdiqlashlarni boshqarish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:61
msgid ""
"Approvers can track their to-do approvals by navigating to "
"the :menuselection:`PLM app`, and selecting the card for an |ECO| type, "
"which shows the count of open tasks assigned to them."
msgstr ""
"Tasdiqlovchilar :menuselection:`PLM app` ilovasiga o'tib, |ECO| turi "
"kartochkasini tanlash orqali bajarilishi kerak bo'lgan tasdiqlashlarini "
"kuzatishlari mumkin — kartochkada ularga tayinlangan ochiq vazifalar soni "
"ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:None
msgid ""
"Display count of validations to-do and buttons to open filtered list of ECOs."
msgstr ""
"Bajarilishi kerak bo'lgan tasdiqlashlar sonini va filtrlangan ECO ro'yxatini "
"ochish tugmalarini ko'rsatish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:67
msgid "Here's what each button on an |ECO| project card does:"
msgstr "|ECO| loyiha kartochkasidagi har bir tugma quyidagilarni bajaradi:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:69
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`# Engineering Changes` button displays a count of in-progress "
"|ECOs| of this ECO type. Clicking the button opens the Gantt view of "
"the :guilabel:`Engineering Change Orders` page."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`# Engineering Changes` tugmasi ushbu ECO turidagi bajarilayotgan |"
"ECOs| sonini ko'rsatadi. Tugmani bosish :guilabel:`Engineering Change "
"Orders` sahifasining Gantt ko'rinishini ochadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:71
msgid ""
":guilabel:`My Validations` displays a count of |ECOs| the approver must "
"accept or reject. Clicking on this button displays |ECOs| pending approval "
"or rejected (marked with the red :guilabel:`Blocked` state)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`My Validations` tasdiqlovchi qabul qilishi yoki rad etishi kerak "
"bo'lgan |ECOs| sonini ko'rsatadi. Ushbu tugmani bosish tasdiqlanishi "
"kutilayotgan yoki rad etilgan (qizil :guilabel:`Blocked` holati bilan "
"belgilangan) |ECOs| ni ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:74
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`All Validations` button shows the count of |ECOs| awaiting "
"approval or rejected by any approver. Clicking it reveals these pending |"
"ECOs|."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`All Validations` tugmasi har qanday tasdiqlovchi tomonidan "
"tasdiqlanishi kutilayotgan yoki rad etilgan |ECOs| sonini ko'rsatadi. Uni "
"bosish ushbu kutilayotgan |ECOs| ni ochadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:76
msgid ""
":guilabel:`To Apply` displays a count of |ECOs| to which the user needs to "
"apply changes. Clicking on the button displays all the |ECOs| to approve, "
"and apply changes to, in the verification stage."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`To Apply` foydalanuvchi o'zgarishlarni qo'llashi kerak bo'lgan |"
"ECOs| sonini ko'rsatadi. Tugmani bosish tekshirish bosqichida tasdiqlanishi "
"va o'zgarishlar qo'llanishi kerak bo'lgan barcha |ECOs| ni ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:80
msgid ""
"|ECOs| marked with the green :guilabel:`Done` stage have already been "
"approved, and the user needs to click on the |ECO| to enter the form view, "
"and click the :guilabel:`Apply Changes` button."
msgstr ""
"Yashil :guilabel:`Done` bosqichi bilan belgilangan |ECOs| allaqachon "
"tasdiqlangan bo'lib, foydalanuvchi forma ko'rinishiga kirish uchun |ECO| "
"ustiga bosishi va :guilabel:`Apply Changes` tugmasini bosishi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:84
msgid ""
"|ECO| approvals can be accessed, managed, and follow-up actions scheduled "
"through *Activities*. See the :doc:`Activities documentation <../../../"
"essentials/activities>` to learn more about integrating management workflows."
msgstr ""
"|ECO| tasdiqlashlariga kirish, ularni boshqarish va keyingi harakatlarni "
"rejalashtirish *Activities* orqali amalga oshiriladi. Boshqaruv ish "
"jarayonlarini integratsiyalash haqida ko'proq ma'lumot olish "
"uchun :doc:`Activities hujjatlariga <../../../essentials/activities>` qarang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:89
msgid "Approve ECOs"
msgstr "ECO larni tasdiqlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:91
msgid ""
"Navigate to an |ECO| in a verification stage, while logged in as the "
"assigned approver, to see the :guilabel:`Approve`, :guilabel:`Reject`, "
"and :guilabel:`Apply Changes` buttons."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Approve`, :guilabel:`Reject` va :guilabel:`Apply Changes` "
"tugmalarini ko'rish uchun tayinlangan tasdiqlovchi sifatida tizimga kirgan "
"holda tekshirish bosqichidagi |ECO| ga o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:94
msgid ""
"To approve the |ECO|, and apply the changes onto the production :abbr:`BoM "
"(Bill of Materials)`, click :guilabel:`Approve`, and then :guilabel:`Apply "
"Changes`."
msgstr ""
"|ECO| ni tasdiqlash va o'zgarishlarni ishlab chiqarishdagi :abbr:`BoM (Bill "
"of Materials)` ga qo'llash uchun :guilabel:`Approve` tugmasini, "
"so'ngra :guilabel:`Apply Changes` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:97
msgid ""
"Note that the :guilabel:`Apply Changes` button will **not** work unless "
"the :guilabel:`Approve` button was clicked first. Additionally, the chatter "
"logs the history of the clicked buttons."
msgstr ""
"Shuni yodda tutingki, avval :guilabel:`Approve` tugmasi bosilmagan "
"bo'lsa, :guilabel:`Apply Changes` tugmasi **ishlamaydi**. Bundan tashqari, "
"chatter bosilgan tugmalar tarixini qayd qilib boradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/plm/management/approvals.rst:101
msgid ""
"If no approver has the :guilabel:`Is required to approve` approval type, "
"the :guilabel:`Apply Changes` button **will work** without requiring "
"the :guilabel:`Approve` button to be clicked first."
msgstr ""
"Agar hech bir tasdiqlovchida :guilabel:`Is required to approve` tasdiqlash "
"turi bo'lmasa, :guilabel:`Apply Changes` tugmasi avval :guilabel:`Approve` "
"tugmasi bosilishini talab qilmasdan **ishlaydi**."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase.rst:8
msgid "Purchase"
msgstr "Xarid"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase.rst:10
msgid ""
"**Odoo Purchase** helps keep track of purchase agreements, quotations, and "
"purchase orders. Learn how to monitor purchase tender, automate "
"replenishment, and follow up on your orders."
msgstr ""
"**Odoo Purchase** xarid kelishuvlari, takliflar va xarid buyurtmalarini "
"kuzatib borishga yordam beradi. Xarid tenderini kuzatish, to'ldirishni "
"avtomatlashtirish va buyurtmalaringizni nazorat qilishni o'rganing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase.rst:14
msgid "`Odoo Tutorials: Purchase <https://www.odoo.com/slides/purchase-23>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Odoo darsliklari: Purchase <https://www.odoo.com/slides/purchase-23>`_"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced.rst:5
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Kengaytirilgan"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:3
msgid "Purchase Analysis report"
msgstr "Xarid tahlili hisoboti"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:8
msgid ""
"The *Purchase Analysis* report provides statistics about products purchased "
"using Odoo's **Purchase** app. This data is useful for gaining a deeper "
"understanding of key metrics related to purchase orders (POs), including the "
"quantity of products ordered and received, the amount of time it takes to "
"receive purchased products, and more."
msgstr ""
"*Xarid tahlili* hisoboti Odoo **Purchase** ilovasi orqali xarid qilingan "
"mahsulotlar haqidagi statistikani taqdim etadi. Bu ma'lumotlar xarid "
"buyurtmalariga (PO) oid asosiy ko'rsatkichlarni, jumladan buyurtma qilingan "
"va qabul qilingan mahsulotlar miqdorini, xarid qilingan mahsulotlarni qabul "
"qilish uchun ketadigan vaqtni va boshqalarni chuqurroq tushunish uchun "
"foydalidir."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:13
msgid ""
"To open the Purchase Analysis report, navigate to :menuselection:`Purchase "
"app --> Reporting --> Purchase`."
msgstr ""
"Xarid tahlili hisobotini ochish uchun :menuselection:`Purchase app --> "
"Reporting --> Purchase` yo'lidan o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:17
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Purchase Analysis` report is one of many reports available "
"across the Odoo app suite. This documentation only covers the measures "
"specific to the :guilabel:`Purchase Analysis` report, along with a few use "
"case examples."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Purchase Analysis` hisoboti Odoo ilovalar to'plamida mavjud "
"bo'lgan ko'plab hisobotlardan biridir. Ushbu hujjat "
"faqat :guilabel:`Purchase Analysis` hisobotiga xos o'lchovlarni hamda bir "
"nechta foydalanish holati misollarini qamrab oladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:27
msgid ""
"*Measures* refer to the various datasets that can be displayed on "
"the :guilabel:`Purchase Analysis` report, with each dataset representing a "
"key statistic about |POs| or products. To choose a measure, click "
"the :guilabel:`Measures` :icon:`fa-caret-down` button, and select one of the "
"options from the drop-down menu:"
msgstr ""
"*O'lchovlar* :guilabel:`Purchase Analysis` hisobotida ko'rsatilishi mumkin "
"bo'lgan turli ma'lumotlar to'plamlarini anglatadi, bunda har bir ma'lumotlar "
"to'plami |POs| yoki mahsulotlar haqidagi asosiy statistikani ifodalaydi. "
"O'lchovni tanlash uchun :guilabel:`Measures` :icon:`fa-caret-down` tugmasini "
"bosing va ochiluvchi menyudan variantlardan birini tanlang:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`# of Lines`: The number of |PO| order lines, across all |POs|."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`# of Lines`: Barcha |POs| bo'yicha |PO| buyurtma qatorlari soni."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:33
msgid ":guilabel:`Average Cost`: The average cost of |POs|."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Average Cost`: |POs| ning o'rtacha qiymati."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Days to Confirm`: The number of days it takes to confirm a |PO|."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Days to Confirm`: |PO| ni tasdiqlash uchun ketadigan kunlar soni."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Days to Receive`: The number of days it takes to receive the "
"products in a |PO|."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Days to Receive`: |PO| dagi mahsulotlarni qabul qilish uchun "
"ketadigan kunlar soni."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:36
msgid ":guilabel:`Gross Weight`: The total weight of purchased products."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Gross Weight`: Xarid qilingan mahsulotlarning umumiy og'irligi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:37
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Qty Billed`: The quantity of a product (or products) for which "
"the vendor has already been billed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Qty Billed`: Yetkazib beruvchiga allaqachon hisob-faktura "
"yozilgan mahsulot (yoki mahsulotlar) miqdori."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:39
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Qty Ordered`: The quantity of a product (or products) ordered."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Qty Ordered`: Buyurtma qilingan mahsulot (yoki mahsulotlar) "
"miqdori."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:40
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Qty Received`: The quantity of an ordered product (or products) "
"received."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Qty Received`: Buyurtma qilingan mahsulotning (yoki "
"mahsulotlarning) qabul qilingan miqdori."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Qty to be Billed`: The quantity of an ordered product (or "
"products) for which the vendor has yet to be billed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Qty to be Billed`: Yetkazib beruvchiga hali hisob-faktura "
"yozilmagan buyurtma qilingan mahsulot (yoki mahsulotlar) miqdori."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:43
msgid ":guilabel:`Total`: The total amount spent, including tax."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Total`: Soliqni ham qo'shgan holda sarflangan umumiy summa."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:44
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Untaxed Total`: The total amount spent, excluding tax. This "
"measure is selected by default."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Untaxed Total`: Soliqni hisobga olmagan holda sarflangan umumiy "
"summa. Ushbu o'lchov standart bo'yicha tanlangan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:46
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Volume`: The total volume of ordered products, for products which "
"are measured by volume."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Volume`: Hajm bo'yicha o'lchanadigan mahsulotlar uchun buyurtma "
"qilingan mahsulotlarning umumiy hajmi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:48
msgid ":guilabel:`Count`: The total count of |POs|."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Count`: |POs| ning umumiy soni."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:59
msgid "Use case: determine days to receive products from each vendor"
msgstr ""
"Foydalanish holati: har bir yetkazib beruvchidan mahsulotlarni qabul qilish "
"kunlarini aniqlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:61
msgid ""
"One possible use case for the :guilabel:`Purchase Analysis` report is "
"determining how long each vendor takes to deliver purchased items. This "
"allows companies to make better informed decisions about which vendors they "
"want to purchase from."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Purchase Analysis` hisobotidan foydalanishning mumkin bo'lgan "
"holatlaridan biri — har bir yetkazib beruvchi xarid qilingan mahsulotlarni "
"yetkazib berishga qancha vaqt sarflashini aniqlashdir. Bu kompaniyalarga "
"qaysi yetkazib beruvchilardan xarid qilishni xohlashlari haqida yaxshiroq "
"asoslangan qarorlar qabul qilish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:66
msgid ""
"A local bike shop, *Bike Haus*, sells high-quality unicycles, bicycles, "
"tricycles, and all the accessories needed to ride and maintain them. They "
"purchase their inventory from a few different vendors, and then sell those "
"products on to customers through their storefront."
msgstr ""
"Mahalliy velosiped do'koni *Bike Haus* yuqori sifatli bir g'ildirakli, ikki "
"g'ildirakli va uch g'ildirakli velosipedlar hamda ularni minish va texnik "
"holatda saqlash uchun zarur bo'lgan barcha aksessuarlarni sotadi. Ular o'z "
"zaxiralarini bir nechta turli yetkazib beruvchilardan xarid qiladi, so'ngra "
"bu mahsulotlarni do'konlari orqali mijozlarga sotadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:70
msgid ""
"Recently, Bike Haus has decided to have their purchasing manager, David, "
"look into how long it has taken each of their vendors to deliver the items "
"they've purchased during the current year, 2024."
msgstr ""
"Yaqinda Bike Haus o'z xarid menejeri Davidga joriy 2024-yil davomida xarid "
"qilingan mahsulotlarni har bir yetkazib beruvchi qancha vaqtda yetkazib "
"berganini o'rganib chiqishni topshirishga qaror qildi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:74
msgid ""
"David starts by navigating to :menuselection:`Purchase app --> Reporting --> "
"Purchase`, and selecting the :icon:`fa-bar-chart` (bar chart) graph type at "
"the top of the report."
msgstr ""
"David ishni :menuselection:`Purchase app --> Reporting --> Purchase` "
"yo'lidan o'tishdan va hisobotning yuqori qismidagi :icon:`fa-bar-chart` "
"(ustunli diagramma) grafik turini tanlashdan boshlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:77
msgid ""
"Next, he clicks the :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(toggle)` button on the "
"right of the search bar to open its drop-down menu. In "
"the :guilabel:`Confirmation Date` filter section, he makes sure that "
"**only** the :guilabel:`2024` filter is enabled. Then, he selects "
"the :guilabel:`Vendor` option in the :guilabel:`Group By` section, before "
"clicking away from the drop-down menu to close it."
msgstr ""
"So'ngra u ochiluvchi menyuni ochish uchun qidiruv panelining o'ng "
"tomonidagi :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(toggle)` tugmasini "
"bosadi. :guilabel:`Confirmation Date` filtri bo'limida u "
"**faqat** :guilabel:`2024` filtri yoqilganiga ishonch hosil qiladi. Keyin "
"u :guilabel:`Group By` bo'limida :guilabel:`Vendor` variantini tanlaydi va "
"ochiluvchi menyuni yopish uchun undan tashqariga bosadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:83
msgid ""
"Finally, David clicks on the :guilabel:`Measures` :icon:`fa-caret-down` drop-"
"down menu, and selects the :guilabel:`Days to Receive` option."
msgstr ""
"Nihoyat, David :guilabel:`Measures` :icon:`fa-caret-down` ochiluvchi "
"menyusini bosadi va :guilabel:`Days to Receive` variantini tanlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:86
msgid ""
"With all of these options enabled, the :guilabel:`Purchase Analysis` report "
"shows a bar chart, with one bar for each vendor, representing the average "
"number of days it takes to receive products purchased from the vendor."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu barcha variantlar yoqilganda, :guilabel:`Purchase Analysis` hisoboti "
"har bir yetkazib beruvchi uchun bittadan ustunli diagrammani ko'rsatadi; har "
"bir ustun yetkazib beruvchidan xarid qilingan mahsulotlarni qabul qilish "
"uchun ketadigan o'rtacha kunlar sonini ifodalaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:90
msgid ""
"Using this data, David can see that it takes Bike Friends over 4.5 days, on "
"average, to deliver purchased products. This is more than four times the "
"amount of time it takes any other vendor."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu ma'lumotlardan foydalanib, David Bike Friends xarid qilingan "
"mahsulotlarni yetkazib berish uchun o'rtacha 4,5 kundan ortiq vaqt "
"sarflashini ko'rishi mumkin. Bu boshqa har qanday yetkazib beruvchi "
"sarflaydigan vaqtdan to'rt baravar ko'proq."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:93
msgid ""
"Based on these findings, David makes the decision to reduce the quantity of "
"products purchased from Bike Friends."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu xulosalarga asoslanib, David Bike Friends'dan xarid qilinadigan "
"mahsulotlar miqdorini kamaytirish to'g'risida qaror qabul qiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:0
msgid ""
"The Purchase report, showing the average days to receive products from "
"vendors."
msgstr ""
"Yetkazib beruvchilardan mahsulotlarni qabul qilishning o'rtacha kunlarini "
"ko'rsatuvchi Xarid hisoboti."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:101
msgid "Use case: compare vendor POs for two time periods"
msgstr ""
"Foydalanish holati: ikki vaqt oralig'i uchun yetkazib beruvchi xarid "
"buyurtmalarini solishtirish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:103
msgid ""
"Another use for the :guilabel:`Purchase Analysis` report is to compare key "
"statistics about |POs| for two different time periods, for a specific "
"vendor. By doing so, it is easy to understand how purchases from the vendor "
"have increased or decreased."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Purchase Analysis` hisobotidan yana bir foydalanish usuli — "
"muayyan yetkazib beruvchi uchun ikki xil vaqt oralig'idagi |POs| haqidagi "
"asosiy statistikani solishtirishdir. Shu tariqa yetkazib beruvchidan "
"xaridlar qanchalik oshgan yoki kamayganini tushunish oson bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:108
msgid ""
"Following the :ref:`previous example <purchase/purchase-analysis-example>`, "
"it has been one month since Bike Haus decided to reduce the quantity of "
"products purchased from Bike Friends, one of their retailers. Bike Haus' "
"purchasing manager, David, wants to understand the impact this decision has "
"had on the amount of money they have spent on Bike Friends products."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Oldingi misol <purchase/purchase-analysis-example>` davomi sifatida, "
"Bike Haus o'z sotuvchilaridan biri bo'lgan Bike Friends'dan xarid "
"qilinadigan mahsulotlar miqdorini kamaytirishga qaror qilganiga bir oy "
"bo'ldi. Bike Haus'ning xarid menejeri David ushbu qarorning Bike Friends "
"mahsulotlariga sarflangan pul miqdoriga qanday ta'sir ko'rsatganini "
"tushunmoqchi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:113
msgid ""
"David starts by navigating to :menuselection:`Purchase app --> Reporting --> "
"Purchase`. Then, he selects the :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`(pivot "
"table)` option at the top of the screen."
msgstr ""
"David ishni :menuselection:`Purchase app --> Reporting --> Purchase` "
"yo'lidan o'tishdan boshlaydi. Keyin u ekranning yuqori qismidagi :icon:`oi-"
"view-pivot` :guilabel:`(pivot table)` variantini tanlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:116
msgid ""
"In the search bar, he types `Bike Friends`, and clicks :guilabel:`Enter`, so "
"the report only shows data for purchases from Bike Friends."
msgstr ""
"Qidiruv paneliga u `Bike Friends` deb yozadi va :guilabel:`Enter` tugmasini "
"bosadi, shunda hisobot faqat Bike Friends'dan qilingan xaridlar bo'yicha "
"ma'lumotlarni ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:119
msgid ""
"Then, David clicks the :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(toggle)` button on "
"the right of the search bar to open its drop-down menu. In "
"the :guilabel:`Confirmation Date` field, he leaves the :guilabel:`June` "
"and :guilabel:`2024` filters enabled. He also "
"selects :guilabel:`Confirmation Date: Previous Period` in "
"the :guilabel:`Comparison` section, before clicking away from the drop-down "
"menu to close it."
msgstr ""
"So'ngra David ochiluvchi menyuni ochish uchun qidiruv panelining o'ng "
"tomonidagi :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(toggle)` tugmasini "
"bosadi. :guilabel:`Confirmation Date` maydonida u :guilabel:`June` "
"va :guilabel:`2024` filtrlarini yoqilgan holda qoldiradi. Shuningdek, "
"u :guilabel:`Comparison` bo'limida :guilabel:`Confirmation Date: Previous "
"Period` variantini tanlaydi va ochiluvchi menyuni yopish uchun undan "
"tashqariga bosadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:125
msgid ""
"Next, David clicks on the :guilabel:`Measures` :icon:`fa-caret-down` drop-"
"down menu. He leaves the :guilabel:`Total` and :guilabel:`Untaxed Total` "
"datasets enabled, and disables the :guilabel:`Order` and :guilabel:`Count` "
"datasets."
msgstr ""
"Keyin David :guilabel:`Measures` :icon:`fa-caret-down` ochiluvchi menyusini "
"bosadi. U :guilabel:`Total` va :guilabel:`Untaxed Total` ma'lumotlar "
"to'plamlarini yoqilgan holda qoldiradi hamda :guilabel:`Order` "
"va :guilabel:`Count` ma'lumotlar to'plamlarini o'chiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:129
msgid ""
"Finally, David clicks the :icon:`fa-minus-square-o` :guilabel:`Total` button "
"above the rows on the pivot table, and selects the :guilabel:`Product` "
"option."
msgstr ""
"Nihoyat, David pivot jadvalidagi qatorlar ustidagi :icon:`fa-minus-square-"
"o` :guilabel:`Total` tugmasini bosadi va :guilabel:`Product` variantini "
"tanlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:132
msgid ""
"With all of these options configured, the :guilabel:`Purchase Analysis` "
"report shows a pivot table comparing purchase data for the current month, "
"June, with the previous month, May."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu barcha variantlar sozlanganda, :guilabel:`Purchase Analysis` hisoboti "
"joriy oy — iyun uchun xarid ma'lumotlarini oldingi oy — may bilan "
"solishtiruvchi pivot jadvalini ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:135
msgid ""
"The pivot table is broken down into two main columns: one for the untaxed "
"total spent, and one for the taxed total spent. These columns are further "
"broken down into three smaller columns: the amount spent in May, the amount "
"spent in June, and the variation between the two months, represented as a "
"percentage."
msgstr ""
"Pivot jadvali ikkita asosiy ustunga bo'lingan: biri soliqsiz sarflangan "
"umumiy summa uchun, ikkinchisi soliq bilan sarflangan umumiy summa uchun. "
"Ushbu ustunlar yana uchta kichikroq ustunga bo'linadi: may oyida sarflangan "
"summa, iyun oyida sarflangan summa va ikki oy orasidagi farq, foiz sifatida "
"ifodalangan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:140
msgid ""
"On the left side of the pivot table, one row is shown for each product "
"purchased from Bike Friends during June. Using this report, David is able to "
"see that Bike Haus has spent much less money on products purchased from Bike "
"Friends, compared to the previous month."
msgstr ""
"Pivot jadvalining chap tomonida iyun oyi davomida Bike Friends'dan xarid "
"qilingan har bir mahsulot uchun bittadan qator ko'rsatiladi. Ushbu hisobot "
"yordamida David Bike Haus oldingi oyga nisbatan Bike Friends'dan xarid "
"qilingan mahsulotlarga ancha kam pul sarflaganini ko'rishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/analyze.rst:0
msgid "The Purchase report, comparing the amount spent at a vendor."
msgstr "Yetkazib beruvchiga sarflangan summani solishtiruvchi Xarid hisoboti."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:3
msgid "EDI purchase-to-sales order import"
msgstr "EDI orqali xarid buyurtmasini sotuv buyurtmasi sifatida import qilish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:9
msgid ""
"Electronic data interchange (EDI) enables companies using different software "
"systems to exchange information in a standardized, structured format."
msgstr ""
"Elektron ma'lumotlar almashinuvi (EDI) turli dasturiy tizimlardan "
"foydalanadigan kompaniyalarga ma'lumotlarni standartlashtirilgan, "
"tuzilmalangan formatda almashish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:12
msgid ""
"In Odoo, a *purchase order* (PO) can be exported as an XML file and imported "
"as a *sales order* (SO) into another Odoo database, removing the need for "
"manual entry of products, quantities, prices, and other key information."
msgstr ""
"Odooda *xarid buyurtmasi* (PO) XML fayl sifatida eksport qilinishi va boshqa "
"Odoo ma'lumotlar bazasiga *sotuv buyurtmasi* (SO) sifatida import qilinishi "
"mumkin, bu esa mahsulotlar, miqdorlar, narxlar va boshqa asosiy "
"ma'lumotlarni qo'lda kiritish zaruratini bartaraf etadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:16
msgid ""
"The workflow in this document describes how buyers and sellers exchange data "
"directly between their Odoo databases. As an alternative, sellers can "
"receive a PDF version of the request for quotation (RFQ) by email "
"and :ref:`upload it directly in their Sales dashboard <purchase/advanced/rfq-"
"upload>`. **This method is simpler** but does not use the XML-based exchange "
"described in the document."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu hujjatdagi ish jarayoni xaridorlar va sotuvchilar o'z Odoo ma'lumotlar "
"bazalari o'rtasida ma'lumotlarni to'g'ridan-to'g'ri qanday almashishini "
"tavsiflaydi. Muqobil sifatida, sotuvchilar narx so'rovining (RFQ) PDF "
"versiyasini elektron pochta orqali olishlari va :ref:`uni to'g'ridan-to'g'ri "
"o'zlarining Sales boshqaruv paneliga yuklashlari <purchase/advanced/rfq-"
"upload>` mumkin. **Bu usul soddaroq**, lekin hujjatda tavsiflangan XML "
"asosidagi almashinuvdan foydalanmaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:23
msgid ""
"Exported XMLs follow the `UBL schema <https://docs.peppol.eu/poacc/upgrade-3/"
"syntax/Order/tree/>`_. When exchanging data between two Odoo databases, this "
"schema remains compatible."
msgstr ""
"Eksport qilingan XML fayllar `UBL sxemasiga <https://docs.peppol.eu/poacc/"
"upgrade-3/syntax/Order/tree/>`_ amal qiladi. Ikki Odoo ma'lumotlar bazasi "
"o'rtasida ma'lumot almashishda ushbu sxema mos bo'lib qoladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:27
msgid ""
"However, implementing custom developments for software that does not support "
"the UBL schema may introduce additional complexity."
msgstr ""
"Biroq, UBL sxemasini qo'llab-quvvatlamaydigan dasturiy ta'minot uchun maxsus "
"ishlanmalarni joriy etish qo'shimcha murakkablik keltirib chiqarishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:31
msgid "Roles and configuration"
msgstr "Rollar va sozlash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:33
msgid ""
"To facilitate the |EDI| workflow, two companies are involved: the buyer (the "
"company placing the order) and the seller (the company fulfilling the "
"order). Each company has specific roles and configurations."
msgstr ""
"|EDI| ish jarayonini amalga oshirish uchun ikkita kompaniya ishtirok etadi: "
"xaridor (buyurtma beruvchi kompaniya) va sotuvchi (buyurtmani bajaruvchi "
"kompaniya). Har bir kompaniyaning o'ziga xos rollari va sozlamalari bor."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:38
msgid "Buyer database"
msgstr "Xaridor ma'lumotlar bazasi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:40
msgid ""
"The buyer database is responsible for creating and confirming purchase "
"orders. Prerequisites include:"
msgstr ""
"Xaridor ma'lumotlar bazasi xarid buyurtmalarini yaratish va tasdiqlash uchun "
"javobgardir. Dastlabki talablar quyidagilarni o'z ichiga oladi:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:43
msgid "(required) :ref:`installing <general/install>` the **Purchase** app"
msgstr "(majburiy) **Purchase** ilovasini :ref:`o'rnatish <general/install>`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:44
msgid ""
"(optional) adding vendors (the sellers in this workflow) as :doc:`portal "
"users <../../../general/users/user_portals>`."
msgstr ""
"(ixtiyoriy) yetkazib beruvchilarni (ushbu ish jarayonidagi "
"sotuvchilarni) :doc:`portal foydalanuvchilari <../../../general/users/"
"user_portals>` sifatida qo'shish."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:48
msgid "Seller database"
msgstr "Sotuvchi ma'lumotlar bazasi"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:50
msgid ""
"The seller database is responsible for receiving and processing sales "
"orders. The only prerequisite is :ref:`installing <general/install>` the "
"**Sales** app."
msgstr ""
"Sotuvchi ma'lumotlar bazasi sotuv buyurtmalarini qabul qilish va qayta "
"ishlash uchun javobgardir. Yagona talab — **Sales** "
"ilovasini :ref:`o'rnatish <general/install>`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:57
msgid "Buyer's process"
msgstr "Xaridor jarayoni"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:59
msgid ""
"To begin, the buyer (in their database) navigates to "
"the :menuselection:`Purchase` app to create a :abbr:`RFQ (request for "
"quotation)`."
msgstr ""
"Boshlash uchun xaridor (o'z ma'lumotlar bazasida) :abbr:`RFQ (request for "
"quotation)` yaratish uchun :menuselection:`Purchase` ilovasiga o'tadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:62
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`Vendor` to the portal user representing the seller, "
"and :guilabel:`Confirm` the :abbr:`RFQ (request for quotation)`. Doing so "
"converts it into a :doc:`purchase order <../manage_deals/rfq>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Vendor` maydonida sotuvchini ifodalovchi portal foydalanuvchisini "
"belgilang va :abbr:`RFQ (request for quotation)` ni :guilabel:`Confirm` "
"tugmasi bilan tasdiqlang. Shunda u :doc:`xarid buyurtmasiga <../manage_deals/"
"rfq>` aylanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:67
msgid ""
"|PO| from the buyer's database. The :guilabel:`Vendor` is the seller's "
"portal user account, Joel."
msgstr ""
"Xaridor ma'lumotlar bazasidagi |PO|. :guilabel:`Vendor` — sotuvchining "
"portal foydalanuvchi hisobi, Joel."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:0
msgid "Example PO. The Vendor is the seller's portal user account, Joel."
msgstr "Namuna PO. Vendor — sotuvchining portal foydalanuvchi hisobi, Joel."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:73
msgid "Seller's process"
msgstr "Sotuvchi jarayoni"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:75
msgid ""
"Once the |PO| is confirmed, it appears on the seller's portal dashboard. The "
"seller downloads the XML file and uploads it to their database."
msgstr ""
"|PO| tasdiqlangach, u sotuvchining portal boshqaruv panelida paydo bo'ladi. "
"Sotuvchi XML faylini yuklab oladi va uni o'z ma'lumotlar bazasiga yuklaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:79
msgid "Download file"
msgstr "Faylni yuklab olish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:81
msgid ""
"As the seller, log in to the buyer's database as the portal user. On the "
"dashboard, scroll down and click the :guilabel:`Our Orders` button. Doing so "
"reveals a list of purchase orders the buyer's database has addressed to the "
"portal user."
msgstr ""
"Sotuvchi sifatida xaridorning ma'lumotlar bazasiga portal foydalanuvchisi "
"sifatida kiring. Boshqaruv panelida pastga aylantiring va :guilabel:`Our "
"Orders` tugmasini bosing. Shunda xaridor ma'lumotlar bazasi portal "
"foydalanuvchisiga yo'llagan xarid buyurtmalari ro'yxati ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:85
msgid ""
"Select the desired purchase order, and the click :guilabel:`Connect with "
"your software!` button."
msgstr ""
"Kerakli xarid buyurtmasini tanlang va :guilabel:`Connect with your software!"
"` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:87
msgid ""
"In the pop-up window, copy the provided URL, and paste it into a new browser "
"tab to download the XML file."
msgstr ""
"Qalqib chiquvchi oynada taqdim etilgan URL manzilini nusxalang va XML "
"faylini yuklab olish uchun uni yangi brauzer varag'iga joylashtiring."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:91
msgid ""
"Joel's portal view of the PO. The first image displays "
"the :guilabel:`Connect with your software!` button, and the second image "
"displays a pop-up window with the :guilabel:`Copy` button."
msgstr ""
"Joelning PO bo'yicha portal ko'rinishi. Birinchi rasmda :guilabel:`Connect "
"with your software!` tugmasi, ikkinchi rasmda esa :guilabel:`Copy` tugmasi "
"bo'lgan qalqib chiquvchi oyna ko'rsatilgan."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:None
msgid "Portal view of the PO, with \"Connect your software!\" button."
msgstr "\"Connect your software!\" tugmasi bilan PO ning portal ko'rinishi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:None
msgid "Pop-up to copy link."
msgstr "Havolani nusxalash uchun qalqib chiquvchi oyna."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:102
msgid ":download:`XML file <edi/P00017.xml>` for PO00017"
msgstr "PO00017 uchun :download:`XML fayli <edi/P00017.xml>`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:107
msgid "Upload file"
msgstr "Faylni yuklash"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:109
msgid ""
"Next, the seller logs in to their own Odoo database and "
"opens :menuselection:`Sales` app. Click :guilabel:`Upload` and select the "
"downloaded XML file. Alternatively, users can drag and drop the file into "
"the :guilabel:`Quotations` dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Keyin sotuvchi o'zining Odoo ma'lumotlar bazasiga kiradi "
"va :menuselection:`Sales` ilovasini ochadi. :guilabel:`Upload` tugmasini "
"bosing va yuklab olingan XML faylini tanlang. Yoki foydalanuvchilar "
"faylni :guilabel:`Quotations` boshqaruv paneliga sudrab tashlashlari mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:113
msgid ""
"Doing so automatically generates a sales order with the customer populated "
"as the buyer and all product lines, quantities, and prices pre-filled. This "
"process ensures efficient and accurate data exchange between the two "
"databases."
msgstr ""
"Shunda mijoz sifatida xaridor kiritilgan hamda barcha mahsulot qatorlari, "
"miqdorlar va narxlar oldindan to'ldirilgan sotuv buyurtmasi avtomatik "
"yaratiladi. Ushbu jarayon ikki ma'lumotlar bazasi o'rtasida samarali va aniq "
"ma'lumot almashinuvini ta'minlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/edi.rst:120
msgid "Uploaded SO in the seller's database."
msgstr "Sotuvchi ma'lumotlar bazasiga yuklangan SO."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:3
msgid "Procurement expenses report"
msgstr "Ta'minot xarajatlari hisoboti"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:12
msgid ""
"With the *Purchase* application, users can monitor procurement expenses over "
"time. This report helps companies track and analyze spending, identify cost-"
"saving opportunities, and ensure efficient budget management."
msgstr ""
"*Purchase* ilovasi yordamida foydalanuvchilar ta'minot xarajatlarini vaqt "
"davomida kuzatishlari mumkin. Ushbu hisobot kompaniyalarga sarf-xarajatlarni "
"kuzatish va tahlil qilish, xarajatlarni tejash imkoniyatlarini aniqlash "
"hamda byudjetni samarali boshqarishni ta'minlashga yordam beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:17
msgid "Create procurement expenses report"
msgstr "Ta'minot xarajatlari hisobotini yaratish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:19
msgid ""
"To create a |per|, first navigate to :menuselection:`Purchase app --> "
"Reporting --> Purchase` to open the :guilabel:`Purchase Analysis` dashboard."
msgstr ""
"|per| yaratish uchun avval :guilabel:`Purchase Analysis` boshqaruv panelini "
"ochish uchun :menuselection:`Purchase app --> Reporting --> Purchase` "
"yo'lidan o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:22
msgid ""
"By default, the dashboard displays a line chart overview of "
"the :guilabel:`Untaxed Total` of :guilabel:`Purchase Orders` (POs) with "
"a :guilabel:`Confirmation Date` for the current month, or of Requests for "
"Quotation (RFQs) with a status of *Draft*, *Sent*, or *Cancelled*."
msgstr ""
"Standart holatda boshqaruv paneli joriy oy uchun :guilabel:`Confirmation "
"Date` ga ega :guilabel:`Purchase Orders` (PO'lar) yoki holati *Draft*, "
"*Sent* yoki *Cancelled* bo'lgan narx so'rovlari (RFQ'lar) "
"bo'yicha :guilabel:`Untaxed Total` ning chiziqli diagramma ko'rinishidagi "
"umumiy ko'rinishini ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:27
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/vendor_costs_report.rst:25
msgid "Add filters and groups"
msgstr "Filtrlar va guruhlarni qo'shish"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:29
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/vendor_costs_report.rst:27
msgid ""
"On the top-right, click the :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`(pivot)` icon "
"to switch to pivot view."
msgstr ""
"Yuqori o'ng burchakda pivot ko'rinishiga o'tish uchun :icon:`oi-view-"
"pivot` :guilabel:`(pivot)` belgisini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:32
msgid ""
"While the |per| can also be :ref:`viewed <purchase/view-results>` as "
"a :icon:`fa-bar-chart` :guilabel:`(bar chart)`, :icon:`fa-line-"
"chart` :guilabel:`(line chart)`, or :icon:`fa-pie-chart` :guilabel:`(pie "
"chart)`, the pivot view provides the most detailed view of the data, and is "
"the recommended starting point."
msgstr ""
"|per| ni :icon:`fa-bar-chart` :guilabel:`(bar chart)`, :icon:`fa-line-"
"chart` :guilabel:`(line chart)` yoki :icon:`fa-pie-chart` :guilabel:`(pie "
"chart)` sifatida ham :ref:`ko'rish <purchase/view-results>` mumkin bo'lsa-"
"da, pivot ko'rinishi ma'lumotlarning eng batafsil ko'rinishini taqdim etadi "
"va tavsiya etilgan boshlang'ich nuqta hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:37
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/vendor_costs_report.rst:29
msgid ""
"Remove any default filters from the :guilabel:`Search...` bar. Then, click "
"the |caret| to open the drop-down menu that contains "
"the :guilabel:`Filters`, :guilabel:`Group By`, and :guilabel:`Favorites` "
"columns."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Search...` panelidan barcha standart filtrlarni olib tashlang. "
"Keyin :guilabel:`Filters`, :guilabel:`Group By` va :guilabel:`Favorites` "
"ustunlarini o'z ichiga olgan ochiluvchi menyuni ochish uchun |caret| ni "
"bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:42
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/vendor_costs_report.rst:34
msgid ""
"Unless otherwise specified, the report displays data from both |RFQs| and |"
"POs|. This can be changed by selecting either :guilabel:`Requests for "
"Quotation` or :guilabel:`Purchase Orders` under the :guilabel:`Filters` "
"column."
msgstr ""
"Agar boshqacha ko'rsatilmagan bo'lsa, hisobot |RFQs| va |POs| dan olingan "
"ma'lumotlarni ko'rsatadi. Buni :guilabel:`Filters` "
"ustunida :guilabel:`Requests for Quotation` yoki :guilabel:`Purchase Orders` "
"ni tanlash orqali o'zgartirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:46
msgid ""
"Under the :guilabel:`Filters` column, select a time frame to use for "
"comparison. The report can be filtered by either :guilabel:`Order Date` "
"or :guilabel:`Confirmation Date`. Choose one from the list, and click the |"
"caret| to specify the date range, either by month, quarter, or year."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Filters` ustunida taqqoslash uchun vaqt oralig'ini tanlang. "
"Hisobotni :guilabel:`Order Date` yoki :guilabel:`Confirmation Date` bo'yicha "
"filtrlash mumkin. Ro'yxatdan birini tanlang va sana oralig'ini oy, chorak "
"yoki yil bo'yicha belgilash uchun |caret| ni bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:50
msgid ""
"Next, under the :guilabel:`Group by` column, select :guilabel:`Vendor`. "
"Then, select :guilabel:`Product Category`, which is also located in "
"the :guilabel:`Group By` column."
msgstr ""
"Keyin :guilabel:`Group by` ustunida :guilabel:`Vendor` ni tanlang. So'ngra "
"yana :guilabel:`Group By` ustunida joylashgan :guilabel:`Product Category` "
"ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:54
msgid ""
"The selections under the :guilabel:`Group By` heading can be altered, "
"depending on the needs of the individual company. For example, "
"selecting :guilabel:`Product`, instead of :guilabel:`Product Category`, "
"provides a more in depth look at the performance of specific items, in place "
"of an entire category."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Group By` sarlavhasi ostidagi tanlovlarni har bir kompaniyaning "
"ehtiyojlariga qarab o'zgartirish mumkin. Masalan, :guilabel:`Product "
"Category` o'rniga :guilabel:`Product` ni tanlash butun kategoriya o'rniga "
"muayyan mahsulotlar samaradorligini chuqurroq ko'rib chiqish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/advanced/procurement_expenses_report.rst:59
msgid ""
"Next, make a selection under the :guilabel:`Comparison` heading that "
